انات متعددة","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 frequency-lookup","什么是 SDR","frequency-lookup 安装","WaveCap 替代品","frequency-lookup 与其他工具的比较","如何配置 frequency-lookup","frequency-lookup 文档","AI智能代理工具"],"ja":["frequency-lookup の使用方法","SDR とは","frequency-lookup のインストール","WaveCap の代替","frequency-lookup と他のツールの比較","frequency-lookup の設定方法","frequency-lookup ドキュメント","AIエージェント ツール"],"ko":["frequency-lookup 사용법","SDR란","frequency-lookup 설치","WaveCap 대체","frequency-lookup와 다른 도구 비교","frequency-lookup 설정 방법","frequency-lookup 문서","AI 에이전트 도구"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","frequency-lookup","WaveCap","desarrollo de software","SDR","cómo usar frequency-lookup","alternativas a frequency-lookup","instalación de frequency-lookup"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","frequency-lookup","WaveCap","développement de logiciels","SDR","comment utiliser frequency-lookup","alternatives à frequency-lookup","installation de frequency-lookup"],"de":["KI-Tools","frequency-lookup","WaveCap","Software-Entwicklung","SDR","wie man frequency-lookup verwendet","Alternativen zu frequency-lookup","Installation von frequency-lookup"],"pt":["como usar frequency-lookup","o que é frequency-lookup","frequency-lookup vs outros módulos","instalar frequency-lookup","guia de configuração do frequency-lookup","desenvolvimento de aplicações de processamento de sinais","análise de frequência em Python","bibliotecas de processamento de sinais em Node.js"],"ru":["как использовать frequency-lookup","что такое frequency-lookup","frequency-lookup vs другие модули","установить frequency-lookup","руководство по настройке frequency-lookup","разработка приложений обработки сигналов","анализ частоты на Python","библиотеки обработки сигналов на Node.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام frequency-lookup","ما هو frequency-lookup","frequency-lookup مقابل مكونات أخرى","تثبيت frequency-lookup","دليل إعداد frequency-lookup","تطوير تطبيقات معالجة الإشارات","تحليل التردد bằng Python","مكتبات معالجة الإشارات في Node.js"]}},"owner":"TobiasWooldridge","repo":"WaveCap-SDR","repoPath":"TobiasWooldridge/WaveCap-SDR","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.903Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frequency-lookup","description":"Look up frequency allocations, band plans, and known stations for radio services (marine, aviation, amateur, broadcast, NOAA weather). Use when finding frequencies to monitor, verifying band allocations, or discovering channels in a frequency range.","bodyPreview":"# Frequency Lookup for WaveCap-SDR\n\nThis skill helps find frequencies and band plans for various radio services.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Finding frequencies for marine/aviation/amateur bands\n- Looking up broadcast stations by location\n- Verifying frequency allocations\n- Discovering what''s on a frequency\n- Planning SDR monitoring scenarios\n- Creating new recipes for specific bands\n\n## Common Frequency Bands\n\n### VHF Marine (156-162 MHz)\n\n**Channel 16 (156.800 MHz)** - I","body":"# Frequency Lookup for WaveCap-SDR\n\nThis skill helps find frequencies and band plans for various radio services.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Finding frequencies for marine/aviation/amateur bands\n- Looking up broadcast stations by location\n- Verifying frequency allocations\n- Discovering what''s on a frequency\n- Planning SDR monitoring scenarios\n- Creating new recipes for specific bands\n\n## Common Frequency Bands\n\n### VHF Marine (156-162 MHz)\n\n**Channel 16 (156.800 MHz)** - International Distress/Safety/Calling\n**Channel 9 (156.450 MHz)** - Recreational calling (US)\n**Channel 6 (156.300 MHz)** - Intership safety\n\nFull band plan: https://www.navcen.uscg.gov/marine-communications-channel-table\n\n### Aviation (118-137 MHz)\n\n**121.500 MHz** - Emergency frequency\n**Typical ranges:**\n- Tower: 118.0-121.4 MHz\n- Ground: 121.6-121.9 MHz\n- ATIS: Varies by airport\n\nFind local frequencies: https://www.airnav.com\n\n### NOAA Weather Radio (162-163 MHz)\n\n**WX1: 162.550 MHz**\n**WX2: 162.400 MHz**\n**WX3: 162.475 MHz**\n**WX4: 162.425 MHz**\n**WX5: 162.450 MHz**\n**WX6: 162.500 MHz**\n**WX7: 162.525 MHz**\n\nCoverage map: https://www.weather.gov/nwr/\n\n### FM Broadcast (88-108 MHz)\n\n**US band:** 88.1-107.9 MHz (odd tenths only)\n**Europe/Asia:** 87.5-108.0 MHz\n\nFind local stations:\n- https://radio-locator.com\n- https://fmscan.org\n\n### Amateur Radio (Ham)\n\n**2 meters:** 144-148 MHz (FM repeaters typically 145-147 MHz)\n**70 cm:** 420-450 MHz\n**HF bands:** 3.5, 7, 14, 21, 28 MHz\n\nRepeater directory: https://www.repeaterbook.com\n\n### Public Safety / Trunking\n\n**VHF:** 150-174 MHz\n**UHF:** 450-470 MHz, 806-824 MHz\n\nDatabase: https://www.radioreference.com\n\n## Online Resources\n\n**RadioReference.com** - Comprehensive frequency database\n- Trunked systems\n- Talkgroup IDs\n- Local agencies\n\n**SignalWiki** - Signal identification\n- Decode unknown signals\n- Modulation types\n\n**WebSDR** - Remote SDR receivers\n- Listen without hardware\n- Check propagation\n\n**FlightAware/FlightRadar24** - Aviation tracking\n- Find airport frequencies\n- Track aircraft\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Find Marine Channels\n```\nVHF Marine channels are spaced 25 kHz apart\nChannel number = (Frequency - 156.000) / 0.025\nChannel 16 = 156.800 MHz\nChannel 9 = 156.450 MHz\n```\n\n### Find Local FM Stations\nVisit https://radio-locator.com and enter your ZIP code\n\n### Find NOAA Weather\nFind nearest transmitter at https://www.weather.gov/nwr/\n\n### Find Aviation Frequencies\nVisit https://www.airnav.com and search for airport code (e.g., KSEA)\n\n## Integration with WaveCap-SDR\n\nAfter finding frequencies, create a recipe:\n\n```yaml\nrecipes:\n  my_frequencies:\n    name: \"My Frequencies\"\n    capture:\n      center_hz: 156800000  # Center on Ch 16\n      sample_rate: 250000\n      gain_db: 35\n    channels:\n      - {name: \"Ch 16\", offset_hz: 0, mode: \"fm\"}\n      - {name: \"Ch 9\", offset_hz: -350000, mode: \"fm\"}\n```\n\nOr use presets for quick tuning.\n\n## Band Plan Quick Reference\n\n| Service | Frequency Range | Typical Use |\n|---------|----------------|-------------|\n| AM Broadcast | 530-1700 kHz | Radio stations |\n| Ham 160m | 1.8-2.0 MHz | Amateur HF |\n| Marine SSB | 2-4 MHz | Long-range marine |\n| Ham 80m | 3.5-4.0 MHz | Amateur HF |\n| Ham 40m | 7.0-7.3 MHz | Amateur HF |\n| Ham 20m | 14.0-14.35 MHz | Amateur HF |\n| Ham 10m | 28-29.7 MHz | Amateur HF |\n| CB | 26.965-27.405 MHz | Citizens Band |\n| Ham 6m | 50-54 MHz | Amateur VHF |\n| FM Broadcast | 88-108 MHz | Radio stations |\n| Aviation | 118-137 MHz | Air traffic control |\n| Ham 2m | 144-148 MHz | Amateur VHF |\n| Marine VHF | 156-162 MHz | Maritime |\n| NOAA WX | 162.400-162.550 MHz | Weather |\n| Ham 70cm | 420-450 MHz | Amateur UHF |\n| GMRS/FRS | 462-467 MHz | Personal radio |\n\n## Files in This Skill\n\n- `SKILL.md`: This file - frequency reference and lookup guide\n\n## Notes\n\n- Frequencies vary by country (this guide is US-centric)\n- Always check local regulations before transmitting\n- Some frequencies require licenses (ham, marine, aviation)\n- SDR receiving is legal, transmitting requires proper licensing\n- Band plans change - verify with official sources\n- Use RadioReference.com for most comprehensive database\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:15:49.142Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Radio Frequency Analysis Agents needing advanced band plan visualization and lookup capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级频带计划可视化和查找功能的射频分析代理。","ja":"高級なバンドプランの視覚化および検索機能を必要とする無線周波数分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 대역 계획 시각화 및 조회 기능이 필요한 무선 주파수 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Frecuencia de Radio que necesitan una visualización avanzada de planes de banda y capacidades de búsqueda.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Fréquence Radio nécessitant une visualisation avancée de plans de bande et des capacités de recherche.","de":"Perfekt für Radiofrequenzanalyse-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Bandplan-Visualisierung und Suchfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Frequência de Rádio que necessitam de visualização e capacidades de lookup de plano de banda avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа радиочастот, которым необходимы расширенные возможности визуализации и поиска планов частот.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل ترددات الراديو التي تحتاج إلى تخطيط حزمة تردد متقدم وقدرات بحث"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to accurately identify frequencies for marine, aviation, and amateur bands using VHF and other protocols, facilitating SDR monitoring scenario planning and frequency allocation verification.","zh":"使代理能够使用VHF和其他协议准确识别海事、航空和业余频带的频率，从而促进SDR监控场景规划和频率分配验证。","ja":"VHFやその他のプロトコルを使用して、海事、航空、またはアマチュアバンドの周波数を正確に識別することで、SDRモニタリングシナリオの計画と周波数割り当ての検証を容易にします。","ko":"VHF 및 기타 프로토콜을 사용하여 해상, 항공 및 아마추어 대역의 주파수를 정확하게 식별하여 SDR 모니터링 시나리오 계획 및 주파수 할당 확인을促进합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes identificar con precisión las frecuencias para bandas marinas, aeronáuticas y de aficionados utilizando VHF y otros protocolos, facilitando la planificación de escenarios de monitoreo SDR y la verificación de la asignación de frecuencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier avec précision les fréquences pour les bandes marines, aéronautiques et amateur en utilisant VHF et d''autres protocoles, facilitant la planification des scénarios de surveillance SDR et la vérification de l''allocation des fréquences.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Frequenzen für Marine-, Luftfahrt- und Amateurfrequenzen mithilfe von VHF und anderen Protokollen genau zu identifizieren, wodurch die Planung von SDR-Überwachungsszenarien und die Überprüfung der Frequenzzuweisung erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar com precisão as frequências para bandas marítimas, aviação e amadoras usando VHF e outros protocolos, facilitando o planejamento de cenários de monitoramento SDR e verificação de alocação de frequência.","ru":"Позволяет агентам точно определять частоты для морских, авиационных и любительских диапазонов, используя VHF и другие протоколы, что облегчает планирование сценариев мониторинга SDR и проверку выделения частот.","ar":"يمكن العميل من تحديد الترددات بدقة للنطاقات البحرية والطيران والهواة باستخدام بروتوكول VHF وغيرها، مما يسهل تخطيط سيناريوهات مراقبة SDR والتحقق من تخصيص الترددات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating frequency lookups for specific geographic locations","Generating band plans for SDR monitoring scenarios","Verifying frequency allocations for compliance and interference avoidance"],"zh":["为特定地理位置自动执行频率查找","为SDR监控场景生成频带计划","验证频率分配以确保合规性和避免干扰"],"ja":["特定の地理的位置の周波数検索を自動化する","SDRモニタリングシナリオのバンドプランを生成する","コンプライアンスと干渉の回避のために周波数割り当てを検証する"],"ko":["특정 지리적 위치의 주파수 조회 자동화","SDR 모니터링 시나리오를 위한 대역 계획 생성","준수 및 간섭 방지를 위한 주파수 할당 확인"],"es":["Automatizar búsquedas de frecuencias para ubicaciones geográficas específicas","Generar planes de banda para escenarios de monitoreo SDR","Verificar asignaciones de frecuencias para cumplimiento y evitación de interferencias"],"fr":["Automatiser les recherches de fréquences pour des emplacements géographiques spécifiques","Générer des plans de bande pour les scénarios de surveillance SDR","Vérifier les allocations de fréquences pour la conformité et l''évitement des interférences"],"de":["Automatisieren von Frequenzsuchen für spezifische geografische Standorte","Erstellen von Bandplänen für SDR-Überwachungsszenarien","Überprüfen von Frequenzzuweisungen für die Einhaltung und Vermeidung von Störungen"],"pt":["Automatizar pesquisas de frequência para localizações geográficas específicas","Gerar planos de banda para cenários de monitoramento SDR","Verificar alocações de frequência para conformidade e evasão de interferência"],"ru":["Автоматизировать поиск частот для конкретных географических местоположений","Генерировать планы частот для сценариев мониторинга SDR","Проверять выделение частот для соблюдения требований и избегания помех"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات البحث عن الترددات لمواقع جغرافية محددة","إنتاج خطط حزمة تردد لمشاهدة سيناريوهات SDR","التحقق من تخصيص الترددات للامتثال وتجنب التداخل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to radio frequency services and band plans","Requires knowledge of frequency bands and protocols (e.g., VHF Marine, Channel 16)"],"zh":["仅限于无线电频率服务和频带计划","需要对频率带和协议（例如VHF海事、第16频道）有所了解"],"ja":["無線周波数サービスおよびバンドプランに限定される","周波数バンドおよびプロトコル（例：VHF海事、チャンネル16）に関する知識が必要"],"ko":["무선 주파수 서비스 및 대역 계획에만 제한됨","주파수 대역 및 프로토콜(VHF 해상, 채널 16 등)에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Limitado a servicios de radiofrecuencia y planes de banda","Requiere conocimiento de bandas de frecuencia y protocolos (por ejemplo, VHF Marina, Canal 16)"],"fr":["Limité aux services de fréquence radio et aux plans de bande","Nécessite une connaissance des bandes de fréquence et des protocoles (par exemple, VHF Marine, Canal 16)"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Radiofrequenzdienste und Bandpläne","Benötigt Kenntnisse von Frequenzbändern und Protokollen (z. B. VHF Marine, Kanal 16)"],"pt":["Limitado a serviços de frequência de rádio e planos de banda","Exige conhecimento de bandas de frequência e protocolos (por exemplo, VHF Marine, Canal 16)"],"ru":["Ограничен радиочастотными услугами и планами частот","Требует знания диапазонов частот и протоколов (например, VHF Marine, Канал 16)"],"ar":["محدود لخدمات ترددات الراديو وخطط الحزمة","يتطلب معرفة حزم الترددات والبروتوكولات (على سبيل المثال، بروتوكول VHF البحرية، القناة 16)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fc0ab586bd7cd73ea0d356ec706fc9e5c782d6386e37098ade17638c524f7bc2","qualityScore":40}');
