애플리케이션의 개발과 배포를 지원","LMS 플랫폼의 기능을 통합"],"es":["Desarrollado con Next.js para una experiencia de usuario fluida","Utiliza Express para una gestión eficiente de solicitudes","Integración con Prisma para una base de datos robusta","Mejora la experiencia de aprendizaje en plataformas LMS","Herramienta de AI para una mayor eficiencia en la gestión de tareas"],"fr":["Développé avec Next.js pour une expérience utilisateur fluide","Utilise Express pour une gestion efficace des requêtes","Intégration avec Prisma pour une base de données robuste","Améliore l''expérience d''apprentissage sur les plateformes LMS","Outil d''IA pour une plus grande efficacité dans la gestion de tâches"],"de":["Entwickelt mit Next.js für eine flüssige Benutzeroberfläche","Verwendet Express für eine effiziente Anfrageverwaltung","Integration mit Prisma für eine robuste Datenbank","Verbessert die Lernerfahrung auf LMS-Plattformen","KI-Tool für eine höhere Effizienz bei der Aufgabenverwaltung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de plataformas de LMS com Next.js","Integração com Express e Prisma","Ferramenta de IA para automação de tarefas","Suporte a desenvolvedores","Código aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["Разработка платформ LMS с использованием Next.js","Интеграция с Express и Prisma","ИИ Агент для автоматизации задач","Поддержка разработчиков","Открытый и настраиваемый код"],"ar":["تطوير منصات LMS باستخدام Next.js","التكامل مع Express و Prisma","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للتحكم الآلي في المهام","دعم المطورين","كود مفتوح ويمكن تخصيصه"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","LMS平台","Next.js","Express","Prisma","AI应用开发","knowns.task.brainstorm教程","LMS平台开发","AI工具比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","LMSプラットフォーム","Next.js","Express","Prisma","AIアプリケーションの開発","knowns.task.brainstormの使い方","LMSプラットフォームの開発","AIエージェントの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","LMS 플랫폼","Next.js","Express","Prisma","AI 애플리케이션 개발","knowns.task.brainstorm 사용법","LMS 플랫폼 개발","AI 에이전트 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI para LMS","knowns.task.brainstorm","Next.js para LMS","cómo utilizar knowns.task.brainstorm","alternativas a knowns.task.brainstorm","guía de instalación de knowns.task.brainstorm","configuración de knowns.task.brainstorm","mejora de la experiencia de aprendizaje"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les plateformes LMS","knowns.task.brainstorm","Next.js pour les plateformes LMS","comment utiliser knowns.task.brainstorm","alternatives à knowns.task.brainstorm","guide d''installation de knowns.task.brainstorm","configuration de knowns.task.brainstorm","amélioration de l''expérience d''apprentissage"],"de":["KI-Tools für LMS-Plattformen","knowns.task.brainstorm","Next.js für LMS-Plattformen","wie man knowns.task.brainstorm verwendet","Alternativen zu knowns.task.brainstorm","Installationsanleitung für knowns.task.brainstorm","Konfiguration von knowns.task.brainstorm","Verbesserung der Lernerfahrung"],"pt":["como usar knowns.task.brainstorm","o que é knowns.task.brainstorm","desenvolvimento de plataformas de LMS","Next.js para desenvolvedores","Express e Prisma para LMS","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","knowns.task.brainstorm vs outras ferramentas","guia de instalação do knowns.task.brainstorm"],"ru":["как использовать известный инструмент knowns.task.brainstorm","что такое известный инструмент knowns.task.brainstorm","разработка платформ LMS","Next.js для разработчиков","Express и Prisma для LMS","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","knowns.task.brainstorm против других инструментов","руководство по установке известного инструмента knowns.task.brainstorm"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام knowns.task.brainstorm","ما هو knowns.task.brainstorm","تطوير منصات LMS","Next.js لمطورين التطبيقات","Express و Prisma لمنصات LMS","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمطورين التطبيقات","knowns.task.brainstorm مقابل أدوات أخرى","دليل تثبيت knowns.task.brainstorm"]}},"owner":"tung68nt","repo":"tulie_lab","repoPath":"tung68nt/tulie_lab","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.935Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"knowns.task.brainstorm","description":"Use when requirements are unclear, multiple approaches exist, or you need to explore solutions before planning","bodyPreview":"# Brainstorming for Tasks\n\nConvert vague requirements into concrete design through structured questioning and exploration.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the knowns.task.brainstorm skill to explore approaches.\"\n\n**Core principle:** UNDERSTAND THE PROBLEM BEFORE PROPOSING SOLUTIONS.\n\n## The Process\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery\n\n**One question at a time.** Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions.\n\nPrefer multiple-choice when possible:\n```\nWhich approach do you prefer?\nA) Quick solution with trade-o","body":"# Brainstorming for Tasks\n\nConvert vague requirements into concrete design through structured questioning and exploration.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the knowns.task.brainstorm skill to explore approaches.\"\n\n**Core principle:** UNDERSTAND THE PROBLEM BEFORE PROPOSING SOLUTIONS.\n\n## The Process\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery\n\n**One question at a time.** Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions.\n\nPrefer multiple-choice when possible:\n```\nWhich approach do you prefer?\nA) Quick solution with trade-offs\nB) Comprehensive solution, more effort\nC) Something else (describe)\n```\n\nQuestions to clarify:\n- What problem are we solving?\n- Who are the users/stakeholders?\n- What are the constraints?\n- What does success look like?\n\n### Phase 2: Research Existing Patterns\n\n```json\n// Search docs for related patterns\nmcp__knowns__search_docs({ \"query\": \"<topic>\" })\n\n// Check how similar things were done\nmcp__knowns__search_tasks({ \"query\": \"<keywords>\" })\n```\n\n**Learn from history** - completed tasks often contain implementation insights.\n\n### Phase 3: Explore Approaches\n\nPresent 2-3 options with trade-offs:\n\n```markdown\n## Option A: [Name]\n- **Approach**: Brief description\n- **Pros**: What''s good\n- **Cons**: What''s challenging\n- **Effort**: Low/Medium/High\n\n## Option B: [Name]\n- **Approach**: Brief description\n- **Pros**: What''s good\n- **Cons**: What''s challenging\n- **Effort**: Low/Medium/High\n```\n\n**Lead with your recommendation** and explain why.\n\n### Phase 4: Validate and Document\n\nAfter agreement:\n- Summarize the chosen approach\n- Identify potential risks\n- Define acceptance criteria\n\nIf creating a new task:\n```json\nmcp__knowns__create_task({\n  \"title\": \"<title>\",\n  \"description\": \"Based on brainstorm: <key decisions>\",\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\"Criterion 1\", \"Criterion 2\"]\n})\n```\n\nIf updating existing task:\n```json\nmcp__knowns__update_task({\n  \"taskId\": \"$ARGUMENTS\",\n  \"description\": \"Updated based on brainstorm...\"\n})\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n**Good candidates:**\n- Vague requirements (\"make it faster\", \"improve UX\")\n- Multiple valid approaches exist\n- Significant effort involved\n- New territory for the project\n\n**Skip for:**\n- Clear, well-defined tasks\n- Bug fixes with obvious solutions\n- Simple additions following existing patterns\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**You''re doing it wrong if:**\n- Proposing solutions before understanding the problem\n- Asking too many questions at once\n- Not researching existing patterns first\n- Skipping trade-off analysis\n\n## Remember\n\n- One question at a time\n- Research existing patterns first\n- Present options with trade-offs\n- Lead with your recommendation\n- Document the decision"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:34:23.394Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing structured task analysis and design capabilities through Next.js, Express, and Prisma.","zh":"适合需要通过 Next.js、Express 和 Prisma 进行结构化任务分析和设计的高级 AI Agent。","ja":"Next.js、Express、Prisma を使用した構造化されたタスク分析および設計機能が必要な高度な AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Next.js, Express, Prisma를 통해 구조화된 작업 분석 및 설계 기능이 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Avanzados que necesitan un análisis y diseño de tareas estructurados a través de Next.js, Express y Prisma.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA Avancés nécessitant une analyse et une conception de tâches structurées via Next.js, Express et Prisma.","de":"Perfekt für fortschrittliche KI-Agenten, die eine strukturierte Aufgabenanalyse und -gestaltung durch Next.js, Express und Prisma benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de análise e design de tarefas estruturadas por meio do Next.js, Express e Prisma.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым необходимы структурированный анализ и проектирование задач с помощью Next.js, Express и Prisma.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوسائط المتقدمة التي تحتاج إلى تحليل هيكلي وقدرات تصميم عبر Next.js و Express و Prisma."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert vague requirements into concrete designs through systematic questioning, utilizing protocols like multiple-choice preferences and single-question-at-a-time exploration, all within the Tulie Lab ecosystem.","zh":"通过系统化的问题、利用多选偏好和单一问题探索等协议，使得代理能够将模糊的需求转化为具体的设计，所有这些都在 Tulie Lab 生态系统中进行。","ja":"エージェントは、システム化された質問、複数選択型の好みや一つの質問ずつの探索などのプロトコルを利用して、曖昧な要件を具体的な設計に変換できるようになります。これらはすべて、Tulie Lab エコシステムの中で行われます。","ko":"시스템화된 질문과 다중 선택형 선호도 및 단일 질문 탐색 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 에이전트가 모호한 요구 사항을 구체적인 설계로 변환 할 수 있도록 하며, 모든 것은 Tulie Lab 생태계 내에서 진행됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir requisitos vagos en diseños concretos a través de un cuestionamiento sistemático, utilizando protocolos como preferencias de múltiple opción y exploración de una sola pregunta a la vez, todo dentro del ecosistema de Tulie Lab.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des exigences vagues en conceptions concrètes grâce à un questionnement systématique, en utilisant des protocoles tels que des préférences à choix multiple et une exploration d''une seule question à la fois, le tout au sein de l''écosystème de Tulie Lab.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, vage Anforderungen in konkrete Entwürfe umzuwandeln, indem sie systematisches Fragen stellen, Protokolle wie Multiple-Choice-Präferenzen und schrittweises Nachfragen verwenden, all dies innerhalb des Tulie Lab-Ökosystems.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter requisitos vagos em designs concretos por meio de questionamento sistemático, utilizando protocolos como preferências de múltipla escolha e exploração de uma pergunta por vez, tudo dentro do ecossistema do Tulie Lab.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать нечеткие требования в конкретные проекты посредством систематического опроса, использующего протоколы, такие как множественный выбор и исследование по одной вопросу за раз, все в рамках экосистемы Tulie Lab.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تحويل المتطلبات الغامضة إلى تصاميم ملموسة من خلال الاستجواب المنهجي، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تفضيلات اختيار متعددة واستكشاف سؤال واحد في كل مرة، كل ذلك داخل منظومة Tulie Lab."},"useCases":{"en":["Structuring ambiguous project requirements","Generating concrete task designs through phased questioning","Exploring approaches for solution development"],"zh":["结构化模糊的项目需求","通过分阶段的问题生成具体的任务设计","探索解决方案开发的方法"],"ja":["曖昧なプロジェクト要件の構造化","段階的な質問を通じて具体的なタスク設計を生成する","ソリューションの開発方法を探索する"],"ko":["모호한 프로젝트 요구 사항 구조화","단계적인 질문을 통해 구체적인 작업 설계 생성","솔루션 개발 방법 탐색"],"es":["Estructuración de requisitos de proyecto ambiguos","Generación de diseños de tareas concretos a través de un cuestionamiento por fases","Exploración de enfoques para el desarrollo de soluciones"],"fr":["Structuration des exigences de projet ambiguës","Génération de conceptions de tâches concrètes à travers un questionnement par phases","Exploration d''approches pour le développement de solutions"],"de":["Strukturierung von mehrdeutigen Projektanforderungen","Erzeugung von konkreten Aufgabenentwürfen durch schrittweises Nachfragen","Erforschung von Ansätzen für die Lösungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Estruturar requisitos de projeto ambíguos","Gerar projetos de tarefas concretos por meio de questionamento por fases","Explorar abordagens para desenvolvimento de soluções"],"ru":["Структуризация неоднозначных требований проекта","Генерация конкретных проектов задач посредством поэтапного опроса","Изучение подходов к разработке решений"],"ar":["هيكلة متطلبات المشروع الغامضة","توليد تصاميم ملموسة للمهام من خلال الاستجواب بالمراحل","استكشاف مناهج لتطوير الحلول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tulie Lab LMS platform integration","Dependent on Express and Prisma for backend functionality","Limited to Next.js for frontend implementation"],"zh":["需要 Tulie Lab LMS 平台集成","依赖于 Express 和 Prisma 进行后端功能","仅限于 Next.js 进行前端实现"],"ja":["Tulie Lab LMS プラットフォームの統合が必要","Express と Prisma に依存してバックエンド機能を実現","Next.js だけがフロントエンドの実装に限定される"],"ko":["Tulie Lab LMS 플랫폼 통합 필요","Express 및 Prisma에 의존하여 백엔드 기능 구현","Next.js로만 프론트엔드 구현이 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la integración de la plataforma LMS de Tulie Lab","Dependiente de Express y Prisma para la funcionalidad de backend","Limitado a Next.js para la implementación de frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la plate-forme LMS de Tulie Lab","Dépendant d''Express et de Prisma pour la fonctionnalité backend","Limité à Next.js pour la mise en œuvre de frontend"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der Tulie Lab LMS-Plattform","Abhängig von Express und Prisma für die Backend-Funktionalität","Begrenzt auf Next.js für die Frontend-Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer integração com a plataforma LMS do Tulie Lab","Depende do Express e Prisma para funcionalidade backend","Limitado ao Next.js para implementação frontend"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с платформой LMS Tulie Lab","Зависит от Express и Prisma для функциональности бэкэнда","Ограничен Next.js для реализации фронтэнда"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع منصة Tulie Lab LMS","يعتمد على Express و Prisma لتفعيل الخلفية","محدود بـ Next.js لتنفيذ الواجهة الأمامية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"35ba22358662fbcbbe0c6720d3bc8313872f21c112dfb8d0be79ec1385e4541a","qualityScore":40}');
