,"regelmodul","software-entwicklung","hochleistung","rust","geschäftsregeln","individualisierung","integration","ordo-testing-installationsanleitung","ordo-testing im vergleich zu anderen regelmodulen"],"pt":["como usar ordo testing","o que é ordo testing","ordo testing vs outras ferramentas","instalar ordo testing","guia de configuração do ordo testing","desenvolvimento de software com ordo testing","ordo testing para desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["как использовать ордо тестинг","что такое ордо тестинг","ордо тестинг vs другие инструменты","установить ордо тестинг","руководство по настройке ордо тестинга","разработка программного обеспечения с ордо тестингом","ордо тестинг для разработчиков","инструменты разработки программного обеспечения"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أوردو تيستينج","ما هو أوردو تيستينج","أوردو تيستينج مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أوردو تيستينج","دليل إعداد أوردو تيستينج","تطوير البرمجيات مع أوردو تيستينج","أوردو تيستينج للمطورين","أدوات تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Pama-Lee","repo":"Ordo","repoPath":"Pama-Lee/Ordo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.002Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ordo-testing","description":"Ordo testing and benchmarking guide. Includes unit tests, integration tests, Criterion benchmarks, k6 load tests, CI configuration. Use for writing tests, performance analysis, continuous integration.","bodyPreview":"# Ordo Testing and Benchmarking\n\n## Unit Tests\n\n### Running Tests\n\n```bash\n# Run all tests\ncargo test\n\n# Run specific crate\ncargo test --package ordo-core\ncargo test --package ordo-server\n\n# Run specific test\ncargo test test_full_workflow\n\n# Show output\ncargo test -- --nocapture\n\n# Parallel control\ncargo test -- --test-threads=4\n```\n\n### Test Example\n\n```rust\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n    use ordo_core::prelude::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn test_rule_execution() {\n        let mut rule","body":"# Ordo Testing and Benchmarking\n\n## Unit Tests\n\n### Running Tests\n\n```bash\n# Run all tests\ncargo test\n\n# Run specific crate\ncargo test --package ordo-core\ncargo test --package ordo-server\n\n# Run specific test\ncargo test test_full_workflow\n\n# Show output\ncargo test -- --nocapture\n\n# Parallel control\ncargo test -- --test-threads=4\n```\n\n### Test Example\n\n```rust\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n    use ordo_core::prelude::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn test_rule_execution() {\n        let mut ruleset = RuleSet::new(\"test\", \"start\");\n        \n        ruleset.add_step(\n            Step::decision(\"start\", \"Start\")\n                .branch(Condition::from_string(\"value > 10\"), \"high\")\n                .default(\"low\")\n                .build()\n        );\n        \n        ruleset.add_step(Step::terminal(\"high\", \"High\", \n            TerminalResult::new(\"HIGH\")));\n        ruleset.add_step(Step::terminal(\"low\", \"Low\", \n            TerminalResult::new(\"LOW\")));\n\n        let executor = RuleExecutor::new();\n        \n        // Test high value\n        let input: Value = serde_json::from_str(r#\"{\"value\": 20}\"#).unwrap();\n        let result = executor.execute(&ruleset, input).unwrap();\n        assert_eq!(result.code, \"HIGH\");\n        \n        // Test low value\n        let input: Value = serde_json::from_str(r#\"{\"value\": 5}\"#).unwrap();\n        let result = executor.execute(&ruleset, input).unwrap();\n        assert_eq!(result.code, \"LOW\");\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn test_expression_eval() {\n        let evaluator = Evaluator::new();\n        let parser = ExprParser::new();\n        \n        let expr = parser.parse(\"age >= 18 && status == \\\"active\\\"\").unwrap();\n        let ctx = Context::from_json(r#\"{\"age\": 25, \"status\": \"active\"}\"#).unwrap();\n        let result = evaluator.eval(&expr, &ctx).unwrap();\n        \n        assert_eq!(result, Value::Bool(true));\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Tests\n\n### gRPC Tests\n\n```bash\ncargo test --package ordo-server --test grpc_test\n```\n\n### UDS Tests\n\n```bash\ncargo test --package ordo-server --test uds_test\n```\n\n## Benchmarks\n\n### Running Criterion Benchmarks\n\n```bash\n# All benchmarks\ncargo bench --package ordo-core\n\n# Specific benchmarks\ncargo bench --package ordo-core --bench engine_bench\ncargo bench --package ordo-core --bench jit_comparison_bench\ncargo bench --package ordo-core --bench schema_jit_bench\ncargo bench --package ordo-core --bench optimization_bench\n```\n\n### Benchmark Files\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `engine_bench.rs` | Overall engine performance |\n| `jit_comparison_bench.rs` | JIT vs interpreter comparison |\n| `jit_realistic_bench.rs` | Realistic JIT scenarios |\n| `jit_stress_bench.rs` | JIT stress testing |\n| `schema_jit_bench.rs` | Schema JIT performance |\n| `optimization_bench.rs` | Optimization effectiveness |\n\n### Writing Benchmarks\n\n```rust\nuse criterion::{black_box, criterion_group, criterion_main, Criterion};\nuse ordo_core::prelude::*;\n\nfn bench_rule_execution(c: &mut Criterion) {\n    let mut ruleset = RuleSet::new(\"bench\", \"start\");\n    // ... setup rules\n    \n    let executor = RuleExecutor::new();\n    let input: Value = serde_json::from_str(r#\"{\"value\": 100}\"#).unwrap();\n    \n    c.bench_function(\"rule_execution\", |b| {\n        b.iter(|| {\n            executor.execute(&ruleset, black_box(input.clone()))\n        })\n    });\n}\n\ncriterion_group!(benches, bench_rule_execution);\ncriterion_main!(benches);\n```\n\n## k6 Load Testing\n\n### Running Load Tests\n\n```bash\n# Basic test\n./scripts/benchmark.sh\n\n# Custom parameters\n./scripts/benchmark.sh \\\n    -h localhost \\\n    -p 8080 \\\n    -d 60s \\\n    -u 50 \\\n    -r 500 \\\n    --rule order_discount \\\n    --analyze\n```\n\n### Parameter Reference\n\n| Parameter | Description | Default |\n|-----------|-------------|---------|\n| `-h, --host` | Server address | localhost |\n| `-p, --port` | Port | 8080 |\n| `-d, --duration` | Test duration | 30s |\n| `-u, --vus` | Virtual users | 10 |\n| `-r, --rps` | Target RPS | 100 |\n| `--rule` | Rule name to test | order_discount |\n| `--analyze` | Show CPU analysis | false |\n\n### Custom k6 Script\n\n```javascript\nimport http from ''k6/http'';\nimport { check } from ''k6'';\n\nexport const options = {\n    scenarios: {\n        constant_load: {\n            executor: ''constant-arrival-rate'',\n            rate: 100,\n            timeUnit: ''1s'',\n            duration: ''30s'',\n            preAllocatedVUs: 10,\n        },\n    },\n    thresholds: {\n        http_req_duration: [''p(95)<500'', ''p(99)<1000''],\n    },\n};\n\nexport default function() {\n    const url = ''http://localhost:8080/api/v1/execute/my-rule'';\n    const payload = JSON.stringify({\n        input: { value: Math.random() * 1000 }\n    });\n    \n    const response = http.post(url, payload, {\n        headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n    });\n    \n    check(response, {\n        ''status is 200'': (r) => r.status === 200,\n        ''response time < 100ms'': (r) => r.timings.duration < 100,\n    });\n}\n```\n\n## CI Configuration\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\nKey workflow file: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`\n\n```yaml\n# Test job\ntest:\n  runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n  strategy:\n    matrix:\n      os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]\n      rust: [stable, beta]\n  steps:\n    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n    - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@master\n      with:\n        toolchain: ${{ matrix.rust }}\n    - run: cargo test --all-features\n```\n\n### Local CI Simulation\n\n```bash\n# Format check\ncargo fmt --all -- --check\n\n# Clippy check\ncargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings\n\n# Test\ncargo test --all-features\n\n# Build\ncargo build --release\n```\n\n## Test Coverage\n\n```bash\n# Install tarpaulin\ncargo install cargo-tarpaulin\n\n# Generate coverage report\ncargo tarpaulin --out Html --output-dir coverage/\n\n# Or use llvm-cov\ncargo install cargo-llvm-cov\ncargo llvm-cov --html\n```\n\n## Frontend Testing\n\n```bash\ncd ordo-editor\n\n# Run tests\npnpm test\n\n# Run specific package tests\npnpm --filter @ordo-engine/editor-core test\n```\n\n## Key Files\n\n- `crates/ordo-core/benches/` - Rust benchmarks\n- `crates/ordo-server/tests/` - Server integration tests\n- `scripts/benchmark.sh` - k6 load test script\n- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` - CI configuration\n- `ordo-editor/packages/core/src/engine/__tests__/` - Frontend tests\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:05:58.591Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust-based AI Agents needing high-performance rule engine testing and benchmarking capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能规则引擎测试和基准测试能力的Rust-based AI Agents。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントが、高性能のルールエンジンテストとベンチマークテスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고성능 규칙 엔진 테스트 및 벤치마크 테스트 기능이 필요한 Rust 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Rust que necesitan capacidades de prueba y benchmarking de motores de reglas de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Rust nécessitant des capacités de test et de benchmarking de moteurs de règles haute performance.","de":"Perfekt für auf Rust basierende KI-Agents, die Hochleistungs-Regel-Engine-Test- und Benchmarking-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Rust que necessitam de capacidades de teste e benchmarking de motores de regras de alto desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, основанных на Rust, которые требуют высокопроизводительных возможностей тестирования и бенчмаркинга правил двигателя.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يستندون إلى Rust و الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات اختبار و قياس أداء محرك قواعد ذات أداء عالي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute and validate rules using a comprehensive test suite, leveraging Cargo for test execution and Rust for core logic, with features like parallel testing and specific test targeting.","zh":"赋予代理执行和验证规则的能力，使用全面测试套件，利用Cargo进行测试执行和Rust进行核心逻辑，具有并行测试和特定测试目标等功能。","ja":"エージェントがルールを実行および検証できるようにすることで、包括的なテストスイートを活用し、Cargoを使用してテストを実行し、Rustを使用してコアロジックを実現し、並列テストや特定のテストターゲットなどの機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 규칙을 실행하고 검증할 수 있도록 해주는 강력한 기능으로, 포괄적인 테스트 스위트를 활용하여 Cargo를 사용한 테스트 실행과 Rust를 사용한 코어 로직을 제공하며, 병렬 테스트 및 특정 테스트 대상과 같은 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar y validar reglas utilizando un conjunto de pruebas integral, aprovechando Cargo para la ejecución de pruebas y Rust para la lógica principal, con características como pruebas paralelas y targeting de pruebas específicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter et de valider des règles en utilisant un ensemble de tests complet, en exploitant Cargo pour l''exécution des tests et Rust pour la logique principale, avec des fonctionnalités comme les tests parallèles et la ciblerie de tests spécifiques.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Regeln auszuführen und zu validieren, indem sie ein umfassendes Testpaket verwenden, das Cargo für die Testausführung und Rust für die Kernlogik nutzt, mit Funktionen wie parallelen Tests und spezifischem Testtargeting.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar e validar regras usando um conjunto de testes abrangente, aproveitando o Cargo para execução de testes e o Rust para lógica central, com recursos como testes paralelos e direcionamento de testes específicos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять и проверять правила с помощью комплексного набора тестов, используя Cargo для выполнения тестов и Rust для основной логики, с функциями, такими как параллельное тестирование и целевое тестирование.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل و التحقق من القواعد باستخدام مجموعة شاملة من الاختبارات، وتحقيقاً لذلك من خلال استخدام Cargo لتشغيل الاختبارات و Rust للمنطق الأساسي، مع ميزات مثل الاختبارات الموازية و استهداف الاختبارات المحددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Running comprehensive unit tests for rule engines","Benchmarking rule execution performance","Debugging specific test cases with detailed output"],"zh":["运行规则引擎的综合单元测试","基准测试规则执行性能","使用详细输出调试特定测试用例"],"ja":["ルールエンジンの包括的なユニットテストを実行する","ルールの実行性能をベンチマークテストする","詳細な出力を使用して特定のテストケースをデバッグする"],"ko":["규칙 엔진의 포괄적인 유닛 테스트를 실행합니다","규칙 실행 성능을 벤치마크 테스트합니다","상세한 출력을 사용하여 특정 테스트 케이스를 디버깅합니다"],"es":["Ejecutar pruebas unitarias integrales para motores de reglas","Benchmarking del rendimiento de la ejecución de reglas","Depuración de casos de prueba específicos con salida detallada"],"fr":["Exécuter des tests unitaires complets pour les moteurs de règles","Benchmarking des performances d''exécution de règles","Débogage de cas de test spécifiques avec sortie détaillée"],"de":["Ausführen umfassender Unit-Tests für Regel-Engines","Benchmarking der Regel-Ausführungsleistung","Fehlerbehebung spezifischer Testfälle mit detaillierter Ausgabe"],"pt":["Execução de testes unitários abrangentes para motores de regras","Benchmarking do desempenho de execução de regras","Depuração de casos de teste específicos com saída detalhada"],"ru":["Выполнение комплексных юнит-тестов для двигателей правил","Бенчмаркинг производительности выполнения правил","Отладка конкретных тестовых случаев с подробным выводом"],"ar":["تشغيل اختبارات الوحدات الشاملة لمحركات القواعد","قياس أداء تشغيل القواعد","تصحيح أخطاء حالات الاختبار المحددة مع إخراج مفصل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust and Cargo installation","Limited to Rust-based projects","Dependent on ordo-core and ordo-server crates"],"zh":["需要Rust和Cargo安装","仅限于Rust-based项目","依赖于ordo-core和ordo-server crates"],"ja":["RustとCargoのインストールが必要","Rustベースのプロジェクトのみに限定","ordo-coreとordo-server cratesに依存"],"ko":["Rust 및 Cargo 설치가 필요합니다","Rust 기반 프로젝트에만 제한됨","ordo-core 및 ordo-server crates에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Rust y Cargo","Limitado a proyectos basados en Rust","Dependiente de los crates ordo-core y ordo-server"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Rust et de Cargo","Limité aux pro