tices vs otros herramientas de autenticación","instalación de better-auth-best-practices","guía de configuración de better-auth-best-practices","desarrollo de sitios web de finanzas personales con seguridad","herramientas de autenticación AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''authentification","qu''est-ce que l''authentification sécurisée","meilleures pratiques de sécurité pour les sites web","alternatives à better-auth-best-practices","better-auth-best-practices vs d''autres outils d''authentification","installation de better-auth-best-practices","guide de configuration de better-auth-best-practices","développement de sites web de finances personnelles avec sécurité","outils d''authentification AI pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man Authentifizierungstools verwendet","was ist sichere Authentifizierung","Best Practices für Sicherheit auf Websites","Alternativen zu better-auth-best-practices","better-auth-best-practices vs andere Authentifizierungstools","Installation von better-auth-best-practices","Konfigurationsanleitung für better-auth-best-practices","Entwicklung von Websites für persönliche Finanzen mit Sicherheit","AI-Authentifizierungstools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar autenticação de dois fatores","o que é autenticação","melhor auth alternative","autenticação vs autorização","instalar autenticação no react","guia de configuração de autenticação"],"ru":["как использовать двухфакторную аутентификацию","что такое аутентификация","лучший альтернативный аутентификатор","аутентификация vs авторизация","установка аутентификации в node js","руководство по настройке аутентификации"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام التأكيد من الذات بfactores اثنين","ما هو التأكيد من الذات","أفضل بديل للتأكيد من الذات","التأكيد من الذات مقابل السماح","تثبيت التأكيد من الذات في python","دليل إعداد التأكيد من الذات"]}},"owner":"PaulPio","repo":"financeFlow","repoPath":"PaulPio/financeFlow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.109Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"better-auth-best-practices","description":"Skill for integrating Better Auth - the comprehensive TypeScript authentication framework.","bodyPreview":"# Better Auth Integration Guide\n\n**Always consult [better-auth.com/docs](https://better-auth.com/docs) for code examples and latest API.**\n\nBetter Auth is a TypeScript-first, framework-agnostic auth framework supporting email/password, OAuth, magic links, passkeys, and more via plugins.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Environment Variables\n- `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` - Encryption secret (min 32 chars). Generate: `openssl rand -base64 32`\n- `BETTER_AUTH_URL` - Base URL (e.g., `https://example.com`)\n\nOnl","body":"# Better Auth Integration Guide\n\n**Always consult [better-auth.com/docs](https://better-auth.com/docs) for code examples and latest API.**\n\nBetter Auth is a TypeScript-first, framework-agnostic auth framework supporting email/password, OAuth, magic links, passkeys, and more via plugins.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Environment Variables\n- `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` - Encryption secret (min 32 chars). Generate: `openssl rand -base64 32`\n- `BETTER_AUTH_URL` - Base URL (e.g., `https://example.com`)\n\nOnly define `baseURL`/`secret` in config if env vars are NOT set.\n\n### File Location\nCLI looks for `auth.ts` in: `./`, `./lib`, `./utils`, or under `./src`. Use `--config` for custom path.\n\n### CLI Commands\n- `npx @better-auth/cli@latest migrate` - Apply schema (built-in adapter)\n- `npx @better-auth/cli@latest generate` - Generate schema for Prisma/Drizzle\n- `npx @better-auth/cli mcp --cursor` - Add MCP to AI tools\n\n**Re-run after adding/changing plugins.**\n\n---\n\n## Core Config Options\n\n| Option | Notes |\n|--------|-------|\n| `appName` | Optional display name |\n| `baseURL` | Only if `BETTER_AUTH_URL` not set |\n| `basePath` | Default `/api/auth`. Set `/` for root. |\n| `secret` | Only if `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` not set |\n| `database` | Required for most features. See adapters docs. |\n| `secondaryStorage` | Redis/KV for sessions & rate limits |\n| `emailAndPassword` | `{ enabled: true }` to activate |\n| `socialProviders` | `{ google: { clientId, clientSecret }, ... }` |\n| `plugins` | Array of plugins |\n| `trustedOrigins` | CSRF whitelist |\n\n---\n\n## Database\n\n**Direct connections:** Pass `pg.Pool`, `mysql2` pool, `better-sqlite3`, or `bun:sqlite` instance.\n\n**ORM adapters:** Import from `better-auth/adapters/drizzle`, `better-auth/adapters/prisma`, `better-auth/adapters/mongodb`.\n\n**Critical:** Better Auth uses adapter model names, NOT underlying table names. If Prisma model is `User` mapping to table `users`, use `modelName: \"user\"` (Prisma reference), not `\"users\"`.\n\n---\n\n## Session Management\n\n**Storage priority:**\n1. If `secondaryStorage` defined → sessions go there (not DB)\n2. Set `session.storeSessionInDatabase: true` to also persist to DB\n3. No database + `cookieCache` → fully stateless mode\n\n**Cookie cache strategies:**\n- `compact` (default) - Base64url + HMAC. Smallest.\n- `jwt` - Standard JWT. Readable but signed.\n- `jwe` - Encrypted. Maximum security.\n\n**Key options:** `session.expiresIn` (default 7 days), `session.updateAge` (refresh interval), `session.cookieCache.maxAge`, `session.cookieCache.version` (change to invalidate all sessions).\n\n---\n\n## User & Account Config\n\n**User:** `user.modelName`, `user.fields` (column mapping), `user.additionalFields`, `user.changeEmail.enabled` (disabled by default), `user.deleteUser.enabled` (disabled by default).\n\n**Account:** `account.modelName`, `account.accountLinking.enabled`, `account.storeAccountCookie` (for stateless OAuth).\n\n**Required for registration:** `email` and `name` fields.\n\n---\n\n## Email Flows\n\n- `emailVerification.sendVerificationEmail` - Must be defined for verification to work\n- `emailVerification.sendOnSignUp` / `sendOnSignIn` - Auto-send triggers\n- `emailAndPassword.sendResetPassword` - Password reset email handler\n\n---\n\n## Security\n\n**In `advanced`:**\n- `useSecureCookies` - Force HTTPS cookies\n- `disableCSRFCheck` - ⚠️ Security risk\n- `disableOriginCheck` - ⚠️ Security risk  \n- `crossSubDomainCookies.enabled` - Share cookies across subdomains\n- `ipAddress.ipAddressHeaders` - Custom IP headers for proxies\n- `database.generateId` - Custom ID generation or `\"serial\"`/`\"uuid\"`/`false`\n\n**Rate limiting:** `rateLimit.enabled`, `rateLimit.window`, `rateLimit.max`, `rateLimit.storage` (\"memory\" | \"database\" | \"secondary-storage\").\n\n---\n\n## Hooks\n\n**Endpoint hooks:** `hooks.before` / `hooks.after` - Array of `{ matcher, handler }`. Use `createAuthMiddleware`. Access `ctx.path`, `ctx.context.returned` (after), `ctx.context.session`.\n\n**Database hooks:** `databaseHooks.user.create.before/after`, same for `session`, `account`. Useful for adding default values or post-creation actions.\n\n**Hook context (`ctx.context`):** `session`, `secret`, `authCookies`, `password.hash()`/`verify()`, `adapter`, `internalAdapter`, `generateId()`, `tables`, `baseURL`.\n\n---\n\n## Plugins\n\n**Import from dedicated paths for tree-shaking:**\n```\nimport { twoFactor } from \"better-auth/plugins/two-factor\"\n```\nNOT `from \"better-auth/plugins\"`.\n\n**Popular plugins:** `twoFactor`, `organization`, `passkey`, `magicLink`, `emailOtp`, `username`, `phoneNumber`, `admin`, `apiKey`, `bearer`, `jwt`, `multiSession`, `sso`, `oauthProvider`, `oidcProvider`, `openAPI`, `genericOAuth`.\n\nClient plugins go in `createAuthClient({ plugins: [...] })`.\n\n---\n\n## Client\n\nImport from: `better-auth/client` (vanilla), `better-auth/react`, `better-auth/vue`, `better-auth/svelte`, `better-auth/solid`.\n\nKey methods: `signUp.email()`, `signIn.email()`, `signIn.social()`, `signOut()`, `useSession()`, `getSession()`, `revokeSession()`, `revokeSessions()`.\n\n---\n\n## Type Safety\n\nInfer types: `typeof auth.$Infer.Session`, `typeof auth.$Infer.Session.user`.\n\nFor separate client/server projects: `createAuthClient<typeof auth>()`.\n\n---\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n1. **Model vs table name** - Config uses ORM model name, not DB table name\n2. **Plugin schema** - Re-run CLI after adding plugins\n3. **Secondary storage** - Sessions go there by default, not DB\n4. **Cookie cache** - Custom session fields NOT cached, always re-fetched\n5. **Stateless mode** - No DB = session in cookie only, logout on cache expiry\n6. **Change email flow** - Sends to current email first, then new email\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Docs](https://better-auth.com/docs)\n- [Options Reference](https://better-auth.com/docs/reference/options)\n- [LLMs.txt](https://better-auth.com/llms.txt)\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth)\n- [Init Options Source](https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/blob/main/packages/core/src/types/init-options.ts)"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:36:37.399Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security-focused Agents requiring robust authentication and authorization capabilities with TypeScript and framework-agnostic support","zh":"适用于需要强大的身份验证和授权能力的安全专注代理，支持TypeScript和框架无关的支持","ja":"セキュリティに焦点を当てたエージェントがTypeScriptとフレームワーク非依存のサポートを必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"강력한 인증 및 인가 기능이 필요한 보안 중심 에이전트에게 적합하며 TypeScript 및 프레임워크 독립 지원을 제공합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes con enfoque en seguridad que requieren capacidades de autenticación y autorización robustas con TypeScript y soporte agnóstico de framework","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur la sécurité nécessitant des capacités d''authentification et d''autorisation robustes avec TypeScript et une prise en charge agnostique de framework","de":"Ideal für sicherheitsorientierte Agenten, die robuste Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsfunktionen mit TypeScript und framework-unabhängiger Unterstützung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes focados em Segurança que exigem capacidades robustas de autenticação e autorização com TypeScript e suporte agnóstico de framework","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на безопасность, требующих надежных возможностей аутентификации и авторизации с помощью TypeScript и фреймворка-независимой поддержки","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتخصصين في الأمان الذين يتطلبون قدرات تأكيد وتصريح قوية مع TypeScript ودعم عام ل_framework"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure authentication via email/password, OAuth, magic links, and passkeys, leveraging plugins and a TypeScript-first approach, while utilizing environment variables like BETTER_AUTH_SECRET and BETTER_AUTH_URL for configuration","zh":"赋予代理实现通过电子邮件/密码、OAuth、魔术链接和密钥等方式进行安全身份验证的能力，利用插件和TypeScript优先方法，同时利用环境变量如BETTER_AUTH_SECRET和BETTER_AUTH_URL进行配置","ja":"エージェントは、メール/パスワード、OAuth、マジックリンク、パスキーなどの方法でセキュアな認証を実装できます。プラグインとTypeScriptを優先したアプローチを使用し、環境変数BETTER_AUTH_SECRETとBETTER_AUTH_URLを使用して構成します","ko":"에이전트가 이메일/비밀번호, OAuth, 마법 링크 및 패스키 등을 통해 보안 인증을 구현할 수 있도록 합니다. 플러그인 및 TypeScript 우선 접근 방식을 사용하며 환경 변수 BETTER_AUTH_SECRET 및 BETTER_AUTH_URL를 사용하여 구성합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una autenticación segura a través de correo electrónico/contraseña, OAuth, enlaces mágicos y passkeys, aprovechando plugins y un enfoque de TypeScript, mientras utiliza variables de entorno como BETTER_AUTH_SECRET y BETTER_AUTH_URL para la configuración","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une authentification sécurisée via e-mail/mot de passe, OAuth, liens magiques et passkeys, en exploitant les plugins et une approche TypeScript, tout en utilisant des variables d''environnement comme BETTER_AUTH_SECRET et BETTER_AUTH_URL pour la configuration","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, eine sichere Authentifizierung über E-Mail/Passwort, OAuth, Magische Links und Passkeys zu implementieren, indem sie Plugins und einen TypeScript-First-Ansatz nutzen und Umgebungsvariablen wie BETTER_AUTH_SECRET und BETTER_AUTH_URL für die Konfiguration verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar autenticação segura via email/senha, OAuth, links mágicos e chaves, aproveitando plugins e uma abordagem TypeScript-first, enquanto utiliza variáveis de ambiente como BETTER_AUTH_SECRET e BETTER_AUTH_URL para configuração","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовать безопасную аутентификацию через электронную почту/пароль, OAuth, магические ссылки и ключи, используя плагины и подход TypeScript-first, а также использует переменные среды, такие как BETTER_AUTH_SECRET и BETTER_AUTH_URL, для конфигурации","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ تأكيد آمن عبر البريد الإلكتروني/كلمة المرور، OAuth، وصلات سحرية ومفاتيح، مع الاستفادة من الإضافات ومنهجية TypeScript-first، بينما يستخدم متغيرات بيئية مثل BETTER_AUTH_SECRET و BETTER_AUTH_URL للتهيئة"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing multi-factor authentication with passkeys","Configuring OAuth flows for social media integrations","Generating secure encryption secrets using OpenSSL"],"zh":["使用密钥实现多因素身份验证","配置OAuth流程以用于社交媒体集成","使用OpenSSL生成安全加密密钥"],"ja":["パスキーを使用したマルチファクタ認証の実装","ソーシャルメディア統合用のOAuthフローの構成","OpenSSLを使用したセキュアな暗号化シークレットの生成"],"ko":["패스키를 사용한 다단계 인증 구현","소셜 미디어 통합을 위한 OAuth 흐름 구성","OpenSSL을 사용한 보안 암호화 시크릿 생성"],"es":["Implementar la autenticación de múltiples factores con passkeys","Configurar flujos de OAuth para integraciones de redes sociales","Generar secretos de cifrado seguros utilizando OpenSSL"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une authentification à plusieurs facteurs avec des passkeys","Configurer les flux OAuth pour les intégrations de réseaux sociaux","Générer des secrets de chiffrement sécurisés en utilisant OpenSSL"],"de":["Implementierung der Authentifizierung mit mehreren Faktoren mit Passkeys","Konfigurieren von OAuth-Flows für soziale Medien-Integrationen","Erzeugen sicherer Verschlüsselungsgeheimnisse unter Verwendung von OpenSSL"],"pt":["Implementar autenticação de vários fatores com chaves","Configurar fluxos OAuth para integrações de mídia social","Gerar segredos de criptografia seguros usando OpenSSL"],"ru":["Реализация аутентификации с несколькими факторами с помощью ключей","Настройка