endências","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Suporte a CLI","Otimização do processo de codificação"],"ru":["Управление зависимостями","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Поддержка CLI","Оптимизация процесса кодирования"],"ar":["إدارة التبعيات","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","دعم CLI","تحسين عملية البرمجة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["vx-usage 教程","vx-usage 安装","vx-usage 使用方法","vx-usage 替代品","vx-usage 和 Jenkins","vx-usage 安装指南","vx-usage 设置教程","vx-usage 优化","vx-usage 开发工具管理"],"ja":["vx-usage チュートリアル","vx-usage インストール","vx-usage 使い方","vx-usage の代替","vx-usage と Jenkins","vx-usage インストールガイド","vx-usage 設定チュートリアル","vx-usage 最適化","vx-usage 開発ツール管理"],"ko":["vx-usage 튜토리얼","vx-usage 설치","vx-usage 사용법","vx-usage 대체품","vx-usage와 Jenkins","vx-usage 설치 가이드","vx-usage 설정 튜토리얼","vx-usage 최적화","vx-usage 개발 도구 관리"],"es":["cómo utilizar vx-usage","qué es vx-usage","alternativas a vx-usage","vx-usage vs otras herramientas","instalación de vx-usage","guía de configuración de vx-usage","desarrollo de software con vx-usage"],"fr":["comment utiliser vx-usage","qu''est-ce que vx-usage","alternatives à vx-usage","vx-usage vs autres outils","installation de vx-usage","guide de configuration de vx-usage","développement de logiciels avec vx-usage"],"de":["wie man vx-usage verwendet","was ist vx-usage","alternativen zu vx-usage","vx-usage vs andere tools","installation von vx-usage","konfigurationsanleitung für vx-usage","softwareentwicklung mit vx-usage"],"pt":["como usar vx-usage","o que é vx-usage","vx-usage alternativa","vx-usage vs npm","instalar vx-usage","guia de configuração do vx-usage"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты vx-usage","что такое ИИ Агенты vx-usage","ИИ Агенты vx-usage альтернатива","ИИ Агенты vx-usage vs npm","установить ИИ Агенты vx-usage","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов vx-usage"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام vx-usage","ما هو vx-usage","بديل vx-usage","vx-usage مقابل npm","تثبيت vx-usage","دليل إعداد vx-usage"]}},"owner":"loonghao","repo":"vx","repoPath":"loonghao/vx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.127Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vx-usage","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# VX - Universal Development Tool Manager\n\nvx is a universal development tool manager that automatically installs and manages\ndevelopment tools (Node.js, Python/uv, Go, Rust, etc.) with zero configuration.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nInstead of requiring users to manually install tools, prefix any command with `vx`:\n\n```bash\nvx node --version      # Auto-installs Node.js if needed\nvx uv pip install x    # Auto-installs uv if needed\nvx go build .          # Auto-installs Go if needed\nvx cargo build","body":"# VX - Universal Development Tool Manager\n\nvx is a universal development tool manager that automatically installs and manages\ndevelopment tools (Node.js, Python/uv, Go, Rust, etc.) with zero configuration.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nInstead of requiring users to manually install tools, prefix any command with `vx`:\n\n```bash\nvx node --version      # Auto-installs Node.js if needed\nvx uv pip install x    # Auto-installs uv if needed\nvx go build .          # Auto-installs Go if needed\nvx cargo build         # Auto-installs Rust if needed\nvx just test           # Auto-installs just if needed\n```\n\nvx is fully transparent - same commands, same arguments, just add `vx` prefix.\n\n## Essential Commands\n\n### Tool Execution (most common)\n```bash\nvx <tool> [args...]           # Run any tool (auto-installs if missing)\nvx node app.js                # Run Node.js\nvx python script.py           # Run Python (via uv)\nvx npm install                # Run npm\nvx npx create-react-app app   # Run npx\nvx cargo test                 # Run cargo\nvx just build                 # Run just (task runner)\nvx git status                 # Run git\n```\n\n### Tool Management\n```bash\nvx install node@22            # Install specific version\nvx install uv go rust         # Install multiple tools at once\nvx list                       # List all available tools\nvx list --installed           # List installed tools only\nvx versions node              # Show available versions\nvx switch node@20             # Switch active version\nvx uninstall go@1.21          # Remove a version\n```\n\n### Project Management\n```bash\nvx init                       # Initialize vx.toml for project\nvx sync                       # Install all tools from vx.toml\nvx setup                      # Full project setup (sync + hooks)\nvx dev                        # Enter dev environment with all tools\nvx run test                   # Run project scripts from vx.toml\nvx check                      # Verify tool constraints\nvx lock                       # Generate vx.lock for reproducibility\n```\n\n### Environment & Config\n```bash\nvx env list                   # List environments\nvx config show                # Show configuration\nvx cache info                 # Show cache usage\nvx search <query>             # Search available tools\nvx info                       # System info and capabilities\n```\n\n## Project Configuration (vx.toml)\n\nProjects use `vx.toml` in the root directory:\n\n```toml\n[tools]\nnode = \"22\"         # Major version\ngo = \"1.22\"         # Minor version\nuv = \"latest\"       # Always latest\nrust = \"1.80\"       # Specific version\njust = \"*\"          # Any version\n\n[scripts]\ndev = \"npm run dev\"\ntest = \"cargo test\"\nlint = \"npm run lint && cargo clippy\"\nbuild = \"just build\"\n\n[hooks]\npre_commit = [\"vx run lint\"]\npost_setup = [\"npm install\"]\n```\n\n## Using `--with` for Multi-Runtime\n\nWhen a command needs additional runtimes available:\n\n```bash\nvx --with bun node app.js     # Node.js + Bun in PATH\nvx --with deno npm test        # npm + Deno available\n```\n\n## Supported Tools (50+)\n\n| Category | Tools |\n|----------|-------|\n| JavaScript | node, npm, npx, bun, deno, pnpm, yarn, vite |\n| Python | uv, uvx, python, pip |\n| Rust | cargo, rustc, rustup |\n| Go | go, gofmt |\n| System | git, just, jq, cmake, make, ninja, meson |\n| Cloud | docker, kubectl, helm, awscli, azcli, gcloud, terraform |\n| .NET | dotnet, msbuild, nuget |\n| Other | zig, java, protoc, ffmpeg, gh, ollama, dagu, skills |\n\n## Important Rules for AI Agents\n\n1. **Always use `vx` prefix** when running tools in vx-managed projects\n2. **Use `vx just`** instead of `just` for task runner commands\n3. **Use `vx npm`** instead of `npm` directly\n4. **Use `vx cargo`** instead of `cargo` directly\n5. **Check `vx.toml`** first to understand project tool requirements\n6. **Use `vx run <script>`** for project-defined scripts\n7. **Never suggest manual tool installation** - vx handles it automatically\n8. Commands like `vx install` are for explicit pre-installation; normal usage auto-installs\n\n## GitHub Actions Integration\n\nvx provides a GitHub Action (`action.yml`) for CI/CD workflows. Use it in `.github/workflows/` files:\n\n### Basic Usage\n\n```yaml\n- uses: loonghao/vx@main\n  with:\n    version: ''latest''           # vx version (default: latest)\n    github-token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n```\n\n### Pre-install Tools\n\n```yaml\n- uses: loonghao/vx@main\n  with:\n    tools: ''node go uv''         # Space-separated tools to pre-install\n    cache: ''true''               # Enable tool caching (default: true)\n```\n\n### Project Setup (vx.toml)\n\n```yaml\n- uses: loonghao/vx@main\n  with:\n    setup: ''true''               # Run `vx setup --ci` for vx.toml projects\n```\n\n### Full Example\n\n```yaml\nname: CI\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n\n      - uses: loonghao/vx@main\n        with:\n          tools: ''node@22 uv''\n          setup: ''true''\n          cache: ''true''\n\n      - run: vx node --version\n      - run: vx npm test\n```\n\n### Action Inputs\n\n| Input | Default | Description |\n|-------|---------|-------------|\n| `version` | `latest` | vx version to install |\n| `github-token` | `${{ github.token }}` | GitHub token for API requests |\n| `tools` | `''''` | Space-separated tools to pre-install |\n| `cache` | `true` | Enable caching of ~/.vx directory |\n| `cache-key-prefix` | `vx-tools` | Custom prefix for cache key |\n| `setup` | `false` | Run `vx setup --ci` for vx.toml projects |\n\n### Action Outputs\n\n| Output | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `version` | The installed vx version |\n| `cache-hit` | Whether the cache was hit |\n\n## Docker Support\n\nvx provides a Docker image for containerized workflows:\n\n```dockerfile\n# Use vx as base image\nFROM ghcr.io/loonghao/vx:latest\n\n# Tools are auto-installed on first use\nRUN vx node --version\nRUN vx uv pip install mypackage\n```\n\n### Multi-stage Build with vx\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM ghcr.io/loonghao/vx:latest AS builder\nRUN vx node --version && vx npm ci && vx npm run build\n\nFROM nginx:alpine\nCOPY --from=builder /home/vx/dist /usr/share/nginx/html\n```\n\n### GitHub Actions with Docker\n\n```yaml\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    container:\n      image: ghcr.io/loonghao/vx:latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n      - run: vx node --version\n      - run: vx npm test\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:41:22.425Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing zero-configuration development tool management.","zh":"非常适合需要零配置开发工具管理的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが零構成の開発ツール管理を行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 제로 구성 개발 도구 관리가 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de herramientas de desarrollo sin configuración.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion d''outils de développement sans configuration.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine Entwicklungstool-Verwaltung ohne Konfiguration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de gerenciamento de ferramentas de desenvolvimento sem configuração.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима управление инструментами разработки без настройки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى أداة إدارة تطوير بدون إعداد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automatically install and manage development tools like Node.js, Python/uv, Go, and Rust, using protocols like `vx node --version` and file formats like `.bashrc`.","zh":"赋予代理自动安装和管理像 Node.js、Python/uv、Go 和 Rust 这样的开发工具的能力，使用像 `vx node --version` 的协议和像 `.bashrc` 的文件格式。","ja":"エージェントが Node.js、Python/uv、Go、Rust などの開発ツールを自動的にインストールして管理することを可能にします。プロトコルとして `vx node --version`、ファイル形式として `.bashrc` を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Node.js, Python/uv, Go, Rust와 같은 개발 도구를 자동으로 설치하고 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. `vx node --version`와 같은 프로토콜 및 `.bashrc`와 같은 파일 형식을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a instalar y gestionar automáticamente herramientas de desarrollo como Node.js, Python/uv, Go y Rust, utilizando protocolos como `vx node --version` y formatos de archivo como `.bashrc`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''installer et de gérer automatiquement des outils de développement comme Node.js, Python/uv, Go et Rust, en utilisant des protocoles comme `vx node --version` et des formats de fichiers comme `.bashrc`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Entwicklungstools wie Node.js, Python/uv, Go und Rust automatisch zu installieren und zu verwalten, indem Protokolle wie `vx node --version` und Dateiformate wie `.bashrc` verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a instalar e gerenciar automaticamente ferramentas de desenvolvimento como Node.js, Python/uv, Go e Rust, usando protocolos como `vx node --version` e formatos de arquivo como `.bashrc`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически устанавливать и управлять инструментами разработки, такими как Node.js, Python/uv, Go и Rust, используя протоколы, такие как `vx node --version` и форматы файлов, такие как `.bashrc`.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تثبيت أدوات التطوير وتشغيلها تلقائيا مثل Node.js، Python/uv، Go، و Rust، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل `vx node --version` وتنسيقات الملفات مثل `.bashrc`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating development tool installations for various projects","Generating and managing development environments for teams","Debugging and troubleshooting development tool issues using `vx`"],"zh":["自动化各种项目的开发工具安装","为团队生成和管理开发环境","使用 `vx` 调试和排除开发工具问题"],"ja":["プロジェクトごとの開発ツールのインストールを自動化する","チームの開発環境を生成して管理する","開発ツールの問題を `vx` でデバッグしてトラブルシューティングする"],"ko":["さまざま한 프로젝트의 개발 도구 설치를 자동화하는 것","팀의 개발 환경을 생성하고 관리하는 것","개발 도구의 문제를 `vx`로 디버깅하고 트러블슈팅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las instalaciones de herramientas de desarrollo para varios proyectos","Generar y gestionar entornos de desarrollo para equipos","Depurar y solucionar problemas de herramientas de desarrollo utilizando `vx`"],"fr":["Automatiser les installations d''outils de développement pour divers projets","Générer et gérer des environnements de développement pour les équipes","Déboguer et résoudre les problèmes d''outils de développement en utilisant `vx`"],"de":["Automatisieren der Installation von Entwicklungstools für verschiedene Projekte","Erstellen und Verwalten von Entwicklungsumgebungen für Teams","Fehlerbehebung und Troubleshooting von Entwicklungstool-Problemen mit `vx`"],"pt":["Automatizar a instalação de ferramentas de desenvolvimento para vários projetos","Gerar e gerenciar ambientes de desenvolvimento para equipes","Depurar e solucionar problemas de ferramentas de desenvolvimento usando `vx`"],"ru":["Автоматизация установки инструментов разработки для различных проектов","Генерация и управление средами разработки для команд","Отладка и устранение неполадок инструментов разработки с помощью `vx`"],"ar":["أتمتة تثبيت أدوات التطوير لمختلف المشاريع","إنشاء وتشغيل بيئات التطوير للفرق","تصحيح الأخطاء ومعالجة مشاكل أدوات التطوير باستخدام `vx`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shell access","Limited to supported development tools like Node.js, Python/uv, Go, and Rust"],"zh":["需要 shell 访问","仅限支持的开发工具，如 Node.js、Python/uv、Go 和 Rust"],"ja":["シェルアクセスが必要","サポートされている開発ツール（Node.js、Python/uv、Go、Rust など）に限定される"],"ko":["쉘 액세스가 필요","지원되는 개발 도구(Node.js, Python/uv, Go, Rust 등)에 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la shell","Limitado a herramientas de desarrollo admitidas como Node.js, Python/uv, Go y Rust"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la shell","Limité aux outils de développement pris en charge comme Node.js, Python/uv, Go et Rust"],"de":["Benötigt Shell-Zugriff","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Entwicklungstools wie Node.js, Python/uv, Go und Rust"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao shell","Limitado a ferramentas de desenvolvimento compatíveis como Node.js, Python/uv, Go e Rust"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к оболочке","Ограничен поддерживаемыми инструментами разработки, такими как Node.js, Python/uv, Go и Rust"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى Shell","محدود بالأدوات المتوافقة مثل Node.js، Python/uv، Go، و Rust"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"eeb6c7950d24461d1be3ab5416c9114468568256ae5349d1afb3f61aa51b3408","qualityScore":40}');
