solid"},"description":{"zh":"Shadcn registry 是一个为 SolidJS 提供的注册库，帮助开发者从 React 迁移。它提供了简洁的 API 和高效的开发体验。","ja":"Shadcn レジストリは SolidJS 用のレジストリライブラリで、React からの移行を支援します。シンプルな API と効率的な開発体験を提供します。","ko":"Shadcn 등록은 SolidJS를 위한 등록 라이브러리로서 React에서 마이그레이션하는 것을 지원합니다. 간결한 API와 효율적인 개발 경험을 제공합니다.","es":"El registro de Shadcn para SolidJS es una herramienta de inteligencia artificial que mejora la productividad de los desarrolladores de React","fr":"Le registre de Shadcn pour SolidJS est un outil d''intelligence artificielle qui améliore la productivité des développeurs de React","de":"Das Shadcn-Register für SolidJS ist ein KI-Tool, das die Produktivität von React-Entwicklern verbessert","pt":"O react-to-solid é um registry Shadcn para SolidJS, permitindo que os desenvolvedores criem aplicações mais eficientes","ru":"React-to-solid - это реестр Shadcn для SolidJS, позволяющий разработчикам создавать более эффективные приложения","ar":"react-to-solid هو سجل Shadcn ل SolidJS، مما يسمح للمطورين بإنشاء تطبيقات أكثر كفاءة","en":"Shadcn registry for SolidJS"},"definition":{"en":"Shadcn registry for SolidJS"},"features":{"zh":["支持从 React 到 SolidJS 的无缝迁移","提供简洁的 API 和高效的开发体验","兼容 shadcn-ui 和 SolidJS","易于集成和扩展","提高开发效率和生产力"],"ja":["React から SolidJS へのシームレスな移行をサポート","シンプルな API と効率的な開発体験を提供","shadcn-ui と SolidJS に対応","簡単な統合と拡張","開発効率と生産性を高める"],"ko":["React에서 SolidJS로의 무결점 마이그레이션 지원","간결한 API와 효율적인 개발 경험 제공","shadcn-ui와 SolidJS와의 호환","쉽게 통합하고 확장할 수 있음","개발 효율성과 생산성을 높임"],"es":["Registro de Shadcn para SolidJS","Mejora de la productividad de los desarrolladores de React","Integración con herramientas de inteligencia artificial","Facilidad de uso y configuración","Compatibilidad con proyectos de React existentes"],"fr":["Registre de Shadcn pour SolidJS","Amélioration de la productivité des développeurs de React","Intégration avec des outils d''intelligence artificielle","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration","Compatibilité avec les projets de React existants"],"de":["Shadcn-Register für SolidJS","Verbesserung der Produktivität von React-Entwicklern","Integration mit KI-Tools","Einfache Bedienung und Konfiguration","Kompatibilität mit bestehenden React-Projekten"],"pt":["Registry Shadcn para SolidJS","Criação de aplicações mais eficientes","Integração com shadcn-ui","Suporte ao framework SolidJS","Desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis"],"ru":["Реестр Shadcn для SolidJS","Создание более эффективных приложений","Интеграция с shadcn-ui","Поддержка фреймворка SolidJS","Разработка масштабируемых приложений"],"ar":["سجل Shadcn ل SolidJS","إنشاء تطبيقات أكثر كفاءة","التكامل مع shadcn-ui","دعم إطار العمل SolidJS","تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Shadcn registry","React 到 SolidJS 的迁移","Shadcn registry 介绍","SolidJS 开发工具","React 和 SolidJS 的区别","Shadcn registry 安装","Shadcn registry 教程"],"ja":["Shadcn レジストリの使い方","React から SolidJS への移行","Shadcn レジストリの紹介","SolidJS 開発ツール","React と SolidJS の違い","Shadcn レジストリのインストール","Shadcn レジストリのチュートリアル"],"ko":["Shadcn 등록의 사용 방법","React에서 SolidJS로의 마이그레이션","Shadcn 등록 소개","SolidJS 개발 도구","React와 SolidJS의 차이","Shadcn 등록 설치","Shadcn 등록 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial para React","registro de Shadcn para SolidJS","desarrollo de aplicaciones de React","mejora de la productividad de los desarrolladores","integración con herramientas de inteligencia artificial","react-to-solid vs otros registros","cómo instalar react-to-solid","guía de configuración de react-to-solid"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle pour React","registre de Shadcn pour SolidJS","développement d''applications de React","amélioration de la productivité des développeurs","intégration avec des outils d''intelligence artificielle","react-to-solid vs autres registres","comment installer react-to-solid","guide de configuration de react-to-solid"],"de":["KI-Tools für React","Shadcn-Register für SolidJS","Entwicklung von React-Anwendungen","Verbesserung der Produktivität von Entwicklern","Integration mit KI-Tools","react-to-solid vs andere Register","wie man react-to-solid installiert","Konfigurationsanleitung für react-to-solid"],"pt":["react-to-solid","SolidJS","shadcn-ui","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de aplicações","como usar react-to-solid","o que é react-to-solid","react-to-solid vs outros frameworks","instalar react-to-solid","guia de configuração do react-to-solid"],"ru":["react-to-solid","SolidJS","shadcn-ui","ИИ инструменты","разработка приложений","как использовать react-to-solid","что такое react-to-solid","react-to-solid vs другие фреймворки","установить react-to-solid","руководство по настройке react-to-solid"],"ar":["react-to-solid","SolidJS","shadcn-ui","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير التطبيقات","كيفية استخدام react-to-solid","ما هو react-to-solid","react-to-solid مقابل إطارات العمل الأخرى","تثبيت react-to-solid","دليل إعداد react-to-solid"]}},"owner":"carere","repo":"zaidan","repoPath":"carere/zaidan","stars":45,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T23:00:52Z","topics":["shadcn-ui","solidjs"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-to-solid","description":"Core transformation engine for React-to-SolidJS conversion. Contains React-to-SolidJS mapping tables, Base UI to Kobalte/Corvu mapping, and third-party dependency mapping. Provides transformation rules as reusable context.","bodyPreview":"# React-to-SolidJS Transformation Rules\n\nSingle source of truth for all React-to-SolidJS transformations in the Zaidan project. This is a KNOWLEDGE skill -- it provides transformation rules as reusable context. Agents reference these tables when converting React components to SolidJS equivalents.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: This skill is a **knowledge resource**. It does NOT perform transformations itself. Instead, it provides the necessary rules and mappings that other transformation agents will reference","body":"# React-to-SolidJS Transformation Rules\n\nSingle source of truth for all React-to-SolidJS transformations in the Zaidan project. This is a KNOWLEDGE skill -- it provides transformation rules as reusable context. Agents reference these tables when converting React components to SolidJS equivalents.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: This skill is a **knowledge resource**. It does NOT perform transformations itself. Instead, it provides the necessary rules and mappings that other transformation agents will reference when executing conversions. If user call it manually, explain what this skill covers and redirect user to the agents that will use this skill, then stop. \n\n## React-to-SolidJS Transformation Rules\n\n| Aspect | React (shadcn) | SolidJS (Zaidan) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Class attribute | `className` | `class` |\n| Class prop type | `className?: string` | `class?: string` |\n| Props destructuring | `{ className, ...props }` | `splitProps(props, [\"class\"])` |\n| Spread props | `{...props}` | `{...others}` after splitProps |\n| Default props | Destructure defaults `{ x = 5 }` | `mergeProps({ x: 5 }, props)` |\n| Conditional rendering | `{condition && <El />}` | `<Show when={condition}><El /></Show>` |\n| List rendering | `{items.map(x => ...)}` | `<For each={items}>{x => ...}</For>` |\n| Primitive library | `@base-ui/react-*` | `@kobalte/core/*` |\n| Polymorphic | `asChild` prop | `as` prop with `PolymorphicProps` |\n| Refs | `forwardRef` wrapper | Remove (not needed in SolidJS) |\n| Children type | `React.ReactNode` | `JSX.Element` |\n| Component type | `React.ComponentProps<\"div\">` | `ComponentProps<\"div\">` |\n| Event target | `e.target.value` | `e.currentTarget.value` |\n| Utils import | `@/registry/bases/base/lib/utils` | `@/lib/utils` |\n\n### Import Transformations\n\n```tsx\n// REMOVE (React):\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"base-ui\"\nimport * as DialogPrimitive from \"@base-ui/react/dialog\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/registry/bases/base/lib/utils\"\n\n// ADD (SolidJS):\nimport type { ComponentProps, JSX, ValidComponent } from \"solid-js\"\nimport { splitProps, mergeProps, Show, For } from \"solid-js\"\nimport * as DialogPrimitive from \"@kobalte/core/dialog\"\nimport type { PolymorphicProps } from \"@kobalte/core/polymorphic\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n```\n\n## Advanced Transformation Patterns\n\n### Component Part Patterns WITHOUT Kobalte/Corvu Primitive\n\nWhen a component part does NOT use a Kobalte or Corvu primitive, use this pattern:\n\n```tsx\ntype ComponentPartProps = ComponentProps<\"<html_element>\">\n\nconst ComponentPart = (props: ComponentPartProps) => {\n  const mergedProps = mergeProps({ aProp: \"default\" } as ComponentPartProps, props);\n  const [local, others] = splitProps(mergedProps, [\"aProp\"]);\n  return <html_element aProp={local.aProp} {...others} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Component Part Patterns WITH Kobalte/Corvu Primitive\n\nWhen a component part uses a Kobalte or Corvu primitive, use polymorphic typing:\n\n```tsx\nimport * as Primitive from \"@kobalte/core/primitive\";\n\ntype ComponentPartProps<T extends ValidComponent = \"<html_element>\"> =\n  PolymorphicProps<T, Primitive.PrimitivePartProps<T>> &\n  Pick<ComponentProps<\"<html_element>\">, \"aProp\">;\n\nconst ComponentPart = <T extends ValidComponent = \"<html_element>\">(\n  props: ComponentPartProps<T>\n) => {\n  const mergedProps = mergeProps(\n    { aProp: \"default\" } as ComponentPartProps<T>,\n    props as ComponentPartProps<T>\n  );\n  const [local, others] = splitProps(mergedProps, [\"aProp\"]);\n  return <Primitive.Root aProp={local.aProp} {...others} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Reading Kobalte Documentation\n\nWhen consulting Kobalte docs at `https://kobalte.dev/docs/core/components/<component-name>`:\n\n- **Anatomy Section**: Lists all `ComponentPart` elements and how to combine them\n- **Rendered Elements Section**: Check the \"Default rendered element\" column:\n  - If starts with a capital letter -> no primitive used (e.g., a Kobalte sub-component)\n  - If `none` -> no primitive used (wrapper/context provider)\n  - Otherwise -> native HTML element (e.g., `div`, `button`, `h3`)\n- **API Reference**: Props, data attributes, CSS variables for each part\n- **CSS Variables**: Kobalte prefixes with `--kb-` (e.g., `--kb-accordion-content-height`)\n\n### Reading Corvu Documentation\n\nWhen consulting Corvu docs at `https://corvu.dev/docs/primitives/<component-name>`:\n\n- **Anatomy Section**: Lists all `ComponentPart` elements with combination patterns\n- **API Reference Section**: Rendered elements are specified in the Props table, under the `as` row\n- **DynamicProps**: Corvu uses `DynamicProps` instead of Kobalte''s `PolymorphicProps`\n- **CSS Variables**: Corvu prefixes with `--corvu-` (e.g., `--corvu-disclosure-content-height`)\n- **Data Attributes**: Corvu prefixes with `data-corvu-` (e.g., `data-corvu-accordion-trigger`)\n- **Context Hooks**: `useContext()` and `useItemContext()` for accessing component state\n\n## Documentation Resources\n\n### Kobalte Core Components\n- **URL Pattern**: `https://kobalte.dev/docs/core/components/<component-name>`\n- **Content**: Anatomy, Rendered elements, API Reference, Props, Data Attributes, CSS Variables\n- For detailed patterns, see [docs/kobalte-patterns.md](docs/kobalte-patterns.md)\n\n### Corvu Primitives\n- **URL Pattern**: `https://corvu.dev/docs/primitives/<component-name>`\n- **Content**: Anatomy, API Reference with rendered elements in Props table\n- For detailed patterns, see [docs/corvu-patterns.md](docs/corvu-patterns.md)\n\n### Shadcn Registry\n- **Components**: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shadcn-ui/ui/refs/heads/main/apps/v4/registry/bases/base/ui/<component-name>.tsx`\n- **Examples**: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shadcn-ui/ui/refs/heads/main/apps/v4/registry/bases/base/examples/<component-name>-example.tsx`\n- **Docs**: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shadcn-ui/ui/refs/heads/main/apps/v4/content/docs/components/<component-name>.mdx`\n- **Schema**: `https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json`\n\n## Supporting Documentation\n\n- [docs/kobalte-patterns.md](docs/kobalte-patterns.md) -- Kobalte anatomy, rendered elements, props, data attributes, CSS variables\n- [docs/corvu-patterns.md](docs/corvu-patterns.md) -- Corvu anatomy, API patterns, DynamicProps, context hooks\n- [docs/base-ui-mapping.md](docs/base-ui-mapping.md) -- Complete Base UI to Kobalte/Corvu mapping reference\n- [docs/third-party-deps.md](docs/third-party-deps.md) -- Detailed third-party React-to-SolidJS dependency mapping\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T02:14:24.054Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring seamless React-to-SolidJS component transformations.","zh":"适用于需要无缝 React 到 SolidJS 组件转换的前端代理。","ja":"React から SolidJS への無縫なコンポーネント変換を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに適しています。","ko":"무결점의 React에서 SolidJS로의 컴포넌트 변환을 필요로하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren transformaciones de componentes de React a SolidJS sin problemas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant des transformations de composants React à SolidJS sans interruption.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die nahtlose React-to-SolidJS-Komponenten-Transformationen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que requerem transformações de componentes React para SolidJS sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов frontend, требующих бесшовных преобразований компонентов React в SolidJS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يتطلبون تحويلات مكونات React إلى SolidJS دون انقطاع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage the Shadcn registry for SolidJS, providing transformation rules as reusable context for converting React components to SolidJS equivalents, utilizing SolidJS and React libraries.","zh":"使代理能够利用 Shadcn 注册表中的 SolidJS，提供转换规则作为可重用的上下文，以便将 React 组件转换为 SolidJS 等价物，利用 SolidJS 和 React 库。","ja":"Shadcn レジストリの SolidJS を利用して、React コンポーネントを SolidJS の同等品に変換するための変換規則を再利用可能なコンテキストとして提供することで、エージェントが SolidJS および React ライブラリを活用できるようにします。","ko":"Shadcn 레지스트리의 SolidJS를 활용하여 React 컴포넌트를 SolidJS의 동일한 물건으로 변환하기 위한 변환 규칙을 재사용 가능한 컨텍스트로 제공함으로써, 에이전트가 SolidJS 및 React 라이브러리를 활용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar el registro de Shadcn para SolidJS, proporcionando reglas de transformación como contexto reutilizable para convertir componentes de React en equivalentes de SolidJS, utilizando las bibliotecas de SolidJS y React.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser le registre Shadcn pour SolidJS, en fournissant des règles de transformation comme contexte réutilisable pour convertir des composants React en équivalents SolidJS, en utilisant les bibliothèques SolidJS et React.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das Shadcn-Register für SolidJS zu nutzen, indem es Transformationsregeln als wiederverwendbaren Kontext für die Umwandlung von React-Komponenten in SolidJS-Äquivalente bereitstellt, unter Verwendung der SolidJS- und React-Bibliotheken.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o registro Shadcn para SolidJS, fornecendo regras de transformação como contexto reutilizável para converter componentes React em equivalentes SolidJS, utilizando bibliotecas SolidJS e React.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать реестр Shadcn для SolidJS, предоставляя правила преобразования как многократно используемый контекст для преобразования компонентов React в эквивалентные SolidJS, используя библиотеки SolidJS и React.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استخدام سجل Shadcn من أجل SolidJS، وتوفير قواعد التحويل كسياق قابل لإعادة الاستخدام لتحويل مكونات React إلى ما يعادلها من SolidJS، باستخدام مكتبات SolidJS و React."},"useCases":{"en":["Transforming React components to SolidJS","Generating SolidJS equivalents from React codebases","Referencing transformation rules for Zaidan project compatibility"],"zh":["将 React 组件转换为 SolidJS","从 React 代码库生成 SolidJS 等价物","引用转换规则以实现 Zaidan 项目兼容性"],"ja":["React コンポーネントを SolidJS に変換する","React コードベースから SolidJS の同等品を生成する","Zaidan プロジェクトの互換性を実現するための変換規則の参照"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트를 SolidJS로 변환하는 것","React 코드베이스에서 SolidJS의 동일한 물건을 생성하는 것","Zaidan 프로젝트 호환성을 위해 변환 규칙을 참조하는 것"],"es":["Transformar componentes de React en SolidJS","Generar equivalentes de SolidJS a partir de bases de código de React","Referenciar reglas de transformación para la compatibilidad del proyecto Zaidan"],"fr":["Transformer des composants React en SolidJS","Générer des équivalents SolidJS à partir de bases de code React","Référencer des règles de transformation pour la compatibilité du projet Zaidan"],"de":["React-Komponenten in SolidJS umwandeln","SolidJS-Äquivalente aus React-Codebasen generieren","Transformationsregeln für die Kompatibilität des Zaidan-Projekts referenzieren"],"pt":["Transformar componentes React em SolidJS","Gerar equivalentes SolidJS a partir de bases de código React","Referenciar regras de transformação para compatibilidade com o projeto Zaidan"],"ru":["Преобразование компонентов React в SolidJS","Генерация эквивалентных SolidJS из баз кода React","Ссылка на правила преобразования для совместимости с проектом Zaidan"],"ar":["تحويل مكونات React إلى SolidJS","توليد ما يعادل SolidJS من قواعد بيانات React","الإشارة إلى قواعد التحويل لتوافق مشروع Zaidan"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not perform transformations itself","Requires reference by other transformation agents","Specific to React-to-SolidJS transformations"],"zh":["不能自己执行转换","需要其他转换代理的引用","仅适用于 React 到 SolidJS 的转换"],"ja":["変換を自身で実行できない","他の変換エージェントによる参照が必要","React から SolidJS への変換にのみ特化している"],"ko":["자체적으로 변환을 수행할 수 없음","他の 변환 에이전트에 의한 참조가 필요","React에서 SolidJS로의 변환에만 특화되어 있음"],"es":["No realiza transformaciones en sí mismo","Requiere referencia por parte de otros agentes de transformación","Específico para transformaciones de React a SolidJS"],"fr":["Ne réalise pas les transformations lui-même","Nécessite une référence par d''autres agents de transformation","Spécifique aux transformations React à SolidJS"],"de":["Führt keine Transformationen selbst durch","Benötigt eine Referenzierung durch andere Transformationsagenten","Spezifisch für React-to-SolidJS-Transformationen"],"pt":["Não realiza transformações por si mesmo","Requer referência por outros agentes de transformação","Específico para transformações React-para-SolidJS"],"ru":["Не выполняет преобразования самостоятельно","Требует ссылки на другие агенты преобразования","Специфичен для преобразований React в SolidJS"],"ar":["لا يقوم بالتحويلات بنفسه","يتطلب الإشارة إلى وكلاء تحويل آخرون","محدد لتحويلات React إلى SolidJS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f83de1a085747c5244374214de4d9e76f11b34a535211cc5833259fbbc4bc12d","qualityScore":39}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('RtlZeroMemory/Zireael/zireael-abi-formats', 'community', 'RtlZeroMemory', 'Zireael', 'RtlZeroMemory/Zireael', 'zireael-abi-formats', 0, 0, 39, '2026-02-28T01:32:52.531Z', '2026-02-28T02:15:24.388Z', 'c969e2ef43f247840692b6340cedcbc6df78060e33537ae4200b3bc998b3391d', '{"id":"RtlZeroMemory/Zireael/zireael-abi-formats","name":"zireael-abi-formats","description":{"zh":"zireael-abi-formats是用于构建高性能终端UI应用的C语言核心引擎，使用FFI/ABI后端","ja":"zireael-abi-formatsは、FFI/ABIバックエンドを使用して、高パフォーマンスのターミナルUIアプリケーションを構築するためのC言語コアエンジンです","ko":"zireael-abi-formats는 FFI/ABI 백엔드를 사용하여 고성능 터미널 UI 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 C 언어 코어 엔진입니다","es":"zireael-abi-formats es un motor de UI determinista en C, diseñado como backend FFI/ABI para Zireael-UI, ideal para desarrolladores que buscan una solución robusta y eficiente","fr":"zireael-abi-formats est un moteur d''UI déterministe en C, conçu comme backend FFI/ABI pour Zireael-UI, idéal pour les développeurs qui recherchent une solution robuste et efficace","de":"zireael-abi-formats ist ein deterministischer UI-Motor in C, entwickelt als FFI/ABI-Backend für Zireael-UI, ideal für Entwickler, die eine robuste und effiziente Lösung suchen","pt":"O zireael-abi-formats é um motor de UI terminal determinístico em C, projetado como backend FFI/ABI para a Zireael-UI, permitindo uma interface de usuário eficiente e personalizável","ru":"Zireael-abi-formats - детерминированный движок терминального UI на C, разработанный как бэкенд FFI/ABI для Zireael-UI, обеспечивающий эффективный и настраиваемый интерфейс пользователя","ar":"zireael-abi-formats هو محرك واجهة المستخدم الطرفية القابل للتحديد بلغة سي، صمّم كخلفية FFI/ABI لمنصة Zireael-UI، مما يتيح واجهة مستخدم فعالة وقابلة للتخصيص","en":"Deterministic terminal UI core engine in C (FFI/ABI backend for Zireael-UI)."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AIエージェント_zireael-abi-formats：C语言