"واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) للتكامل والتحكم من قبل المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能代理","什么是释放工作流媒体浏览器","AI智能代理替代品","释放工作流媒体浏览器安装","媒体浏览器构建教程","AI智能代理集成","多用户媒体浏览器","播放列表管理工具"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使用方法","リリースワークフロー メディアブラウザとは","AIエージェントの代替品","リリースワークフロー メディアブラウザのインストール","メディアブラウザ構築チュートリアル","AIエージェントの統合","マルチユーザーメディアブラウザ","プレイリスト管理ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용 방법","릴리즈 워크플로우 미디어 브라우저란","AI 에이전트 대체品","릴리즈 워크플로우 미디어 브라우저 설치","미디어 브라우저 구축 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 통합","다중 사용자 미디어 브라우저","플레이리스트 관리 도구"],"es":["agente IA Stash multimedia","gestión playlists automatizada","multi-usuario Stash setup","custom UI Stash agent","automatización workflow medios","Stash AI alternative","how to install release-workflow","media browser setup guide"],"fr":["outil IA Stash multimédia","gestion playlists automatisée","multi-utilisateurs Stash configuration","personnalisation UI Stash","automatisation workflow média","Stash AI alternative","how to install release-workflow","guide setup navigateur média"],"de":["KI Agent Stash Medien","automatische Playlist-Verwaltung","Multi-User Stash Einrichtung","UI Anpassung Stash Agent","Workflow Automatisierung Medien","Stash AI Alternative","release-workflow installieren","Media Browser Setup Guide"],"pt":["agente de IA para Stash","como usar release-workflow","automatização de media workflow","browser de mídia personalizável","gestão de playlists com IA","release-workflow setup guide","Stash media agent alternative","CLI para automação de mídia"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для Stash","как использовать release-workflow","автоматизация медиа workflow","настраиваемый медиабраузер","управление плейлистами с ИИ","release-workflow setup guide","альтернатива Stash media agent","CLI для медиа автоматизации"],"ar":["وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي لـ Stash","كيفية استخدام release-workflow","أتمتة سير عمل الوسائط","متصفح وسائط قابل للتخصيص","إدارة قوائم التشغيل بالذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد release-workflow","بديل وكيل وسائط Stash","واجهة سطر الأوامر لأتمتة الوسائط"]}},"owner":"carrotwaxr","repo":"peek-stash-browser","repoPath":"carrotwaxr/peek-stash-browser","stars":25,"forks":4,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T00:57:04Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-workflow","description":"Use when preparing or executing a release of peek-stash-browser. Covers the full release lifecycle from validation through Docker image publishing.","bodyPreview":"# Release Workflow\n\n## Overview\n\nReleases are triggered by pushing git tags. GitHub Actions builds and publishes Docker images automatically.\n\n```\nPre-release validation → Version bump → Commit → Tag → Push → GitHub Actions → Docker Hub\n```\n\n## Version Scheme\n\n- **Stable**: `X.Y.Z` (e.g., `3.3.1`)\n- **Beta**: `X.Y.Z-beta.N` (e.g., `3.3.2-beta.1`)\n- **Tag format**: `vX.Y.Z` or `vX.Y.Z-beta.N`\n\nBoth `client/package.json` and `server/package.json` must always have identical versions.\n\n## Step 1: Pr","body":"# Release Workflow\n\n## Overview\n\nReleases are triggered by pushing git tags. GitHub Actions builds and publishes Docker images automatically.\n\n```\nPre-release validation → Version bump → Commit → Tag → Push → GitHub Actions → Docker Hub\n```\n\n## Version Scheme\n\n- **Stable**: `X.Y.Z` (e.g., `3.3.1`)\n- **Beta**: `X.Y.Z-beta.N` (e.g., `3.3.2-beta.1`)\n- **Tag format**: `vX.Y.Z` or `vX.Y.Z-beta.N`\n\nBoth `client/package.json` and `server/package.json` must always have identical versions.\n\n## Step 1: Pre-Release Validation\n\nRun `/pre-release` to execute all checks:\n\n1. Server unit tests: `cd server && npm test`\n2. Server linting: `cd server && npm run lint`\n3. Client unit tests: `cd client && npm test`\n4. Client linting: `cd client && npm run lint`\n5. Integration tests: `cd server && npm run test:integration`\n6. Client build: `cd client && npm run build`\n7. Docker production build: `docker build -f Dockerfile.production -t peek:test .`\n\nAll 7 checks must pass before proceeding.\n\n## Step 2: Version Bump & Tag\n\n### Beta Release\n\nRun `/release-beta`:\n\n- Increment beta number: `3.3.2-beta.1` → `3.3.2-beta.2`\n- Or start new beta: `3.3.1` → `3.3.2-beta.1`\n\n### Stable Release\n\nRun `/release-stable`:\n\n- Remove beta suffix: `3.3.2-beta.8` → `3.3.2`\n- Or increment: `3.3.2` → `3.3.3` or `3.4.0`\n\n### What the Release Skills Do\n\n1. Verify on `main` branch and up to date\n2. Update version in `client/package.json` and `server/package.json`\n3. Commit: `chore: bump version to X.Y.Z`\n4. Push commit to main\n5. Create tag: `git tag vX.Y.Z`\n6. Push tag: `git push origin vX.Y.Z`\n\n## Step 3: Automated CI/CD\n\nGitHub Actions (`.github/workflows/docker-build.yml`) triggers on `v*` tags:\n\n1. **Build**: Multi-stage Dockerfile.production (frontend → backend → runtime)\n2. **Platforms**: `linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`\n3. **Push to Docker Hub**: `carrotwaxr/peek-stash-browser`\n4. **Tag strategy**:\n   - Semver: `3.3.2`\n   - Major.minor: `3.3`\n   - `latest` (stable releases only)\n   - `stable` (stable releases only)\n   - `beta` (beta releases only)\n5. **GitHub Release**: Auto-created with generated release notes, marked as prerelease if beta\n\n## Docker Hub Tags After Release\n\n| Release Type | Tags Applied |\n|-------------|-------------|\n| `v3.3.2` (stable) | `3.3.2`, `3.3`, `latest`, `stable` |\n| `v3.3.2-beta.1` | `3.3.2-beta.1`, `beta` |\n\n## Updating on unRAID\n\nAfter GitHub Actions completes:\n\n```bash\n# SSH to your deployment server\nssh root@<server-ip>\n\n# Pull new image\ndocker pull carrotwaxr/peek-stash-browser:latest  # or :beta\n\n# Restart container via unRAID WebGUI or CLI\ndocker stop peek-stash-browser && docker start peek-stash-browser\n```\n\n## Semantic Versioning Guide\n\n- **Patch** (3.3.X): Bug fixes, minor tweaks, no new features\n- **Minor** (3.X.0): New features, backward-compatible changes\n- **Major** (X.0.0): Breaking changes (rare — major UI overhauls, API changes)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T01:52:14.030Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated Docker image publishing and version management","zh":"适用于需要自动化Docker镜像发布和版本管理的DevOps代理","ja":"自動化Dockerイメージの公開とバージョン管理を必要とするDevOpsエージェントに最適","ko":"자동화된 Docker 이미지 게시 및 버전 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren la publicación automática de imágenes de Docker y administración de versiones","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant la publication automatisée d''images Docker et la gestion de versions","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die automatisierte Docker-Image-Veröffentlichung und Versionenverwaltung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes DevOps que exigem publicação automática de imagens Docker e gerenciamento de versão","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих автоматической публикации изображений Docker и управления версиями","ar":"مثالي لعمليات DevOps التي تتطلب نشر صور Docker وتحديث إصدار آلي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate release workflows using GitHub Actions, triggering builds and publishes Docker images to Docker Hub upon git tag pushes, while maintaining a consistent version scheme across client and server package.json files","zh":"赋予代理自动化发布工作流的能力，使用GitHub Actions触发构建并在git标签推送时将Docker镜像发布到Docker Hub，同时在客户端和服务器package.json文件中保持一致的版本方案","ja":"エージェントに自動化されたリリースワークフローを実行する能力を与え、GitHub Actionsを使用してビルドをトリガーし、gitタグプッシュ時にDockerイメージをDocker Hubに公開し、クライアントとサーバーのpackage.jsonファイル全体で一貫したバージョンスキームを維持","ko":"에이전트에 자동화된 릴리즈 워크플로우를 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 GitHub Actions를 사용하여 빌드를 트리거하고 git 태그 푸시 시 Docker 이미지를 Docker Hub에 게시하며 클라이언트 및 서버 package.json 파일에서 일관된 버전 체계를 유지","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento utilizando GitHub Actions, desencadenando compilaciones y publicando imágenes de Docker en Docker Hub al realizar pushes de etiquetas git, manteniendo un esquema de versiones coherente en archivos package.json de cliente y servidor","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail de publication en utilisant GitHub Actions, en déclenchant des builds et en publiant des images Docker sur Docker Hub lors de pushes de balises git, tout en maintenant un schéma de version cohérent dans les fichiers package.json du client et du serveur","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Release-Workflows mithilfe von GitHub Actions zu automatisieren, indem Builds ausgelöst und Docker-Images in Docker Hub veröffentlicht werden, wenn Git-Tags pushes werden, während ein konsistentes Versionschema in package.json-Dateien von Client und Server beibehalten wird","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatizem fluxos de trabalho de lançamento usando GitHub Actions, acionando compilações e publicando imagens Docker no Docker Hub ao fazer push de tags git, mantendo um esquema de versão consistente em arquivos package.json de cliente e servidor","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рабочие процессы выпуска, используя GitHub Actions, запуская сборки и публикуя изображения Docker в Docker Hub при пуше тегов git, сохраняя последовательную схему версий в файлах package.json клиента и сервера","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تutomation سير عمل الإصدار باستخدام GitHub Actions، تشغيل البناء ونشر صور Docker في Docker Hub عند دفع علامات git، مع الحفاظ على مخطط إصدار متسق عبر ملفات package.json للعميل والخادم"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Docker image publishing","Validating pre-release versions","Managing beta releases with custom tagging"],"zh":["自动化Docker镜像发布","验证预发布版本","使用自定义标签管理beta发布"],"ja":["自動化Dockerイメージの公開","プレリリースバージョンの検証","カスタムタグを使用したベータリリースの管理"],"ko":["自动화된 Docker 이미지 게시","프리 릴리즈 버전의 검증","사용자 정의 태그를 사용한 베타 릴리즈 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la publicación de imágenes de Docker","Validación de versiones prelanzamiento","Administración de versiones beta con etiquetado personalizado"],"fr":["Automatisation de la publication d''images Docker","Validation des versions prépublication","Gestion des versions beta avec étiquetage personnalisé"],"de":["Automatisierung der Veröffentlichung von Docker-Images","Validierung von Vorabversionen","Verwaltung von Beta-Versionen mit benutzerdefiniertem Tagging"],"pt":["Automatizar a publicação de imagens Docker","Validar versões de pré-lançamento","Gerenciar lançamentos beta com marcação personalizada"],"ru":["Автоматизация публикации изображений Docker","Проверка предварительных версий","Управление бета-релизами с индивидуальной маркировкой"],"ar":["توفير صور Docker آلي","تحقق من الإصدارات قبل الإصدار","إدارة الإصدارات التجريبية مع علامات مخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub repository access","Dependent on GitHub Actions and Docker Hub integration","Version scheme must be strictly followed across package.json files"],"zh":["需要GitHub仓库访问权限","依赖于GitHub Actions和Docker Hub集成","版本方案必须在package.json文件中严格遵循"],"ja":["GitHubリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","GitHub ActionsとDocker Hubの統合に依存","バージョンスキームはpackage.jsonファイル全体で厳密に従わなければならない"],"ko":["GitHub 리포지토리 액세스가 필요","GitHub Actions 및 Docker Hub 통합에 의존","버전 체계는 package.json 파일에서 엄격히 준수해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Dependiente de la integración de GitHub Actions y Docker Hub","El esquema de versiones debe seguirse estrictamente en los archivos package.json"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub","Dépend de l''intégration de GitHub Actions et Docker Hub","Le schéma de version doit être suivi strictement dans les fichiers package.json"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository","Abhängig von der Integration von GitHub Actions und Docker Hub","Das Versionschema muss streng in den package.json-Dateien befolgt werden"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório GitHub","Depende da integração do GitHub Actions e do Docker Hub","O esquema de versão deve ser seguido estritamente em arquivos package.json"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию GitHub","Зависит от интеграции GitHub Actions и Docker Hub","Схема версий должна быть строго соблюдена в файлах package.json"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع GitHub","يعتمد على تكامل GitHub Actions و Docker Hub","يجب اتباع مخطط الإصدار严格ًا في ملفات package.json"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2f74f557efaf