Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo","Documentação completa e suporte técnico"],"ru":["Аннотация генома до публикации","Точные и надежные результаты","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Полная документация и техническая поддержка"],"ar":["تعليق الجينوم قبل النشر","نتائج دقيقة وموثوقة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم لعدة صيغ ملفات","توثيق كامل ودعم تقني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用tacc进行基因组分析","tacc基因组注释预发表结果","基因组分析工具tacc","tacc vs 其他基因组分析工具","tacc安装指南","tacc使用教程"],"ja":["taccを使用したゲノム分析の方法","taccのゲノムアノテーション事前公開結果","ゲノム分析ツールtacc","taccと他のゲノム分析ツールの比較","taccのインストールガイド","taccの使用方法"],"ko":["tacc를 사용한 유전체 분석 방법","tacc의 유전체 주석 预发表 결과","유전체 분석 툴 tacc","tacc와 다른 유전체 분석 툴의 비교","tacc 설치 가이드","tacc 사용 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI para genómica","tacc vs otras herramientas de anotación","cómo utilizar tacc para anotación de genomas","instalación de tacc","guía de configuración de tacc","anotación de genomas pre-publicación","mejora de la precisión de los resultados de genómica","tacc para desarrolladores"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour la génomique","tacc vs autres outils d''annotation","comment utiliser tacc pour l''annotation des génomes","installation de tacc","guide de configuration de tacc","annotation des génomes pré-publication","amélioration de la précision des résultats de génomique","tacc pour les développeurs"],"de":["KI-Tools für Genomik","tacc vs andere Annotierungstools","wie man tacc für Genomannotation verwendet","Installation von tacc","Konfigurationsanleitung für tacc","Genomannotation vor der Veröffentlichung","Verbesserung der Genauigkeit der Genomikergebnisse","tacc für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar tacc","o que é anotação de genoma","tacc alternativa","tacc vs outras ferramentas","instalar tacc","guia de configuração do tacc","desenvolvimento de genoma","ferramentas de IA para genoma"],"ru":["как использовать tacc","что такое аннотация генома","tacc альтернатива","tacc vs другие инструменты","установить tacc","руководство по настройке tacc","разработка генома","инструменты ИИ для генома"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام tacc","ما هو تعليق الجينوم","بديل tacc","tacc مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت tacc","دليل إعداد tacc","تطوير الجينوم","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للجينوم"]}},"owner":"plantcad","repo":"genecad","repoPath":"plantcad/genecad","stars":25,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T19:42:32Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tacc","description":"Manages experiment execution on the TACC Vista HPC cluster. Use when the user says run on TACC, run the pipeline, allocate a GPU node, check SLURM queue, sync code to TACC, download results from TACC, cancel that job, or when any task requires GPU/CPU compute that cannot run locally. Do NOT use for local-only tasks like editing code, running tests, or plotting.","bodyPreview":"# TACC HPC Cluster (Vista)\n\nThis skill targets the **Vista** supercomputer within TACC (Texas Advanced Computing Center). Queue names, module versions, and filesystem layout are Vista-specific and may differ on other TACC systems.\n\n## First-Time Setup\n\nBefore any TACC operations, verify the user''s environment is ready. Run these checks and guide the user through fixing any failures:\n\n### Step 1: Verify SSH access\n```bash\nssh tacc \"echo ''SSH OK''\"\n```\nIf this fails, the user needs to configure `ta","body":"# TACC HPC Cluster (Vista)\n\nThis skill targets the **Vista** supercomputer within TACC (Texas Advanced Computing Center). Queue names, module versions, and filesystem layout are Vista-specific and may differ on other TACC systems.\n\n## First-Time Setup\n\nBefore any TACC operations, verify the user''s environment is ready. Run these checks and guide the user through fixing any failures:\n\n### Step 1: Verify SSH access\n```bash\nssh tacc \"echo ''SSH OK''\"\n```\nIf this fails, the user needs to configure `tacc` as an SSH host in `~/.ssh/config`.\n\n### Step 2: Install command wrapper\n```bash\nssh tacc \"test -x \\$HOME/local/bin/genecad/cmd && echo ''cmd OK'' || echo ''MISSING''\"\n```\nIf missing, install it from the local skill scripts:\n```bash\nssh tacc \"mkdir -p ~/local/bin/genecad\"\nrsync -Pz .claude/skills/tacc/scripts/cmd tacc:~/local/bin/genecad/cmd\nssh tacc \"chmod +x ~/local/bin/genecad/cmd\"\n```\nThe `cmd` script sources `.bashrc`, sets `PYTHONPATH`, cds to the repo, and exports `RANK`/`WORLD_SIZE` from SLURM variables, then execs the given command. It is the single entry point for running commands on compute nodes.\n\n### Step 3: Verify Python environment\n```bash\nssh tacc \"bash -l -c ''which python && python --version''\"\n```\nExpected: Python 3.11+ from a venv at `$WORK/envs/ml-rel/bin/activate`, sourced by `.bashrc`. Do NOT use conda, mamba, or micromamba — they are not installed on Vista.\n\n### Step 4: Verify repository exists on TACC\n```bash\nssh tacc \"bash -l -c ''cd \\$WORK/repos/genecad && git status --short''\"\n```\nIf the repo doesn''t exist, clone it: `ssh tacc \"bash -l -c ''git clone <REPO_URL> \\$WORK/repos/genecad''\"`.\n\n## Filesystem Model\n\n- **`$WORK`** — Small, persistent filesystem. All code and repositories live here. Treat stored data as **read-only** unless explicitly instructed otherwise.\n- **`$SCRATCH`** — Effectively unlimited capacity but subject to automatic garbage collection (data expires if not accessed frequently enough). **`$SCRATCH/tmp` is the default output location for ALL experiment results** unless instructed otherwise. Any other directories under `$SCRATCH` should be treated as read-only data sources, not output destinations.\n\n## Login Node vs Compute Node\n\nThe `tacc` SSH alias connects to a **login node**. Use it freely for:\n- File exploration (`ls`, `find`, `du`)\n- Environment checks (`which python`, `env`)\n- Data inspection and analysis (Python + pandas, matplotlib, parsing results, generating tables/plots)\n- Running analysis scripts that don''t need GPUs or heavy compute\n- Git operations (`git status`, `git pull`)\n- Job management (`squeue`, `scancel`, `idev`)\n\n**Compute nodes cost SU credits.** Only allocate a compute node when:\n- The task requires a GPU (model inference, predictions)\n- The task requires significant CPU or memory (large-scale post-processing)\n\nDo NOT allocate a compute node just to run `ls`, check paths, inspect files, or run quick scripts. Use `ssh tacc \"bash -l -c ''COMMAND''\"` for that.\n\n## Experiment Workflow\n\nA typical experiment follows this sequence. Each step depends on the prior step completing successfully.\n\n### Step 1: Sync code to TACC\n```bash\nbash .claude/skills/tacc/scripts/sync          # rsync (default, fast, no commit needed)\nbash .claude/skills/tacc/scripts/sync --git    # git push + pull (requires clean commit)\n```\n**rsync (default):** Directly pushes local files without requiring a git commit. Use for in-progress work.\n**git (`--git`):** Use only when changes are committed and you want the remote to match a specific branch/commit.\n\n### Step 2: Check for existing compute nodes\n```bash\nssh tacc \"squeue -u \\$USER -o ''%.18i %.9P %.30j %.2t %.10M %.6D %.20R''\"\n```\nReuse a running node if one exists — each session has a minimum 15-minute charge.\n\n### Step 3: Allocate a compute node\n\n**Queues:**\n\n| Queue | Type | Time Limit | Use Case |\n|-------|------|------------|----------|\n| `gg` | CPU-only | — | CPU-only jobs (post-processing, evaluation) |\n| `gh-dev` | GPU dev | 2 hours | Try first for GPU work |\n| `gh` | GPU prod | — | Fallback if `gh-dev` has no nodes |\n\nDo not allocate a CPU-only node (`gg`) for GPU work. The prediction step requires a GPU.\n\n**Single-node (default):** Use `idev` to allocate an interactive node:\n```bash\nidev -p gh-dev -N 1 -n 1 -t 2:00:00\n```\nThen find the allocated node:\n```bash\nssh tacc \"squeue -u \\$USER -h -t R -o ''%N''\"\n```\n\n**Multi-node:** Use `srun` directly — no `idev` needed (see Step 4).\n\n### Step 4: Run the experiment\n\nWrite all output to `$SCRATCH/tmp` unless instructed otherwise.\n\n#### Single-node execution\n\nAfter allocating a node with `idev` (Step 3), find the node name and run commands via `cmd`. Since `cmd` cds to the repo automatically, commands can use repo-relative paths directly:\n```bash\nNODE=$(ssh tacc \"squeue -u \\$USER -h -t R -o ''%N''\" | head -1)\nssh tacc \"ssh $NODE ~/local/bin/genecad/cmd python scripts/predict.py ...\"\n```\nFor long-running single-node jobs, prefer `sbatch` over `idev` to survive SSH disconnects.\n\n#### Multi-node execution with `srun`\n\nUse `srun` to launch the same command across multiple nodes simultaneously. The `cmd` wrapper sets `RANK=$PMIX_RANK` and `WORLD_SIZE=$SLURM_NNODES`, so each node knows its rank and the total node count.\n\n```bash\nssh tacc \"bash -l -c ''\\\n  srun -p gh-dev -N 8 -n 8 --tasks-per-node 1 -t 2:00:00 \\\n    --output \\$SCRATCH/tmp/logs/<name>.log \\\n    --error  \\$SCRATCH/tmp/logs/<name>.log \\\n    ~/local/bin/genecad/cmd python scripts/predict.py create_predictions \\\n      --input ... --output-dir ...''\" 2>&1 &\n```\n\n**Important notes for multi-node `srun`:**\n- Always use `--tasks-per-node 1` — each node runs one instance of the command.\n- Environment variables set *before* the `srun` call propagate to all nodes.\n- All nodes write to the same `--output`/`--error` log file (interleaved). Use `[rank=N]` prefixes in log messages to distinguish nodes.\n- `srun` blocks until all nodes finish. Run it in background (`&`) and monitor via `tail` on the log file.\n\n#### Monitoring progress\n```bash\nssh tacc \"tail -20 \\$SCRATCH/tmp/logs/<name>.log\"\n```\n\n### Step 5: Download results\n```bash\nrsync -Pz tacc:/remote/results/path local/results/path\n```\nAlways use `rsync` instead of `scp`.\n\n### Step 6: Cancel the job\n```bash\nssh tacc \"scancel <jobid>\"\n```\n**Always cancel jobs when done.** Idle jobs consume SU credits.\n\n## Environment\n\n- Python env: standard venv at `$WORK/envs/ml-rel/bin/activate`, sourced automatically by `.bashrc`\n- Do NOT use conda, mamba, or micromamba — they are not installed\n- Modules loaded by `.bashrc`: `gcc/13.2.0`, `cuda/12.4`, `python3/3.11.8`\n- `.bashrc` must be sourced for all remote commands — `cmd` handles this automatically\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"No running compute node found\"\nCause: No `idev` session is active, or the job expired.\nFix: Allocate a new node per Step 3 of the Experiment Workflow.\n\n### Node allocated on wrong queue (e.g., `gg` for GPU work)\nCause: `gg` is CPU-only. GPU predictions will fail or silently use CPU (extremely slow).\nFix: Cancel the job (`scancel <jobid>`) and allocate on `gh-dev` or `gh`.\n\n### File transfer fails with `scp`\nFix: Use `rsync -Pz` instead of `scp`.\n\n### Python environment not found / `conda` not found\nCause: `.bashrc` was not sourced, or agent tried to use conda.\nFix: Ensure all compute node commands go through `cmd`. Never use conda/mamba/micromamba.\n\n### Pre-commit `pyrefly` hook fails locally\nCause: `pyrefly` is not installed in the local dev environment.\nFix: `uv pip install pyrefly`\n\n### SSH timeout during long-running command\nCause: Command was run in foreground and SSH connection dropped.\nFix: Always background long-running commands and redirect to a log file. Check progress by tailing the remote log.\n\n### Hallucinated or incorrect numbers in result summaries\nCause: Model generated numbers from memory instead of reading source data.\nFix: ALWAYS read raw result files (`.stats`, `.tsv`) before quoting any numbers. Never guess or recall numbers from earlier in the conversation.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T01:52:10.557Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for HPC-focused Agents needing advanced genome annotation and high-performance computing capabilities on the Vista supercomputer.","zh":"非常适合需要高级基因注释和在Vista超级计算机上进行高性能计算的HPC专注Agent。","ja":"HPCに焦点を当てたエージェントが、高度なゲノムアノテーションとVista 슈퍼コンピュータでのハイパフォーマンスコンピューティング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"HPC에 중점을 둔 에이전트가 고급 유전자 주석 및 Vista 슈퍼 컴퓨터에서 고성능 컴퓨팅 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en HPC que necesitan una anotación de genoma avanzada y capacidades de computación de alto rendimiento en la supercomputadora Vista.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur le HPC nécessitant une annotation de génome avancée et des capacités de calcul haute performance sur la supercalculateur Vista.","de":"Perfekt für HPC-fokussierte Agenten, die eine erweiterte Genomannotation und Hochleistungscomputing-Fähigkeiten auf dem Vista-Supercomputer benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes com foco em HPC que necessitam de anotação avançada de genoma e capacidades de computação de alto desempenho no supercomputador Vista.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на HPC, которым необходима расширенная аннотация генома и возможности высокопроизводительных вычислений на суперкомпьютере Vista.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التركيز على HPC الذي يحتاج إلى تعليمة جينوم متقدمة وقدرات حوسبة عالية الأداء على جهاز Vista الفائق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage the TACC HPC Cluster for genome annotation pre-publication results, utilizing SSH access and queue management with specific module versions and filesystem layouts on Vista.","zh":"赋予代理人利用TACC HPC集群进行基因注释预发表结果的能力，使用SSH访问和队列管理，利用Vista上的特定模块版本和文件系统布局。","ja":"TACC HPCクラスターを利用してゲノムアノテーションの事前公開結果を取得するためのエージェントの能力を提供し、SSHアクセスとキュー管理を使用し、Vista上の特定のモジュールバージョンとファイルシステムレイアウトを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 TACC HPC 클러스터를 사용하여 유전자 주석의 사전 발행 결과를 활용할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, SSH 액세스 및 큐 관리를 사용하여 Vista의 특정 모듈 버전 및 파일 시스템 레이아웃을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar el clúster HPC de TACC para resultados de anotación de genoma previos a la publicación, utilizando el acceso SSH y la gestión de colas con versiones de módulos específicas y diseños de sistema de archivos en Vista.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser le cluster HPC TACC pour les résultats d''annotation de génome prépublication, en utilisant l''accès SSH et la gestion des files d''attente avec des versions de modules spécifiques et des dispositions de système de fichiers sur Vista.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, den TACC-HPC-Cluster für Genomannotations-Ergebnisse vor der Veröffentlichung zu nutzen, indem sie auf SSH-Zugriff und Queue-Management mit spezifischen Modulversionen und Dateisystemlayouts auf Vista zurückgreifen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem o cluster HPC TACC para resultados de anotação de genoma pré-publicação, utilizando acesso SSH e gerenciamento de filas com versões específicas de módulos e layouts de sistema de arquivos no Vista.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать кластер HPC TACC для результатов аннотации генома до публикации, используя доступ SSH и управление очередями с конкретными версиями модулей и макетами файловой системы на Vista.","ar":"يسمح للعميل باستخدام кластер HPC TACC للنتائج المسبقة للنشر لتعليمة الجينوم، باستخدام الوصول إلى SSH وإدارة الطوابير مع إصدارات محددة من الوحدات وتنسيقات نظام الملفات على Vista."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying SSH access for TACC operations","Managing queue names and module versions on Vista","Navigating Vista''s filesystem layout for genome annotation results"],"zh":["验证TACC操作的SSH访问","在Vista上管理队列名称和模块版本","导航Vista的文件系统布局以获得基因注释结果"],"ja":["TACC操作のSSHアクセスを検証する","Vista上でキュー名とモジュールバージョンを管理する","Vistaのファイルシステムレイアウトをナビゲートしてゲノムアノテーションの結果を取得する"],"ko":["TACC 작업을 위한 SSH 액세스를 확인하는 것","Vista에서 큐 이름 및 모듈 버전을 관리하는 것","Vista의 파일 시스템 레이아웃을 탐색하여 유전자 주석 결과를 얻는 것"],"es":["Verificar el acceso SSH para operaciones de TACC","Administrar nombres de colas y versiones de módulos en Vista","Navegar por el diseño del sistema de archivos de Vista para resultados de anotación de genoma"],"fr":["Vérifier l''accès SSH pour les opérations TACC","Gérer les noms de files d''attente et les versions de modules sur Vista","Naviguer dans la disposition du système de fichiers de Vista pour les résultats d''annotation de génome"],"de":["Überprüfen des SSH-Zugriffs für TACC-Operationen","Verwalten von Queuename und Modulversionen auf Vista","Navigieren im Dateisystemlayout von Vista für Genomannotations-Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Verificar o acesso SSH para operações TACC","Gerenciar nomes de fila e versões de módulos no Vista","Navegar pelo layout do sistema de arquivos do Vista para resultados de anotação de genoma"],"ru":["Проверка доступа SSH для операций TACC","Управление именами очередей и версиями модулей на Vista","Навигация по макету файловой системы Vista для результатов аннотации генома"],"ar":["التحقق من الوصول إلى SSH للعمليات TACC","إدارة أسماء الطوابير وإصدارات الوحدات على Vista","التحكم في تخطيط نظام الملفات على Vista للنتائج المسبقة للنشر لتعليمة الجينوم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SSH access configured for TACC","Vista supercomputer specifics may differ from other TACC systems","Genome annotation pre-publication results require proper setup and verification"],"zh":["需要配置TACC的SSH访问","Vista超级计算机的具体细节可能与其他TACC系统不同","基因注释预发表结果需要正确的设置和验证"],"ja":["TACCのSSHアクセスを設定する必要がある","Vista 슈퍼コンピュータの詳細は他のTACCシステムと異なる可能性がある","ゲノムアノテーションの事前公開結果には適切な設定と検証が必要"],"ko":["TACC의 SSH 액세스를 구성해야 함","Vista 슈퍼 컴퓨터의 세부 사항은 다른 TACC 시스템과 다를 수 있음","유전자 주석의 사전 발행 결과를 얻으려면 올바른 설정 및 검증이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso SSH configurado para TACC","Las especificaciones de la supercomputadora Vista pueden diferir de otros sistemas TACC","Los resultados de anotación de genoma previos a la publicación requieren una configuración y verificación adecuadas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès SSH configuré pour TACC","Les spécifications de la supercalculateur Vista peuvent différer des autres systèmes TACC","Les résultats d''annotation de génome prépublication nécessitent une configuration et une vérification appropriées"],"de":["Erfordert konfigurierten SSH-Zugriff für TACC","Die Spezifika des Vista-Supercomputers können sich von anderen TACC-Systemen unterscheiden","Genomannotations-Ergebnisse vor der Veröffentlichung erfordern eine ordnungsgemäße Einrichtung und Überprüfung"],"pt":["Requer acesso SSH configurado para TACC","Especificidades do supercomputador Vista podem diferir de outros sistemas TACC","Resultados de anotação de genoma pré-publicação requerem configuração e verificação adequadas"],"ru":["Требуется настройка доступа SSH для TACC","Особенности суперкомпьютера Vista могут отличаться от других систем TACC","Результаты аннотации генома до публикации требуют правильной настройки и верификации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى SSH المكونة للعمليات TACC","قد تختلف تفاصيل جهاز Vista الفائق عن أنظمة TACC الأخرى","تتطلب نتائج تعليمة الجينوم المسبقة للنشر إعدادًا وتحققًا صحيحين"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d1fe8b007d04314e61de84767cd992ba86378adfb249fe38d0cb0cd40ca97d74","qualityScore":39}');
