budget-track...","de":"KI-Agenten-Tools - budget-tracker-patterns","pt":"Ferramentas de Agente de IA: budget-tracker-patterns","ru":"ИИ Агенты: шаблоны отслеживания бюджета","ar":"أدوات الوكيل الذكي: أنماط تتبع الميزانية","en":"budget-tracker-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"开源的AI智能跟踪器，支持自托管和Next.js，TypeScript编写","ja":"オープンソースのAIエージェント、自ホストとNext.js、TypeScriptをサポート","ko":"오픈소스 AI 에이전트, 자체 호스팅 및 Next.js, TypeScript 지원","es":"budget-tracker-patterns es una herramienta de agente de inteligencia artificial de código abierto que ofrece una alternativa a ChatGPT","fr":"budget-tracker-patterns est un outil d''agent d''intelligence artificielle open source qui offre une alternative à ChatGPT","de":"budget-tracker-patterns ist ein KI-Agenten-Tool mit Open-Source-Code, das eine Alternative zu ChatGPT bietet","pt":"O budget-tracker-patterns é uma alternativa de código aberto ao ChatGPT, permitindo a auto-hospedagem ou hospedagem em nuvem, com tecnologias como NextJS e T...","ru":"Budget-tracker-patterns - это открытое программное обеспечение, альтернатива ChatGPT, которая позволяет самохостинг или хостинг в облаке, с использованием те...","ar":"أنماط تتبع الميزانية هي بديل مفتوح المصدر لتشات جي بي تي، يسمح بالاستضافة الذاتية أو السحابية، مع استخدام تقنيات مثل NextJS وTypeScript.","en":"All AI models in one chat. Self-hostable open source alternative to ChatGPT. AGPL-3.0. Hosted cloud version available."},"definition":{"en":"All AI models in one chat. Self-hostable open source alternative to ChatGPT. AGPL-3.0. Hosted cloud version available."},"features":{"zh":["自托管的开源AI智能跟踪器","支持Next.js和TypeScript","AGPL-3.0许可","云托管版本可用","替代ChatGPT"],"ja":["自ホスト可能なオープンソースAIエージェント","Next.jsとTypeScriptをサポート","AGPL-3.0ライセンス","クラウドホストバージョン使用可能","ChatGPTの代替"],"ko":["자체 호스팅 가능한 오픈소스 AI 에이전트","Next.js 및 TypeScript 지원","AGPL-3.0 라이선스","클라우드 호스팅 버전 사용 가능","ChatGPT 대체"],"es":["Código abierto bajo licencia AGPL-3.0","Alternativa a ChatGPT","Compatible con Next.js y TypeScript","Versión en la nube disponible","Tecnología de aprendizaje automático avanzada"],"fr":["Code open source sous licence AGPL-3.0","Alternative à ChatGPT","Compatible avec Next.js et TypeScript","Version cloud disponible","Technologie d''apprentissage automatique avancée"],"de":["Open-Source-Code unter AGPL-3.0-Lizenz","Alternative zu ChatGPT","Kompatibel mit Next.js und TypeScript","Cloud-Version verfügbar","Erweiterte maschinelle Lern-Technologie"],"pt":["Código aberto e auto-hospedável","Tecnologias como NextJS e TypeScript","Alternativa ao ChatGPT","Hospedagem em nuvem disponível","Licenciado sob AGPL-3.0"],"ru":["Открытый исходный код и самохостинг","Технологии seperti NextJS и TypeScript","Альтернатива ChatGPT","Хостинг в облаке доступен","Лицензировано под AGPL-3.0"],"ar":["مفتوح المصدر والاستضافة الذاتية","تقنيات مثل NextJS وTypeScript","بديل لتشات جي بي تي","الاستضافة السحابية متاحة","مرخص تحت AGPL-3.0"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能跟踪器","什么是AI智能跟踪器","AI智能跟踪器替代ChatGPT","AI智能跟踪器安装","AI智能跟踪器设置指南","Next.js和TypeScript的AI智能跟踪器","AGPL-3.0的AI智能跟踪器","云托管的AI智能跟踪器","自托管的AI智能跟踪器"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントとは","AIエージェントの代替ChatGPT","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド","Next.jsとTypeScriptのAIエージェント","AGPL-3.0のAIエージェント","クラウドホストのAIエージェント","自ホストのAIエージェント"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","AI 에이전트 대체 ChatGPT","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드","Next.js 및 TypeScript의 AI 에이전트","AGPL-3.0의 AI 에이전트","클라우드 호스팅의 AI 에이전트","자체 호스팅의 AI 에이전트"],"es":["herramientas de agente de inteligencia artificial","cómo usar budget-tracker-patterns","alternativa a ChatGPT","budget-tracker-patterns vs ChatGPT","instalación de budget-tracker-patterns","guía de configuración de budget-tracker-patterns","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Next.js y TypeScript"],"fr":["outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","comment utiliser budget-tracker-patterns","alternative à ChatGPT","budget-tracker-patterns vs ChatGPT","installation de budget-tracker-patterns","guide de configuration de budget-tracker-patterns","développement d''applications avec Next.js et TypeScript"],"de":["KI-Agenten-Tools","wie man budget-tracker-patterns verwendet","Alternative zu ChatGPT","budget-tracker-patterns vs ChatGPT","Installation von budget-tracker-patterns","Konfigurationsanleitung für budget-tracker-patterns","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit Next.js und TypeScript"],"pt":["como usar agente de IA","o que é agente de IA","alternativa ao ChatGPT","budget-tracker-patterns vs ChatGPT","instalar budget-tracker-patterns","guia de configuração do budget-tracker-patterns"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","альтернатива ChatGPT","budget-tracker-patterns vs ChatGPT","установить budget-tracker-patterns","руководство по настройке budget-tracker-patterns"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل لتشات جي بي تي","أنماط تتبع الميزانية مقابل تشات جي بي تي","تثبيت أنماط تتبع الميزانية","دليل إعداد أنماط تتبع الميزانية"]}},"owner":"planetaryescape","repo":"blah.chat","repoPath":"planetaryescape/blah.chat","stars":7,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T20:36:58Z","topics":["agpl","ai","chat","convex","llm","nextjs","self-hosted","typescript"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"budget-tracker-patterns","description":"Backend budget tracking patterns for AI generation. Awareness-based tracking (not blocking), tool timeouts, per-tool rate limits, token estimates, context window management, truncation strategies, search quality detection. Triggers on budget, tool timeout, rate limit, token estimate, truncation, context window, search quality, diminishing returns.","bodyPreview":"# Budget Tracker Patterns\n\nAwareness-based tracking for AI generation tool calls. Tracks context consumption, detects runaway patterns, provides visibility. Does NOT block tool calls - existing step limits handle that.\n\n## BudgetState Interface\n\nCore state tracked during generation:\n\n```typescript\n// From packages/backend/convex/lib/budgetTracker.ts\nexport interface BudgetState {\n  maxTokens: number;\n  usedTokens: number;\n  toolCallCount: number;\n  searchHistory: Array<{\n    query: string;\n    r","body":"# Budget Tracker Patterns\n\nAwareness-based tracking for AI generation tool calls. Tracks context consumption, detects runaway patterns, provides visibility. Does NOT block tool calls - existing step limits handle that.\n\n## BudgetState Interface\n\nCore state tracked during generation:\n\n```typescript\n// From packages/backend/convex/lib/budgetTracker.ts\nexport interface BudgetState {\n  maxTokens: number;\n  usedTokens: number;\n  toolCallCount: number;\n  searchHistory: Array<{\n    query: string;\n    resultCount: number;\n    topScore: number;\n  }>;\n  toolCallCounts: Record<string, number>; // Per-tool counts for rate limiting\n}\n```\n\nInitialize:\n```typescript\nconst budget = createBudgetState(maxTokens);\n```\n\nUpdate immutably:\n```typescript\nbudget = recordUsage(budget, tokens);\nbudget = recordToolCall(budget, toolName);\nbudget = recordSearch(budget, query, resultCount, topScore);\n```\n\n## Tool Timeout Pattern\n\nWall-clock timeout wrapper prevents stuck tools:\n\n```typescript\n// From packages/backend/convex/lib/budgetTracker.ts\nexport async function withTimeout<T>(\n  promise: Promise<T>,\n  timeoutMs: number,\n  operation: string,\n): Promise<T> {\n  let timeoutId: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout>;\n\n  const timeoutPromise = new Promise<never>((_, reject) => {\n    timeoutId = setTimeout(() => {\n      reject(new TimeoutError(operation, timeoutMs));\n    }, timeoutMs);\n  });\n\n  try {\n    const result = await Promise.race([promise, timeoutPromise]);\n    clearTimeout(timeoutId!);\n    return result;\n  } catch (error) {\n    clearTimeout(timeoutId!);\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Tool timeouts** (milliseconds):\n```typescript\nexport const TOOL_TIMEOUTS: Record<string, number> = {\n  searchAll: 30000,        // 30s - multiple parallel searches\n  searchFiles: 15000,\n  searchNotes: 15000,\n  searchTasks: 15000,\n  searchKnowledgeBank: 15000,\n  queryHistory: 15000,\n  urlReader: 120000,       // 2min - external fetch slow\n  codeExecution: 120000,   // 2min - code execution takes time\n  youtubeVideo: 300000,    // 5min - video processing slow\n  weather: 60000,          // 1min - external API\n  calculator: 5000,\n  datetime: 1000,\n  default: 30000,\n};\n```\n\nUsage:\n```typescript\nconst timeout = getToolTimeout(toolName);\nconst result = await withTimeout(toolPromise, timeout, `${toolName} call`);\n```\n\n## Per-Tool Rate Limits\n\nPrevent tool abuse while allowing reasonable usage:\n\n```typescript\n// From packages/backend/convex/lib/budgetTracker.ts\nconst TOOL_RATE_LIMITS: Record<string, number> = {\n  searchAll: 5,\n  searchFiles: 5,\n  searchNotes: 5,\n  searchTasks: 5,\n  searchKnowledgeBank: 5,\n  queryHistory: 5,\n  urlReader: 3,\n  codeExecution: 2,\n  weather: 3,\n  default: 10,\n};\n```\n\nCheck before calling:\n```typescript\nconst { limited, message } = isToolRateLimited(budget, toolName);\nif (limited) {\n  return { error: message };\n}\nbudget = recordToolCall(budget, toolName);\n```\n\nReturns:\n```typescript\n{\n  limited: true,\n  message: \"searchAll limit reached (5/5). Try a different approach.\"\n}\n```\n\n## Token Estimation\n\nRough estimates for context tracking (chars/4 approximation):\n\n```typescript\n// From packages/backend/convex/lib/budgetTracker.ts\nconst TOOL_TOKEN_ESTIMATES: Record<string, number> = {\n  searchAll: 800,\n  searchFiles: 400,\n  searchNotes: 300,\n  searchTasks: 300,\n  searchKnowledgeBank: 500,\n  queryHistory: 400,\n  urlReader: 1500,\n  codeExecution: 600,\n  calculator: 100,\n  datetime: 50,\n  weather: 200,\n  default: 300,\n};\n```\n\nGet estimate before tool execution:\n```typescript\nconst estimatedCost = estimateToolCost(toolName);\n```\n\nRecord actual usage after:\n```typescript\nconst actualTokens = countTokens(toolResult);\nbudget = recordUsage(budget, actualTokens);\n```\n\n## Context Getting Full Detection\n\nTiered warnings based on usage:\n\n```typescript\n// From packages/backend/convex/lib/budgetTracker.ts\nexport function formatStatus(state: BudgetState): string {\n  const percentUsed = getContextPercent(state);\n  const toolCount = state.toolCallCount;\n\n  if (percentUsed >= 70) {\n    return `[Budget Critical: ~${percentUsed}% context, ${toolCount} tools]\nAnswer now with current info or ask user for clarification.`;\n  }\n\n  if (percentUsed >= 50) {\n    return `[Budget: ~${percentUsed}% context, ${toolCount} tools]\nPrioritize essential searches only.`;\n  }\n\n  return `[Context: ${toolCount} tool calls, ~${percentUsed}% of context used]`;\n}\n```\n\nCheck programmatically:\n```typescript\nif (isContextGettingFull(budget)) {\n  // >= 50% used - inject warning into prompt\n}\n```\n\n## Truncation Strategy\n\nPreserve structure while managing context:\n\n```typescript\n// From packages/backend/convex/lib/budgetTracker.ts\nexport const MIN_TOOL_CALLS_FOR_TRUNCATION = 2; // Don''t truncate first tool call\n\nexport function truncateToolResult(\n  result: unknown,\n  maxChars: number = 500,\n): unknown {\n  const str = JSON.stringify(result);\n  if (str.length <= maxChars) return result;\n\n  // Arrays: keep first 3 items\n  if (Array.isArray(result)) {\n    return result\n      .slice(0, 3)\n      .map((item) => truncateToolResult(item, Math.floor(maxChars / 3)));\n  }\n\n  // Strings: truncate with marker\n  if (typeof result === \"string\") {\n    return `${result.slice(0, maxChars)}... [truncated]`;\n  }\n\n  // Objects: truncate string values\n  if (typeof result === \"object\" && result !== null) {\n    const truncated: Record<string, unknown> = {};\n    const keys = Object.keys(result);\n    if (keys.length === 0) return result;\n    const charPerKey = Math.floor(maxChars / keys.length);\n    for (const key of keys) {\n      truncated[key] = truncateToolResult(\n        (result as Record<string, unknown>)[key],\n        charPerKey,\n      );\n    }\n    return truncated;\n  }\n\n  return result;\n}\n```\n\nApply after MIN_TOOL_CALLS_FOR_TRUNCATION:\n```typescript\nif (budget.toolCallCount >= MIN_TOOL_CALLS_FOR_TRUNCATION) {\n  toolResult = truncateToolResult(toolResult);\n}\n```\n\n## Search Quality Detection\n\nDetect diminishing returns from repeated searches:\n\n```typescript\n// From packages/backend/convex/lib/budgetTracker.ts\nexport const LOW_QUALITY_SCORE_THRESHOLD = 0.7;\n\nexport function formatSearchWarning(state: BudgetState): string | null {\n  const { searchHistory } = state;\n  if (searchHistory.length === 0) return null;\n\n  const latest = searchHistory[searchHistory.length - 1];\n\n  // Repeated query\n  const isDuplicate = searchHistory\n    .slice(0, -1)\n    .some((h) => h.query.toLowerCase().trim() === latest.query.toLowerCase().trim());\n  if (isDuplicate) {\n    return `Already searched \"${latest.query}\". Try different terms or answer with current info.`;\n  }\n\n  // Decreasing quality (3+ searches)\n  if (searchHistory.length >= 3) {\n    const last3 = searchHistory.slice(-3).map((h) => h.topScore);\n    if (last3[0] > last3[1] && last3[1] > last3[2] && last3[2] < 0.5) {\n      return \"Search quality declining. Consider different approach or ask user.\";\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Many searches without good results\n  if (searchHistory.length >= 4) {\n    return \"Multiple searches performed. Consider answering with current info.\";\n  }\n\n  return null;\n}\n```\n\nCheck for stuck patterns:\n```typescript\nexport function shouldSuggestAskUser(state: BudgetState): boolean {\n  const { searchHistory } = state;\n\n  // 3+ searches with all low quality results\n  if (searchHistory.length >= 3) {\n    const recentScores = searchHistory.slice(-3).map((h) => h.topScore);\n    if (recentScores.every((s) => s < 0.7)) return true;\n  }\n\n  // Budget critical (>= 70%)\n  if (getContextPercent(state) >= 70) return true;\n\n  return false;\n}\n```\n\n## Key Files\n\n- `packages/backend/convex/lib/budgetTracker.ts` - Budget tracking, timeouts, truncation\n- `packages/backend/convex/generation/tools.ts` - Tool building with budget integration\n\n## BuildTools Integration\n\nPass budget state to tools for rate limiting:\n\n```typescript\n// From packages/backend/convex/generation/tools.ts\nexport interface BuildToolsConfig {\n  ctx: ActionCtx;\n  userId: Id<\"users\">;\n  conversationId: Id<\"conversations\">;\n  budgetState?: {\n    current: BudgetState;\n    update: (newState: BudgetState) => void;\n  };\n  // ... other config\n}\n\nexport function buildTools(config: BuildToolsConfig): Record<string, unknown> {\n  const { budgetState } = config;\n\n  // Pass budgetState to tools that need it (searchAll, etc.)\n  tools.searchAll = createSearchAllTool(\n    ctx,\n    userId,\n    conversationId,\n    searchCache,\n    budgetState, // Tool can check limits and update state\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Avoid\n\n- Don''t block tool calls based on budget - use for awareness only\n- Don''t skip timeout wrapper - prevents generation hangs\n- Don''t ignore rate limits - prevents tool abuse\n- Don''t truncate first tool call - need full initial context\n- Don''t ignore search quality warnings - indicates stuck patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:19:47.047Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced budget tracking and runaway pattern detection capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级预算跟踪和逃逸模式检测能力的AI代理。","ja":"高度な予算追跡とランアウェイパターン検出機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 예산 추적 및 런어웨이 패턴 감지 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de seguimiento de presupuesto avanzadas y detección de patrones descontrolados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des fonctionnalités de suivi de budget avancées et de détection de modèles déchaînés.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Budget-Verfolgungsfunktionen und die Erkennung von unkontrollierten Mustern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que precisam de capacidades avançadas de rastreamento orçamentário e detecção de padrões desenfreados.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности отслеживания бюджета и обнаружения выбегающих паттернов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتتبع الميزانية والكشف عن الأنماط الهاربة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track context consumption and detect runaway patterns using the BudgetState interface, providing visibility into tool call counts and search history through protocols like AGPL-3.0, while utilizing libraries for awareness-based tracking.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪上下文消耗和检测逃逸模式的能力，使用BudgetState接口，通过AGPL-3.0等协议提供对工具调用次数和搜索历史的可见性，同时利用库实现基于意识的跟踪。","ja":"BudgetStateインターフェイスを使用して、エージェントにコンテキスト消費を追跡し、ランアウェイパターンを検出する能力を与え、AGPL-3.0などのプロトコルを通じてツール呼び出し回数や検索履歴の可視性を提供し、ライブラリを使用して認識ベースの追跡を実現します。","ko":"BudgetState 인터페이스를 사용하여 에이전트가 컨텍스트 소비를 추적하고 런어웨이 패턴을 감지하는 기능을 제공하며, AGPL-3.0과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 툴 호출 횟수와 검색 기록의 가시성을 제공하고, 라이브러리를 사용하여 인식 기반 추적을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un seguimiento del consumo de contexto y detectar patrones descontrolados utilizando la interfaz BudgetState, proporcionando visibilidad en los recuentos de llamadas de herramientas y el historial de búsqueda a través de protocolos como AGPL-3.0, mientras utiliza bibliotecas para el seguimiento basado en la conciencia.","fr":"Autorise les agents à suivre la consommation de contexte et à détecter les modèles déchaînés en utilisant l''interface BudgetState, fournissant une visibilité sur les comptes d''appels d''outils et l''historique de recherche via des protocoles tels que AGPL-3.0, tout en utilisant des bibliothèques pour un suivi basé sur la conscience.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, den Kontextverbrauch zu verfolgen und unkontrollierte Muster mithilfe der BudgetState-Schnittstelle zu erkennen, wodurch Einblicke in die Aufrufzählung von Tools und die Suchverlauf über Protokolle wie AGPL-3.0 ermöglicht werden, während Bibliotheken für ein bewusstseinsbasiertes Tracking verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a rastrear o consumo de contexto e detectar padrões desenfreados usando a interface BudgetState, fornecendo visibilidade para as contagens de chamadas de ferramentas e histórico de pesquisa por meio de protocolos como AGPL-3.0, ao mesmo tempo em que utilizam bibliotecas para rastreamento baseado em conscientização.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать потребление контекста и обнаруживать выбегающие паттерны с помощью интерфейса BudgetState, обеспечивая видимость количества вызовов инструментов и истории поиска по протоколам типа AGPL-3.0, а также использует библиотеки для отслеживания на основе осведомленности.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تتبع استهلاك السياق والكشف عن الأنماط الهاربة باستخدام واجهة BudgetState، مما يوفر الرؤية لعدد مكالمات الأدوات وتاريخ البحث من خلال بروتوكولات مثل AGPL-3.0، وفي الوقت نفسه استخدام المكتبات لتتبع القائم على الوعي."},"useCases":{"en":["Tracking context consumption for AI generation tool calls","Detecting runaway patterns in search history","Providing visibility into tool call counts and max tokens used"],"zh":["跟踪AI生成工具的上下文消耗","检测搜索历史中的逃逸模式","提供对工具调用次数和最大令牌使用情况的可见性"],"ja":["AI生成ツールのコンテキスト消費を追跡する","検索履歴のランアウェイパターンを検出する","ツール呼び出し回数と最大トークン使用状況の可視性を提供する"],"ko":["AI 생성 툴의 컨텍스트 소비를 추적하는 것","검색 기록의 런어웨이 패턴을 탐지하는 것","툴 호출 횟수와 최대 토큰 사용 상황의 가시성을 제공하는 것"],"es":["Seguimiento del consumo de contexto para llamadas de herramientas de generación de IA","Detección de patrones descontrolados en el historial de búsqueda","Proporcionar visibilidad en los recuentos de llamadas de herramientas y los tokens máximos utilizados"],"fr":["Suivi de la consommation de contexte pour les appels d''outils de génération d''IA","Détection de modèles déchaînés dans l''historique de recherche","Fournir une visibilité sur les comptes d''appels d''outils et les jetons maximaux utilisés"],"de":["Verfolgung des Kontextverbrauchs für Aufrufe von KI-Generierungstools","Erkennung von unkontrollierten Mustern in der Suchverlaufsliste","Bereitstellung von Einblicken in die Aufrufzählung von Tools und die maximal verwendeten Token"],"pt":["Rastreamento do consumo de contexto para chamadas de ferramentas de geração de IA","Detecção de padrões desenfreados no histórico de pesquisa","Fornecimento de visibilidade para as contagens de chamadas de ferramentas e tokens máximos utilizados"],"ru":["Отслеживание потребления контекста для вызовов инструментов генерации ИИ","Обнаружение выбегающих паттернов в истории поиска","Обеспечение видимости количества вызовов инструментов и максимально используемых токенов"],"ar":["تتبع استهلاك السياق لمكالمات أدوات توليد الذكاء الاصطناعي","الكشف عن الأنماط الهاربة في تاريخ البحث","توفير الرؤية لعدد مكالمات الأدوات والرموز القصوى المستخدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not block tool calls, relies on existing step limits","Requires self-hosting or hosted cloud version access"],"zh":["不阻止工具调用，依赖现有的步骤限制","需要自托管或托管云版本访问"],"ja":["ツール呼び出しをブロックしない、既存のステップ制限に依存する","セルフホスティングまたはホストクラウドバージョンへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["툴 호출을 차단하지 않음, 기존의 단계 제한에 의존함","셀프 호스팅 또는 호스팅 클라우드 버전 액세스가 필요함"],"es":["No bloquea las llamadas de herramientas, depende de los límites de paso existentes","Requiere acceso a la versión autohospedada o en la nube"],"fr":["Ne bloque pas les appels d''outils, repose sur les limites de pas existantes","Nécessite un accès à la version auto-hébergée ou en nuage"],"de":["Blockiert keine Tool-Aufrufe, verlässt sich auf bestehende Schrittlimits","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Selbst-Hosting- oder Cloud-Version"],"pt":["Não bloqueia chamadas de ferramentas, depende dos limites de etapas existentes","Requer acesso à versão auto-hospedada ou hospedada na nuvem"],"ru":["Не блокирует вызовы инструментов, полагается на существующие ограничения шагов","Требует доступа к自охостинговой или облачной версии"],"ar":["لا يمنع مكالمات الأدوات، ويعتمد على حدود الخطوات الموجودة","يتطلب الوصول إلى الإصدار المضيف الذاتي أو الإصدار المضيف السحابي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d731101c652d0cdaec250dfca5be02e780da1765a561c8883c4b574539ea5559","qualityScore":39}');
