gents d''IA et des outils d''UI, évoluez et partagez","de":"Entwickeln Sie Anwendungen mit KI-Agents und UI-Tools, entwickeln und teilen","pt":"O agente de IA para UI permite desenvolver aplicativos de forma colaborativa, com recursos de criação e compartilhamento em tempo real","ru":"ИИ Агент для UI позволяет разработать приложения совместно, с функциями создания и обмена в реальном времени","ar":"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لواجهة المستخدم يسمح بتطوير التطبيقات بشكل تعاوني، مع ميزات إنشاء ومشاركة في الوقت الفعلي","en":"You and Claude using apps together. Evolving them while they run. Making. Sharing. Downloading."},"definition":{"en":"You and Claude using apps together. Evolving them while they run. Making. Sharing. Downloading."},"features":{"zh":["实时演化应用","共享应用开发","提高开发效率","支持多种开发语言","集成CLI工具"],"ja":["アプリの共同開発","進化的なアプリ開発","開発効率の向上","多言語対応","CLIツールの統合"],"ko":["애플리케이션 공동 개발","진화적인 애플리케이션 개발","개발 효율성 향상","다중 언어 지원","CLI 툴 통합"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones con Agentes de IA","Evolución de aplicaciones en tiempo real","Compartir aplicaciones con otros desarrolladores","Descargar aplicaciones de otros desarrolladores","Integración con herramientas de UI","Desarrollo de aplicaciones con React, Python y Node.js"],"fr":["Création d''applications avec des Agents d''IA","Évolution d''applications en temps réel","Partage d''applications avec d''autres développeurs","Téléchargement d''applications d''autres développeurs","Intégration avec des outils d''UI","Développement d''applications avec React, Python et Node.js"],"de":["Erstellung von Anwendungen mit KI-Agents","Entwicklung von Anwendungen in Echtzeit","Teilen von Anwendungen mit anderen Entwicklern","Herunterladen von Anwendungen anderer Entwickler","Integration mit UI-Tools","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit React, Python und Node.js"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos em tempo real","Criação e compartilhamento de aplicativos","Download de aplicativos personalizados","Integração com tecnologias como React e Node.js","Suporte a CLI para automação de tarefas"],"ru":["Создание приложений в реальном времени","Создание и обмен приложениями","Скачивание персонализированных приложений","Интеграция с технологиями seperti React и Node.js","Поддержка CLI для автоматизации задач"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات في الوقت الفعلي","إنشاء وتشارك التطبيقات","تنزيل التطبيقات المخصصة","التكامل مع تقنيات مثل React و Node.js","دعم CLI للautomatisation المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","ui工具","实时演化应用","共享应用开发","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ui機能","アプリの共同開発","進化的なアプリ開発","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","ui 툴","애플리케이션 공동 개발","진화적인 애플리케이션 개발","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de UI","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a herramientas de UI","herramientas de UI vs competidores","instalar herramientas de UI","guía de configuración de herramientas de UI","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Agentes de IA","herramientas de UI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''UI","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","alternatives aux outils d''UI","outils d''UI vs concurrents","installer des outils d''UI","guide de configuration des outils d''UI","développement d''applications avec des Agents d''IA","outils d''UI pour développeurs"],"de":["wie man UI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu UI-Tools","UI-Tools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von UI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für UI-Tools","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit KI-Agents","UI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar agente de IA para UI","o que é agente de IA para UI","alternativas para agente de IA para UI","agente de IA para UI vs outros","instalar agente de IA para UI","guia de configuração do agente de IA para UI"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент для UI","что такое ИИ Агент для UI","альтернативы для ИИ Агента для UI","ИИ Агент для UI vs другие","установить ИИ Агент для UI","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента для UI"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي لواجهة المستخدم","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي لواجهة المستخدم","بديلات لوكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي لواجهة المستخدم","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي لواجهة المستخدم مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي لواجهة المستخدم","دليل إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي لواجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"zot","repo":"frictionless","repoPath":"zot/frictionless","stars":4,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T22:58:57Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui","description":"use when **running Frictionless UIs** or needing to understand UI structure (before modifying one)","bodyPreview":"# UI MCP\n\nFoundation for building and running ui-engine UIs with Lua apps connected to widgets.\n\n## Simple Requests\n\nWhen the user says `/ui`, show app-console as in Quick Start. Prefer Playwright if the user has been using it.\n\nWhen the user says `show APP`, show APP as in Quick Start. Prefer Playwright if the user has been using it.\n\nWhen the user says `events` it means to start the event loop, but not use `.ui/mcp display` or `.ui/mcp browser` as in Quick Start.\n\n## Helper Script Reference\n\nT","body":"# UI MCP\n\nFoundation for building and running ui-engine UIs with Lua apps connected to widgets.\n\n## Simple Requests\n\nWhen the user says `/ui`, show app-console as in Quick Start. Prefer Playwright if the user has been using it.\n\nWhen the user says `show APP`, show APP as in Quick Start. Prefer Playwright if the user has been using it.\n\nWhen the user says `events` it means to start the event loop, but not use `.ui/mcp display` or `.ui/mcp browser` as in Quick Start.\n\n## Helper Script Reference\n\nThe `.ui/mcp` script provides commands for interacting with the UI server. **Always use relative paths** (never absolute — absolute paths break the user''s permission rules).\n\n**`{url}` means the UI server URL** — read the port from `.ui/ui-port` and construct `http://localhost:{port}`. This is NOT the MCP connection port — it''s the UI''s own HTTP server. Use `.ui/mcp status` when you also need session count or base_dir.\n\n**CRITICAL: URLs must NEVER include session IDs.** Always use `{url}/?conserve=true` (root URL). Session IDs in URLs will cause problems.\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `.ui/mcp status` | Get server status (url, sessions, base_dir) |\n| `.ui/mcp browser` | Open browser to `{url}/?conserve=true` |\n| `.ui/mcp display APP` | Display APP in the browser |\n| `.ui/mcp run ''lua code''` | Execute Lua code in session |\n| `.ui/mcp event` | Wait for next UI event (120s timeout) |\n| `.ui/mcp state` | Get current session state |\n| `.ui/mcp variables` | Get current variable values |\n| `.ui/mcp audit APP` | Run code quality audit on APP |\n| `.ui/mcp progress APP PERCENT STAGE` | Report build progress |\n| `.ui/mcp linkapp add\\|remove APP` | Manage app symlinks |\n| `.ui/mcp checkpoint CMD APP [MSG]` | Manage checkpoints (save/list/rollback/diff/clear) |\n| `.ui/mcp theme list` | List available themes |\n| `.ui/mcp theme classes [THEME]` | List semantic classes for theme |\n| `.ui/mcp theme audit APP [THEME]` | Audit app''s theme class usage |\n\n## Quick Start: Show an Existing App\n\n### A. Read the design\n\nRead `{base_dir}/apps/APP/design.md` to learn the global variable name (e.g., `claudePanel`) and event types.\n\n### B. Display the app\n\n- Use `.ui/mcp run` to check if `mcp.value.type == AppName` (PascalCase version of app-name)\n  - If not, use `.ui/mcp display app-name`\n- If Playwright is connected:\n  - `browser_evaluate` with `function: \"() => window.location.href\"` to get current URL\n  - If URL does NOT start with `{url}/`, then `browser_navigate` to `{url}/mark-playwright.html?url={url}/?conserve=true`\n  - **ONLY use mark-playwright.html when navigating via Playwright.** Never use it for `.ui/mcp browser`.\n  - Do not wait for page to display or take a snapshot\n- Otherwise, run `.ui/mcp browser`\n\n### C. Start the event loop\n\n```\nBash(.ui/mcp event, run_in_background=true)\n```\n\nThe UI will NOT respond to clicks until this is running.\n\n### D. Handle events\n\n- Parse JSON: `[{\"app\":\"app-console\",\"event\":\"select\",\"name\":\"contacts\"}]`\n- Read design.md''s \"Events\" section for how to handle each event type\n- **For UI changes**: Check event''s `handler` field and invoke that skill\n- Simple state changes: use `.ui/mcp run` directly\n- Kill old task, then restart: `Bash(.ui/mcp event, run_in_background=true)`\n\n---\n\n## Details\n\n### Step A: The `app` field\n\n**The `app` field is the ONLY field that determines which design.md you read.** Do NOT be misled by `context`, `note`, `name`, or other fields that mention other app names — these are event data, not the source app.\n\n```\nEvent: {\"app\":\"app-console\", \"event\":\"app_created\", \"name\":\"contacts\", \"context\":\"contacts\"}\n       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nRead:  .ui/apps/app-console/design.md  <-- ONLY use the \"app\" field\n```\n\nDo NOT skip reading design.md — even for events that seem obvious like `app_created`.\n\n### Step C: Event loop lifecycle\n\n**Only ONE listener may exist at a time** — the script enforces this via `.ui/.eventpid` and will error if a listener is already running.\n\n**Task lifecycle:**\n1. Run `.ui/mcp event` with `Bash(run_in_background=true)`, save the task_id. If it errors with \"already running\", do nothing — the script manages the PID lock itself. Do NOT manually check PIDs or the `.eventpid` file; just wait for the existing listener to complete.\n2. When the background task completes, **ALWAYS read the output file immediately** — do NOT assume timeout. Failing to read means silently dropping events.\n3. Handle any events received\n4. Start a fresh listener (go to step 1)\n\n**Exit codes:**\n- 0 + JSON output = events received (may be empty array `[]` for timeout)\n- 52 = server restarted (restart both server and event loop)\n\n**After `ui_configure`:** Restart the event loop — reconfiguring changes the MCP port that `.ui/mcp event` uses.\n\n### Step D: Handler dispatch and build settings\n\n**NEVER modify or create UI code directly.** When an event requires UI changes, check the `handler` field and invoke that skill. This applies to ALL UI modifications — requirements, design, code, and viewdefs.\n\nEvery event has two fields injected automatically based on the status bar toggles:\n\n| Toggle | Field | Values |\n|--------|-------|--------|\n| Build mode (rocket/diamond) | `handler` | `\"/ui-fast\"` or `\"/ui-thorough\"` |\n| Execution (hourglass/arrows) | `background` | `false` or `true` |\n\nThese reflect the user''s explicit choices. For background execution:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"ui-builder\", run_in_background=true, prompt=\"invoke {handler} skill...\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## App Variable Convention\n\nEach app defines a **global variable** for interacting with it via `.ui/mcp run`:\n\n| App Name       | Global Variable | Example Call                        |\n|----------------|-----------------|-------------------------------------|\n| `claude-panel` | `claudePanel`   | `claudePanel:addAgentMessage(\"Hi\")` |\n| `contacts`     | `contacts`      | `contacts:addContact(name, email)`  |\n| `ma-luba`      | `maLuba`        | `maLuba:someMethod()`               |\n\n**Convention:** kebab-case app name → camelCase variable. The global variable is exactly the camelCase conversion of the app directory name (no \"App\" suffix).\n\nFind the variable by looking at the bottom of `app.lua` for the instance creation:\n```lua\nif not session.reloading then\n    claudePanel = ClaudePanel:new()  -- <-- this is the global variable\nend\n```\n\n## Chat Messages\n\nAll chat messages render markdown. Use it via `.ui/mcp run`:\n```\n.ui/mcp run ''mcp:addAgentMessage(\"Found **salary data**: $150k-$180k\")''\n```\n\n### Pointing at UI elements\n\nWhen the user asks \"where is X?\" or \"show me the Y\", **both highlight the element AND include a clickable link** in your response so the user can re-trigger the highlight later:\n\n1. Find the element''s DOM id (from variables, viewdefs, or Playwright)\n2. Highlight it immediately: `mcp.code = [=[window.uiApp.highlight(\"ui-42\")// ]=] .. os.time()`\n3. Reply with a rich message containing a highlight link:\n\n```lua\nmcp:addRichMessage(\n    \"The search box is \"\n    .. mcp:highlightLink(\"ui-42\", \"right here\")\n    .. \". Type to filter the list.\"\n)\n```\n\nThe link stays in the chat history — the user can click it anytime to re-highlight the element.\n\n### Message methods\n\n| Method | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `mcp:addAgentMessage(text)` | Agent message with markdown rendering |\n| `mcp:addRichMessage(html)` | Agent message with raw HTML (for highlight links, custom content) |\n| `mcp:highlightLink(elementId, label)` | Returns anchor HTML that highlights an element on click |\n| `mcp:addAgentThinking(text)` | Thinking/progress message (italic, updates status bar) |\n| `mcp:renderMarkdown(text)` | Convert markdown to HTML fragment (for custom use) |\n\n## Building or Modifying UIs\n\nWhen the user asks for changes outside an event loop, ask which mode they prefer or default to `/ui-fast` for small changes.\n\n**Before building a new app:**\n1. Create the app directory: `mkdir -p {base_dir}/apps/<app>`\n2. Write requirements to `{base_dir}/apps/<app>/requirements.md`\n\n### Requirements Format\n\n```markdown\n# Descriptive Title\n\nA short paragraph describing what the app does.\n\n## Section 1\n...\n```\n\nThe first line is a descriptive title (e.g., \"# Contact Manager\"), followed by prose describing the app. See `.claude/skills/ui-builder/examples/requirements.md` for a reference.\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\n{base_dir}/\n├── apps/<app>/           # App source files\n│   ├── requirements.md   # What to build (you write this)\n│   ├── design.md         # How it works (generated)\n│   ├── app.lua           # Lua code (generated)\n│   └── viewdefs/         # HTML templates (generated)\n├── lua/                  # Symlinks to app lua files\n├── viewdefs/             # Symlinks to app viewdefs\n├── html/<app>            # Symlink to app dir (serves static files at /<app>/)\n├── html/<app>-storage    # Symlink to storage dir (serves at /<app>-storage/)\n├── storage/<app>/        # Optional local storage (isolated from app updates)\n├── patterns/             # Reusable pattern documentation\n├── themes/               # Theme definitions and CSS variables\n├── event                 # Event wait script\n└── log/                  # Runtime logs\n```\n\n## File Ownership\n\n- `requirements.md` — you write/update this\n- `design.md`, `app.lua`, `viewdefs/` — **MUST load `/ui-basics` first**, then use `/ui-fast` or `/ui-thorough`. This is a non-standard system; standard web patterns will lead you astray.\n\n## Debugging\n\n- **Lua logs:** `{base_dir}/log/lua.log` for Lua errors\n- **MCP server stderr:** `.ui/log/mcp.log`\n- **Variable inspector:** `http://localhost:{mcp-port}/variables` (read port from `.ui/mcp-port`) — curl for JSON, browser for interactive inspector\n- **MCP resources:** `ui://variables` (full variable tree), `ui://state` (live state JSON)\n- **JS diagnostics:** `window.uiApp.getStore()` (variable state) and `window.uiApp.getBinding()` (widget bindings) in browser console\n- **Remote JS execution:** Set `mcp.code` from Lua — bound to `ui-code` in the MCP shell, enabling JS execution in the browser. Critical when using a system browser instead of Playwright. Re-assigning the same value is a no-op (change detection); append a nonce to re-execute (e.g., `code .. \"\\n// \" .. nonce`)\n- `.ui/mcp run` returns error messages\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:38:40.998Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing interactive user interface capabilities with Lua apps and widgets.","zh":"非常适合需要与Lua应用和小部件交互的用户界面功能的AI代理。","ja":"Luaアプリとウィジェットとのインタラクティブなユーザーインターフェイス機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Lua 애플리케이션 및 위젯과 상호 작용할 수 있는 대화형 사용자 인터페이스 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de interfaz de usuario interactiva con aplicaciones y widgets Lua.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités d''interface utilisateur interactive avec des applications et des widgets Lua.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die interaktive Benutzeroberflächenfunktionen mit Lua-Apps und -Widgets benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades de interface do usuário interativa com aplicativos e widgets Lua.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы возможности интерактивного пользовательского интерфейса с приложениями и виджетами Lua.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية مع تطبيقات Lua والwidgets."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build and run ui-engine UIs with connected widgets, utilizing Lua apps and protocols like Playwright, and enables event loop management with specific commands like `/ui` and `events`.","zh":"赋予代理构建和运行ui-engine UI，并连接小部件，利用Lua应用和Playwright等协议，并使用特定命令（如 `/ui` 和 `events`）启用事件循环管理。","ja":"エージェントがui-engine UIを構築して実行し、ウィジェットを接続してLuaアプリとPlaywrightなどのプロトコルを利用し、 `/ui`および`events`などの特定のコマンドを使用してイベントループ管理を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 ui-engine UI를 구축하고 실행하고 위젯을 연결하여 Lua 애플리케이션 및 Playwright와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하며, `/ui` 및 `events`와 같은 특정 명령을 사용하여 이벤트 루프 관리를 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y ejecutar interfaces de usuario ui-engine con widgets conectados, utilizando aplicaciones Lua y protocolos como Playwright, y permite la gestión del bucle de eventos con comandos específicos como `/ui` y `events`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et d''exécuter des interfaces utilisateur ui-engine avec des widgets connectés, en utilisant des applications Lua et des protocoles comme Playwright, et permet la gestion de la boucle d''événements avec des commandes spécifiques comme `/ui` et `events`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, ui-engine-Benutzeroberflächen mit verbundenen Widgets zu erstellen und auszuführen, indem Lua-Apps und Protokolle wie Playwright verwendet werden, und ermöglicht die Verwaltung der Ereignisschleife mit bestimmten Befehlen wie `/ui` und `events`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir e executar UIs do ui-engine com widgets conectados, utilizando aplicativos Lua e protocolos como o Playwright, e permite o gerenciamento de loop de eventos com comandos específicos como `/ui` e `events`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и запускать UI-интерфейсы ui-engine с подключенными виджетами, используя приложения Lua и протоколы, такие как Playwright, и позволяет управлять циклом событий с помощью конкретных команд, таких как `/ui` и `events`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء وتشغيل واجهات ui-engine UI مع widgets متصلة، باستخدام تطبيقات Lua وبروتوكولات مثل Playwright، وتمكن من إدارة حلقة الأحداث بأوامر محددة مثل `/ui` و `events`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI interactions with Playwright","Generating custom UI components with Lua","Debugging UI events with the event loop"],"zh":["使用Playwright自动化UI交互","使用Lua生成自定义UI组件","使用事件循环调试UI事件"],"ja":["Playwrightを使用したUIインタラクションの自動化","Luaを使用したカスタムUIコンポーネントの生成","イベントループを使用したUIイベントのデバッグ"],"ko":["Playwright를 사용한 UI 상호 작용 자동화","Lua를 사용한 사용자 정의 UI 구성 요소 생성","이벤트 루프를 사용한 UI 이벤트 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones de interfaz de usuario con Playwright","Generar componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados con Lua","Depurar eventos de interfaz de usuario con la bucle de eventos"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions d''interface utilisateur avec Playwright","Générer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés avec Lua","Déboguer les événements d''interface utilisateur avec la boucle d''événements"],"de":["Automatisieren von Benutzeroberflächeninteraktionen mit Playwright","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Lua","Debuggen von Benutzeroberflächenereignissen mit der Ereignisschleife"],"pt":["Automatizar interações de UI com o Playwright","Gerar componentes personalizados de UI com Lua","Depurar eventos de UI com o loop de eventos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать взаимодействия с UI с помощью Playwright","Генерировать пользовательские компоненты UI с помощью Lua","Отлаживать события UI с помощью цикла событий"],"ar":["أتمتة تفاعلات واجهة المستخدم مع Playwright","_generating مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة مع Lua","تصحيح أخطاء أحداث واجهة المستخدم مع حلقة الأحداث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Lua support","Playwright preference may affect compatibility","Specific commands like `/ui` and `events` must be used"],"zh":["需要Lua支持","Playwright首选项可能会影响兼容性","必须使用特定命令（如 `/ui` 和 `events`）"],"ja":["Luaサポートが必要","Playwrightの優先順位によって互換性が影響を受ける可能性がある"," `/ui`および`events`などの特定のコマンドを使用する必要がある"],"ko":["Lua 지원이 필요함","Playwright 우선 순위가 호환성을 영향을 줄 수 있음","특정 명령 (`/ui` 및 `events` 등)이 반드시 사용되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere soporte para Lua","La preferencia de Playwright puede afectar la compatibilidad","Deben utilizarse comandos específicos como `/ui` y `events`"],"fr":["Nécessite un support pour Lua","La préférence pour Playwright peut affecter la compatibilité","Des commandes spécifiques comme `/ui` et `events` doivent être utilisées"],"de":["Benötigt Lua-Unterstützung","Die Präferenz für Playwright kann die Kompatibilität beeinflussen","Bestimmte Befehle wie `/ui` und `events` müssen verwendet werden"],"pt":["Requer suporte a Lua","Preferência do Playwright pode afetar a compatibilidade","Comandos específicos como `/ui` e `events` devem ser usados"],"ru":["Требуется поддержка Lua","Предпочтение Playwright может повлиять на совместимость","Конкретные команды, такие как `/ui` и `events`, должны быть использованы"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم Lua","يمكن أن يؤثر تفضيل Playwright على التوافق","يجب استخدام أوامر محددة مثل `/ui` و `events`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"182b0049834589f72bb98ddf4554c3b351885fe9361de0471ac92c67f5d8e6a2","qualityScore":39}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ll7/robot_sf_ll7/gh-issue-sequencer', 'community', 'll7', 'robot_sf_ll7', 'll7/robot_sf_ll7', 'gh-issue-sequencer', 4, 2, 39, '2026-02-25T13:40:29Z', '2026-02-26T08:38:58.964Z', '3682499cc4644889c591d6c92a38708d0556d9043b7292742fb08e6412c51ab4', '{"id":"ll7/robot_sf_ll7/gh-issue-sequencer","name":"gh-issue-sequencer","description":{"zh":"gh-issue-sequencer 是 robot_sf 在 ll7 命名空间中的一个 AI 工具，用于提高开发效率","ja":"gh-issue-sequencer は、開発プロセスを最適化するための AI エージェントです","ko":"gh-issue-sequencer 는 ll7 네임스페이스의 robot_sf 에서 개발된 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"El agente de inteligencia artificial robot_sf en el namespace ll7 es una herramienta para gestionar problemas en GitHub","fr":"L''agent d''intelligence artificielle robot_sf dans l''espace de noms ll7 est un outil pour gérer les problèmes GitHub","de":"Der KI-Agent robot_sf im ll7-Namespace ist ein Tool für die Verwaltung von GitHub-Problemen","pt":"O gh-issue-sequencer é uma ferramenta de IA que opera no namespace ll7, permitindo a sequenciação de issues no GitHub","ru":"ИИ Агент gh-issue-sequencer работает в namespace ll7, обеспечивая последовательную обработку проблем GitHub","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي gh-issue-sequencer تعمل في namespace ll7، مما يتيح ترتيب قضايا GitHub","en":"robot_sf in the ll7 namespace."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具 gh-issue-sequencer 介绍","ja":"AIエージェント gh-issue-sequencer を使用する","ko":"AI 에이전트 gh-issue-sequencer 기능","es":"Secuencia de problemas de GitHub con robot_sf","fr":"Séquenceur de problèmes GitHub avec robot_sf","de":"GitHub Issue Sequencer mit robot_sf","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: gh-issue-sequencer","ru":"ИИ Агенты: gh-issue-sequencer","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: gh-issue-sequencer","en":"gh-issue-sequencer"},"description":{"zh":"gh-issue-sequencer 是 robot_sf 在 ll7 命名空间中的一个 AI 工具，用于提高开发效率","ja":"gh-issue-sequencer は、開発プロセスを最適化するための AI エージェントです","ko":"gh-issue-sequencer 는 ll7 네임스페이스의 robot_sf 에서 개발된 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"El agente de inteligencia artificial robot_sf en el namespace ll7 es una herramienta para gestionar problemas en GitHub","fr":"L''agent d''intelligence artificielle robot_sf dans l''espace de noms ll7 est un outil pour gérer les problèmes GitHub","de":"Der KI-Agent robot_sf im ll7-Namespace ist ein Tool für die Verwaltung von GitHub-Problemen","pt":"O gh-issue-sequencer é uma ferramenta de IA que opera no namespace ll7, permitindo a sequenciação de issues no GitHub","ru":"ИИ Агент gh-issue-sequencer работает в namespace ll7, обеспечивая последовательную обработку проблем GitHub","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي gh-issue-sequencer تعمل في namespace ll7، مما يتيح ترتيب قضايا GitHub","en":"robot_sf in the ll7 namespace."},"definition":{"en":"robot_sf in the ll7 namespace."},"features":{"zh":["自动化 GitHub 问题管理","优化开发流程","提高团队协作效率","支持多种开发工具","易于安装和设置","高可定制性"],"ja":["GitHub Issue の自動化管理","開発プロセスの最適化","チームのコラボレーション効率の向上","多種の開発ツールをサポート","簡単なインストールと設定","高カスタマイズ性"],"ko":["GitHub 이슈 자동화 관리","개발 프로세스 최적화","チーム 협업 효율성 향상","다양한 개발 도구 지원","쉽게 설치 및 설정","높은 사용자 정의 가능성"],"es":["Gestión de problemas en GitHub","Integración con robot_sf","Namespace ll7","Herramienta de inteligencia artificial","Secuenciación de problemas","Automatización de tareas"],"fr":["Gestion des problèmes GitHub","Intégration avec robot_sf","Espace de noms ll7","Outil d''intelligence artificielle","Séquençage des problèmes","Automatisation des tâches"],"de":["Verwaltung von GitHub-Problemen","Integration mit robot_sf","ll7-Namespace","KI-Tool","Problemmsequenzierung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Sequenciação de issues no GitHub","Opera no namespace ll7","Ferramenta de IA para automação de tarefas","Integração com o GitHub","Suporte a múltiplos repositórios"],"ru":["Последовательная обработка проблем GitHub","Работает в namespace ll7","ИИ Агент для автоматизации задач","Интеграция с GitHub","Поддержка нескольких репозиториев"],"ar":["ترتيب قضايا GitHub","تعمل في namespace ll7","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي للautomação من المهام","التكامل مع GitHub","دعم عدة مستودعات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","gh-issue-sequencer 介绍","GitHub 问题管理","开发效率提高","如何使用 gh-issue-sequencer","gh-issue-sequencer 替代品","gh-issue-sequencer 安装","gh-issue-sequencer 设置指南","AI工具比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","gh-issue-sequencer を使用する","GitHub Issue 管理","開発効率向上","gh-issue-sequencer の使い方","gh-issue-sequencer の代替","gh-issue-sequencer のインストール","gh-issue-sequencer の設定ガイド","AIツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","gh-issue-sequencer 기능","GitHub 이슈 관리","개발 효율성 향상","gh-issue-sequencer 사용 방법","gh-issue-sequencer 대체","gh-issue-sequencer 설치","gh-issue-sequencer 설정 가이드","AI 도구 비교"],"es":["cómo usar robot_sf","qué es un agente de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a robot_sf","robot_sf vs otros agentes","instalación de robot_sf","guía de configuración de robot_sf","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser robot_sf","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à robot_sf","robot_sf vs autres agents","installation de robot_sf","guide de configuration de robot_sf","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour développeurs"],"de":["wie man robot_sf verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","alternativen zu robot_sf","robot_sf vs andere agenten","installation von robot_sf","einrichtungsanleitung für robot_sf","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","gh-issue-sequencer","github issues","ia para automação","como usar gh-issue-sequencer","gh-issue-sequencer vs jira","instalar gh-issue-sequencer","guia de configuração do gh-issue-sequencer"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","gh-issue-sequencer","проблемы github","ИИ для автоматизации","как использовать gh-issue-sequencer","gh-issue-sequencer vs jira","установить gh-issue-sequencer","руководство по настройке gh-issue-sequencer"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","gh-issue-sequencer","قضايا github","الذكاء الاصطناعي للautomação","كيفية استخدام gh-issue-sequencer","gh-issue-sequencer vs jira","تثبيت gh-issue-sequencer","دليل إعداد غه-إشيو-سيكوينسير"]}},"owner":"ll7","repo":"robot_sf_ll7","repoPath":"ll7/robot_sf_ll7","stars":4,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T13:40:29Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-issue-sequencer","description":"Maintain a clear next-work queue in GitHub by normalizing issue metadata, project status/priority fields, and producing a deterministic execution order.","bodyPreview":"# GH Issue Sequencer\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to create and maintain a sequential, high-signal backlog so the next work item is\nalways obvious.\n\n## Goal State\n\n- Exactly one issue is `In progress`.\n- A small, explicit queue (for example top 3) is `Ready`.\n- Remaining actionable issues are `Todo` or `Tracked`.\n- Blocked/decision-heavy issues are labeled and not silently mixed into ready work.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Load project board context\n   - `gh project view 5 --owner ll7 --format json`\n   - `","body":"# GH Issue Sequencer\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to create and maintain a sequential, high-signal backlog so the next work item is\nalways obvious.\n\n## Goal State\n\n- Exactly one issue is `In progress`.\n- A small, explicit queue (for example top 3) is `Ready`.\n- Remaining actionable issues are `Todo` or `Tracked`.\n- Blocked/decision-heavy issues are labeled and not silently mixed into ready work.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Load project board context\n   - `gh project view 5 --owner ll7 --format json`\n   - `gh project field-list 5 --owner ll7 --format json`\n   - `gh project item-list 5 --owner ll7 --limit 200 --format json`\n\n2. Normalize metadata for open issues\n   - Ensure issue has meaningful labels (`bug`, `enhancement`, domain labels like `validation`, `training`, `global planner`, `performance`).\n   - Ensure milestone is set when roadmap context exists (for example `benchmark` milestone).\n   - Ensure project `Priority` is set (`Very High`..`Very Low`) for actionable items.\n   - Move stale completed items to `Done`.\n\n3. Classify issues into lanes\n   - `In progress`: actively being implemented now.\n   - `Ready`: clear scope + acceptance criteria + no missing decisions.\n   - `Todo`: valid but not yet ready to start.\n   - `Tracked`: dependent, blocked, or exploratory.\n\n4. Build deterministic order\n   - Rank by:\n     1. `Status` lane (`Ready` first)\n     2. `Priority` (`Very High` to `Very Low`)\n     3. impact label preference (`bug` before `enhancement`, then others)\n     4. age (older issue number first)\n   - Select and mark:\n     - next one as `In progress` (if none already active)\n     - next 2-3 as `Ready`\n     - demote rest to `Todo` / `Tracked` as needed.\n\n5. Publish the sequence\n   - Add/update a project-level summary comment (or issue comment on the selected next issue):\n     - `Now`: `#<issue>`\n     - `Next`: `#<issue>, #<issue>`\n     - `Blocked/Decision`: `#<issue>`\n   - Use `scripts/dev/gh_comment.sh` for multiline formatting.\n\n6. Keep sequence healthy\n   - Remove `Ready` from issues missing acceptance criteria.\n   - Add `decision-required` label for unresolved decisions and move to `Tracked`.\n   - Split oversized issues into follow-ups and link them.\n\n## Practical Commands\n\n- Add issue to project:\n  - `gh project item-add 5 --owner ll7 --url https://github.com/ll7/robot_sf_ll7/issues/<n>`\n- Edit labels/milestone:\n  - `gh issue edit <n> --add-label \"<label1>,<label2>\" --milestone \"<milestone>\"`\n- Update project single-select fields:\n  - `gh project item-edit --id <item_id> --project-id <project_id> --field-id <field_id> --single-select-option-id <option_id>`\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- Explicitly list:\n  - current `In progress` issue\n  - ordered `Ready` queue\n  - `Tracked` items requiring decisions\n  - any metadata fixes applied (labels, milestone, priority, status)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:38:58.964Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing advanced GitHub issue sequencing and backlog management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 GitHub 问题序列和待办事项管理功能的项目管理代理。","ja":"GitHub の問題シーケンシングとバックログ管理の高度な機能が必要なプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 GitHub 이슈 시퀀싱 및 백로그 관리 기능이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que necesitan secuenciación avanzada de problemas de GitHub y capacidades de gestión de backlog.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une séquenciation avancée des problèmes GitHub et des capacités de gestion de backlog.","de":"Perfekt für Project-Management-Agents, die erweiterte GitHub-Problemmsequenzierung und Backlog-Management-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de sequenciamento avançado de problemas do GitHub e capacidades de gerenciamento de backlog.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, которым требуются продвинутые возможности последовательности проблем GitHub и управления бэклогом.","ar":"مثالي لعميال إدارة المشاريع الذين يحتاجون إلى تسلسلي متقدم لمشاكل GitHub وإدارة بэكلوغ متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain a sequential, high-signal backlog using GitHub project boards, ensuring exactly one issue is ''In progress'' and a small queue is ''Ready'', while utilizing gh project view and JSON formatting for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理维护顺序、高信号待办事项的能力，使用 GitHub 项目板确保只有一个问题处于 ''进行中'' 状态，一个小队列处于 ''准备就绪'' 状态，同时利用 gh 项目视图和 JSON 格式化实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが順序付けられた、高信号のバックログを維持できるようにし、GitHub プロジェクト ボードを使用して、1 つの問題が ''進行中'' であり、小さなキューが ''準備完了'' であることを保証し、gh プロジェクト ビューと JSON フォーマットを使用してシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 순차적이고 고신호 백로그를 유지할 수 있도록 하여 GitHub 프로젝트 보드를 사용하여 정확히 하나의 이슈가 ''進行중''이고 작은 큐가 ''준비 완료''인 것을 보장하며 gh 프로젝트 뷰와 JSON 형식화를 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener un backlog secuencial y de alta señal, utilizando tableros de proyecto de GitHub, asegurando que solo un problema esté ''En progreso'' y una pequeña cola esté ''Lista'', mientras utiliza la vista del proyecto gh y el formato JSON para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir un backlog séquentiel et à haut signal, en utilisant les tableaux de projet GitHub, en s''assurant qu''un seul problème est ''En cours'' et qu''une petite file est ''Prête'', tout en utilisant la vue de projet gh et le formatage JSON pour une intégration sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, ein sequenzielles, hochwertiges Backlog mithilfe von GitHub-Projekt-Boards zu mantener, wobei genau ein Problem ''In Bearbeitung'' ist und eine kleine Warteschlange ''Bereit'' ist, während die gh-Projektansicht und die JSON-Formatierung für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter um backlog sequencial e de alta prioridade usando quadros de projetos do GitHub, garantindo que exatamente uma problema esteja ''Em andamento'' e uma pequena fila esteja ''Pronta'', ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza a visão do projeto gh e formatação JSON para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать последовательный и высокопriorитетный бэклог с помощью досок проектов GitHub, гарантируя, что ровно одна проблема находится в状态е ''В процессе'' и небольшая очередь находится в состоянии ''Готово'', одновременно используя представление проекта gh и форматирование JSON для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من الحفاظ على بэكلوغ متسلسلة وعالي الإشارة باستخدام لوحات مشروع GitHub، مما يضمن أن هناك مشكلة واحدة فقط في状态 ''قيد التقدم'' وطابورة صغيرة في状态 ''جاهزة''، مع استخدام عرض مشروع gh وتدوين JSON من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue prioritization and sequencing","Generating and maintaining a small, explicit ''Ready'' queue","Debugging and resolving blocked or decision-heavy issues using GitHub labels"],"zh":["自动化问题优先级和序列化","生成和维护小的、明确的 ''准备就绪'' 队列","使用 GitHub 标签调试和解决被阻塞或决策密集的问题"],"ja":["問題の優先順位とシーケンシングの自動化","小さな、明確な ''準備完了'' キューの生成と維持","GitHub ラベルを使用してブロックまたは決定密度の高い問題をデバッグして解決する"],"ko":["문제 우선순위 및 시퀀싱 자동화","작은 명시적 ''준비 완료'' 큐 생성 및 유지","GitHub 레이블을 사용하여 차단되거나 결정 집중적인 문제 디버깅 및 해결"],"es":["Automatización de la priorización y secuenciación de problemas","Generación y mantenimiento de una pequeña cola explícita ''Lista''","Depuración y resolución de problemas bloqueados o con muchas decisiones, utilizando etiquetas de GitHub"],"fr":["Automatisation de la priorisation et de la séquenciation des problèmes","Génération et maintien d''une petite file explicite ''Prête''","Débogage et résolution des problèmes bloqués ou à forte charge de décision, en utilisant les étiquettes GitHub"],"de":["Automatisierung der Priorisierung und Sequenzierung von Problemen","Erzeugung und Wartung einer kleinen, expliziten ''Bereit''-Warteschlange","Fehlersuche und Lösung von blockierten oder entscheidungslastigen Problemen, unter Verwendung von GitHub-Labels"],"pt":["Automating issue prioritization and sequencing","Gerar e manter uma pequena fila explícita ''Pronta''","Depurar e resolver problemas bloqueados ou que requerem decisões pesadas usando rótulos do GitHub"],"ru":["Автоматизация приоритизации и последовательности проблем","Генерация и поддержание небольшой явной очереди ''Готово''","Отладка и решение заблокированных или требующих принятия решений проблем с помощью меток GitHub"],"ar":["تأتمة ترتيب الأولوية وتسلسلي المشاكل","توليد والحفاظ على طابورة صغيرة واضحة ''جاهزة''","تصحيح الأخطاء وحل المشاكل المحظورة أو التي تتطلب قرارات ثقيلة باستخدام علامات GitHub"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub project board access","Limited to GitHub issues and project boards","Needs JSON formatting support for gh project view"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 项目板访问权限","仅限 GitHub 问题和项目板","需要 JSON 格式化支持 gh 项目视图"],"ja":["GitHub プロジェクト ボードへのアクセスが必要","GitHub の問題とプロジェクト ボードに限定される","gh プロジェクト ビューの JSON フォーマットのサポートが必要"],"ko":["GitHub 프로젝트 보드 액세스 필요","GitHub 이슈 및 프로젝트 보드에 제한됨","gh 프로젝트 뷰를 위한 JSON 형식화 지원 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a tableros de proyecto de GitHub","Limitado a problemas y tableros de proyecto de GitHub","Necesita soporte de formato JSON para la vista del proyecto gh"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux tableaux de projet GitHub","Limité aux problèmes et tableaux de projet GitHub","Nécessite une prise en charge du formatage JSON pour la vue de projet gh"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub-Projekt-Boards","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Probleme und -Projekt-Boards","Benötigt Unterstützung für JSON-Formatierung für die gh-Projektansicht"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao quadro de projetos do GitHub","Limitado a problemas e quadros de projetos do GitHub","Necessita de suporte à formatação JSON para vista de projeto gh"],"ru":["Требует доступа к доске проектов GitHub","Ограничен проблемами и досками проектов GitHub","Требует поддержки форматирования JSON для представления проекта gh"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى لوحة مشروع GitHub","محدود بمشاكل ولوحات مشروع GitHub","يحتاج إلى دعم تنسيق JSON لعرض مشروع gh"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3682499cc4644889c591d6c92a38708d0556d9043b7292742fb08e6412c51ab4","qualityScore":39}');
