cOS","Entwicklung von Produktivitäts-Apps"],"pt":["Assistente de IA para gerenciar tarefas","Integração com aplicativos de produtividade","Aumento da eficiência com automação de tarefas","Suporte a múltiplos usuários","Interface de usuário personalizável"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для управления задачами","Интеграция с приложениями для повышения производительности","Повышение эффективности с помощью автоматизации задач","Поддержка нескольких пользователей","Настраиваемый интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["مساعد ذكاء اصطناعي لإدارة المهام","التكامل مع تطبيقات تحسين الإنتاجية","زيادة الكفاءة مع توفير المهام","دعم مستخدمين متعددين","واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用ipc-development","什么是AI智能助手","ipc-development替代品","ipc-development vs 其他工具","ipc-development安装","ipc-development设置指南","macOS生产力应用","AI技术开发"],"ja":["ipc開発の使い方","AIエージェントとは","ipc開発の代替","ipc開発 vs 他のツール","ipc開発のインストール","ipc開発の設定ガイド","macOS生産性アプリ","AI技術開発"],"ko":["ipc 개발 사용법","AI 에이전트란","ipc 개발 대안","ipc 개발 vs 다른 도구","ipc 개발 설치","ipc 개발 설정 가이드","macOS 생산성 앱","AI 기술 개발"],"es":["cómo usar ipc-development","qué es la inteligencia artificial","ipc-development alternativa","ipc-development vs otras herramientas","instalación de ipc-development","guía de configuración de ipc-development"],"fr":["comment utiliser ipc-development","quoi est l''intelligence artificielle","ipc-development alternative","ipc-development vs autres outils","installation de ipc-development","guide de configuration de ipc-development"],"de":["wie man ipc-development verwendet","was ist künstliche Intelligenz","ipc-development Alternative","ipc-development vs andere Tools","Installation von ipc-development","Konfigurationshandbuch für ipc-development"],"pt":["como usar ipc-development","o que é ipc-development","ipc-development alternative","ipc-development vs outras ferramentas","ipc-development install","ipc-development setup guide","desenvolvimento de ipc com IA","ferramentas de produtividade para macOS"],"ru":["как использовать ipc-development","что такое ipc-development","ipc-development альтернатива","ipc-development vs другие инструменты","ipc-development установка","ipc-development руководство по настройке","разработка ipc с ИИ","инструменты для повышения производительности на macOS"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ipc-development","ما هو ipc-development","ipc-development بديل","ipc-development مقابل أدوات أخرى","ipc-development تثبيت","ipc-development دليل الإعداد","تطوير ipc باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات تحسين الإنتاجية لنظام macOS"]}},"owner":"BangDori","repo":"prowl","repoPath":"BangDori/prowl","stars":9,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T18:01:03Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ipc-development","description":"IPC 채널 추가/수정 시 안전 규칙과 절차","bodyPreview":"# IPC Development Guide\n\n## Single Source of Truth\n\n모든 IPC 채널은 `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`에 정의. 이 스키마에서 타입이 자동 추론되므로 별도 타입 정의 불필요.\n\n## 채널 추가 절차\n\n새 IPC 채널 추가 시 **3곳 수정**:\n\n1. `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts` — 채널 + params + return 타입 정의\n2. `src/main/ipc.ts` — `handleIpc()` 핸들러 추가\n3. `src/preload/index.ts` — `invokeIpc()` 메서드 추가\n\n→ Renderer 타입은 자동 반영\n\n## 반환 타입 규칙\n\n| 채널 유형 | 반환 타입 | 예시 |\n|-----------|----------|------|\n| 데이터 조회 | 구체적 타입 | `LaunchdJob[]`, `AppSettings` |\n| 데이터 변경 (mutation) | `IpcResult` |","body":"# IPC Development Guide\n\n## Single Source of Truth\n\n모든 IPC 채널은 `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`에 정의. 이 스키마에서 타입이 자동 추론되므로 별도 타입 정의 불필요.\n\n## 채널 추가 절차\n\n새 IPC 채널 추가 시 **3곳 수정**:\n\n1. `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts` — 채널 + params + return 타입 정의\n2. `src/main/ipc.ts` — `handleIpc()` 핸들러 추가\n3. `src/preload/index.ts` — `invokeIpc()` 메서드 추가\n\n→ Renderer 타입은 자동 반영\n\n## 반환 타입 규칙\n\n| 채널 유형 | 반환 타입 | 예시 |\n|-----------|----------|------|\n| 데이터 조회 | 구체적 타입 | `LaunchdJob[]`, `AppSettings` |\n| 데이터 변경 (mutation) | `IpcResult` | `{ success: true }` |\n| Fire-and-forget | `void` | quit, resize, navigate |\n\n## 에러 처리\n\n`handleIpc` 래퍼가 try/catch 자동 적용:\n- 성공 → 핸들러 결과 반환\n- 실패 → 에러 로깅 + mutation은 `{ success: false, error: message }` 반환\n\n## 직렬화\n\n- **Date 객체는 IPC를 통과하지 않음** — ISO 8601 문자열(`string`) 사용\n- 서비스에서 `.toISOString()` 호출 후 전달\n- Renderer에서 `new Date(isoString)` 으로 파싱\n\n## 채널 네이밍\n\n형식: `{domain}:{action}` (액션은 kebab-case)\n\n```\njobs:list              # 조회\njobs:toggle            # 액션\nsettings:get           # 단일 조회\ncalendar:add-local-event  # 복합 액션\n```\n\n## Renderer에서 사용\n\n**컴포넌트에서 `window.electronAPI` 직접 호출 금지.** 반드시 hooks를 통해 접근:\n\n```typescript\n// Bad\nconst jobs = await window.electronAPI.listJobs();\n\n// Good\nconst { jobs } = useLaunchdJobs();\n```\n\n## plist 파싱\n\n외부 데이터(plist)는 Zod `safeParse`로 런타임 검증:\n\n```typescript\n// Bad\nconst data = plist.parse(content) as PlistData;\n\n// Good\nconst result = PlistDataSchema.safeParse(plist.parse(content));\nif (!result.success) { /* handle error */ }\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T01:59:59.898Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Electron-based AI Agents requiring seamless Inter-Process Communication (IPC) with automated type inference via TypeScript","zh":"适用于基于 Electron 的 AI 代理，需要无缝的进程间通信（IPC）以及通过 TypeScript 实现自动类型推断","ja":"Electron ベースの AI エージェントに適し、TypeScript を介した自動型推論によるシームレスなプロセス間通信（IPC）を必要とする","ko":"Electron 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 TypeScript를 통한 자동 형식 추론 및 무缝 프로세스间 통신(IPC)이 필요한 경우","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Electron que requieren una comunicación entre procesos (IPC) sin problemas con inferencia de tipo automática a través de TypeScript","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Electron nécessitant une communication entre processus (IPC) transparente avec une inférence de type automatique via TypeScript","de":"Ideal für auf Electron basierende KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Interprozesskommunikation (IPC) mit automatischer Typinferenz über TypeScript erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Electron que requerem comunicação entre processos (IPC) sem interrupções com inferência de tipo automatizada via TypeScript","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Electron, требующих бесшовной межпроцессной связи (IPC) с автоматическим выводом типа через TypeScript","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى إلكترون الذي يتطلب اتصالًا بين العمليات (IPC) بدون انقطاع مع استدلال نوع آلي عبر TypeScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define and handle IPC channels with ease, utilizing a single source of truth in `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, enabling automatic type inference and streamlined channel management through `handleIpc()` and `invokeIpc()` methods","zh":"赋予代理定义和处理 IPC 通道的能力，利用 `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts` 中的单一真实来源，通过 `handleIpc()` 和 `invokeIpc()` 方法实现自动类型推断和简化的通道管理","ja":"`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts` の単一の真実源を利用して、IPC チャネルの定義と処理を容易にし、`handleIpc()` と `invokeIpc()` メソッドを通じて自動型推論とストリームライン化されたチャンネル管理を可能に","ko":"`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`의 단일 소스 오브 트루스(source of truth)를 이용하여 IPC 채널의 정의와 처리를 쉽게 하며, `handleIpc()` 및 `invokeIpc()` 메서드를 통해 자동 형식 추론 및 간소화된 채널 관리를 가능하게 함","es":"Permite a los agentes definir y manejar canales IPC con facilidad, utilizando una sola fuente de verdad en `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, lo que permite la inferencia de tipo automática y la gestión de canales optimizada a través de los métodos `handleIpc()` y `invokeIpc()`","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir et de gérer les canaux IPC avec facilité, en utilisant une seule source de vérité dans `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, ce qui permet l''inférence de type automatique et la gestion de canaux rationalisée via les méthodes `handleIpc()` et `invokeIpc()`","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, IPC-Kanäle mit Leichtigkeit zu definieren und zu verwalten, unter Verwendung einer einzigen Wahrheitsquelle in `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, was die automatische Typinferenz und die optimierte Kanalverwaltung durch die Methoden `handleIpc()` und `invokeIpc()` ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir e manipular canais IPC com facilidade, utilizando uma única fonte de verdade em `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, permitindo a inferência automática de tipo e o gerenciamento de canal simplificado por meio dos métodos `handleIpc()` e `invokeIpc()`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять и обрабатывать каналы IPC с легкостью, используя единую истину в `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, что позволяет автоматически выводить типы и упрощать управление каналами через методы `handleIpc()` и `invokeIpc()`","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تعريف قنوات اتصال بين العمليات (IPC) وبحوثها بسهولة، باستخدام مصدر وحيد للصحة في `src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`، مما يُمكن استدلال النوع الآلي وإدارة القناة المُبسّطة من خلال أساليب `handleIpc()` و `invokeIpc()`"},"useCases":{"en":["Defining custom IPC channels for data retrieval and mutation","Automating type inference for IPC channels using TypeScript","Implementing IPC handlers and invokers for seamless communication between processes"],"zh":["定义自定义 IPC 通道以检索和修改数据","使用 TypeScript 自动推断 IPC 通道的类型","实现 IPC 处理程序和调用程序以实现进程间的无缝通信"],"ja":["データの取得と変更のためのカスタム IPC チャネルの定義","TypeScript を使用した IPC チャネルの自動型推論","プロセス間のシームレスな通信のための IPC ハンドラーとインボーカーの実装"],"ko":["데이터 수신 및 변경을 위한 사용자 정의 IPC 채널 정의","TypeScript를 사용한 IPC 채널의 자동 형식 추론","프로세스 간의 무결점 통신을 위한 IPC 핸들러 및 호출자의 구현"],"es":["Definir canales IPC personalizados para recuperación y mutación de datos","Automatizar la inferencia de tipo para canales IPC mediante TypeScript","Implementar controladores y invocadores IPC para una comunicación sin problemas entre procesos"],"fr":["Définir des canaux IPC personnalisés pour la récupération et la mutation de données","Automatiser l''inférence de type pour les canaux IPC en utilisant TypeScript","Mettre en œuvre des gestionnaires et des invocateurs IPC pour une communication transparente entre processus"],"de":["Definieren benutzerdefinierter IPC-Kanäle für Datenabruf und -mutation","Automatisieren der Typinferenz für IPC-Kanäle mithilfe von TypeScript","Implementieren von IPC-Handlern und -Invokern für eine nahtlose Kommunikation zwischen Prozessen"],"pt":["Definir canais IPC personalizados para recuperação e mutação de dados","Automatizar a inferência de tipo para canais IPC usando TypeScript","Implementar manipuladores e invocadores IPC para comunicação sem interrupções entre processos"],"ru":["Определение пользовательских каналов IPC для извлечения и мутации данных","Автоматизация вывода типа для каналов IPC с помощью TypeScript","Реализация обработчиков и вызывателей IPC для бесшовной связи между процессами"],"ar":["تعريف قنوات اتصال بين العمليات (IPC) مخصصة لاسترجاع البيانات وتغييرها","تأتمة استدلال النوع لقنوات اتصال بين العمليات (IPC) باستخدام TypeScript","تنفيذ معالجات وداعمين اتصال بين العمليات (IPC) للتواصل السلس بين العمليات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript for automatic type inference","Specific to Electron-based applications","Needs manual updates in three locations (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, `src/main/ipc.ts`, and `src/preload/index.ts`) for new IPC channel additions"],"zh":["需要 TypeScript 来实现自动类型推断","仅适用于基于 Electron 的应用程序","需要在三个位置 (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, `src/main/ipc.ts` 和 `src/preload/index.ts`) 手动更新以添加新的 IPC 通道"],"ja":["自動型推論には TypeScript が必要","Electron ベースのアプリケーションにのみ特化","新しい IPC チャネルの追加には 3 つの場所 (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, `src/main/ipc.ts`, `src/preload/index.ts`) で手動で更新する必要がある"],"ko":["자동 형식 추론을 위해 TypeScript가 필요","Electron 기반 응용 프로그램에만 특화","새로운 IPC 채널을 추가하기 위해 3개의 위치 (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, `src/main/ipc.ts`, `src/preload/index.ts`)에서 수동으로 업데이트해야 함"],"es":["Requiere TypeScript para la inferencia de tipo automática","Específico para aplicaciones basadas en Electron","Requiere actualizaciones manuales en tres ubicaciones (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, `src/main/ipc.ts` y `src/preload/index.ts`) para nuevas adiciones de canales IPC"],"fr":["Nécessite TypeScript pour l''inférence de type automatique","Spécifique aux applications basées sur Electron","Nécessite des mises à jour manuelles dans trois emplacements (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, `src/main/ipc.ts` et `src/preload/index.ts`) pour les nouvelles ajouts de canaux IPC"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript für die automatische Typinferenz","Spezifisch für auf Electron basierende Anwendungen","Benötigt manuelle Updates an drei Stellen (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, `src/main/ipc.ts` und `src/preload/index.ts`) für neue IPC-Kanalhinzufügungen"],"pt":["Requer TypeScript para inferência automática de tipo","Específico para aplicações baseadas em Electron","Necessita de atualizações manuais em três locais (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, `src/main/ipc.ts` e `src/preload/index.ts`) para novas adições de canal IPC"],"ru":["Требует TypeScript для автоматического вывода типа","Специфичен для приложений на основе Electron","Требует ручных обновлений в трех местах (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts`, `src/main/ipc.ts` и `src/preload/index.ts`) для новых добавлений канала IPC"],"ar":["يتطلب TypeScript لاستدلال النوع الآلي","محدد للتطبيقات المعتمدة على إلكترون","يحتاج إلى تحديثات يدوية في ثلاثة مواقع (`src/shared/ipc-schema.ts` و `src/main/ipc.ts` و `src/preload/index.ts`) لإضافات قنوات جديدة اتصال بين العمليات (IPC)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e1598ccc3d6c4809925046cfe1e51b8bf6df81f1a97872fe99c4377e0babb2ff","qualityScore":39}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ronnycoding/.claude/secure-web-search', 'community', 'ronnycoding', '.claude', 'ronnycoding/.claude', 'secure-web-search', 0, 0, 39, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.874Z', '2026-03-02T02:06:56.430Z', '3ca615a4b2c5c8ebd6ab394ee003a63a340d9595cbe5131c9e431455b8b9cc74', '{"id":"ronnycoding/.claude/secure-web-search","name":"secure-web-search","description":{"zh":"本指南帮助开发者安全地进行网页搜索，保护隐私和验证信息准确性","ja":"本ガイドは、開発者がセキュアなウェブ検索を実行し、プライバシーを保護し、情報の正確性を検証するのに役立ちます","ko":"본 가이드는 개발자가 보안 웹 검색을 수행하고 개인 정보를 보호하며 정보의 정확성을 검증하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"La búsqueda web segura es esencial para los desarrolladores. Nuestra guía te ayudará a proteger tu privacidad y a encontrar información fiable","fr":"La recherche web sécurisée est essentielle pour les développeurs. Notre guide vous aidera à protéger votre vie privée et à trouver des informations fiables","de":"Die sichere Web-Suche ist für Entwickler unerlässlich. Unser Leitfaden hilft Ihnen, Ihre Privatsphäre zu schützen und verlässliche Informationen zu finden","pt":"O skill de busca web segura é uma ferramenta essencial para desenvolvedores que precisam realizar pesquisas precisas e proteger sua privacidade.","ru":"Навык безопасного веб-поиска - это необходимый инструмент для разработчиков, которым необходимо проводить точные исследования и защищать свою конфиденциальность.","ar":"مهارة البحث الويب الآمن هي أداة أساسية للمطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إجراء بحث دقيق وحماية خصوصيتهم.","en":"Claude Code configuration featuring specialized AI agents, custom skills, automated GitHub workflows with Epic/Task decomposition, and multi-agent orchestration patterns for complex software development"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"安全网页搜索指南","ja":"セキュアなウェブ検索ガイド","ko":"보안 웹 검색 가이드","es":"Búsqueda web segura: Guía para desarrolladores","fr":"Recherche web sécurisée : Guide pour les développeurs","de":"Sichere Web-Suche: Leitfaden für Entwickler","pt":"Busca Web Segura - Desenvolvimento de Software","ru":"Безопасный Веб-Поиск - Разработка Программного Обеспечения","ar":"بحث ويب آمن - تطوير البرمجيات","en":"secure-web-search"},"description":{"zh":"本指南帮助开发者安全地进行网页搜索，保护隐私和验证信息准确性","ja":"本ガイドは、開発者がセキュアなウェブ検索を実行し、プライバシーを保護し、情報の正確性を検証するのに役立ちます","ko":"본 가이드는 개발자가 보안 웹 검색을 수행하고 개인 정보를 보호하며 정보의 정확성을 검증하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"La búsqueda web segura es esencial para los desarrolladores. Nuestra guía te ayudará a proteger tu privacidad y a encontrar información fiable","fr":"La recherche web sécurisée est essentielle pour les développeurs. Notre guide vous aidera à protéger votre vie privée et à trouver des informations fiables","de":"Die sichere Web-Suche ist für Entwickler unerlässlich. Unser Leitfaden hilft Ihnen, Ihre Privatsphäre zu schützen und verlässliche Informationen zu finden","pt":"O skill de busca web segura é uma ferramenta essencial para desenvolvedores que precisam realizar pesquisas precisas e proteger sua privacidade.","ru":"Навык безопасного веб-поиска - это необходимый инструмент для разработчиков, которым необходимо проводить точные исследования и защищать свою конфиденциально...","ar":"مهارة البحث الويب الآمن هي أداة أساسية للمطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إجراء بحث دقيق وحماية خصوصيتهم.","en":"Claude Code configuration featuring specialized AI agents, custom skills, automated GitHub workflows with Epic/Task decomposition, and multi-agent orchestrat..."},"definition":{"en":"Claude Code configuration featuring specialized AI agents, custom skills, automated GitHub workflows with Epic/Task decomposition, and multi-agent orchestration patterns for complex software development"},"features":{"zh":["定义搜索意图","选择搜索方法","构建有效查询","保护隐私","验证信息准确性"],"ja":["検索意図を定義する","検索方法を選択する","効果的なクエリを構築する","プライバシーを保護する","情報の正確性を検証する"],"ko":["검색 의도를 정의","검색 방법 선택","효과적인 쿼리構築","개인 정보 보호","정보 정확성 검증"],"es":["Definir la intención de búsqueda","Elegir el método de búsqueda adecuado","Crear consultas efectivas","Verificar fuentes y validar la precisión de la información","Proteger la privacidad en línea","Utilizar herramientas de búsqueda especializadas"],"fr":["Définir l''intention de recherche","Choisir la méthode de recherche appropriée","Créer des requêtes efficaces","Vérifier les sources et valider l''exactitude des informations","Protéger la vie privée en ligne","Utiliser des outils de recherche spécialisés"],"de":["Suchabsicht definieren","Das geeignete Suchverfahren wählen","Effektive Abfragen erstellen","Quellen überprüfen und die Genauigkeit der Informationen validieren","Die Online-Privatsphäre schützen","Spezialisierte Suchtools verwenden"],"pt":["Definição de intenção de busca","Escolha de método de busca","Criação de consultas eficazes","Verificação de fontes","Validação de precisão das informações"],"ru":["Определение цели поиска","Выбор метода поиска","Создание эффективных запросов","Проверка источников","Проверка точности информации"],"ar":["تحديد نية البحث","اختيار طريقة البحث","إنشاء استفسارات فعالة","تحقق من المصادر","تحقق من دقة المعلومات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["安全网页搜索","保护隐私","验证信息准确性","网页搜索方法","开发者工具","搜索引擎优化"],"ja":["セキュアなウェブ検索","プライバシー保護","情報の正確性検証","ウェブ検索方法","開発者ツール","検索エンジン最適化"],"ko":["보안 웹 검색","개인 정보 보호","정보 정확성 검증","웹 검색 방법","개발자 도구","검색 엔진 최적화"],"es":["búsqueda web segura","privacidad en línea","seguridad informática","desarrollo web","herramientas de búsqueda","verificación de fuentes","validación de información","consultas efectivas","métodos de búsqueda"],"fr":["recherche web sécurisée","vie privée en ligne","sécurité informatique","développement web","outils de recherche","vérification de sources","validation d''informations","requêtes efficaces","méthodes de recherche"],"de":["sichere Web-Suche","Online-Privatsphäre","IT-Sicherheit","Web-Entwicklung","Suchtools","Quellenüberprüfung","Informationsvalidierung","effektive Abfragen","Suchverfahren"],"pt":["busca web segura","desenvolvimento de software","privacidade","precisão","pesquisa","segurança"],"ru":["безопасный веб-поиск","разработка программного обеспечения","конфиденциальность","точность","исследование","безопасность"],"ar":["بحث ويب آمن","تطوير البرمجيات","الخصوصية","الدقة","البحث","الأمان"]}},"owner":"ronnycoding","repo":".claude","repoPath":"ronnycoding/.claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.874Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"secure-web-search","description":"Guide for performing secure web searches with privacy protection, source verification, and information validation. Use when the user wants to search the web securely, verify sources, fact-check information, or mentions secure search, privacy, source validation, or web research.","bodyPreview":"# Secure Web Search Guide\n\nThis skill helps you perform secure web searches while protecting privacy, verifying sources, and validating information accuracy. Essential for research, fact-checking, and gathering reliable information.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen performing secure web searches, follow this workflow:\n\n1. **Define search intent** - What information do you need and why?\n2. **Choose search method** - Direct search, privacy-focused engine, or specialized tools\n3. **Craft effective query** - U","body":"# Secure Web Search Guide\n\nThis skill helps you perform secure web searches while protecting privacy, verifying sources, and validating information accuracy. Essential for research, fact-checking, and gathering reliable information.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen performing secure web searches, follow this workflow:\n\n1. **Define search intent** - What information do you need and why?\n2. **Choose search method** - Direct search, privacy-focused engine, or specialized tools\n3. **Craft effective query** - Use search operators and specific terms\n4. **Verify sources** - Check credibility, authority, and bias\n5. **Validate information** - Cross-reference multiple sources\n6. **Protect privacy** - Avoid tracking, use secure connections\n7. **Document findings** - Track sources and evidence\n8. **Assess reliability** - Determine confidence level in results\n\n## What is Secure Web Search?\n\n**Secure Web Search** involves:\n\n- **Privacy protection:** Preventing tracking and data collection\n- **Source verification:** Ensuring information comes from credible sources\n- **Information validation:** Cross-referencing and fact-checking\n- **Bias awareness:** Recognizing potential source biases\n- **Safe browsing:** Avoiding malicious sites and phishing\n- **Data integrity:** Ensuring information hasn''t been altered\n\n## Search Privacy Protection\n\n### Privacy-Focused Search Engines\n\n**DuckDuckGo:**\n- No tracking or profiling\n- No search history storage\n- Anonymous search results\n- Built-in tracker blocking\n\n**Startpage:**\n- Google results without tracking\n- Anonymous view feature\n- No IP address logging\n- EU-based privacy protection\n\n**Brave Search:**\n- Independent index\n- No user profiling\n- Anonymous search\n- Open-source transparent ranking\n\n**Searx/SearXNG:**\n- Meta-search engine\n- Self-hostable\n- No tracking\n- Aggregates multiple search engines\n\n### Search Privacy Best Practices\n\n**Avoid revealing patterns:**\n- Don''t use personal information in queries\n- Vary search terms to prevent profiling\n- Use broad terms before narrow searches\n- Consider timing of searches\n\n**Protect identity:**\n- Use VPN for sensitive searches\n- Clear cookies regularly\n- Use private/incognito mode\n- Disable search history\n\n**Secure connections:**\n- Always use HTTPS\n- Verify SSL certificates\n- Avoid public WiFi for sensitive searches\n- Use encrypted DNS (DoH/DoT)\n\n## Effective Search Techniques\n\n### Basic Search Operators\n\n**Exact phrase matching:**\n```\n\"exact phrase here\"\n```\nExample: `\"climate change impact\" 2024`\n\n**Exclude terms:**\n```\nsearch term -excluded\n```\nExample: `python tutorial -Django`\n\n**OR operator:**\n```\nterm1 OR term2\n```\nExample: `JavaScript OR TypeScript framework`\n\n**Wildcard:**\n```\nsearch * term\n```\nExample: `best * programming language 2024`\n\n**Site-specific search:**\n```\nsite:domain.com search term\n```\nExample: `site:github.com authentication library`\n\n**File type search:**\n```\nfiletype:ext search term\n```\nExample: `filetype:pdf security best practices`\n\n**Date range:**\n```\nsearch term after:2024-01-01\nsearch term before:2024-12-31\n```\nExample: `AI developments after:2024-06-01`\n\n### Advanced Search Operators\n\n**Related sites:**\n```\nrelated:domain.com\n```\nExample: `related:stackoverflow.com`\n\n**In URL:**\n```\ninurl:keyword\n```\nExample: `inurl:documentation API design`\n\n**In title:**\n```\nintitle:keyword\n```\nExample: `intitle:\"best practices\" security`\n\n**Cache view:**\n```\ncache:domain.com\n```\nExample: `cache:example.com/article`\n\n**Numeric ranges:**\n```\nsearch term 100..500\n```\nExample: `laptop price $800..$1200`\n\n**Combining operators:**\n```\nsite:edu filetype:pdf \"research paper\" climate change after:2023\n```\n\n## Source Verification\n\n### Credibility Assessment\n\n**Check domain authority:**\n- .edu (educational institutions)\n- .gov (government agencies)\n- .org (organizations - verify legitimacy)\n- .com (commercial - verify credibility)\n\n**Verify author credentials:**\n- Professional qualifications\n- Academic affiliations\n- Industry experience\n- Publication history\n- Peer recognition\n\n**Review publication date:**\n- Recent information for current topics\n- Historical context for established facts\n- Update frequency\n- Version or revision history\n\n**Assess editorial standards:**\n- Fact-checking processes\n- Editorial oversight\n- Correction policies\n- Source citations\n\n### Red Flags for Unreliable Sources\n\n**Content warning signs:**\n- No author attribution\n- Extreme or sensational language\n- Unsupported claims\n- No citations or references\n- Grammar and spelling errors\n- Contradicts established facts\n\n**Site warning signs:**\n- No about page or contact info\n- Excessive advertising\n- Misleading domain names\n- No privacy policy\n- Poor site security (no HTTPS)\n- Popup-heavy design\n\n**Bias indicators:**\n- Political or ideological slant\n- Financial conflicts of interest\n- Selective fact presentation\n- Emotional manipulation\n- Echo chamber characteristics\n\n### Source Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Author identified and credentials verified\n- [ ] Publication date is recent (for current topics)\n- [ ] Domain is reputable and secure (HTTPS)\n- [ ] Information is cited with sources\n- [ ] Cross-referenced with other credible sources\n- [ ] No obvious bias or agenda\n- [ ] Editorial standards are evident\n- [ ] Contact information available\n- [ ] No red flags for misinformation\n- [ ] Consistent with expert consensus\n\n## Information Validation\n\n### Cross-Reference Multiple Sources\n\n**Triangulation method:**\n1. Find at least 3 independent sources\n2. Compare information across sources\n3. Look for consensus on key facts\n4. Note discrepancies and investigate\n5. Prioritize primary sources\n\n**Source diversity:**\n- Academic research papers\n- Reputable news organizations\n- Government/official statistics\n- Industry experts\n- Independent fact-checkers\n\n**Primary vs secondary sources:**\n- **Primary:** Original research, data, documents\n- **Secondary:** Analysis, interpretation, reporting\n- Prefer primary when available\n- Verify secondary against primary\n\n### Fact-Checking Resources\n\n**Established fact-checkers:**\n- FactCheck.org\n- Snopes.com\n- PolitiFact\n- Full Fact\n- AFP Fact Check\n- Reuters Fact Check\n\n**Academic databases:**\n- Google Scholar\n- PubMed (medical)\n- JSTOR\n- arXiv (preprints)\n- IEEE Xplore (technical)\n\n**Government sources:**\n- Official statistics agencies\n- Regulatory bodies\n- Legislative databases\n- Public records\n\n**Specialized validators:**\n- Media Bias/Fact Check (news bias)\n- Retraction Watch (scientific retractions)\n- AllSides (political bias)\n- NewsGuard (news reliability)\n\n### Evidence Quality Assessment\n\n**Strongest evidence:**\n- Peer-reviewed research\n- Official government data\n- Primary source documents\n- Expert consensus\n- Replicated studies\n\n**Moderate evidence:**\n- Reputable journalism\n- Industry reports\n- Expert opinions\n- Well-documented analysis\n- Established organizations\n\n**Weakest evidence:**\n- Anecdotal reports\n- Social media claims\n- Unverified sources\n- Conflicting information\n- Opinion pieces without support\n\n## Secure Search Workflows\n\n### Research Workflow\n\n**1. Planning phase:**\n- Define research question\n- Identify key terms and concepts\n- List potential source types\n- Determine credibility requirements\n\n**2. Initial search:**\n- Use broad terms to understand landscape\n- Identify authoritative sources\n- Note common themes and terminology\n- Bookmark promising sources\n\n**3. Deep research:**\n- Use advanced search operators\n- Access primary sources\n- Cross-reference findings\n- Track citations and references\n\n**4. Verification:**\n- Check author credentials\n- Verify publication dates\n- Cross-reference facts\n- Consult fact-checkers\n\n**5. Documentation:**\n- Save source URLs\n- Note access dates\n- Record key quotes with citations\n- Track evidence quality\n\n### Fact-Checking Workflow\n\n**1. Identify claim:**\n- Extract specific factual claim\n- Note original source\n- Understand context\n\n**2. Search for primary source:**\n- Find original data or research\n- Verify attribution\n- Check for misquotes or context removal\n\n**3. Consult fact-checkers:**\n- Search established fact-checking sites\n- Look for previous verification\n- Note fact-checker methodology\n\n**4. Expert verification:**\n- Find domain experts\n- Check academic consensus\n- Review peer-reviewed research\n\n**5. Document findings:**\n- True/False/Misleading/Unverified\n- Evidence summary\n- Source quality assessment\n- Confidence level\n\n### Investigative Research Workflow\n\n**1. Start with known facts:**\n- Establish baseline verified information\n- Identify information gaps\n- List questions to answer\n\n**2. Expand search scope:**\n- Use related search operators\n- Explore connected topics\n- Find primary documents\n\n**3. Follow citation trails:**\n- Check source references\n- Find original studies\n- Trace information lineage\n\n**4. Verify independently:**\n- Don''t rely on single source\n- Cross-reference multiple times\n- Check for contradictions\n\n**5. Assess confidence:**\n- Rate evidence quality\n- Note uncertainties\n- Document limitations\n\n## Privacy and Security\n\n### Protecting Search Privacy\n\n**Browser configuration:**\n- Use privacy-focused browsers (Brave, Firefox)\n- Enable tracking protection\n- Block third-party cookies\n- Use extensions (uBlock Origin, Privacy Badger)\n- Enable Do Not Track\n\n**Network security:**\n- Use VPN for sensitive searches\n- Enable DNS over HTTPS (DoH)\n- Avoid public WiFi for sensitive research\n- Use Tor for maximum anonymity (when necessary)\n\n**Search history management:**\n- Regularly clear history\n- Use private/incognito mode\n- Disable search suggestions\n- Use separate browser profiles\n\n**Account isolation:**\n- Don''t search while logged into services\n- Use separate email for sensitive topics\n- Avoid Google/Microsoft accounts for private searches\n- Use disposable email addresses\n\n### Safe Browsing Practices\n\n**Verify HTTPS:**\n- Check for padlock icon\n- Verify certificate validity\n- Avoid HTTP sites for sensitive information\n- Be cautious of certificate warnings\n\n**Avoid malicious sites:**\n- Don''t click suspicious links\n- Verify URLs before clicking\n- Use link checkers (VirusTotal)\n- Enable safe browsing features\n\n**Phishing protection:**\n- Verify sender/domain legitimacy\n- Hover over links before clicking\n- Check for misspellings in URLs\n- Don''t enter credentials on unknown sites\n\n**Download safety:**\n- Scan files with antivirus\n- Only download from trusted sources\n- Verify file signatures when available\n- Use sandboxed environments for testing\n\n## Search Query Best Practices\n\n### Effective Query Construction\n\n**Be specific:**\n```\n❌ programming\n✅ Python async programming best practices 2024\n```\n\n**Use quotes for phrases:**\n```\n❌ climate change effects\n✅ \"climate change effects\" agricultural productivity\n```\n\n**Combine operators:**\n```\n✅ site:edu filetype:pdf \"machine learning\" ethics\n✅ (Python OR JavaScript) tutorial -beginners after:2024\n```\n\n**Target specific sources:**\n```\n✅ site:github.com authentication library stars:>1000\n✅ site:stackoverflow.com [python] database connection pooling\n```\n\n### Query Refinement\n\n**Start broad, then narrow:**\n1. General topic search\n2. Add specific terms\n3. Filter by date/type\n4. Target authoritative sources\n\n**Use search feedback:**\n- Check \"related searches\"\n- Review autocomplete suggestions\n- Note common terminology\n- Adjust based on results quality\n\n**Iterate and refine:**\n- Try multiple phrasings\n- Use synonyms\n- Adjust specificity\n- Change search operators\n\n## Bias and Perspective Awareness\n\n### Recognizing Bias\n\n**Political bias:**\n- Left/right leaning language\n- Selective fact presentation\n- Partisan framing\n- Ideological assumptions\n\n**Commercial bias:**\n- Sponsored content\n- Affiliate relationships\n- Advertising influence\n- Product promotion\n\n**Confirmation bias:**\n- Seeking supporting evidence only\n- Ignoring contradictory information\n- Cherry-picking sources\n- Motivated reasoning\n\n**Cultural bias:**\n- Western-centric perspectives\n- Regional assumptions\n- Cultural stereotypes\n- Language limitations\n\n### Seeking Diverse Perspectives\n\n**Geographic diversity:**\n- International news sources\n- Regional publications\n- Non-Western perspectives\n- Local reporting\n\n**Ideological diversity:**\n- Conservative and liberal sources\n- Academic vs popular sources\n- Industry vs independent analysis\n- Government vs watchdog groups\n\n**Expertise diversity:**\n- Academic researchers\n- Industry practitioners\n- Policy makers\n- Affected communities\n\n**Methodological diversity:**\n- Quantitative studies\n- Qualitative research\n- Case studies\n- Meta-analyses\n\n## Specialized Search Types\n\n### Academic Research Search\n\n**Academic databases:**\n- Google Scholar\n- PubMed (medical/health)\n- IEEE Xplore (engineering/tech)\n- JSTOR (humanities)\n- arXiv (preprints)\n\n**Search strategies:**\n```\nauthor:\"lastname\" \"research topic\"\nallintitle: key terms here\n\"exact methodology phrase\"\nfiletype:pdf site:edu\n```\n\n**Quality indicators:**\n- Peer-reviewed journals\n- Citation count\n- H-index of authors\n- Impact factor\n- Recent publication\n\n### News and Current Events\n\n**Reputable news sources:**\n- Associated Press (AP)\n- Reuters\n- BBC News\n- NPR\n- ProPublica (investigative)\n\n**News search techniques:**\n```\n\"news topic\" after:YYYY-MM-DD\nsite:reuters.com OR site:ap.org topic\n\"breaking news\" -opinion -editorial\n```\n\n**Verification:**\n- Check multiple news sources\n- Find original statements/documents\n- Consult fact-checkers\n- Note update timestamps\n\n### Technical Documentation\n\n**Official sources:**\n- Official documentation sites\n- GitHub repositories\n- Stack Overflow\n- Technical blogs (verified experts)\n\n**Search patterns:**\n```\nsite:docs.python.org specific function\nsite:github.com language:python topic stars:>100\n[tag] error message site:stackoverflow.com\n\"official documentation\" framework version\n```\n\n### Legal and Regulatory\n\n**Official sources:**\n- Government websites (.gov)\n- Legal databases\n- Regulatory agencies\n- Court records\n\n**Search techniques:**\n```\nsite:gov law OR regulation topic\nfiletype:pdf \"legal code\" section\n\"court case\" parties site:justia.com\n\"federal register\" regulation\n```\n\n## Documentation and Citation\n\n### Recording Sources\n\n**Essential information:**\n- Full URL\n- Page title\n- Author(s)\n- Publication date\n- Access date\n- Publisher/site name\n- Relevant quotes with page numbers (for PDFs)\n\n**Organization methods:**\n- Bookmarking tools (Pocket, Raindrop.io)\n- Reference managers (Zotero, Mendeley)\n- Note-taking apps (Notion, Obsidian)\n- Spreadsheets with metadata\n\n### Citation Formats\n\n**APA style:**\n```\nAuthor, A. A. (Year, Month Day). Title of page. Site Name. URL\n```\n\n**MLA style:**\n```\nAuthor Last Name, First Name. \"Title of Page.\" Website Name, Day Month Year, URL.\n```\n\n**Chicago style:**\n```\nAuthor First Name Last Name, \"Title of Page,\" Website Name, accessed Month Day, Year, URL.\n```\n\n**Simple attribution:**\n```\nSource: [Title] by [Author] ([Site], [Date]) - [URL]\n```\n\n## Quality Assessment Framework\n\n### CRAAP Test\n\n**Currency:**\n- When was information published/updated?\n- Is it current enough for your topic?\n- Are links functional?\n\n**Relevance:**\n- Does it answer your question?\n- Is it appropriate for your audience/purpose?\n- Is it at the right level (basic/advanced)?\n\n**Authority:**\n- Who is the author/publisher?\n- What are their credentials?\n- Is contact information provided?\n- Is domain appropriate (.edu, .gov, .org)?\n\n**Accuracy:**\n- Is information supported by evidence?\n- Can you verify information elsewhere?\n- Are sources cited?\n- Is language unbiased?\n\n**Purpose:**\n- Why was information published?\n- Is there commercial/political agenda?\n- Is it fact, opinion, or propaganda?\n- Is bias evident?\n\n### Confidence Levels\n\n**High confidence (90%+):**\n- Multiple authoritative sources agree\n- Primary sources verified\n- Peer-reviewed research\n- Expert consensus\n- Recent and comprehensive\n\n**Medium confidence (50-90%):**\n- Reputable sources with some agreement\n- Secondary sources verified\n- Some expert support\n- Reasonably current\n- Minor inconsistencies\n\n**Low confidence (<50%):**\n- Single source or conflicting sources\n- Unverified claims\n- Questionable authority\n- Outdated information\n- Significant inconsistencies\n\n**Unverified:**\n- Cannot confirm information\n- Conflicting evidence\n- No credible sources\n- Requires further investigation\n\n## Red Flags and Warning Signs\n\n### Content Red Flags\n\n**Misinformation indicators:**\n- No author or credentials\n- Extreme claims without evidence\n- Emotional manipulation\n- Conspiracy theories\n- \"Too good to be true\" claims\n\n**Low quality indicators:**\n- Poor grammar/spelling\n- Clickbait headlines\n- Excessive ads\n- Autoplay videos\n- No dates or sources\n\n**Manipulation indicators:**\n- Cherry-picked statistics\n- Misleading graphs\n- Out-of-context quotes\n- Logical fallacies\n- False equivalencies\n\n### Technical Red Flags\n\n**Security concerns:**\n- No HTTPS encryption\n- Invalid SSL certificates\n- Suspicious download prompts\n- Excessive permissions requests\n- Malware warnings\n\n**Privacy concerns:**\n- Excessive tracking scripts\n- Data collection without notice\n- No privacy policy\n- Suspicious redirects\n- Fingerprinting techniques\n\n## Best Practices Checklist\n\nWhen performing secure web searches:\n\n- [ ] Use privacy-focused search engine or incognito mode\n- [ ] Craft specific query with appropriate operators\n- [ ] Verify HTTPS on all visited sites\n- [ ] Check source credibility and author credentials\n- [ ] Cross-reference with at least 3 independent sources\n- [ ] Consult fact-checkers for controversial claims\n- [ ] Note publication dates and update frequency\n- [ ] Assess potential bias and conflicts of interest\n- [ ] Document sources with full citation information\n- [ ] Rate confidence level in findings\n- [ ] Clear browser history after sensitive searches\n- [ ] Use VPN for highly sensitive research\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Privacy first** - Protect your search privacy and identity\n2. **Verify sources** - Check credibility before trusting information\n3. **Cross-reference** - Never rely on a single source\n4. **Think critically** - Question claims and assess evidence\n5. **Use operators** - Leverage advanced search techniques\n6. **Document thoroughly** - Track sources and evidence\n7. **Stay current** - Check publication dates and updates\n8. **Recognize bias** - Understand source perspectives and agendas\n9. **Secure connections** - Always use HTTPS and avoid malicious sites\n10. **Assess confidence** - Rate reliability of your findings\n\n## Workflow Summary\n\nWhen user asks to perform secure web search:\n\n1. **Define objective** - What information is needed and why?\n2. **Plan search strategy** - Choose engines, operators, and sources\n3. **Protect privacy** - Use appropriate privacy tools and techniques\n4. **Execute search** - Craft effective queries with operators\n5. **Verify sources** - Check credibility, authority, and bias\n6. **Cross-reference** - Find multiple independent confirmations\n7. **Fact-check** - Consult fact-checkers and primary sources\n8. **Assess quality** - Apply CRAAP test and evidence evaluation\n9. **Document findings** - Record sources with full citations\n10. **Rate confidence** - Determine reliability level of information\n\nRemember: Secure web search combines privacy protection, source verification, and critical thinking. Always question information, verify independently, and protect your privacy throughout the research process.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:06:56.430Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Research Agents requiring advanced secure web search capabilities with privacy protection and source verification","zh":"适用于需要高级安全网页搜索功能的研究代理，具有隐私保护和来源验证","ja":"高度なセキュアなWeb検索機能とプライバシー保護、ソースの検証が必要な研究エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 보안 웹 검색 기능과 개인 정보 보호, 출처 검증이 필요한 연구 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Investigación que requieren capacidades de búsqueda web seguras avanzadas con protección de privacidad y verificación de fuentes","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche nécessitant des capacités de recherche web sécurisées avancées avec protection de la vie privée et vérification des sources","de":"Ideal für Forschungsagenten, die erweiterte sichere Web-Suchfunktionen mit Datenschutz und Quellenüberprüfung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pesquisa que exigem capacidades de busca na web avançadas e seguras com proteção de privacidade e verificação de fontes","ru":"Идеально для агентов-исследователей, требующих продвинутых возможностей безопасного поиска в интернете с защитой приватности и проверкой источников","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانات بحث ويب متقدمة وأمنية مع حماية الخصوصية وتحقق المصدر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform secure web searches using privacy-focused engines and specialized tools, ensuring information accuracy and validating sources through effective query crafting and intent definition, leveraging protocols like HTTPS and verifying authenticity","zh":"赋予代理安全地使用注重隐私的搜索引擎和专用工具进行Web搜索，确保信息准确性并通过有效的查询构建和意图定义验证来源，利用HTTPS等协议并验证真实性","ja":"プライバシーに焦点を当てたエンジンや専用ツールを使用してセキュアなWeb検索を実行することで、エージェントに情報の正確性を確保し、有効なクエリの作成と意図の定義を通じてソースを検証し、HTTPSなどのプロトコルを利用して真実性を検証する能力を提供する","ko":"프라이버シー에 중점을 둔 엔진과 전문 도구를 사용하여 보안 웹 검색을 수행하여 에이전트가 정보의 정확성을 보장하고 유효한 쿼리 구축 및 의도 정의를 통해 출처를 검증하며 HTTPS 등의 프로토콜을 활용하여 진실성을 검증하는 능력을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar búsquedas web seguras utilizando motores de búsqueda centrados en la privacidad y herramientas especializadas, garantizando la precisión de la información y validando las fuentes a través de una elaboración de consultas y definición de intención efectivas, aprovechando protocolos como HTTPS y verificando la autenticidad","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des recherches web sécurisées en utilisant des moteurs de recherche axés sur la confidentialité et des outils spécialisés, garantissant l''exactitude des informations et validant les sources grâce à une élaboration de requêtes et une définition d''intention efficaces, en exploitant des protocoles comme HTTPS et en vérifiant l''authenticité","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere Web-Suchen durchzuführen, indem sie datenschutzorientierte Suchmaschinen und spezielle Tools verwenden, um die Genauigkeit der Informationen sicherzustellen und die Quellen durch effektive Abfragegestaltung und Intentionsermittlung zu überprüfen, indem Protokolle wie HTTPS genutzt und die Echtheit überprüft werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar buscas na web seguras usando mecanismos de busca focados na privacidade e ferramentas especializadas, garantindo a precisão das informações e validando as fontes por meio de uma definição eficaz de consultas e intenção, utilizando protocolos como HTTPS e verificando a autenticidade","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять безопасные поисковые запросы в интернете с помощью поисковых систем, ориентированных на приватность, и специализированных инструментов, обеспечивая точность информации и проверку источников посредством эффективного формирования запросов и определения намерений, используя протоколы như HTTPS и проверяя подлинность","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إجراء عمليات بحث آمنة على الويب باستخدام محركات بحث تركز على الخصوصية والأدوات المتخصصة، مما يضمن دقة المعلومات والتحقق من المصادر من خلال صياغة استفسارات فعالة وتحديد النية، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS والتحقق من الصحة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating fact-checking workflows","Generating reliable information for research papers","Validating online sources for credibility"],"zh":["自动化事实核查工作流程","为研究论文生成可靠的信息","验证在线来源的可信度"],"ja":["事実の検証ワークフローを自動化する","研究論文のための信頼できる情報を生成する","オンラインソースの信頼性を検証する"],"ko":["팩트 체크 워크플로 자동화","연구 논문에 대한 신뢰할 수 있는 정보 생성","온라인 출처의 신뢰성 검증"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de verificación de hechos","Generar información fiable para artículos de investigación","Validar fuentes en línea para credibilidad"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de vérification des faits","Générer des informations fiables pour les articles de recherche","Valider les sources en ligne pour crédibilité"],"de":["Automatisierung von Workflows zur Überprüfung von Fakten","Generierung zuverlässiger Informationen für Forschungsarbeiten","Überprüfung von Online-Quellen auf Glaubwürdigkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de verificação de fatos","Gerar informações confiáveis para artigos de pesquisa","Validar fontes online para credibilidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы проверки фактов","Генерировать надежную информацию для исследовательских работ","Проверять онлайн-источники на достоверность"],"ar":["أتمتة سير عمل التحقق من الحقائق","توليد معلومات موثوقة لأبحاث الورقات","التحقق من مصادر الإنترنت لمصداقيتها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires custom workflow configuration","Dependent on quality of search query and intent definition"],"zh":["需要自定义工作流配置","依赖于搜索查询和意图定义的质量"],"ja":["カスタムワークフローの構成が必要","検索クエリと意図の定義の品質に依存する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 워크플로 구성이 필요","검색 쿼리 및 의도 정의의 품질에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de flujo de trabajo personalizado","Dependiente de la calidad de la consulta de búsqueda y la definición de intención"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de flux de travail personnalisée","Dépend de la qualité de la requête de recherche et de la définition de l''intention"],"de":["Benötigt eine benutzerdefinierte Workflow-Konfiguration","Abhängig von der Qualität der Suchabfrage und der Intentionsermittlung"],"pt":["Exige configuração personalizada do fluxo de trabalho","Depende da qualidade da consulta de pesquisa e da definição de intenção"],"ru":["Требует индивидуальной настройки рабочего процесса","Зависит от качества поискового запроса и определения намерений"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوينًا مخصصًا لسير العمل","يعتمد على جودة استفسار البحث وتحديد النية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3ca615a4b2c5c8ebd6ab394ee003a63a340d9595cbe5131c9e431455b8b9cc74","qualityScore":39}');
