وير البرمجيات","دعم لغات البرمجة","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI)","توسيع الوظائف مع الإضافات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["nix AI工具","AI编码助手","如何使用nix AI工具","nix AI工具安装","nix AI工具设置指南","nix AI工具与其他工具比较","nix AI工具替代品","nix AI工具教程"],"ja":["nix AIエージェント","AIコーディングアシスタント","nix AIエージェントの使い方","nix AIエージェントのインストール","nix AIエージェントの設定ガイド","nix AIエージェントと他のツールの比較","nix AIエージェントの代替","nix AIエージェントのチュートリアル"],"ko":["nix AI 에이전트","AI 코딩 도우미","nix AI 에이전트 사용법","nix AI 에이전트 설치","nix AI 에이전트 설정 가이드","nix AI 에이전트와 다른 도구 비교","nix AI 에이전트 대체","nix AI 에이전트 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI para codificar","nix vs otros entornos de desarrollo","cómo instalar nix","guía de configuración de nix","mejores prácticas para codificar con nix","alternativas a nix para la codificación","nix para principiantes","cómo usar nix con React","cómo usar nix con Node.js"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour coder","nix vs d''autres environnements de développement","comment installer nix","guide de configuration de nix","meilleures pratiques pour coder avec nix","alternatives à nix pour la programmation","nix pour les débutants","comment utiliser nix avec React","comment utiliser nix avec Node.js"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Codierung","nix vs andere Entwicklungsumgebungen","wie man nix installiert","Konfigurationshandbuch für nix","beste Praktiken für die Codierung mit nix","Alternativen zu nix für die Programmierung","nix für Anfänger","wie man nix mit React verwendet","wie man nix mit Node.js verwendet"],"pt":["como usar nix","o que é nix","nix vs outras ferramentas de ia","guia de instalação do nix","configuração do nix para codificação","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","nix para desenvolvimento de software","alternativas ao nix"],"ru":["как использовать nix","что такое nix","nix vs другие ИИ инструменты","руководство по установке nix","настройка nix для кодирования","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","nix для разработки программного обеспечения","альтернативы nix"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام نيكس","ما هو نيكس","نيكس مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","دليل تثبيت نيكس","تكوين نيكس للبرمجة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","نيكس لتطوير البرمجيات","بديلات نيكس"]}},"owner":"srid","repo":"AI","repoPath":"srid/AI","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.877Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nix","description":"Expert Nix development assistance. Use when working with Nix code, .nix files, flakes, NixOS configuration, or when user mentions Nix, flake-parts, nixpkgs.","bodyPreview":"# Nix Development\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Use **flake-parts** when creating new flakes\n- Format with **nixpkgs-fmt** after changes\n- Use **writeShellApplication** for shell scripts (not writeShellScriptBin)\n  - Automatically runs ShellCheck validation\n  - Sets strict bash options (`set -euo pipefail`)\n  - Fix ALL ShellCheck warnings without ignoring them\n  - Add **meta.description**\n\n## Building with Nix\n\nWhen running `nix build`:\n- **ALWAYS** use `--print-out-paths` flag so final build path is printe","body":"# Nix Development\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Use **flake-parts** when creating new flakes\n- Format with **nixpkgs-fmt** after changes\n- Use **writeShellApplication** for shell scripts (not writeShellScriptBin)\n  - Automatically runs ShellCheck validation\n  - Sets strict bash options (`set -euo pipefail`)\n  - Fix ALL ShellCheck warnings without ignoring them\n  - Add **meta.description**\n\n## Building with Nix\n\nWhen running `nix build`:\n- **ALWAYS** use `--print-out-paths` flag so final build path is printed\n- **NEVER** run with timeout - allow command to finish completely\n- If command doesn''t finish OR final out path is not shown, consider it **FAILED**\n- On failure, investigate logs without hallucinating - look at actual error messages\n\n## Home-Manager Module\n\nWhen adding a home-manager module to a project:\n\n1. Module: `nix/modules/home-manager/<name>.nix` - options & config with systemd (Linux) + launchd (Darwin)\n2. Export: `nix/modules/flake/<name>-module.nix` - `flake.homeManagerModules.<name> = ../home-manager/<name>.nix;`\n3. Example: `nix/examples/home-manager/flake.nix` - homeConfiguration + checks.runNixOSTest\n4. CI: Add to `vira.hs` build.flakes: `\"./nix/examples/home-manager\" { overrideInputs = [(\"<name>\", \".\")] }`\n5. Format: `nixpkgs-fmt` all .nix files"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:18.000Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing reproducible and declarative package management with Nix","zh":"非常适合需要可复现和声明性包管理的DevOps代理，使用Nix","ja":"Nixを使用して再現可能で宣言的なパッケージ管理が必要なDevOpsエージェントに最適","ko":"Nix를 사용하여 재현 가능하고 선언적인 패키지 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión de paquetes reproductible y declarativa con Nix","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une gestion de paquets reproductible et déclarative avec Nix","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine reproduzierbare und deklarative Paketverwaltung mit Nix benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que precisam de gerenciamento de pacotes reprodutível e declarativo com Nix","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих воспроизводимого и декларативного управления пакетами с помощью Nix","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة حزمة قابلة للتكرار وإعلانية مع Nix"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage packages and dependencies using Nix flakes, ensuring consistent builds with nixpkgs-fmt and writeShellApplication for robust shell scripting, including automatic ShellCheck validation and strict bash options","zh":"赋予代理使用Nix flakes管理包和依赖项，确保使用nixpkgs-fmt和writeShellApplication进行一致的构建，包括自动的ShellCheck验证和严格的bash选项","ja":"Nix flakesを使用してエージェントがパッケージと依存関係を管理できるようにし、nixpkgs-fmtとwriteShellApplicationを使用して一貫したビルドを保証し、自動的なShellCheck検証と厳格なbashオプションを含む","ko":"에이전트가 Nix flakes를 사용하여 패키지와 의존성을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, nixpkgs-fmt와 writeShellApplication를 사용하여 일관된 빌드를 보장하고, 자동 ShellCheck 검증 및 엄격한 bash 옵션을 포함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar paquetes y dependencias utilizando Nix flakes, asegurando construcciones coherentes con nixpkgs-fmt y writeShellApplication para una scripting de shell robusta, incluyendo la validación automática de ShellCheck y opciones estrictas de bash","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des paquets et des dépendances en utilisant Nix flakes, garantissant des constructions cohérentes avec nixpkgs-fmt et writeShellApplication pour une scripting de shell robuste, y compris la validation automatique de ShellCheck et des options bash strictes","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Pakete und Abhängigkeiten mit Nix flakes zu verwalten, um konsistente Builds mit nixpkgs-fmt und writeShellApplication für robuste Shell-Skripting sicherzustellen, einschließlich automatischer ShellCheck-Validierung und strikter Bash-Optionen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar pacotes e dependências usando Nix flakes, garantindo compilações consistentes com nixpkgs-fmt e writeShellApplication para script de shell robusto, incluindo validação automática do ShellCheck e opções bash estritas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять пакетами и зависимостями с помощью Nix flakes, обеспечивая последовательные сборки с nixpkgs-fmt и writeShellApplication для прочного скриптинга shell, включая автоматическую валидацию ShellCheck и строгие опции bash","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إدارة الحزم والاعتماديات باستخدام Nix flakes، مما يضمن بناء متسق مع nixpkgs-fmt و writeShellApplication للبرمجة النصية القوية للshell، بما في ذلك التحقق التلقائي من ShellCheck وخيارات bash الصارمة"},"useCases":{"en":["Building reproducible development environments with flake-parts","Automating package management with nix build and --print-out-paths flag","Validating shell scripts with ShellCheck and fixing warnings"],"zh":["使用flake-parts构建可复现的开发环境","使用nix build和--print-out-paths标志自动化包管理","使用ShellCheck验证shell脚本并修复警告"],"ja":["flake-partsを使用して再現可能な開発環境を構築する","nix buildと--print-out-pathsフラグを使用してパッケージ管理を自動化する","ShellCheckを使用してシェルスクリプトを検証し、警告を修正する"],"ko":["flake-parts를 사용하여 재현 가능한 개발 환경을 구축","nix build와 --print-out-paths 플래그를 사용하여 패키지管理 자동화","ShellCheck를 사용하여 셸 스크립트를 확인하고 경고 수정"],"es":["Creación de entornos de desarrollo reproductibles con flake-parts","Automatización de la gestión de paquetes con nix build y la bandera --print-out-paths","Validación de scripts de shell con ShellCheck y corrección de advertencias"],"fr":["Création d''environnements de développement reproductibles avec flake-parts","Automatisation de la gestion de paquets avec nix build et le drapeau --print-out-paths","Validation de scripts de shell avec ShellCheck et correction des avertissements"],"de":["Erstellung von reproduzierbaren Entwicklungsumgebungen mit flake-parts","Automatisierung der Paketverwaltung mit nix build und der --print-out-paths-Flagge","Validierung von Shell-Skripten mit ShellCheck und Behebung von Warnungen"],"pt":["Construir ambientes de desenvolvimento reprodutíveis com flake-parts","Automatizar o gerenciamento de pacotes com nix build e flagra --print-out-paths","Validar scripts de shell com ShellCheck e corrigir avisos"],"ru":["Построение воспроизводимых сред разработки с помощью flake-parts","Автоматизация управления пакетами с nix build и флагом --print-out-paths","Валидация скриптов shell с помощью ShellCheck и исправление предупреждений"],"ar":["بناء بيئات تطوير قابلة للتكرار مع flake-parts","توفير إدارة الحزم تلقائيًا مع nix build و --print-out-paths العلامة","التحقق من صحة نصوص shell مع ShellCheck وتصحيح التحذيرات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nix installation","Limited to Nix-compatible packages and dependencies"],"zh":["需要Nix安装","仅限于Nix兼容包和依赖项"],"ja":["Nixのインストールが必要","Nixと互換性のあるパッケージと依存関係のみ"],"ko":["Nix 설치 필요","Nix와 호환되는 패키지 및 의존성만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Nix","Limitado a paquetes y dependencias compatibles con Nix"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Nix","Limité aux paquets et dépendances compatibles avec Nix"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Nix","Begrenzt auf Nix-kompatible Pakete und Abhängigkeiten"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Nix","Limitado a pacotes e dependências compatíveis com Nix"],"ru":["Требуется установка Nix","Ограничен пакетами и зависимостями, совместимыми с Nix"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Nix","محدود بالحزم والاعتماديات المتوافقة مع Nix"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"076a9e2b1215bd389023d9e194be279ca8e98958f94f5d750d8ab33736519c6f","qualityScore":39}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('resend/react-email/react-email', 'community', 'resend', 'react-email', 'resend/react-email', 'react-email', 0, 0, 39, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.879Z', '2026-03-02T02:08:08.507Z', '3e1c597c4292eaf8555211ba75d7afc57552e21a6657a470ca0e3ef6b934dcae', '{"id":"resend/react-email/react-email","name":"react-email","description":{"zh":"React 电子邮件是一个现代的、基于组件的电子邮件开发方法，使用 React 组件构建和发送 HTML 电子邮件","ja":"React 電子メールは、React コンポーネントを使用して HTML 電子メールをビルドして送信する、モダンなコンポーネントベースの電子メール開発方法です","ko":"React 이메일은 React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 HTML 이메일을 빌드하고 전송하는 모던한 컴포넌트 기반의 이메일 개발 방법입니다","es":"React Email es una herramienta para construir y enviar correos electrónicos HTML utilizando componentes de React","fr":"React Email est un outil pour créer et envoyer des emails HTML en utilisant des composants React","de":"React Email ist ein Tool zum Erstellen und Senden von HTML-E-Mails mithilfe von React-Komponenten","pt":"O React Email é uma abordagem moderna e baseada em componentes para o desenvolvimento de e-mails que funciona em todos os principais clientes de e-mail","ru":"React Email - это современный, компонентно-ориентированный подход к разработке электронных писем, который работает во всех основных клиентах электронной почты","ar":"React Email هو نهج حديث وقائم على المكونات لتنمية البريد الإلكتروني والذي يعمل على جميع عملاء البريد الإلكتروني الرئيسيين","en":"💌 Build and send emails using React"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"React 电子邮件构建和发送","ja":"React で電子メールをビルドして送信","ko":"React 이메일 빌드 및 전송","es":"React Email: Construye correos electrónicos con React","fr":"React Email : Créez des emails avec React","de":"React Email: Erstellen Sie E-Mails mit React","pt":"React Email: Construa e envie e-mails com React","ru":"React Email: Создавайте и отправляйте электронные письма ...","ar":"React Email: بناء وارسال البريد الإلكتروني باستخدام React","en":"react-email"},"description":{"zh":"React 电子邮件是一个现代的、基于组件的电子邮件开发方法，使用 React 组件构建和发送 HTML 电子邮件","ja":"React 電子メールは、React コンポーネントを使用して HTML 電子メールをビルドして送信する、モダンなコンポーネントベースの電子メール開発方法です","ko":"React 이메일은 React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 HTML 이메일을 빌드하고 전송하는 모던한 컴포넌트 기반의 이메일 개발 방법입니다","es":"React Email es una herramienta para construir y enviar correos electrónicos HTML utilizando componentes de React","fr":"React Email est un outil pour créer et envoyer des emails HTML en utilisant des composants React","de":"React Email ist ein Tool zum Erstellen und Senden von HTML-E-Mails mithilfe von React-Komponenten","pt":"O React Email é uma abordagem moderna e baseada em componentes para o desenvolvimento de e-mails que funciona em todos os principais clientes de e-mail","ru":"React Email - это современный, компонентно-ориентированный подход к разработке электронных писем, который работает во всех основных клиентах электронной почты","ar":"React Email هو نهج حديث وقائم على المكونات لتنمية البريد الإلكتروني والذي يعمل على جميع عملاء البريد الإلكتروني الرئيسيين","en":"💌 Build and send emails using React"},"definition":{"en":"💌 Build and send emails using React"},"features":{"zh":["使用 React 组件构建电子邮件","支持所有主要电子邮件客户端","使用 create-email CLI 快速创建新项目","支持 npm、yarn、pnpm 和 bun 包管理器","提供样本电子邮件模板","现代的、基于组件的电子邮件开发方法"],"ja":["React コンポーネントを使用して電子メールをビルド","主要な電子メールクライアントをサポート","create-email CLI を使用して新規プロジェクトを迅速に作成","npm、yarn、pnpm、bun パッケージマネージャーをサポート","サンプル電子メールテンプレートを提供","モダンなコンポーネントベースの電子メール開発方法"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 이메일을 빌드","주요 이메일 클라이언트를 지원","create-email CLI를 사용하여 새로운 프로젝트를 빠르게 생성","npm, yarn, pnpm, bun 패키지 관리자를 지원","샘플 이메일 템플릿을 제공","모던한 컴포넌트 기반의 이메일 개발 방법"],"es":["Crea correos electrónicos HTML personalizados","Utiliza componentes de React para construir correos electrónicos","Compatible con todos los principales clientes de correo electrónico","Fácil de instalar y configurar","Permite la creación de plantillas de correo electrónico personalizadas"],"fr":["Créez des emails HTML personnalisés","Utilisez des composants React pour créer des emails","Compatible avec tous les principaux clients de messagerie","Facile à installer et à configurer","Permet de créer des modèles d''email personnalisés"],"de":["Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte HTML-E-Mails","Verwenden Sie React-Komponenten, um E-Mails zu erstellen","Kompatibel mit allen wichtigen E-Mail-Clients","Einfach zu installieren und zu konfigurieren","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten E-Mail-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Crie e-mails personalizados com componentes React","Funciona em todos os principais clientes de e-mail","Abordagem moderna e baseada em componentes","Instalação fácil com create-email CLI","Suporte a npm, yarn, pnpm e bun"],"ru":["Создавайте настраиваемые электронные письма с помощью компонентов React","Работает во всех основных клиентах электронной почты","Современный, компонентно-ориентированный подход","Легкая установка с помощью create-email CLI","Поддержка npm, yarn, pnpm и bun"],"ar":["انشئ رسائل بريد إلكتروني مخصصة باستخدام مكونات React","يعمل على جميع عملاء البريد الإلكتروني الرئيسيين","نهج حديث وقائم على المكونات","تثبيت سهل مع create-email CLI","دعم npm و yarn و pnpm و bun"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 电子邮件","React 邮件","电子邮件开发","React 组件","HTML 电子邮件","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ja":["React 電子メール","React メール","電子メール開発","React コンポーネント","HTML 電子メール","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ko":["React 이메일","React 메일","이메일 개발","React 컴포넌트","HTML 이메일","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"es":["React Email","correo electrónico react","crear correos electrónicos con React","enviar correos electrónicos HTML","correo electrónico personalizado","react email template"],"fr":["React Email","email react","créer des emails avec React","envoyer des emails HTML","email personnalisé","modèle d''email react"],"de":["React Email","React E-Mail","Erstellen von E-Mails mit React","Senden von HTML-E-Mails","benutzerdefinierte E-Mail","React-E-Mail-Vorlage"],"pt":["React Email","Desenvolvimento de e-mails","Componentes React","E-mails personalizados","Create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ru":["React Email","Разработка электронных писем","Компоненты React","Настраиваемые электронные письма","Create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ar":["React Email","تنمية البريد الإلكتروني","مكونات React","البريد الإلكتروني المخصص","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"]}},"owner":"resend","repo":"react-email","repoPath":"resend/react-email","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.879Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-email","description":"Use when creating HTML email templates with React components - welcome emails, password resets, notifications, order confirmations, newsletters, or transactional emails.","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# React Email\n\nBuild and send HTML emails using React components - a modern, component-based approach to email development that works across all major email clients.\n\n## Installation\n\nYou need to scaffold a new React Email project using the create-email CLI. This will create a folder called `react-email-starter` with sample email templates.\n\nUsing npm:\n```sh\nnpx create-email@latest\n```\n\nUsing yarn:\n```sh\nyarn create email\n```\n\nUsing pnpm:\n```sh\npnpm create email\n```\n\nUsing bun:\n```sh\nbun create","body":"# React Email\n\nBuild and send HTML emails using React components - a modern, component-based approach to email development that works across all major email clients.\n\n## Installation\n\nYou need to scaffold a new React Email project using the create-email CLI. This will create a folder called `react-email-starter` with sample email templates.\n\nUsing npm:\n```sh\nnpx create-email@latest\n```\n\nUsing yarn:\n```sh\nyarn create email\n```\n\nUsing pnpm:\n```sh\npnpm create email\n```\n\nUsing bun:\n```sh\nbun create email\n```\n\n## Navigate to Project Directory\n\nYou must change into the newly created project folder:\n\n```sh\ncd react-email-starter\n```\n\n## Install Dependencies\n\nYou need to install all project dependencies before running the development server.\n\nUsing npm:\n```sh\nnpm install\n```\n\nUsing yarn:\n```sh\nyarn\n```\n\nUsing pnpm:\n```sh\npnpm install\n```\n\nUsing bun:\n```sh\nbun install\n```\n\n## Start the Development Server\n\nYour task is to start the local preview server to view and edit email templates.\n\nUsing npm:\n```sh\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nUsing yarn:\n```sh\nyarn dev\n```\n\nUsing pnpm:\n```sh\npnpm dev\n```\n\nUsing bun:\n```sh\nbun dev\n```\n\n## Verify Installation\n\nConfirm the development server is running by checking that localhost:3000 is accessible. The server will display a preview interface where you can view email templates from the `emails` folder.\n\n### Notes on installation\nAssuming React Email is installed in an existing project, update the top-level package.json file with a script to run the React Email preview server.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"email\": \"email dev --dir emails --port 3000\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nMake sure the path to the emails folder is relative to the base project directory.\n\n\n### tsconfig.json updating or creation\n\nEnsure the tsconfig.json includes proper support for jsx.\n\n## Basic Email Template\n\nReplace the sample email templates. Here is how to create a new email template:\n\nCreate an email component with proper structure using the Tailwind component for styling:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Html,\n  Head,\n  Preview,\n  Body,\n  Container,\n  Heading,\n  Text,\n  Button,\n  Tailwind,\n  pixelBasedPreset\n} from ''@react-email/components'';\n\ninterface WelcomeEmailProps {\n  name: string;\n  verificationUrl: string;\n}\n\nexport default function WelcomeEmail({ name, verificationUrl }: WelcomeEmailProps) {\n  return (\n    <Html lang=\"en\">\n      <Tailwind\n        config={{\n          presets: [pixelBasedPreset],\n          theme: {\n            extend: {\n              colors: {\n                brand: ''#007bff'',\n              },\n            },\n          },\n        }}\n      >\n        <Head />\n        <Preview>Welcome - Verify your email</Preview>\n        <Body className=\"bg-gray-100 font-sans\">\n          <Container className=\"max-w-xl mx-auto p-5\">\n            <Heading className=\"text-2xl text-gray-800\">\n              Welcome!\n            </Heading>\n            <Text className=\"text-base text-gray-800\">\n              Hi {name}, thanks for signing up!\n            </Text>\n            <Button\n              href={verificationUrl}\n              className=\"bg-brand text-white px-5 py-3 rounded block text-center no-underline box-border\"\n            >\n              Verify Email\n            </Button>\n          </Container>\n        </Body>\n      </Tailwind>\n    </Html>\n  );\n}\n\n// Preview props for testing\nWelcomeEmail.PreviewProps = {\n  name: ''John Doe'',\n  verificationUrl: ''https://example.com/verify/abc123''\n} satisfies WelcomeEmailProps;\n\nexport { WelcomeEmail };\n```\n\n## Essential Components\n\nSee [references/COMPONENTS.md](references/COMPONENTS.md) for complete component documentation.\n\n**Core Structure:**\n- `Html` - Root wrapper with `lang` attribute\n- `Head` - Meta elements, styles, fonts\n- `Body` - Main content wrapper\n- `Container` - Centers content (max-width layout)\n- `Section` - Layout sections\n- `Row` & `Column` - Multi-column layouts\n- `Tailwind` - Enables Tailwind CSS utility classes\n\n**Content:**\n- `Preview` - Inbox preview text, always first in `Body`\n- `Heading` - h1-h6 headings\n- `Text` - Paragraphs\n- `Button` - Styled link buttons\n- `Link` - Hyperlinks\n- `Img` - Images (see Static Files section below)\n- `Hr` - Horizontal dividers\n\n**Specialized:**\n- `CodeBlock` - Syntax-highlighted code\n- `CodeInline` - Inline code\n- `Markdown` - Render markdown\n- `Font` - Custom web fonts\n\n## Before Writing Code\n\nWhen a user requests an email template, ask clarifying questions FIRST if they haven''t provided:\n\n1. **Brand colors** - Ask for primary brand color (hex code like #007bff)\n2. **Logo** - Ask if they have a logo file and its format (PNG/JPG only - warn if SVG/WEBP)\n3. **Style preference** - Professional, casual, or minimal tone\n4. **Production URL** - Where will static assets be hosted in production?\n\nExample response to vague request:\n> Before I create your email template, I have a few questions:\n> 1. What is your primary brand color? (hex code)\n> 2. Do you have a logo file? (PNG or JPG - note: SVG and WEBP don''t work reliably in email clients)\n> 3. What tone do you prefer - professional, casual, or minimal?\n> 4. Where will you host static assets in production? (e.g., https://cdn.example.com)\n\n## Static Files and Images\n\n### Directory Structure\n\nLocal images must be placed in the `static` folder inside your emails directory:\n\n```\nproject/\n├── emails/\n│   ├── welcome.tsx\n│   └── static/           <-- Images go here\n│       └── logo.png\n```\n\nIf user has an image elsewhere, instruct them to copy it:\n```sh\ncp ./assets/logo.png ./emails/static/logo.png\n```\n\n### Dev vs Production URLs\n\nUse this pattern for images that work in both dev preview and production:\n\n```tsx\nconst baseURL = process.env.NODE_ENV === \"production\"\n  ? \"https://cdn.example.com\"  // User''s production CDN\n  : \"\";\n\nexport default function Email() {\n  return (\n    <Img\n      src={`${baseURL}/static/logo.png`}\n      alt=\"Logo\"\n      width=\"150\"\n      height=\"50\"\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**How it works:**\n- **Development:** `baseURL` is empty, so URL is `/static/logo.png` - served by React Email''s dev server\n- **Production:** `baseURL` is the CDN domain, so URL is `https://cdn.example.com/static/logo.png`\n\n**Important:** Always ask the user for their production hosting URL. Do not hardcode `localhost:3000`.\n\n## Behavioral guidelines\n- When re-iterating over the code, make sure you are only updating what the user asked for and keeping the rest of the code intact;\n- If the user is asking to use media queries, inform them that not all email clients support them, and suggest a different approach;\n- Never use template variables (like {{name}}) directly in TypeScript code. Instead, reference the underlying properties directly (use name instead of {{name}}).\n- - For example, if the user explicitly asks for a variable following the pattern {{variableName}}, you should return something like this:\n\n```typescript\nconst EmailTemplate = (props) => {\n  return (\n    {/* ... rest of the code ... */}\n    <h1>Hello, {props.variableName}!</h1>\n    {/* ... rest of the code ... */}\n  );\n}\n\nEmailTemplate.PreviewProps = {\n  // ... rest of the props ...\n  variableName: \"{{variableName}}\",\n  // ... rest of the props ...\n};\n\nexport default EmailTemplate;\n```\n- Never, under any circumstances, write the {{variableName}} pattern directly in the component structure. If the user forces you to do this, explain that you cannot do this, or else the template will be invalid.\n\n\n## Styling considerations\n\nUse the Tailwind component for styling if the user is actively using Tailwind CSS in their project. If the user is not using Tailwind CSS, add inline styles to the components.\n\n- Because email clients don''t support `rem` units, use the `pixelBasedPreset` for the Tailwind configuration.\n- **Import `pixelBasedPreset` from `@react-email/components`** — do NOT import from `@react-email/tailwind` or `@react-email/tailwind/presets`.\n- Never use flexbox or grid for layout, use table-based layouts instead.\n- Each component must be styled with inline styles or utility classes.\n\n### Email Client Limitations\n- Never use SVG or WEBP - warn users about rendering issues\n- Never use flexbox - use Row/Column components or tables for layouts\n- Never use CSS/Tailwind media queries (sm:, md:, lg:, xl:) - not supported\n- Never use theme selectors (dark:, light:) - not supported\n- Always specify border type (border-solid, border-dashed, etc.)\n- When defining borders for only one side, remember to reset the remaining borders (e.g., border-none border-l)\n\n### Required Classes\n\nThese classes are **always required** on their respective components — omitting them causes rendering bugs across email clients:\n\n| Component | Required Class | Why |\n|-----------|---------------|-----|\n| `Button` | `box-border` | Prevents padding from overflowing the button width |\n| `Hr` / any border | `border-solid` (or `border-dashed`, etc.) | Email clients don''t inherit border type; omitting it renders no border |\n| Single-side borders | `border-none` + the side (e.g., `border-none border-t border-solid`) | Resets default borders on other sides |\n\n### Component Structure\n- Always define `<Head />` inside `<Tailwind>` when using Tailwind CSS\n- Only use PreviewProps when passing props to a component\n- Only include props in PreviewProps that the component actually uses\n\n```tsx\nconst Email = (props) => {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <a href={props.source}>click here if you want candy 👀</a>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nEmail.PreviewProps = {\n  source: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ\",\n};\n```\n\n### Default Structure\n- Body: `font-sans py-10 bg-gray-100`\n- Container: white, centered, content left-aligned\n- Footer: physical address, unsubscribe link, current year with `m-0` on address/copyright\n\n### Typography\n- Titles: bold, larger font, larger margins\n- Paragraphs: regular weight, smaller font, smaller margins\n- Use consistent spacing respecting content hierarchy\n\n### Images\n- Only include if user requests\n- Never use fixed width/height - use responsive units (w-full, h-auto)\n- Never distort user-provided images\n- Never create SVG images - only use provided or web images\n\n### Buttons\n- Always use `box-border` to prevent padding overflow\n\n### Layout\n- Always mobile-friendly by default\n- Use stacked layouts that work on all screen sizes\n- Remove default spacing/margins/padding between list items\n\n### Dark Mode\nWhen requested: container black (#000), background dark gray (#151516)\n\n### Best Practices\n- Choose colors, layout, and copy based on user''s request\n- Make templates unique, not generic\n- Use keywords in email body to increase conversion\n\n## Rendering\n\n### Convert to HTML\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from ''@react-email/components'';\nimport { WelcomeEmail } from ''./emails/welcome'';\n\nconst html = await render(\n  <WelcomeEmail name=\"John\" verificationUrl=\"https://example.com/verify\" />\n);\n```\n\n### Convert to Plain Text\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from ''@react-email/components'';\nimport { WelcomeEmail } from ''./emails/welcome'';\n\nconst text = await render(<WelcomeEmail name=\"John\" verificationUrl=\"https://example.com/verify\" />, { plainText: true });\n```\n\n## Sending\n\nReact Email supports sending with any email service provider. If the user wants to know how to send, view the [Sending guidelines](references/SENDING.md).\n\nQuick example using the Resend SDK for Node.js:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Resend } from ''resend'';\nimport { WelcomeEmail } from ''./emails/welcome'';\n\nconst resend = new Resend(process.env.RESEND_API_KEY);\n\nconst { data, error } = await resend.emails.send({\n  from: ''Acme <onboarding@resend.dev>'',\n  to: [''user@example.com''],\n  subject: ''Welcome to Acme'',\n  react: <WelcomeEmail name=\"John\" verificationUrl=\"https://example.com/verify\" />\n});\n\nif (error) {\n  console.error(''Failed to send:'', error);\n}\n```\n\nThe Node SDK automatically handles the plain-text rendering and HTML rendering for you.\n\n## Internationalization\n\nSee [references/I18N.md](references/I18N.md) for complete i18n documentation.\n\nReact Email supports three i18n libraries: next-intl, react-i18next, and react-intl.\n\n### Quick Example (next-intl)\n\n```tsx\nimport { createTranslator } from ''next-intl'';\nimport {\n  Html,\n  Body,\n  Container,\n  Text,\n  Button,\n  Tailwind,\n  pixelBasedPreset\n} from ''@react-email/components'';\n\ninterface EmailProps {\n  name: string;\n  locale: string;\n}\n\nexport default async function WelcomeEmail({ name, locale }: EmailProps) {\n  const t = createTranslator({\n    messages: await import(\\`../messages/\\${locale}.json\\`),\n    namespace: ''welcome-email'',\n    locale\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <Html lang={locale}>\n      <Tailwind config={{ presets: [pixelBasedPreset] }}>\n        <Body className=\"bg-gray-100 font-sans\">\n          <Container className=\"max-w-xl mx-auto p-5\">\n            <Text className=\"text-base text-gray-800\">{t(''greeting'')} {name},</Text>\n            <Text className=\"text-base text-gray-800\">{t(''body'')}</Text>\n            <Button href=\"https://example.com\" className=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded\">\n              {t(''cta'')}\n            </Button>\n          </Container>\n        </Body>\n      </Tailwind>\n    </Html>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nMessage files (\\`messages/en.json\\`, \\`messages/es.json\\`, etc.):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"welcome-email\": {\n    \"greeting\": \"Hi\",\n    \"body\": \"Thanks for signing up!\",\n    \"cta\": \"Get Started\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Email Best Practices\n\n1. **Test across email clients** - Test in Gmail, Outlook, Apple Mail, Yahoo Mail. Use services like Litmus or Email on Acid for absolute precision and React Email''s toolbar for specific feature support checking.\n\n2. **Keep it responsive** - Max-width around 600px, test on mobile devices.\n\n3. **Use absolute image URLs** - Host on reliable CDN, always include \\`alt\\` text.\n\n4. **Provide plain text version** - Required for accessibility and some email clients.\n\n5. **Keep file size under 102KB** - Gmail clips larger emails.\n\n6. **Add proper TypeScript types** - Define interfaces for all email props.\n\n7. **Include preview props** - Add \\`.PreviewProps\\` to components for development testing.\n\n8. **Handle errors** - Always check for errors when sending emails.\n\n9.  **Use verified domains** - For production, use verified domains in \\`from\\` addresses.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\nSee [references/PATTERNS.md](references/PATTERNS.md) for complete examples including:\n- Password reset emails\n- Order confirmations with product lists\n- Notification emails with code blocks\n- Multi-column layouts\n- Email templates with custom fonts\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- [React Email Documentation](https://react.email/docs/llms.txt)\n- [React Email GitHub](https://github.com/resend/react-email)\n- [Resend Documentation](https://resend.com/docs/llms.txt)\n- [Email Client CSS Support](https://www.caniemail.com)\n- Component Reference: [references/COMPONENTS.md](references/COMPONENTS.md)\n- Internationalization Guide: [references/I18N.md](references/I18N.md)\n- Common Patterns: [references/PATTERNS.md](references/PATTERNS.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:08.507Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents needing to build and send dynamic HTML emails using React components","zh":"适用于需要使用React组件构建和发送动态HTML电子邮件的前端代理","ja":"Reactコンポーネントを使用して動的なHTML電子メールを構築および送信する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに適しています","ko":"React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 동적인 HTML 이메일을 구축하고 보낼 수 있는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que necesitan crear y enviar correos electrónicos HTML dinámicos utilizando componentes de React","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de créer et d''envoyer des courriels HTML dynamiques à l''aide de composants React","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die dynamische HTML-E-Mails mit React-Komponenten erstellen und senden müssen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que precisam criar e enviar e-mails dinâmicos em HTML usando componentes React","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо создавать и отправлять динамические электронные письма в формате HTML, используя компоненты React","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى بناء وارسال رسائل بريد إلكتروني ديناميكية في HTML باستخدام مكونات React"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and send cross-client compatible HTML emails using React, leveraging create-email CLI for scaffolding and supporting npm, yarn, pnpm, and bun package managers for seamless project setup and management","zh":"赋予代理构建和发送跨客户端兼容的HTML电子邮件的能力，使用React，并利用create-email CLI进行脚手架构建，并支持npm、yarn、pnpm和bun包管理器，以实现无缝的项目设置和管理","ja":"Reactを使用して、クロスクライアント互換性のあるHTML電子メールを構築および送信するためのエージェントの能力を提供し、create-email CLIを使用してスケルトンを作成し、npm、yarn、pnpm、およびbunパッケージマネージャーをサポートして、プロジェクトの設定と管理を無縫に行う","ko":"React를 사용하여 크로스 클라이언트 호환 HTML 이메일을 구축하고 보낼 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, create-email CLI를 사용하여 스켈레톤을 생성하고, npm, yarn, pnpm 및 bun 패키지 관리자를 지원하여 프로젝트 설정 및 관리를 무결점으로 진행합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y enviar correos electrónicos HTML compatibles con varios clientes, utilizando React, aprovechando create-email CLI para la creación del esqueleto del proyecto y admitiendo npm, yarn, pnpm y bun como administradores de paquetes para una configuración y administración de proyectos sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et d''envoyer des courriels HTML compatibles avec plusieurs clients, en utilisant React, en exploitant create-email CLI pour le squelette du projet et en prenant en charge npm, yarn, pnpm et bun en tant que gestionnaires de paquets pour une configuration et une gestion de projet sans problème","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, cross-client-kompatible HTML-E-Mails zu generieren und zu senden, indem React verwendet wird, wobei create-email CLI für die Projektskelettierung genutzt wird und npm, yarn, pnpm und bun als Paket-Manager für eine reibungslose Projektsetup und -verwaltung unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e enviar e-mails em HTML compatíveis com vários clientes, usando React, aproveitando o create-email CLI para estruturação e suportando os gerenciadores de pacotes npm, yarn, pnpm e bun para configuração e gerenciamento de projetos sem interrupções","ru":"Наделяе