rketing, SEO, trading y video"],"fr":["170+ compétences préconstruites","Compatibilité avec Claude Code, Cursor, Codex et plus","Accès instantané à l''expertise dans des domaines spécifiques","Inclut des flux de travail de marketing, SEO, trading et vidéo"],"de":["170+ vorgefertigte Fähigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code, Cursor, Codex und mehr","Sofortiger Zugang zu Fachwissen in bestimmten Bereichen","Enthält Workflows für Marketing, SEO, Trading und Video"],"pt":["170+ habilidades pré-construídas","Integração com Claude Code, Cursor, Codex e 14+ ferramentas de IA","Marketing, SEO, Trading e Video workflows incluídos","Um comando para especialização de domínio instantânea","Evite reensinar seu IA as mesmas coisas"],"ru":["170+ предустановленных навыков","Интеграция с Claude Code, Cursor, Codex и 14+ инструментами ИИ","Маркетинг, SEO, торговля и видео workflows включены","Одна команда для мгновенной специализации домена","Избегайте повторного обучения вашего ИИ одним и тем же"],"ar":["أكثر من 170 مهارة مسبقة الإعداد","التكامل مع Claude Code و Cursor و Codex و 14+ أداة إلكترونية ذكية","سير عمل التسويق و SEO والتجارة والفيديو المضمنة","أمر واحد لتحقيق خبرة المجال على الفور","تجنب إعادة تعليم الذكاء الاصطناعي للأشياء نفسها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","resource-scout","预建技能","AI工具","开发者效率","Marketing","SEO","Trading","Video","PM工作流"],"ja":["AIエージェント","resource-scout","事前ビルドスキル","AIツール","開発者の生産性","Marketing","SEO","Trading","Video","PMワークフロー"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","resource-scout","사전 구축된 기술","AI 도구","개발자의 생산성","마케팅","SEO","트레이딩","비디오","PM 워크플로"],"es":["cómo usar resource-scout","qué es un agente de recursos inteligentes","alternative a Claude Code","resource-scout vs Codex","instalación de resource-scout","guía de configuración de resource-scout"],"fr":["comment utiliser resource-scout","qu''est-ce qu''un agent de ressources IA","alternative à Claude Code","resource-scout vs Codex","installation de resource-scout","guide de configuration de resource-scout"],"de":["wie man resource-scout verwendet","was ist ein KI-Ressourcen-Scout","Alternative zu Claude Code","resource-scout vs Codex","Installation von resource-scout","Konfigurationsanleitung für resource-scout"],"pt":["como usar resource-scout","o que é resource-scout","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","resource-scout vs outras ferramentas de IA","guia de instalação do resource-scout","como configurar o resource-scout","resource-scout para marketing","resource-scout para SEO","resource-scout para trading","resource-scout para video"],"ru":["как использовать ресурс-скаут","что такое ресурс-скаут","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","ресурс-скаут vs другие инструменты ИИ","руководство по установке ресурс-скаута","как настроить ресурс-скаут","ресурс-скаут для маркетинга","ресурс-скаут для SEO","ресурс-скаут для торговли","ресурс-скаут для видео"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مرشح الموارد","ما هو مرشح الموارد","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","مرشح الموارد مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","دليل تثبيت مرشح الموارد","كيفية تكوين مرشح الموارد","مرشح الموارد للتسويق","مرشح الموارد للاستعلام","مرشح الموارد للتجارة","مرشح الموارد للفيديو"]}},"owner":"nicepkg","repo":"ai-workflow","repoPath":"nicepkg/ai-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.896Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"resource-scout","description":"Search and discover Claude Code skills and MCP servers from marketplaces, GitHub repositories, and registries. Use when (1) user asks to find skills for a specific task, (2) looking for MCP servers to connect external tools, (3) user mentions find skill, search MCP, discover tools, or what skills exist for X, (4) before creating a custom skill to check if one already exists.","bodyPreview":"# Resource Scout\n\nSearch and discover existing Claude Code skills and MCP servers before building custom solutions.\n\n## Quick Search Strategy\n\n**For Skills:**\n1. WebSearch: `site:skillsmp.com [topic]` or `claude skill [topic]`\n2. Check GitHub: `awesome-claude-skills [topic]`\n3. Browse: skillhub.club, claudeskills.info\n\n**For MCP:**\n1. WebSearch: `MCP server [tool/service name]`\n2. Check: glama.ai/mcp/servers, mcpmarket.com\n3. Official: github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers\n\n## Skill Search Wor","body":"# Resource Scout\n\nSearch and discover existing Claude Code skills and MCP servers before building custom solutions.\n\n## Quick Search Strategy\n\n**For Skills:**\n1. WebSearch: `site:skillsmp.com [topic]` or `claude skill [topic]`\n2. Check GitHub: `awesome-claude-skills [topic]`\n3. Browse: skillhub.club, claudeskills.info\n\n**For MCP:**\n1. WebSearch: `MCP server [tool/service name]`\n2. Check: glama.ai/mcp/servers, mcpmarket.com\n3. Official: github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers\n\n## Skill Search Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Define Need\n\nBefore searching, clarify:\n- What task needs to be accomplished?\n- What tools/services are involved?\n- Is it a common pattern (git, testing, API) or domain-specific?\n\n### Step 2: Search Marketplaces\n\n**Primary sources (largest catalogs):**\n\n| Source | URL | Best For |\n|--------|-----|----------|\n| SkillsMP | skillsmp.com | 71000+ skills, long-tail search |\n| SkillHub.club | skillhub.club | AI-evaluated, quality filter |\n| Claude Skills Hub | claudeskills.info | UI-friendly browsing |\n\n**Search patterns:**\n```\n# On SkillsMP\n[domain] skill          → \"marketing skill\", \"database skill\"\n[framework] claude      → \"react claude\", \"fastapi claude\"\n[task] automation       → \"deployment automation\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Search GitHub\n\n**Curated lists:**\n- `github.com/keyuyuan/skillhub-awesome-skills` - 精选清单\n- `github.com/VoltAgent/awesome-claude-skills` - 生态大全\n- `github.com/ComposioHQ/awesome-claude-skills` - 大量通用技能\n\n**Ready-to-use repositories:**\n- `github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills` - Content/Marketing\n- `github.com/gked2121/claude-skills` - Workflow思维\n- `github.com/Microck/ordinary-claude-skills` - 超大集合\n- `github.com/sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills` - 结构化\n\n**Search command:**\n```bash\n# Use WebSearch tool\nsite:github.com \"claude skill\" [topic]\nsite:github.com \"SKILL.md\" [topic]\n```\n\n### Step 4: Evaluate & Install\n\nWhen skill found:\n1. Check last update date (prefer recent)\n2. Review SKILL.md for quality\n3. Check if has scripts/references\n4. Install with skill-downloader or manual copy\n\n## MCP Server Search Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify Integration Need\n\nCommon patterns:\n- Database access → postgres, mysql, sqlite MCP\n- GitHub workflow → github MCP\n- Cloud services → AWS, GCP, Azure MCPs\n- Communication → slack, discord MCPs\n- File systems → filesystem MCP\n\n### Step 2: Search Official Sources\n\n**Primary:**\n- Official registry: `registry.modelcontextprotocol.io`\n- Official repo: `github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers`\n\n**Directories:**\n| Source | URL | Features |\n|--------|-----|----------|\n| Glama | glama.ai/mcp/servers | Stars, downloads, updates |\n| MCP Market | mcpmarket.com | Skills + MCP combined |\n| mcpservers.org | mcpservers.org | Categorized |\n| PulseMCP | pulsemcp.com/servers | Daily updates |\n| Smithery | smithery.ai | Registry/distribution |\n\n### Step 3: Search GitHub\n\n```bash\n# Use WebSearch tool\nsite:github.com \"mcp server\" [service]\nsite:github.com \"@modelcontextprotocol\" [service]\n```\n\n**Awesome lists:**\n- `github.com/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers`\n- `github.com/wong2/awesome-mcp-servers`\n\n### Step 4: Verify & Configure\n\nWhen MCP found:\n1. Check compatibility (stdio vs HTTP)\n2. Review required environment variables\n3. Test connection locally\n4. Add to `.claude/settings.json`\n\n## Search by Category\n\n### Development Tools\n```\nSkills: \"code review skill\", \"git commit skill\", \"testing skill\"\nMCP: \"github mcp\", \"gitlab mcp\", \"jira mcp\"\n```\n\n### Databases\n```\nSkills: \"database skill\", \"sql skill\", \"migration skill\"\nMCP: \"postgres mcp\", \"mysql mcp\", \"mongodb mcp\"\n```\n\n### Content & Marketing\n```\nSkills: \"content creator skill\", \"seo skill\", \"social media skill\"\nMCP: \"wordpress mcp\", \"notion mcp\"\n```\n\n### Cloud & DevOps\n```\nSkills: \"deployment skill\", \"kubernetes skill\", \"terraform skill\"\nMCP: \"aws mcp\", \"gcp mcp\", \"azure mcp\"\n```\n\n### AI & Data\n```\nSkills: \"data analysis skill\", \"ml skill\"\nMCP: \"openai mcp\", \"huggingface mcp\"\n```\n\n## Complete Source Reference\n\nSee [references/sources.md](references/sources.md) for full directory of all skill and MCP sources with detailed descriptions.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Search before build** - Always check existing resources first\n2. **Prefer maintained** - Choose skills with recent updates\n3. **Check quality** - Review SKILL.md structure and content\n4. **Consider combining** - Multiple simple skills > one complex custom\n5. **Verify security** - Review MCP permissions and token scopes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:42.077Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code, Cursor, and AutoGPT needing efficient discovery of existing skills and MCP servers.","zh":"适合像 Claude Code、Cursor 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI Agents，它们需要高效地发现现有的技能和 MCP 服务器。","ja":"Claude Code、Cursor、AutoGPT などの AI エージェントに適しています。これらのエージェントは、既存のスキルと MCP サーバーの効率的な発見が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code, Cursor, AutoGPT 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 기존의 스킬과 MCP 서버를 효율적으로 발견해야 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code, Cursor y AutoGPT que necesitan un descubrimiento eficiente de habilidades y servidores MCP existentes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, Cursor et AutoGPT qui ont besoin d''une découverte efficace des compétences et des serveurs MCP existants.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, Cursor und AutoGPT, die eine effiziente Entdeckung bestehender Fähigkeiten und MCP-Server benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, Cursor e AutoGPT que necessitam de descoberta eficiente de habilidades existentes e servidores MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, Cursor и AutoGPT, которым необходима эффективная поисковая система для существующих навыков и серверов MCP.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و Cursor و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى اكتشاف فعال لل مهارات الحالية وخوادم MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to instantly discover relevant Claude Code skills and MCP servers using targeted web searches, GitHub repositories, and specialized platforms like skillhub.club and glama.ai/mcp/servers, streamlining the development of custom solutions.","zh":"赋予代理人使用有针对性的网络搜索、GitHub 存储库和专门的平台（如 skillhub.club 和 glama.ai/mcp/servers）来立即发现相关的 Claude Code 技能和 MCP 服务器的能力，从而简化自定义解决方案的开发。","ja":"エージェントに、ターゲットを絞った Web 検索、GitHub リポジトリ、および skillhub.club や glama.ai/mcp/servers などの専用プラットフォームを使用して、関連する Claude Code スキルと MCP サーバーを即座に発見する能力を付与し、カスタム ソリューションの開発を簡素化します。","ko":"대리인에게 목표를 좁힌 웹 검색, GitHub 저장소 및 skillhub.club 및 glama.ai/mcp/servers와 같은 전문 플랫폼을 사용하여 관련 Claude Code 스킬 및 MCP 서버를 즉시 발견할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 사용자 지정 솔루션의 개발을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descubrir instantáneamente habilidades relevantes de Claude Code y servidores MCP utilizando búsquedas web dirigidas, repositorios de GitHub y plataformas especializadas como skillhub.club y glama.ai/mcp/servers, agilizando el desarrollo de soluciones personalizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir instantanément des compétences pertinentes de Claude Code et des serveurs MCP en utilisant des recherches Web ciblées, des référentiels GitHub et des plateformes spécialisées comme skillhub.club et glama.ai/mcp/servers, rationalisant le développement de solutions personnalisées.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, relevante Claude Code-Fähigkeiten und MCP-Server mithilfe gezielter Web-Suchen, GitHub-Repositorys und spezialisierter Plattformen wie skillhub.club und glama.ai/mcp/servers sofort zu entdecken, wodurch die Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Lösungen rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrir instantaneamente habilidades relevantes do Claude Code e servidores MCP usando pesquisas web direcionadas, repositórios do GitHub e plataformas especializadas como skillhub.club e glama.ai/mcp/servers, otimizando o desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам мгновенно обнаруживать соответствующие навыки Claude Code и серверы MCP с помощью целевых веб-поисков, репозиториев GitHub и специализированных платформ, таких как skillhub.club и glama.ai/mcp/servers, оптимизируя разработку индивидуальных решений.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من اكتشاف مهارات كلود كود وخوادم MCP ذات الصلة على الفور باستخدام عمليات بحث ويب محددة و مخازن جيت هاب و منصات متخصصة مثل skillhub.club و glama.ai/mcp/servers، وتحسين تطوير الحلول المخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Searching for pre-built skills on skillsmp.com and GitHub","Discovering MCP servers for specific tools and services","Browsing skill repositories like skillhub.club and claudeskills.info"],"zh":["在 skillsmp.com 和 GitHub 上搜索预建技能","发现特定工具和服务的 MCP 服务器","浏览技能存储库，如 skillhub.club 和 claudeskills.info"],"ja":["skillsmp.com と GitHub で事前にビルドされたスキルを検索する","特定のツールとサービス用の MCP サーバーを発見する","スキル リポジトリ (skillhub.club や claudeskills.info など) を参照する"],"ko":["skillsmp.com 및 GitHub에서 사전 구축된 스킬 검색","특정 도구 및 서비스를 위한 MCP 서버 검색","스킬 저장소(skillhub.club 및 claudeskills.info 등) 탐색"],"es":["Buscar habilidades preconstruidas en skillsmp.com y GitHub","Descubrir servidores MCP para herramientas y servicios específicos","Navegar por repositorios de habilidades como skillhub.club y claudeskills.info"],"fr":["Rechercher des compétences préconstruites sur skillsmp.com et GitHub","Découvrir des serveurs MCP pour des outils et services spécifiques","Parcourir des référentiels de compétences comme skillhub.club et claudeskills.info"],"de":["Vorab erstellte Fähigkeiten auf skillsmp.com und GitHub suchen","MCP-Server für bestimmte Tools und Dienste entdecken","Fähigkeits-Repositorys wie skillhub.club und claudeskills.info durchsuchen"],"pt":["Pesquisar habilidades pré-construídas em skillsmp.com e GitHub","Descobrir servidores MCP para ferramentas e serviços específicos","Navegar repositórios de habilidades como skillhub.club e claudeskills.info"],"ru":["Поиск предварительно созданных навыков на skillsmp.com и GitHub","Обнаружение серверов MCP для конкретных инструментов и услуг","Просмотр репозиториев навыков, таких как skillhub.club и claudeskills.info"],"ar":["بحث المهارات المسبقة الصنع على skillsmp.com و جيت هاب","اكتشاف خوادم MCP للأدوات والخدمات المحددة","استعراض مستودعات المهارات مثل skillhub.club و claudeskills.info"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internet access for web searches","Dependent on the quality and accuracy of search results","Limited to discovering existing skills and servers, not creating new ones"],"zh":["需要网络访问才能进行网络搜索","依赖于搜索结果的质量和准确性","仅限于发现现有的技能和服务器，而不是创建新的"],"ja":["Web 検索を行うためにインターネット接続が必要","検索結果の品質と正確性に依存する","既存のスキルとサーバーを発見することのみが可能で、新しいものを作成することはできない"],"ko":["웹 검색을 수행하기 위해 인터넷 접속이 필요","검색 결과의 품질 및 정확도에 의존","기존의 스킬 및 서버를 발견하는 것만 가능하며, 새로운 것을 생성할 수는 없음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Internet para búsquedas web","Depende de la calidad y exactitud de los resultados de búsqueda","Limitado a descubrir habilidades y servidores existentes, no a crear nuevos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès Internet pour les recherches Web","Dépend de la qualité et de l''exactitude des résultats de recherche","Limité à la découverte de compétences et de serveurs existants, et non à la création de nouveaux"],"de":["Benötigt Internetzugang für Web-Suchen","Hängt von der Qualität und Genauigkeit der Suchergebnisse ab","Begrenzt auf das Entdecken bestehender Fähigkeiten und Server, nicht auf das Erstellen neuer"],"pt":["Requer acesso à internet para pesquisas web","Depende da qualidade e precisão dos resultados da pesquisa","Limitado à descoberta de habilidades e servidores existentes, não criando novos"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к интернету для веб-поиска","Зависит от качества и точности результатов поиска","Ограничен обнаружением существующих навыков и серверов, не создает новые"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الإنترنت للبحث على الويب","يعتمد على جودة ودقة نتائج البحث","محدود باكتشاف المهارات وخوادم الحالية، وليس إنشاء مهارات جديدة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"85e027b9ceca958179e7ad42cd391edb80063df47abd9ad786381307ca522ba9","qualityScore":39}');
