th Claude Code, featuring specialized agents and skills to support testing activities for a product at any stage of the SDLC. Free to use, fork, build, and contribute. Based on the Agentic QE Framework created by Dragan Spiridonov."},"features":{"zh":["开源的 AI 驱动的质量工程平台","支持测试活动","免费使用、分叉、构建和贡献","基于 Agentic QE Framework","支持 Claude Code"],"ja":["オープンソースの AI パワードの品質エンジニアリングプラットフォーム","テスト活動をサポート","無料で使用、フォーク、ビルド、貢献","Agentic QE Framework に基づく","Claude Code をサポート"],"ko":["오픈소스의 AI 기반 품질 엔지니어링 플랫폼","테스트 활동을 지원","무료로 사용, 포크, 빌드 및 기여","Agentic QE Framework 기반","Claude Code 지원"],"es":["Plataforma de código abierto","Impulsada por IA","Diseñada para testing de contratos QE","Compatible con Claude Code","Funciona en cualquier fase del SDLC"],"fr":["Plateforme open source","Propulsée par l''IA","Conçue pour le testing de contrats QE","Compatible avec Claude Code","Fonctionne à tout stade du SDLC"],"de":["Open-Source-Plattform","Von KI angetrieben","Für QE-Vertragstests konzipiert","Kompatibel mit Claude Code","Funktioniert in jeder Phase des SDLC"],"pt":["Plataforma open-source para teste de contrato QE","Agentes especializados para apoio ao teste de contrato","Compatível com Claude Code","Fork, construa e contribua gratuitamente","Suporte a testes em qualquer estágio do SDLC","Integração com o framework Agentic QE"],"ru":["Открытая платформа для тестирования контрактов QE","Специализированные агенты для поддержки тестирования контрактов","Компатибельность с Claude Code","Бесплатно для использования, форка, построения и вклада","Поддержка тестирования на любом этапе SDLC","Интеграция с фреймворком Agentic QE"],"ar":["منصة مفتوحة المصدر لاختبار العقد QE","وكلاء متخصصون لدعم اختبار العقد","متوافق مع Claude Code","استخدمها وافرقها وبنها وساهم بشكل مجاني","دعم اختبار في أي مرحلة من SDLC","التكامل مع إطار العمل Agentic QE"]},"keywords":{"zh":["QE 合同测试","AI 工具","质量工程","测试活动","Agentic QE Fleet","Claude Code","如何使用 QE 合同测试","QE 合同测试 与 其他工具的比较"],"ja":["QE 契約テスト","AI エージェント","品質エンジニアリング","テスト活動","Agentic QE Fleet","Claude Code","QE 契約テストの使い方","QE 契約テストと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["QE 계약 테스트","AI 에이전트","품질 엔지니어링","테스트 활동","Agentic QE Fleet","Claude Code","QE 계약 테스트 사용법","QE 계약 테스트와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI para testing","qué es QE Contract Testing","cómo usar Agentic QE Fleet","alternativas a Agentic QE Fleet","Agentic QE Fleet vs otros","instalación de Agentic QE Fleet","guía de configuración de Agentic QE Fleet"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour testing","qu''est-ce que le test de contrat QE","comment utiliser Agentic QE Fleet","alternatives à Agentic QE Fleet","Agentic QE Fleet vs autres","installation d''Agentic QE Fleet","guide de configuration d''Agentic QE Fleet"],"de":["KI-Tools für Testing","was ist QE-Vertragstest","wie man Agentic QE Fleet verwendet","Alternativen zu Agentic QE Fleet","Agentic QE Fleet vs andere","Installation von Agentic QE Fleet","Konfigurationsanleitung für Agentic QE Fleet"],"pt":["teste de contrato QE","Agentic QE Fleet","ferramentas de teste de contrato","plataforma de engenharia de qualidade","Claude Code","SDLC","teste de software","agentes especializados","fork e contribua","guia de instalação Agentic QE Fleet"],"ru":["тестирование контрактов QE","ИИ Агенты для тестирования","Agentic QE Fleet","инструменты для тестирования контрактов","платформа инженерии качества","Claude Code","SDLC","тестирование программного обеспечения","специализированные агенты","форк и вклад","руководство по установке Agentic QE Fleet"],"ar":["اختبار العقد QE","أدوات اختبار العقد","Agentic QE Fleet","منصة هندسة الجودة","Claude Code","SDLC","اختبار البرمجيات","وكلاء متخصصون","استخدمها وافرقها","دليل تثبيت Agentic QE Fleet"]}},"owner":"proffesor-for-testing","repo":"agentic-qe","repoPath":"proffesor-for-testing/agentic-qe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.909Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"QE Contract Testing","description":"Consumer-driven contract testing for APIs including REST, GraphQL, and event-driven systems with schema validation.","bodyPreview":"# QE Contract Testing\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide the use of v3''s contract testing capabilities including consumer-driven contracts, schema validation, backward compatibility checking, and API versioning verification.\n\n## Activation\n\n- When testing API contracts\n- When validating schema changes\n- When checking backward compatibility\n- When testing GraphQL APIs\n- When verifying event schemas\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Generate contract from API\naqe contract generate --api openapi.yaml --output contracts/","body":"# QE Contract Testing\n\n## Purpose\n\nGuide the use of v3''s contract testing capabilities including consumer-driven contracts, schema validation, backward compatibility checking, and API versioning verification.\n\n## Activation\n\n- When testing API contracts\n- When validating schema changes\n- When checking backward compatibility\n- When testing GraphQL APIs\n- When verifying event schemas\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Generate contract from API\naqe contract generate --api openapi.yaml --output contracts/\n\n# Verify provider against contracts\naqe contract verify --provider http://localhost:3000 --contracts contracts/\n\n# Check breaking changes\naqe contract breaking --old api-v1.yaml --new api-v2.yaml\n\n# Test GraphQL schema\naqe contract graphql --schema schema.graphql --operations queries/\n```\n\n## Agent Workflow\n\n```typescript\n// Contract generation\nTask(\"Generate API contracts\", `\n  Analyze the REST API and generate consumer contracts:\n  - Parse OpenAPI specification\n  - Identify critical endpoints\n  - Generate Pact contracts\n  - Include example requests/responses\n  Output to contracts/ directory.\n`, \"qe-api-contract\")\n\n// Breaking change detection\nTask(\"Check API compatibility\", `\n  Compare API v2.0 against v1.0:\n  - Detect removed endpoints\n  - Check parameter changes\n  - Verify response schema changes\n  - Identify deprecations\n  Report breaking vs non-breaking changes.\n`, \"qe-api-compatibility\")\n```\n\n## Contract Testing Types\n\n### 1. Consumer-Driven Contracts (Pact)\n\n```typescript\nawait contractTester.consumerDriven({\n  consumer: ''web-app'',\n  provider: ''user-service'',\n  contracts: ''contracts/web-app-user-service.json'',\n  verification: {\n    providerBaseUrl: ''http://localhost:3000'',\n    providerStates: providerStateHandlers,\n    publishResults: true\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### 2. Schema Validation\n\n```typescript\nawait contractTester.validateSchema({\n  type: ''openapi'',\n  schema: ''api/openapi.yaml'',\n  requests: actualRequests,\n  validation: {\n    requestBody: true,\n    responseBody: true,\n    headers: true,\n    statusCodes: true\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### 3. GraphQL Contract Testing\n\n```typescript\nawait graphqlTester.testContracts({\n  schema: ''schema.graphql'',\n  operations: ''queries/**/*.graphql'',\n  validation: {\n    queryValidity: true,\n    responseShapes: true,\n    nullability: true,\n    deprecations: true\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### 4. Event Contract Testing\n\n```typescript\nawait contractTester.eventContracts({\n  schema: ''events/schemas/'',\n  events: {\n    ''user.created'': {\n      schema: ''UserCreatedEvent.json'',\n      examples: [''examples/user-created.json'']\n    },\n    ''order.completed'': {\n      schema: ''OrderCompletedEvent.json'',\n      examples: [''examples/order-completed.json'']\n    }\n  },\n  compatibility: ''backward''\n});\n```\n\n## Breaking Change Detection\n\n```yaml\nbreaking_changes:\n  always_breaking:\n    - endpoint_removed\n    - required_param_added\n    - response_field_removed\n    - type_changed\n\n  potentially_breaking:\n    - optional_param_removed\n    - response_field_added\n    - enum_value_removed\n\n  non_breaking:\n    - endpoint_added\n    - optional_param_added\n    - response_field_made_optional\n    - documentation_changed\n```\n\n## Contract Report\n\n```typescript\ninterface ContractReport {\n  summary: {\n    contracts: number;\n    passed: number;\n    failed: number;\n    warnings: number;\n  };\n  consumers: {\n    name: string;\n    contracts: ContractResult[];\n    compatibility: ''compatible'' | ''breaking'' | ''unknown'';\n  }[];\n  breakingChanges: {\n    type: string;\n    location: string;\n    description: string;\n    impact: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'';\n    migration: string;\n  }[];\n  deprecations: {\n    item: string;\n    deprecatedIn: string;\n    removeIn: string;\n    replacement: string;\n  }[];\n}\n```\n\n## CI/CD Integration\n\n```yaml\ncontract_verification:\n  consumer_side:\n    - generate_contracts\n    - publish_to_broker\n    - can_i_deploy_check\n\n  provider_side:\n    - fetch_contracts_from_broker\n    - verify_against_provider\n    - publish_results\n\n  pre_release:\n    - check_breaking_changes\n    - verify_all_consumers\n    - update_compatibility_matrix\n```\n\n## Pact Broker Integration\n\n```typescript\nawait contractTester.withBroker({\n  brokerUrl: ''https://pact-broker.example.com'',\n  auth: { token: process.env.PACT_TOKEN },\n  operations: {\n    publish: true,\n    canIDeploy: true,\n    webhooks: true\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## Coordination\n\n**Primary Agents**: qe-api-contract, qe-api-compatibility, qe-graphql-tester\n**Coordinator**: qe-contract-coordinator\n**Related Skills**: qe-test-generation, qe-security-compliance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:20:18.967Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Testing Agents focused on API quality, seeking advanced contract testing capabilities with consumer-driven contracts and schema validation.","zh":"适用于专注于 API 质量的测试代理，寻求具有消费者驱动合同和模式验证的高级合同测试功能。","ja":"API の品質に焦点を当てたテスト エージェントに適しています。消費者主導の契約とスキーマの検証を備えた高度な契約テスト機能を探している場合に適しています。","ko":"API 품질에 중점을 둔 테스트 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 소비자 주도 계약 및 스키마 유효성 검사를備한 고급 계약 테스트 기능을 찾고 있다면 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de prueba enfocados en la calidad de la API, que buscan capacidades de prueba de contrato avanzadas con contratos impulsados por el consumidor y validación de esquemas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de test axés sur la qualité de l''API, recherchant des capacités de test de contrat avancées avec des contrats définis par le consommateur et une validation de schéma.","de":"Ideal für Testagenten, die auf die API-Qualität fokussiert sind und erweiterte Vertragstestfunktionen mit verbrauchergetriebenen Verträgen und Schemavalidierung suchen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de teste focados na qualidade da API, buscando capacidades avançadas de teste de contrato com contratos impulsionados pelo consumidor e validaçãoo de esquema.","ru":"Идеально для агентов тестирования, ориентированных на качество API, ищущих расширенные возможности тестирования контрактов с контрактами, управляемыми потребителями, и проверкой схемы.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات اختبار الوكلاء التي تركز على جودة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، تسعى إلى إمكانيات اختبار متقدمة للعقود مع عقود مدفوعة بالاستهلاك وتحقق من مخطط البيان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify API versioning, check backward compatibility, and validate schema changes using OpenAPI definitions, ensuring robust testing of GraphQL APIs and event schemas with tools like aqe contract generate.","zh":"赋予代理验证 API 版本、检查向后兼容性并使用 OpenAPI 定义验证模式更改，确保使用 aqe 合同生成等工具对 GraphQL API 和事件模式进行稳健的测试。","ja":"エージェントに API のバージョニングの検証、後方互換性の確認、および OpenAPI 定義を使用したスキーマの変更の検証を可能にします。aqe 契約生成などのツールを使用して、GraphQL API とイベント スキーマの堅牢なテストを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 API 버전 확인, 후방 호환성 확인 및 OpenAPI 정의를 사용한 스키마 변경 유효성 검사를 수행할 수 있도록 합니다. aqe 계약 생성과 같은 도구를 사용하여 GraphQL API 및 이벤트 스키마에 대한 견고한 테스트를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para verificar la versión de la API, comprobar la compatibilidad hacia atrás y validar los cambios de esquema utilizando definiciones de OpenAPI, asegurando una prueba robusta de las API de GraphQL y los esquemas de eventos con herramientas como aqe contract generate.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier la version de l''API, de vérifier la compatibilité ascendante et de valider les modifications de schéma en utilisant des définitions OpenAPI, assurant ainsi un test robuste des API GraphQL et des schémas d''événements avec des outils comme aqe contract generate.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die API-Version zu überprüfen, die Abwärtskompatibilität zu prüfen und Änderungen am Schema mit OpenAPI-Definitionen zu validieren, wodurch eine robuste Prüfung von GraphQL-APIs und Ereignisschemata mit Tools wie aqe contract generate sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar a versão da API, verificar a compatibilidade com versões anteriores e validar alterações de esquema usando definições OpenAPI, garantindo testes robustos de APIs GraphQL e esquemas de eventos com ferramentas como aqe contract generate.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять версионирование API, проверять обратную совместимость и проверять изменения схемы с помощью определений OpenAPI, обеспечивая надежное тестирование API GraphQL и схем событий с помощью инструментов, таких как aqe contract generate.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التحقق من إصدار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، واختبار التوافق العكسي، والتحقق من تغييرات مخطط البيانات باستخدام تعريفات OpenAPI، مما يضمن اختبارات قوية ل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات GraphQL ومخططات الأحداث باستخدام أدوات مثل aqe contract generate."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating contract testing for API updates","Validating schema changes for backward compatibility","Testing GraphQL APIs with consumer-driven contracts","Verifying event schemas for consistent data exchange"],"zh":["自动化 API 更新的合同测试","验证后向兼容性的模式更改","使用消费者驱动合同测试 GraphQL API","验证事件模式以实现一致的数据交换"],"ja":["API 更新の契約テストの自動化","後方互換性のためのスキーマの変更の検証","消費者主導の契約を使用した GraphQL API のテスト","イベント スキーマの検証による一貫したデータ交換の保証"],"ko":["API 업데이트 계약 테스트 자동화","후방 호환성을 위한 스키마 변경 유효성 검사","소비자 주도 계약을 사용한 GraphQL API 테스트","이벤트 스키마 유효성 검사를 통한 일관된 데이터 교환 보장"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de contrato para actualizaciones de la API","Validar los cambios de esquema para la compatibilidad hacia atrás","Probar las API de GraphQL con contratos impulsados por el consumidor","Verificar los esquemas de eventos para un intercambio de datos coherente"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de contrat pour les mises à jour de l''API","Valider les modifications de schéma pour la compatibilité ascendante","Tester les API GraphQL avec des contrats définis par le consommateur","Vérifier les schémas d''événements pour un échange de données cohérent"],"de":["Automatisieren von Vertragstests für API-Updates","Validieren von Schemäänderungen für Abwärtskompatibilität","Testen von GraphQL-APIs mit verbrauchergetriebenen Verträgen","Überprüfen von Ereignisschemata für einen konsistenten Datenaustausch"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de contrato para atualizações da API","Validar alterações de esquema para compatibilidade com versões anteriores","Testar APIs GraphQL com contratos impulsionados pelo consumidor","Verificar esquemas de eventos para troca de dados consistente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование контрактов для обновлений API","Проверять изменения схемы для обратной совместимости","Тестировать API GraphQL с контрактами, управляемыми потребителями","Проверять схемы событий для последовательного обмена данными"],"ar":["تحسين اختبارات العقد لتحديثات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تحقق من تغييرات مخطط البيانات للتوافق العكسي","اختبار واجهات برمجة التطبيقات GraphQL مع عقود مدفوعة بالاستهلاك","التحقق من مخططات الأحداث لنقل البيانات المتسق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAPI definitions like openapi.yaml","Specifically designed for use with Claude Code and Agentic QE Framework"],"zh":["需要 OpenAPI 定义，如 openapi.yaml","专门为 Claude Code 和 Agentic QE Framework 设计"],"ja":["OpenAPI 定義（例： openapi.yaml）が必要","Claude Code および Agentic QE Framework 専用に設計"],"ko":["OpenAPI 정의가 필요합니다(예: openapi.yaml)","Claude Code 및 Agentic QE Framework 용으로 특별히 설계되었습니다"],"es":["Requiere definiciones de OpenAPI como openapi.yaml","Diseñado específicamente para su uso con Claude Code y Agentic QE Framework"],"fr":["Nécessite des définitions OpenAPI comme openapi.yaml","Conçu spécifiquement pour une utilisation avec Claude Code et Agentic QE Framework"],"de":["Benötigt OpenAPI-Definitionen wie openapi.yaml","Speziell für die Verwendung mit Claude Code und Agentic QE Framework entwickelt"],"pt":["Exige definições OpenAPI como openapi.yaml","Projetado especificamente para uso com Claude Code e Agentic QE Framework"],"ru":["Требует определений OpenAPI, таких как openapi.yaml","Разработан специально для использования с Claude Code и Agentic QE Framework"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريفات OpenAPI مثل openapi.yaml","صمّم خصيصًا للاستخدام مع Claude Code و Agentic QE Framework"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e9205afaa4499aa08a269e8441cc0c8a7923bf8d1fb360e777ae6242aa806890","qualityScore":39}');
