ide de configuration d''agent IA","développement d''agent IA avec Node.js","automatisation de tâches avec Python"],"de":["wie man WhatsApp für KI-Agenten verwendet","KI-Agent-Tools für Entwickler","WhatsApp-Claude Alternative"," Claude Code CLI vs andere","Installation von WhatsApp-Claude","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agenten","Entwicklung von KI-Agenten mit Node.js","Automatisierung von Aufgaben mit Python"],"pt":["como usar agente de IA","o que é agente de IA","ferramentas de agente de IA","alternativa ao Claude","Claude vs outros agentes de IA","instalar agente de IA","guia de configuração do agente de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","инструменты ИИ Агентов","альтернатива Claude","Claude vs другие ИИ Агенты","установка ИИ Агента","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل لبرنامج Claude","برنامج Claude مقابل أدوات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"az9713","repo":"whatsapp-claude-old","repoPath":"az9713/whatsapp-claude-old","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.913Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"video-script","description":"Write compelling video scripts with voiceover and visual directions","bodyPreview":"# Video Script Skill\n\nWrite professional video scripts with voiceover narration and visual directions.\n\n## Script Structure\n\n### Standard Video Script Format\n\n```markdown\n# {Video Title}\n\n**Duration**: {estimated length}\n**Style**: {educational/news/tutorial/entertainment}\n**Target Audience**: {who is this for}\n\n---\n\n## INTRO (0:00 - 0:15)\n\n### VISUAL\n{Description of what appears on screen}\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{What the narrator says}\"\n\n### NOTES\n{Any production notes}\n\n---\n\n## SECTION 1: {Title} (0","body":"# Video Script Skill\n\nWrite professional video scripts with voiceover narration and visual directions.\n\n## Script Structure\n\n### Standard Video Script Format\n\n```markdown\n# {Video Title}\n\n**Duration**: {estimated length}\n**Style**: {educational/news/tutorial/entertainment}\n**Target Audience**: {who is this for}\n\n---\n\n## INTRO (0:00 - 0:15)\n\n### VISUAL\n{Description of what appears on screen}\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{What the narrator says}\"\n\n### NOTES\n{Any production notes}\n\n---\n\n## SECTION 1: {Title} (0:15 - 0:45)\n\n### VISUAL\n{Visual description}\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{Narration}\"\n\n---\n```\n\n## Script Types\n\n### 1. News/Explainer Video\n\n```markdown\n# {Topic} Explained\n\n**Duration**: 60-90 seconds\n**Style**: News/Educational\n\n---\n\n## HOOK (0:00 - 0:05)\n\n### VISUAL\nBold text on screen: \"{Attention-grabbing statement}\"\nQuick cuts of relevant footage\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{One-liner that creates curiosity or states the significance}\"\n\n---\n\n## CONTEXT (0:05 - 0:20)\n\n### VISUAL\nBackground footage, screenshots, or B-roll related to topic\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{Brief background - what viewers need to know to understand this story}\"\n\n---\n\n## MAIN STORY (0:20 - 0:50)\n\n### VISUAL\n- Demo footage or screenshots\n- Key data/stats on screen\n- Expert quote overlay\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{The meat of the story - what happened, why it matters, key details}\"\n\n---\n\n## IMPLICATIONS (0:50 - 1:10)\n\n### VISUAL\nConceptual visuals showing impact\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{What this means for the viewer/industry/world}\"\n\n---\n\n## OUTRO (1:10 - 1:20)\n\n### VISUAL\nChannel branding, subscribe button\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{Call to action - like, subscribe, comment with thoughts}\"\n\n---\n```\n\n## Writing Tips\n\n### Voiceover Best Practices\n\n1. **Write for the ear**: Use conversational language\n2. **Short sentences**: 15-20 words max per sentence\n3. **Active voice**: \"The company launched\" not \"was launched by\"\n4. **Present tense**: Creates immediacy\n5. **Read aloud**: Test if it sounds natural\n6. **Pause points**: Use \"...\" for natural breathing pauses\n\n### Hook Formulas\n\n| Type | Example |\n|------|---------|\n| Curiosity | \"What if I told you...\" |\n| Stakes | \"This could change everything about...\" |\n| Contrast | \"Everyone thought X, but actually...\" |\n| Question | \"Have you ever wondered why...\" |\n| Bold claim | \"This is the biggest {thing} since...\" |\n\n### Pacing Guidelines\n\n| Section | % of Video | Purpose |\n|---------|------------|---------|\n| Hook | 5-10% | Grab attention |\n| Context | 15-20% | Set up understanding |\n| Main content | 50-60% | Deliver value |\n| Implications | 10-15% | Make it relevant |\n| CTA | 5-10% | Drive action |\n\n## Word Count to Duration\n\n| Words | Approx. Duration |\n|-------|------------------|\n| 50 | 15 seconds |\n| 100 | 30 seconds |\n| 150 | 45 seconds |\n| 200 | 60 seconds |\n| 300 | 90 seconds |\n| 400 | 2 minutes |\n\nSpeaking pace: ~150 words per minute\n\n## Script Output File\n\nSave completed scripts to: `output/scripts/{topic}_script.md`\n\nInclude metadata at top:\n```markdown\n---\ntitle: \"{Title}\"\nduration: \"{Estimated duration}\"\ncreated: \"{Date}\"\nstatus: \"draft|review|approved\"\n---\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:22:35.210Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing professional video script generation with voiceover narration and visual directions.","zh":"非常适合需要专业视频脚本生成、配音解说和视觉方向的内容创作代理","ja":"コンテンツ作成エージェントがプロフェッショナルな動画脚本生成、ナレーション、ビジュアルディレクションを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"컨텐츠 제작 에이전트가 전문 비디오 스크립트 생성, 성우 해설 및 시각적 지시를 필요로 할 경우 최적","es":"Perfecto para agentes de creación de contenido que necesitan generación profesional de guiones de video con narración de voz y direcciones visuales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de contenu ayant besoin de génération professionnelle de scripts de vidéo avec narration vocale et directions visuelles.","de":"Perfekt für Content Creation Agents, die professionelle Videodrehbuchgenerierung mit Voiceover-Erzählung und visuellen Anweisungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que precisam de geração profissional de roteiros de vídeo com narração de voz e direções visuais.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по созданию контента, которым необходима профессиональная генерация сценариев видео с озвучкой и визуальными указаниями.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إنشاء المحتوى الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء نصوص فيديو احترافية مع رواية صوتية وتوجيهات بصرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create standard video script formats with Markdown structuring, including estimated duration, style, and target audience, utilizing voiceover and visual direction specifications.","zh":"赋予代理创建标准视频脚本格式的能力，包括Markdown结构、预计时长、风格和目标受众，利用配音和视觉方向规范","ja":"エージェントが標準的な動画脚本形式を作成できるようにし、Markdown構造、推定時間、スタイル、対象オーディエンスを含み、ナレーションとビジュアルディレクションの仕様を利用","ko":"에이전트가 표준 비디오 스크립트 형식을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Markdown 구조, 추정 시간, 스타일, 대상 오디언스를 포함하고, 성우 및 시각적 지시 사양을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear formatos de guiones de video estándar con estructuración de Markdown, incluyendo duración estimada, estilo y audiencia objetivo, utilizando especificaciones de voz y direcciones visuales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des formats de scripts de vidéo standard avec une structuration Markdown, y compris la durée estimée, le style et le public cible, en utilisant des spécifications de voix et de directions visuelles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, standardmäßige Videodrehbuchformate mit Markdown-Strukturierung zu erstellen, einschließlich der geschätzten Dauer, des Stils und der Zielgruppe, unter Verwendung von Voiceover- und visuellen Richtlinien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar formatos de roteiro de vídeo padrão com estruturação em Markdown, incluindo duração estimada, estilo e público-alvo, utilizando especificações de voz e direção visual.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать стандартные форматы сценариев видео с структурированием в Markdown, включая оценочную продолжительность, стиль и 