,"error-report vs otras herramientas","instalación de error-report","guía de configuración de error-report"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","rapport d''erreurs raspberry","gestion des erreurs dans raspberry","comment utiliser error-report","error-report vs autres outils","installation d''error-report","guide de configuration d''error-report"],"de":["künstliche Intelligenz-Tools","Fehlerbericht Raspberry","Fehlerverwaltung in Raspberry","wie man error-report verwendet","error-report vs andere Tools","Installation von error-report","Konfigurationsanleitung für error-report"],"pt":["relatório de erro de agente de IA","ferramenta de depuração","RaspberryServer","RaspberryScanner","como usar relatório de erro de agente de IA","o que é relatório de erro de agente de IA","relatório de erro de agente de IA vs outros ferramentas","instalar relatório de erro de agente de IA","guia de configuração do relatório de erro de agente de IA"],"ru":["отчет об ошибке ИИ Агента","инструмент отладки","RaspberryServer","RaspberryScanner","как использовать отчет об ошибке ИИ Агента","что такое отчет об ошибке ИИ Агента","отчет об ошибке ИИ Агента vs другие инструменты","установка отчета об ошибке ИИ Агента","руководство по настройке отчета об ошибке ИИ Агента"],"ar":["تقرير خطأ وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","أداة فحص الشفرة","RaspberryServer","RaspberryScanner","كيفية استخدام تقرير خطأ وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو تقرير خطأ وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقرير خطأ وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت تقرير خطأ وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد تقرير خطأ وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"fulviomanente","repo":"IQRight_Local","repoPath":"fulviomanente/IQRight_Local","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.915Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"error-report","description":"Generate a categorized error summary from server logs. Shows whats failing, frequency, severity, and recommendations. Use when troubleshooting system failures or before go-live checks.","bodyPreview":"# Error Report\n\nAnalyze all ERROR messages in the IQRight server logs.\n\n## Step 1: Error Count\n\nCount total ERROR lines in `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug` and any rotated logs.\n\n## Step 2: Categorize by Type\n\nSearch for ERROR lines and group by message pattern. The known error categories are:\n\n### LoRa Errors\n- `Error in sendDataScanner` - Failed to send response to scanner\n- `''LoRaTransceiver'' object has no attribute ''create_packet''` - Method name bug (should be `create_data_packet`)\n- `Failed to s","body":"# Error Report\n\nAnalyze all ERROR messages in the IQRight server logs.\n\n## Step 1: Error Count\n\nCount total ERROR lines in `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug` and any rotated logs.\n\n## Step 2: Categorize by Type\n\nSearch for ERROR lines and group by message pattern. The known error categories are:\n\n### LoRa Errors\n- `Error in sendDataScanner` - Failed to send response to scanner\n- `''LoRaTransceiver'' object has no attribute ''create_packet''` - Method name bug (should be `create_data_packet`)\n- `Failed to send DATA` / `FAILED to send data to Scanner` - LoRa TX failure\n\n### API Errors\n- `Connection reset by peer` - API server unreachable\n- `Server disconnected` - API connection dropped mid-request\n- `API call timed out` - API timeout exceeded\n- `Client error during API call` - General HTTP client error\n- `API getUserAccess request failed on getting secrets` - Credential retrieval failure\n\n### MQTT Errors\n- `MQTT-TX.*FAILED.*Status=7` - Broker connection lost during publish\n- `MQTT ERROR publishing data` - Data publish failed after all retries\n- `MQTT ERROR publishing command ACK` - Command ACK publish failed\n\n### Data/Lookup Errors\n- `Couldn''t find Code: {code} locally` - Code not in local database\n- `No data found for code {code}` - Neither API nor local found the code\n- `Invalid DATA packet format` - Corrupted LoRa payload structure\n- `Invalid UTF-8 String` - Binary corruption in packet payload\n\n### Handshake Errors\n- `Failed to send HELLO_ACK` - Could not respond to scanner handshake\n- `Invalid HELLO packet format` - Malformed HELLO payload\n\n## Step 3: Severity Classification\n\n**CRITICAL** (blocks user-facing operations):\n- LoRa send failures (scanner gets no response)\n- MQTT publish failures (web UI gets no data)\n- `create_packet` attribute errors (code bug)\n\n**WARNING** (degrades but doesn''t block):\n- API connection failures (local fallback works)\n- QR code corruption / lookup failures (~10% expected)\n- MQTT Status=7 with successful retry\n\n**INFO** (normal/expected):\n- `own_packet_looped` discards (repeater forwarding back - normal)\n- Duplicate packet discards (normal if < 5% of traffic)\n\n## Step 4: Recent Examples\n\nShow the last 10-15 ERROR lines with timestamps and full messages.\n\n## Step 5: Summary\n\nPresent a report with:\n- Total error count and percentage of log lines\n- Top 5 error types ranked by frequency\n- Severity of each type\n- Whether each is a known pattern (reference PATTERN-001 through PATTERN-004) or new\n- Actionable recommendations for each critical/warning error\n\nReference: See `docs/LOG_ANALYSIS_SKILLS.md` section 5 for known bugs and section 6 for alerting thresholds."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:24:43.627Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing advanced error analysis and logging capabilities in RaspberryServer and RaspberryScanner environments.","zh":"非常适合需要在RaspberryServer和RaspberryScanner环境中进行高级错误分析和日志记录的调试代理。","ja":"RaspberryServerとRaspberryScannerの環境で高度なエラー分析とログ記録機能が必要なデバッグエージェントに最適です。","ko":"RaspberryServer와 RaspberryScanner 환경에서 고급 오류 분석 및 로깅 기능이 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Depuración que necesitan análisis de errores avanzados y capacidades de registro en entornos RaspberryServer y RaspberryScanner.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Débogage nécessitant une analyse d''erreurs avancée et des capacités de journalisation dans les environnements RaspberryServer et RaspberryScanner.","de":"Perfekt für Debugging-Agents, die eine erweiterte Fehleranalyse und Protokollfunktionen in RaspberryServer- und RaspberryScanner-Umgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de depuração que necessitam de análise de erros avançada e capacidades de registro em ambientes RaspberryServer e RaspberryScanner.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов отладки, которым требуются расширенный анализ ошибок и возможности ведения журнала в средах RaspberryServer и RaspberryScanner.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات فك الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم للأخطاء وقدرات التسجيل في بيئات RaspberryServer و RaspberryScanner."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to categorize and count ERROR messages in IQRight server logs, utilizing log rotation and pattern matching for LoRa Errors, and provides comprehensive insights into error types and frequencies, leveraging log files like `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug`.","zh":"赋予代理在IQRight服务器日志中对ERROR消息进行分类和计数的能力，利用日志轮换和模式匹配来识别LoRa错误，并提供对错误类型和频率的全面见解，利用日志文件如`logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug`。","ja":"IQRightサーバーログ内でERRORメッセージをカテゴリ化およびカウントするエージェントを可能にし、LoRaエラーの識別にログローテーションとパターンマッチングを利用し、`logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug`のようなログファイルを利用してエラータイプと頻度に関する包括的な洞察を提供する。","ko":"IQRight 서버 로그에서 ERROR 메시지를 분류하고 카운트할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하며, 로그 회전과 패턴 매칭을 사용하여 LoRa 오류를 식별하고, `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug`와 같은 로그 파일을 사용하여 오류 유형과 빈도에 대한 종합적인 통찰력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a categorizar y contar mensajes de ERROR en los registros del servidor IQRight, utilizando la rotación de registros y la coincidencia de patrones para errores LoRa, y proporciona información integral sobre los tipos y frecuencias de errores, aprovechando archivos de registro como `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de catégoriser et de compter les messages d''ERREUR dans les journaux du serveur IQRight, en utilisant la rotation des journaux et la correspondance de modèles pour les erreurs LoRa, et fournit des informations complètes sur les types et les fréquences d''erreurs, en exploitant des fichiers de journal tels que `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ERROR-Meldungen in den IQRight-Server-Protokollen zu kategorisieren und zu zählen, indem sie Protokollrotation und Mustervergleich für LoRa-Fehler verwenden, und bietet umfassende Einblicke in Fehlerarten und -häufigkeiten, indem es Protokolldateien wie `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug` nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a categorizar e contar mensagens de ERRO nos logs do servidor IQRight, utilizando rotação de logs e correspondência de padrões para erros LoRa, e fornece insights abrangentes sobre tipos e frequências de erros, aproveitando arquivos de log como `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью категоризировать и подсчитывать сообщения об ошибках в журналах сервера IQRight, используя ротацию журналов и сопоставление с образцом для ошибок LoRa, и предоставляет полное представление о типах и частоте ошибок, используя файлы журнала, такие как `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصنيف وعدّ رسائل الخطأ في سجلات خادم IQRight، باستخدام دوران السجلات وتماثل الأنماط لخطأ LoRa، وتقديم رؤى شاملة حول أنواع وتكرار الأخطاء، مستفيدة من ملفات السجل مثل `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug`."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing ERROR messages in RaspberryServer logs","Categorizing errors by type, including LoRa Errors and method name bugs","Counting total ERROR lines in IQRight server logs and rotated logs"],"zh":["分析RaspberryServer日志中的ERROR消息","按类型分类错误，包括LoRa错误和方法名错误","在IQRight服务器日志和轮换日志中计数总ERROR行数"],"ja":["RaspberryServerログ内のERRORメッセージを分析する","エラーをタイプ別にカテゴリ化する（LoRaエラーとメソッド名バグなど）","IQRightサーバーログおよびローテーションログ内の総ERROR行数をカウントする"],"ko":["RaspberryServer 로그中的 ERROR 메시지 분석","오류를 유형별로 분류(LoRa 오류 및 메서드 이름 버그 등)","IQRight 서버 로그 및 회전 로그中的 총 ERROR 행 수 카운트"],"es":["Analizar mensajes de ERROR en los registros de RaspberryServer","Categorizar errores por tipo, incluidos errores LoRa y errores de nombre de método","Contar el total de líneas de ERROR en los registros del servidor IQRight y en los registros rotados"],"fr":["Analyser les messages d''ERREUR dans les journaux de RaspberryServer","Catégoriser les erreurs par type, y compris les erreurs LoRa et les bogues de nom de méthode","Compter le total des lignes d''ERREUR dans les journaux du serveur IQRight et dans les journaux rotatifs"],"de":["ERROR-Meldungen in RaspberryServer-Protokollen analysieren","Fehler nach Typ kategorisieren, einschließlich LoRa-Fehler und Methodenname-Fehler","Gesamtzahl der ERROR-Zeilen in den IQRight-Server-Protokollen und in den rotierten Protokollen zählen"],"pt":["Analisar mensagens de ERRO nos logs do RaspberryServer","Categorizar erros por tipo, incluindo erros LoRa e bugs de nome de método","Contar o total de linhas de ERRO nos logs do servidor IQRight e logs rotacionados"],"ru":["Анализировать сообщения об ошибках в журналах RaspberryServer","Категоризировать ошибки по типу, включая ошибки LoRa и ошибки имен методов","Подсчитывать общее количество строк с ошибками в журналах сервера IQRight и ротированных журналах"],"ar":["تحليل رسائل الخطأ في سجلات RaspberryServer","تصنيف الأخطاء حسب النوع، بما في ذلك أخطاء LoRa و أخطاء أسماء الطرق","عدّ إجمالي سطور الخطأ في سجلات خادم IQRight والسجلات المدوّرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to IQRight server logs","Limited to analyzing ERROR messages in specific log files","Dependent on log rotation and pattern matching for accurate error categorization"],"zh":["需要访问IQRight服务器日志","仅限分析特定日志文件中的ERROR消息","依赖日志轮换和模式匹配进行准确的错误分类"],"ja":["IQRightサーバーログへのアクセスが必要","特定のログファイル内でのみERRORメッセージを分析可能","正確なエラーカテゴリ化のためにはログローテーションとパターンマッチングに依存する"],"ko":["IQRight 서버 로그에 대한 접근이 필요","특정 로그 파일 내에서만 ERROR 메시지를 분석할 수 있음","정확한 오류 분류를 위해 로그 회전 및 패턴 매칭에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los registros del servidor IQRight","Limitado a analizar mensajes de ERROR en archivos de registro específicos","Dependiente de la rotación de registros y la coincidencia de patrones para una categorización de errores precisa"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux journaux du serveur IQRight","Limité à l''analyse des messages d''ERREUR dans des fichiers de journal spécifiques","Dépendant de la rotation des journaux et de la correspondance de modèles pour une catégorisation d''erreurs précise"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die IQRight-Server-Protokolle","Befindet sich auf die Analyse von ERROR-Meldungen in bestimmten Protokolldateien","Hängt von der Protokollrotation und dem Mustervergleich für eine genaue Fehlerkategorisierung ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos logs do servidor IQRight","Limitado à análise de mensagens de ERRO em arquivos de log específicos","Dependente da rotação de logs e correspondência de padrões para categorização de erros precisa"],"ru":["Требует доступа к журналам сервера IQRight","Ограничен анализом сообщений об ошибках в определенных файлах журнала","Зависит от ротации журналов и сопоставления с образцом для точной категоризации ошибок"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سجلات خادم IQRight","محدود بالتحليل رسائل الخطأ في ملفات سجل محددة","يعتمد على دوران السجلات وتماثل الأنماط لتصنيف دقيق للأخطاء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bee19fe7c8d5a5139f20ab51c11b4d0023693c9377d80813678b7b839e308bb6","qualityScore":39}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('atlassian/atlassian-mcp-server/generate-status-report', 'community', 'atlassian', 'atlassian-mcp-server', 'atlassian/atlassian-mcp-server', 'generate-status-report', 0, 0, 39, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.917Z', '2026-03-02T02:26:01.226Z', '4af95baa652def9230dd1f87713e779438fe87b3e3da159522288841a5f251d4', '{"id":"atlassian/atlassian-mcp-server/generate-status-report","name":"generate-status-report","description":{"zh":"远程MCP服务器安全地连接Jira和Confluence与您的LLM、IDE或代理平台，生成状态报告。","ja":"リモートMCPサーバーを使用してJiraとConfluenceをLLM、IDE、またはエージェントプラットフォームに安全に接続し、ステータス報告を生成。","ko":"원격 MCP 서버를 사용하여 Jira와 Confluence를 LLM, IDE 또는 에이전트 플랫폼에 안전하게 연결하여 상태 보고서를 생성합니다.","es":"Nuestro Agente de Inteligencia Artificial conecta Jira y Confluence con tu LLM, IDE o plataforma de agente de choice de manera segura","fr":"Notre Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle connecte Jira et Confluence à votre LLM, IDE ou plateforme d''agent de choix de manière sécurisée","de":"Unser KI-Agent verbindet Jira und Confluence sicher mit Ihrem LLM, IDE oder Agenten-Plattform","pt":"O MCP Server é uma solução remota que conecta Jira e Confluence ao seu LLM, IDE ou plataforma de agentes de forma segura. Gere relatórios de status com facilidade","ru":"MCP Server - это удаленное решение, которое безопасно подключает Jira и Confluence к вашему LLM, IDE или платформе агентов. Генерируйте отчеты о статусе с легкостью","ar":"خادم MCP هو حل عن بعد يصل جيرا وكونفلونس بآمن إلى منصة لغة للمعالجة اللغوية أو بيئة التطوير أو منصة الوكيل. انشئ تقارير الحالة بسهولة","en":"Remote MCP Server that securely connects Jira and Confluence with your LLM, IDE, or agent platform of choice."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理生成状态报告","ja":"AIエージェントのステータス報告を生成","ko":"AI 에이전트 상태 보고서 생성","es":"Generador de informes de estado de Agente de Inteligencia...","fr":"Générateur de rapports de statut d''Agent d''Intelligence A...","de":"Statusbericht-Generator für KI-Agenten","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Gere Relatórios de Status com MCP Server","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Генерация Отчетов о Статусе с Помощью MCP Server","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: إنشاء تقارير الحالة مع خادم MCP","en":"generate-status-report"},"description":{"zh":"远程MCP服务器安全地连接Jira和Confluence与您的LLM、IDE或代理平台，生成状态报告。","ja":"リモートMCPサーバーを使用してJiraとConfluenceをLLM、IDE、またはエージェントプラットフォームに安全に接続し、ステータス報告を生成。","ko":"원격 MCP 서버를 사용하여 Jira와 Confluence를 LLM, IDE 또는 에이전트 플랫폼에 안전하게 연결하여 상태 보고서를 생성합니다.","es":"Nuestro Agente de Inteligencia Artificial conecta Jira y Confluence con tu LLM, IDE o plataforma de agente de choice de manera segura","fr":"Notre Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle connecte Jira et Confluence à votre LLM, IDE ou plateforme d''agent de choix de manière sécurisée","de":"Unser KI-Agent verbindet Jira und Confluence sicher mit Ihrem LLM, IDE oder Agenten-Plattform","pt":"O MCP Server é uma solução remota que conecta Jira e Confluence ao seu LLM, IDE ou plataforma de agentes de forma segura. Gere relatórios de status com facil...","ru":"MCP Server - это удаленное решение, которое безопасно подключает Jira и Confluence к вашему LLM, IDE или платформе агентов. Генерируйте отчеты о статусе с ле...","ar":"خادم MCP هو حل عن بعد يصل جيرا وكونفلونس بآمن إلى منصة لغة للمعالجة اللغوية أو بيئة التطوير أو منصة الوكيل. انشئ تقارير الحالة بسهولة","en":"Remote MCP Server that securely connects Jira and Confluence with your LLM, IDE, or agent platform of choice."},"definition":{"en":"Remote MCP Server that securely connects Jira and Confluence with your LLM, IDE, or agent platform of choice."},"features":{"zh":["安全地连接Jira和Confluence","支持LLM、IDE和代理平台","生成状态报告","使用远程MCP服务器","提高开发效率"],"ja":["JiraとConfluenceを安全に接続","LLM、IDE、エージェントプラットフォームをサポート","ステータス報告を生成","リモートMCPサーバーを使用","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["Jira와 Confluence를 안전하게 연결","LLM, IDE, 에이전트 플랫폼을 지원","상태 보고서를 생성","원격 MCP 서버를 사용","개발 효율성을 향상"],"es":["Conexión segura a Jira y Confluence","Compatibilidad con LLM, IDE y plataformas de agente","Generación de informes de estado personalizados","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Seguridad y autenticación avanzadas"],"fr":["Connexion sécurisée à Jira et Confluence","Compatibilité avec LLM, IDE et plateformes d''agent","Génération de rapports de statut personnalisés","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Sécurité et authentification avancées"],"de":["Sichere Verbindung zu Jira und Confluence","Kompatibilität mit LLM, IDE und Agenten-Plattformen","Generierung von benutzerdefinierten Statusberichten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Erweiterte Sicherheit und Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Conexão segura com Jira e Confluence","Geração de relatórios de status personalizados","Integração com LLM, IDE e plataformas de agentes","Acesso remoto ao MCP Server","Relatórios de status em tempo real"],"ru":["Безопасное подключение к Jira и Confluence","Генерация индивидуальных отчетов о статусе","Интеграция с LLM, IDE и платформами агентов","Удаленный доступ к MCP Server","Отчеты о статусе в режиме реального времени"],"ar":["اتصال آمن بجيرا وكونفلونس","إنشاء تقارير الحالة المخصصة","التكامل مع منصة لغة للمعالجة اللغوية أو بيئة التطوير أو منصة الوكيل","الوصول عن بعد إلى خادم MCP","تقارير الحالة في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","生成状态报告","远程MCP服务器","Jira和Confluence","LLM、IDE和代理平台","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理的优点","AI智能代理与其他工具的比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ステータス報告を生成","リモートMCPサーバー","JiraとConfluence","LLM、IDE、エージェントプラットフォーム","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの利点","AIエージェントと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","상태 보고서 생성","원격 MCP 서버","Jira와 Confluence","LLM, IDE, 에이전트 플랫폼","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트의优势","AI 에이전트와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["cómo usar Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","qué es un Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","alternativa a Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","Agente de Inteligencia Artificial vs competidor","instalación de Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","guía de configuración de Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","herramientas de desarrollo para Agente de Inteligencia Artificial"],"fr":["comment utiliser un Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle","quoi est un Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle","alternative à un Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle","Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle vs concurrent","installation d''un Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle","guide de configuration d''un Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle","outils de développement pour un Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle"],"de":["wie man einen KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternative zu einem KI-Agenten","KI-Agenten vs Wettbewerber","Installation eines KI-Agenten","Einrichtungsanleitung für einen KI-Agenten","Entwicklungstools für KI-Agenten"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","gerar relatórios de status","conexão segura com jira","integração com confluence","llm para desenvolvedores","ide para programadores","plataformas de agentes","relatórios de status personalizados","acesso remoto ao mcp server"],"ru":["ии агенты","генерация отчетов о статусе","безопасное подключение к jira","интеграция с confluence","llm для разработчиков","ide для программистов","платформы агентов","отчеты о статусе в режиме реального времени","удаленный доступ к mcp server"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء تقارير الحالة","اتصال آمن بجيرا","التكامل مع كونفلونس","لغة للمعالجة اللغوية لالمطورين","بيئة التطوير للمبرمجين","منصات الوكيل","تقارير الحالة المخصصة","الوصول عن بعد إلى خادم ميكرو"]}},"owner":"atlassian","repo":"atlassian-mcp-server","repoPath":"atlassian/atlassian-mcp-server","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.917Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"generate-status-report","description":"Generate project status reports from Jira issues and publish to Confluence. When Claude needs to: (1) Create a status report for a project, (2) Summarize project progress or updates, (3) Generate weekly/daily reports from Jira, (4) Publish status summaries to Confluence, or (5) Analyze project blockers and completion. Queries Jira issues, categorizes by status/priority, and creates formatted reports for delivery managers and executives.","bodyPreview":"# Generate Status Report\n\n## Keywords\nstatus report, project status, weekly update, daily standup, Jira report, project summary, blockers, progress update, Confluence report, sprint report, project update, publish to Confluence, write to Confluence, post report\n\nAutomatically query Jira for project status, analyze issues, and generate formatted status reports published to Confluence.\n\n**CRITICAL**: This skill should be **interactive**. Always clarify scope (time period, audience, Confluence dest","body":"# Generate Status Report\n\n## Keywords\nstatus report, project status, weekly update, daily standup, Jira report, project summary, blockers, progress update, Confluence report, sprint report, project update, publish to Confluence, write to Confluence, post report\n\nAutomatically query Jira for project status, analyze issues, and generate formatted status reports published to Confluence.\n\n**CRITICAL**: This skill should be **interactive**. Always clarify scope (time period, audience, Confluence destination) with the user before or after generating the report. Do not silently skip Confluence publishing—always offer it.\n\n## Workflow\n\nGenerating a status report follows these steps:\n\n1. **Identify scope** - Determine project, time period, and target audience\n2. **Query Jira** - Fetch relevant issues using JQL queries\n3. **Analyze data** - Categorize issues and identify key insights\n4. **Format report** - Structure content based on audience and purpose\n5. **Publish to Confluence** - Create or update a page with the report\n\n## Step 1: Identify Scope\n\n**IMPORTANT**: If the user''s request is missing key information, ASK before proceeding with queries. Do not assume defaults without confirmation for Confluence publishing.\n\nClarify these details:\n\n**Project identification:**\n- Which Jira project key? (e.g., \"PROJ\", \"ENG\", \"MKTG\")\n- If the user mentions a project by name but not key, search Jira to find the project key\n\n**Time period:**\n- If not specified, ask: \"What time period should this report cover? (default: last 7 days)\"\n- Options: Weekly (7 days), Daily (24 hours), Sprint-based (2 weeks), Custom period\n\n**Target audience:**\n- If not specified, ask: \"Who is this report for? (Executives/Delivery Managers, Team-level, or Daily standup)\"\n- **Executives/Delivery Managers**: High-level summary with key metrics and blockers\n- **Team-level**: Detailed breakdown with issue-by-issue status  \n- **Daily standup**: Brief update on yesterday/today/blockers\n\n**Report destination:**\n- **ALWAYS ASK** if not specified: \"Would you like me to publish this report to Confluence? If so, which space should I use?\"\n- If user says yes: Ask for space name or offer to list available spaces\n- Determine: New page or update existing page?\n- Ask about parent page if creating under a specific section\n\n## Step 2: Query Jira\n\nUse the `searchJiraIssuesUsingJql` tool to fetch issues. Build JQL queries based on report needs.\n\n### Common Query Patterns\n\nFor comprehensive queries, use the `scripts/jql_builder.py` utility to programmatically build JQL strings. For quick queries, reference `references/jql-patterns.md` for examples.\n\n**All open issues in project:**\n```jql\nproject = \"PROJECT_KEY\" AND status != Done ORDER BY priority DESC, updated DESC\n```\n\n**Issues updated in last week:**\n```jql\nproject = \"PROJECT_KEY\" AND updated >= -7d ORDER BY priority DESC\n```\n\n**High priority and blocked issues:**\n```jql\nproject = \"PROJECT_KEY\" AND (priority IN (Highest, High) OR status = Blocked) AND status != Done ORDER BY priority DESC\n```\n\n**Completed in reporting period:**\n```jql\nproject = \"PROJECT_KEY\" AND status = Done AND resolved >= -7d ORDER BY resolved DESC\n```\n\n### Query Strategy\n\nFor most reports, execute multiple targeted queries rather than one large query:\n\n1. **Completed issues**: Get recently resolved tickets\n2. **In-progress issues**: Get active work items\n3. **Blocked issues**: Get blockers requiring attention\n4. **High priority open**: Get critical upcoming work\n\nUse `maxResults: 100` for initial queries. If pagination is needed, use `nextPageToken` from results.\n\n### Data to Extract\n\nFor each issue, capture:\n- `key` (e.g., \"PROJ-123\")\n- `summary` (issue title)\n- `status` (current state)\n- `priority` (importance level)\n- `assignee` (who''s working on it)\n- `created` / `updated` / `resolved` dates\n- `description` (if needed for context on blockers)\n\n## Step 3: Analyze Data\n\nProcess the retrieved issues to identify:\n\n**Metrics:**\n- Total issues by status (Done, In Progress, Blocked, etc.)\n- Completion rate (if historical data available)\n- Number of high priority items\n- Unassigned issue count\n\n**Key insights:**\n- Major accomplishments (recently completed high-value items)\n- Critical blockers (blocked high priority issues)\n- At-risk items (overdue or stuck in progress)\n- Resource bottlenecks (one assignee with many issues)\n\n**Categorization:**\nGroup issues logically:\n- By status (Done, In Progress, Blocked)\n- By priority (Highest → Low)\n- By assignee or team\n- By component or epic (if relevant)\n\n## Step 4: Format Report\n\nSelect the appropriate template based on audience. Templates are in `references/report-templates.md`.\n\n### For Executives and Delivery Managers\n\nUse **Executive Summary Format**:\n- Brief overall status (🟢 On Track / 🟡 At Risk / 🔴 Blocked)\n- Key metrics (total, completed, in progress, blocked)\n- Top 3 highlights (major accomplishments)\n- Critical blockers with impact\n- Upcoming priorities\n\n**Keep it concise** - 1-2 pages maximum. Focus on what matters to decision-makers.\n\n### For Team-Level Reports\n\nUse **Detailed Technical Format**:\n- Completed issues listed with keys\n- In-progress issues with assignee and priority\n- Blocked issues with blocker description and action needed\n- Risks and dependencies\n- Next period priorities\n\n**Include more detail** - Team needs issue-level visibility.\n\n### For Daily Updates\n\nUse **Daily Standup Format**:\n- What was completed yesterday\n- What''s planned for today\n- Current blockers\n- Brief notes\n\n**Keep it brief** - This is a quick sync, not comprehensive analysis.\n\n## Step 5: Publish to Confluence\n\n**After generating the report, ALWAYS offer to publish to Confluence** (unless user explicitly said not to).\n\nIf user hasn''t specified Confluence details yet, ask:\n- \"Would you like me to publish this report to Confluence?\"\n- \"Which Confluence space should I use?\"\n- \"Should this be nested under a specific parent page?\"\n\nUse the `createConfluencePage` tool to publish the report.\n\n**Page creation:**\n```\ncreateConfluencePage(\n    cloudId=\"[obtained from getConfluenceSpaces or URL]\",\n    spaceId=\"[numerical space ID]\",\n    title=\"[Project Name] - Status Report - [Date]\",\n    body=\"[formatted report in Markdown]\",\n    contentFormat=\"markdown\",\n    parentId=\"[optional - parent page ID if nesting under another page]\"\n)\n```\n\n**Title format examples:**\n- \"Project Phoenix - Weekly Status - Dec 3, 2025\"\n- \"Engineering Sprint 23 - Status Report\"\n- \"Q4 Initiatives - Status Update - Week 49\"\n\n**Body formatting:**\nWrite the report content in Markdown. The tool will convert it to Confluence format. Use:\n- Headers (`#`, `##`, `###`) for structure\n- Bullet points for lists\n- Bold (`**text**`) for emphasis\n- Tables for metrics if needed\n- Links to Jira issues: `[PROJ-123](https://yourinstance.atlassian.net/browse/PROJ-123)`\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Include the report date prominently\n- Link directly to relevant Jira issues\n- Use consistent naming conventions for recurring reports\n- Consider creating under a \"Status Reports\" parent page for organization\n\n### Finding the Right Space\n\nIf the user doesn''t specify a Confluence space:\n\n1. Use `getConfluenceSpaces` to list available spaces\n2. Look for spaces related to the project (matching project name or key)\n3. If unsure, ask the user which space to use\n4. Default to creating in the most relevant team or project space\n\n### Updating Existing Reports\n\nIf updating an existing page instead of creating new:\n\n1. Get the current page content:\n```\ngetConfluencePage(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    pageId=\"123456\",\n    contentFormat=\"markdown\"\n)\n```\n\n2. Update the page with new content:\n```\nupdateConfluencePage(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    pageId=\"123456\",\n    body=\"[updated report content]\",\n    contentFormat=\"markdown\",\n    versionMessage=\"Updated with latest status - Dec 8, 2025\"\n)\n```\n\n## Complete Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Generate a status report for Project Phoenix and publish it to Confluence\"\n\n**Step 1 - Identify scope:**\n- Project: Phoenix (need to find project key)\n- Time period: Last week (default)\n- Audience: Not specified, assume executive level\n- Destination: Confluence, need to find appropriate space\n\n**Step 2 - Query Jira:**\n```python\n# Find project key first\nsearchJiraIssuesUsingJql(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    jql=''project = \"PHOENIX\" OR project = \"PHX\"'',\n    maxResults=1\n)\n\n# Query completed issues\nsearchJiraIssuesUsingJql(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    jql=''project = \"PHX\" AND status = Done AND resolved >= -7d'',\n    maxResults=50\n)\n\n# Query blocked issues\nsearchJiraIssuesUsingJql(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    jql=''project = \"PHX\" AND status = Blocked'',\n    maxResults=50\n)\n\n# Query in-progress high priority\nsearchJiraIssuesUsingJql(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    jql=''project = \"PHX\" AND status IN (\"In Progress\", \"In Review\") AND priority IN (Highest, High)'',\n    maxResults=50\n)\n```\n\n**Step 3 - Analyze:**\n- 15 issues completed (metrics)\n- 3 critical blockers (key insight)\n- Major accomplishment: API integration completed (highlight)\n\n**Step 4 - Format:**\nUse Executive Summary Format from templates. Create concise report with metrics, highlights, and blockers.\n\n**Step 5 - Publish:**\n```python\n# Find appropriate space\ngetConfluenceSpaces(cloudId=\"...\")\n\n# Create page\ncreateConfluencePage(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    spaceId=\"12345\",\n    title=\"Project Phoenix - Weekly Status - Dec 3, 2025\",\n    body=\"[formatted markdown report]\",\n    contentFormat=\"markdown\"\n)\n```\n\n## Tips for Quality Reports\n\n**Be data-driven:**\n- Include specific numbers and metrics\n- Reference issue keys directly\n- Show trends when possible (e.g., \"completed 15 vs 12 last week\")\n\n**Highlight what matters:**\n- Lead with the most important information\n- Flag blockers prominently\n- Celebrate significant wins\n\n**Make it actionable:**\n- For blockers, state what action is needed and from whom\n- For risks, provide mitigation options\n- For priorities, be specific about next steps\n\n**Keep it consistent:**\n- Use the same format for recurring reports\n- Maintain predictable structure\n- Include comparable metrics week-over-week\n\n**Provide context:**\n- Link to Jira for details\n- Explain the impact of blockers\n- Connect work to business objectives when possible\n\n## Resources\n\n### scripts/jql_builder.py\nPython utility for programmatically building JQL queries. Use this when you need to construct complex or dynamic queries. Import and use the helper functions rather than manually concatenating JQL strings.\n\n### references/jql-patterns.md\nQuick reference of common JQL query patterns for status reports. Use this for standard queries or as a starting point for custom queries.\n\n### references/report-templates.md\nDetailed templates for different report types and audiences. Reference this to select the appropriate format and structure for your report.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:01.226Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing advanced Jira and Confluence integration capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级Jira和Confluence集成能力的项目管理代理。","ja":"プロジェクト管理エージェントがJiraおよびConfluenceの高度な統合機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"프로젝트 관리 에이전트가 고급 Jira 및 Confluence 통합 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que necesitan capacidades de integración avanzadas de Jira y Confluence.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet ayant besoin de capacités d''intégration avancées de Jira et Confluence.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die erweiterte Jira- und Confluence-Integrationseigenschaften benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de integração com Jira e Confluence.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, которым необходимы расширенные возможности интеграции с Jira и Confluence.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المشاريع التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة من أجل الدمج مع Jira و Confluence."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate formatted status reports published to Confluence, analyzing issues and progress updates from Jira. It provides secure connections and interactive querying capabilities, including protocols like HTTP and file formats like JSON.","zh":"赋予代理生成格式化的状态报告并将其发布到Confluence，分析Jira的问题和进度更新。它提供安全的连接和交互式查询功能，包括像HTTP这样的协议和像JSON这样的文件格式。","ja":"エージェントがフォーマット済みのステータスレポートを生成し、Confluenceに公開することを可能にします。Jiraの問題や進度更新を分析し、HTTPなどのプロトコルやJSONなどのファイル形式などのインタラクティブなクエリ機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 형식화된 상태 보고서를 생성하고 Confluence에 발행할 수 있도록 합니다. Jira의 문제와 진행 업데이트 분석 및 HTTP와 같은 프로토콜 및 JSON과 같은 파일 형식과 같은 상호 작용 쿼리 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar informes de estado formateados publicados en Confluence, analizando problemas y actualizaciones de progreso desde Jira. Proporciona conexiones seguras y capacidades de consulta interactiva, incluyendo protocolos como HTTP y formatos de archivo como JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des rapports de statut formatés publiés sur Confluence, en analysant les problèmes et les mises à jour de progression à partir de Jira. Fournit des connexions sécurisées et des capacités de requête interactives, notamment des protocoles comme HTTP et des formats de fichier comme JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, formatierte Statusberichte zu generieren, die in Confluence veröffentlicht werden, und analysiert Probleme und Fortschrittsupdates aus Jira. Bietet sichere Verbindungen und interaktive Abfragefunktionen, einschließlich Protokollen wie HTTP und Dateiformaten wie JSON.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar relatórios de status formatados publicados no Confluence, analisando problemas e atualizações de progresso do Jira. Ele fornece conexões seguras e capacidades de consulta interativa, incluindo protocolos como HTTP e formatos de arquivo como JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать отформатированные отчеты о статусе, публикуемые в Confluence, анализируя проблемы и обновления прогресса из Jira. Он обеспечивает безопасные соединения и интерактивные возможности запроса, включая протоколы, такие как HTTP, и форматы файлов, такие как JSON.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنتاج تقارير حالة منسقة ونشرها على منصة Confluence، مع تحليل المشكلات وتحديثات التقدم من الجيرا. كما يوفر اتصالات آمنة وسمات استجواب تفاعلية، بما في ذلك بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وتنسيقات الملفات مثل JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating weekly project status reports","Generating daily standup updates for team members","Debugging project blockers and progress updates from Jira and Confluence"],"zh":["自动执行每周项目状态报告","为团队成员生成每日站立式更新","调试Jira和Confluence的项目阻塞器和进度更新"],"ja":["週次プロジェクトステータスレポートの自動化","チームメンバーのための毎日のスタンドアップ更新の生成","JiraおよびConfluenceのプロジェクトブロッカーと進度更新のデバッグ"],"ko":["주간 프로젝트 상태 보고서 자동화","팀 구성원을 위한 일일 스탠드업 업데이트 생성","Jira 및 Confluence의 프로젝트 블로커 및 진행 업데이트 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar informes de estado del proyecto semanales","Generar actualizaciones diarias de standup para los miembros del equipo","Depurar bloqueadores y actualizaciones de progreso del proyecto desde Jira y Confluence"],"fr":["Automatiser les rapports de statut du projet hebdomadaires","Générer des mises à jour quotidiennes de standup pour les membres de l''équipe","Déboguer les bloqueurs et les mises à jour de progression du projet à partir de Jira et Confluence"],"de":["Automatisieren von wöchentlichen Projektstatusberichten","Generieren von täglichen Standup-Updates für Teammitglieder","Debuggen von Projektblockierern und Fortschrittsupdates aus Jira und Confluence"],"pt":["Automatizar relatórios semanais de status do projeto","Gerar atualizações diárias de reunião para membros da equipe","Depurar bloqueadores e atualizações de progresso do Jira e Confluence"],"ru":["Автоматизировать еженедельные отчеты о статусе проекта","Генерировать ежедневные обновления для членов команды","Отлаживать блокировки и обновления прогресса из Jira и Confluence"],"ar":["تutomatizar تقارير حالة المشروع الأسبوعية","إنتاج تحديثات يومية للفريق","تصحيح مشاكل المشروع وتحديثات التقدم من الجيرا وكونفلونس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires active Jira and Confluence connections","Interactive querying needed for scope clarification"],"zh":["需要活动的Jira和Confluence连接","需要交互式查询来澄清范围"],"ja":["アクティブなJiraおよびConfluence接続が必要","スコープの明確化にインタラクティブなクエリが必要"],"ko":["활성 Jira 및 Confluence 연결이 필요","범위 명확화를 위해 상호 작용 쿼리가 필요"],"es":["Requiere conexiones activas de Jira y Confluence","Se necesita consulta interactiva para la aclaración del alcance"],"fr":["Nécessite des connexions actives Jira et Confluence","Requiert une requête interactive pour la clarification de la portée"],"de":["Erfordert aktive Jira- und Confluence-Verbindungen","Interaktive Abfrage erforderlich für die Klärung des Umfangs"],"pt":["Requer conexões ativas com Jira e Confluence","Necessidade de consulta interativa para esclarecimento de escopo"],"ru":["Требует активных соединений с Jira и Confluence","Необходимость интерактивного запроса для уточнения объема"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصالات نشطة مع الجيرا وكونفلونس","يحتاج إلى استفسار تفاعلي من أجل توضيح النطاق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4af95baa652def9230dd1f87713e779438fe87b3e3da159522288841a5f251d4","qualityScore":39}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cartridge-gg/controller/codegen', 'community', 'cartridge-gg', 'controller', 'cartridge-gg/controller', 'codegen', 0, 0, 39, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.920Z', '2026-03-02T02:26:16.118Z', '0df21ed58b1f0fce55915e9b80e852a978ef39c5a62ae720c7b94a75a3c65dd8', '{"id":"cartridge-gg/controller/codegen","name":"codegen","description":{"zh":"codegen是一种自托管的嵌入式账户，允许开发者创建无缝的オンチェーン游戏体验","ja":"codegenは、開発者がシームレスなオンチェーンゲーム体験を作成できる自托管の埋め込みアカウントです","ko":"codegen은 개발자가 온체인 게임의 무결점 경험을 만들 수 있는 자체 보관嵌入式 계정입니다","es":"codegen es una cuenta autónoma integrada para jugar juegos en blockchain de forma fluida","fr":"codegen est un compte autonome intégré pour jouer à des jeux sur blockchain de manière fluide","de":"codegen ist ein autonomes Konto, das das Spielen von Blockchain-Spielen ermöglicht","pt":"O codegen é uma conta autônoma embarcada que permite jogar jogos on-chain de forma segura e fácil","ru":"codegen - это самостоятельный счет, позволяющий играть в игры на блокчейне безопасно и легко","ar":"codegen هو حساب ذاتي مدمج يسمح باللعب بأمان وسهولة في ألعاب السلسلة","en":"A self custodial embedded account to seamlessly play onchain games"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具codegen：自托管游戏账户","ja":"AIエージェントcodegen：オンチェーンゲームをプレイするための自托管アカウント","ko":"AI 에이전트 codegen: 온체인 게임을 위한 자체 보관 계정","es":"Herramientas de código para juegos en blockchain","fr":"Outils de code pour jeux sur blockchain","de":"AI-Tools für Blockchain-Spiele","pt":"codegen: Ferramenta de Conta Autônoma para Jogos On-Chain","ru":"codegen: Самостоятельный счет для игр на блокчейне от ИИ ...","ar":"codegen: أداة الحساب الذاتي للعبة على السلسلة","en":"codegen"},"description":{"zh":"codegen是一种自托管的嵌入式账户，允许开发者创建无缝的オンチェーン游戏体验","ja":"codegenは、開発者がシームレスなオンチェーンゲーム体験を作成できる自托管の埋め込みアカウントです","ko":"codegen은 개발자가 온체인 게임의 무결점 경험을 만들 수 있는 자체 보관嵌入式 계정입니다","es":"codegen es una cuenta autónoma integrada para jugar juegos en blockchain de forma fluida","fr":"codegen est un compte autonome intégré pour jouer à des jeux sur blockchain de manière fluide","de":"codegen ist ein autonomes Konto, das das Spielen von Blockchain-Spielen ermöglicht","pt":"O codegen é uma conta autônoma embarcada que permite jogar jogos on-chain de forma segura e fácil","ru":"codegen - это самостоятельный счет, позволяющий играть в игры на блокчейне безопасно и легко","ar":"codegen هو حساب ذاتي مدمج يسمح باللعب بأمان وسهولة في ألعاب السلسلة","en":"A self custodial embedded account to seamlessly play onchain games"},"definition":{"en":"A self custodial embedded account to seamlessly play onchain games"},"features":{"zh":["自托管的游戏账户","无缝的オンチェーン游戏体验","支持多种游戏平台","高安全性和可靠性","易于集成和开发"],"ja":["自托管のゲームアカウント","シームレスなオンチェーンゲーム体験","複数のゲームプラットフォームをサポート","高セキュリティと信頼性","簡単な統合と開発"],"ko":["자체 보관 게임 계정","온체인 게임의 무결점 경험","다양한 게임 플랫폼 지원","높은 보안성과 신뢰성","쉬운 통합과 개발"],"es":["Cuenta autónoma integrada","Juegos en blockchain seguros","Experiencia de juego fluida","Acceso a juegos en blockchain","Seguridad y autonomía en el juego"],"fr":["Compte autonome intégré","Jeux sur blockchain sécurisés","Expérience de jeu fluide","Accès à des jeux sur blockchain","Sécurité et autonomie dans le jeu"],"de":["Autonomes Konto integriert","Sichere Blockchain-Spiele","Flüssige Spielereahrung","Zugang zu Blockchain-Spielen","Sicherheit und Autonomie im Spiel"],"pt":["Conta autônoma para jogos on-chain","Segurança e facilidade de uso","Integração com tecnologias de blockchain","Suporte a jogos descentralizados","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Самостоятельный счет для игр на блокчейне","Безопасность и легкость использования","Интеграция с технологиями блокчейна","Поддержка децентрализованных игр","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["حساب ذاتي لألعاب السلسلة","أمان وسهولة الاستخدام","التكامل مع تقنيات السلسلة","دعم ألعاب اللامركزية","واجهة مستخدم直觉ية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["codegen是什么","如何使用codegen","codegen安装指南","codegen与其他游戏平台的比较","codegen的优势和劣势","codegen开发教程","codegen游戏账户创建","codegen安全性和可靠性"],"ja":["codegenとは","codegenの使い方","codegenのインストールガイド","codegenと他のゲームプラットフォームの比較","codegenの利点と欠点","codegen開発チュートリアル","codegenゲームアカウントの作成","codegenのセキュリティと信頼性"],"ko":["codegen이란","codegen 사용법","codegen 설치 가이드","codegen과 다른 게임 플랫폼의 비교","codegen의 장점과 단점","codegen 개발 튜토리얼","codegen 게임 계정 생성","codegen의 보안성과 신뢰성"],"es":["herramientas de código para juegos en blockchain","cómo usar codegen","qué es codegen","codegen alternativa","codegen vs otros","instalar codegen","guía de configuración de codegen"],"fr":["outils de code pour jeux sur blockchain","comment utiliser codegen","quoi est codegen","codegen alternative","codegen vs autres","installer codegen","guide de configuration de codegen"],"de":["AI-Tools für Blockchain-Spiele","wie man codegen verwendet","was ist codegen","codegen Alternative","codegen vs Konkurrenten","codegen installieren","codegen Setup-Anleitung"],"pt":["como usar codegen","o que é codegen","codegen alternative","codegen vs outros ferramentas","instalar codegen","guia de configuração codegen","jogos on-chain","conta autônoma","segurança blockchain"],"ru":["как использовать codegen","что такое codegen","codegen альтернатива","codegen vs другие инструменты","установить codegen","руководство по настройке codegen","игры на блокчейне","самостоятельный счет","безопасность блокчейна"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام codegen","ما هو codegen","codegen بديل","codegen مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت codegen","دليل إعداد codegen","ألعاب السلسلة","حساب ذاتي","أمان السلسلة"]}},"owner":"cartridge-gg","repo":"controller","repoPath":"cartridge-gg/controller","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.920Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"codegen","description":"Regenerate GraphQL types from API schema. Use when API schema has changed, GraphQL queries/mutations added or modified, or type errors in API calls.","bodyPreview":"# GraphQL Codegen Skill\n\nRegenerate GraphQL types from API schema.\n\n## Usage\n\nRun when:\n- API schema has changed\n- GraphQL queries/mutations added or modified\n- Type errors in API calls\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Run `pnpm --filter @cartridge/keychain codegen`\n2. Verify generated types in `packages/keychain/src/utils/api/graphql.ts`\n3. Check for any TypeScript errors in files using the API\n4. Run `pnpm test` to ensure tests still pass\n\n## Configuration\n\n- Schema source: https://api.cartridge.gg/query\n- Confi","body":"# GraphQL Codegen Skill\n\nRegenerate GraphQL types from API schema.\n\n## Usage\n\nRun when:\n- API schema has changed\n- GraphQL queries/mutations added or modified\n- Type errors in API calls\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Run `pnpm --filter @cartridge/keychain codegen`\n2. Verify generated types in `packages/keychain/src/utils/api/graphql.ts`\n3. Check for any TypeScript errors in files using the API\n4. Run `pnpm test` to ensure tests still pass\n\n## Configuration\n\n- Schema source: https://api.cartridge.gg/query\n- Config: `packages/keychain/src/utils/api/codegen.yaml`\n- Auto-runs during build process\n\n## Notes\n\n- Codegen is also triggered automatically during `pnpm build`\n- Generated files should not be manually edited\n- Commit generated changes with schema updates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:16.118Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing automated GraphQL type regeneration and API schema synchronization.","zh":"适用于需要自动化 GraphQL 类型重新生成和 API 模式同步的全栈代理。","ja":"自動化された GraphQL タイプ再生成と API スキーマ同期が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 GraphQL 유형 재생성 및 API 스키마 동기화가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan regeneración automática de tipos GraphQL y sincronización de esquema de API.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''une régénération automatique de types GraphQL et d''une synchronisation de schéma d''API.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine automatisierte Regenerierung von GraphQL-Typen und eine Synchronisierung von API-Schemata benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de regeneração automática de tipos GraphQL e sincronização de esquema de API.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, которым необходима автоматическая регенерация типов GraphQL и синхронизация схемы API.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى تجديد تلقائي لأنواع GraphQL وتنسق مخطط واجهة البرنامج"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to regenerate GraphQL types from API schema using codegen, ensuring seamless on-chain game development with protocols like GraphQL and libraries like TypeScript, while maintaining type safety and API call integrity.","zh":"赋予代理以使用 codegen 从 API 模式重新生成 GraphQL 类型的能力，确保使用 GraphQL 和 TypeScript 等协议以及库的链上游戏开发的无缝进行，同时保持类型安全和 API 调用完整性。","ja":"コードジェネレーターを使用して API スキーマから GraphQL タイプを再生成する機能をエージェントに与え、GraphQL や TypeScript などのプロトコルおよびライブラリを使用したオンチェーンゲーム開発をスムーズに進めると同時に、タイプセーフティと API 呼び出し完全性を維持します。","ko":"코드젠을 사용하여 API 스키마에서 GraphQL 유형을 다시 생성하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여 GraphQL 및 TypeScript와 같은 프로토콜 및 라이브러리를 사용한 온체인 게임 개발을 원활하게 진행하면서 유형 안전성 및 API 호출 무결성을 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a regenerar tipos GraphQL desde el esquema de API utilizando codegen, lo que garantiza un desarrollo de juegos en cadena sin problemas con protocolos como GraphQL y bibliotecas como TypeScript, manteniendo la seguridad de los tipos y la integridad de las llamadas a la API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de régénérer des types GraphQL à partir du schéma d''API en utilisant codegen, garantissant ainsi un développement de jeux en chaîne sans heurts avec des protocoles comme GraphQL et des bibliothèques comme TypeScript, tout en maintenant la sécurité des types et l''intégrité des appels d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, GraphQL-Typen aus dem API-Schema mithilfe von codegen zu regenerieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Entwicklung von On-Chain-Spielen mit Protokollen wie GraphQL und Bibliotheken wie TypeScript gewährleistet wird, während die Typsicherheit und die Integrität von API-Aufrufen aufrechterhalten werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a regenerar tipos GraphQL a partir do esquema de API usando codegen, garantindo desenvolvimento de jogos em cadeia sem interrupção com protocolos como GraphQL e bibliotecas como TypeScript, mantendo a segurança de tipo e integridade da chamada de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью регенерировать типы GraphQL из схемы API с помощью codegen, обеспечивая бесперебойное развитие игр в цепочке с протоколами như GraphQL и библиотеками как TypeScript, сохраняя безопасность типа и целостность вызова API.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تجديد أنواع GraphQL من مخطط واجهة البرنامج باستخدام codegen، مما يضمن تطوير ألعاب سلس مع بروتوكولات مثل GraphQL ومكتبات مثل TypeScript، مع الحفاظ على سلامة النوع وصحة استدعاء واجهة البرنامج"},"useCases":{"en":["Regenerating GraphQL types after API schema updates","Automating type checks for API calls and queries","Debugging type errors in files using the API"],"zh":["API 模式更新后重新生成 GraphQL 类型","自动化 API 调用和查询的类型检查","使用 API 调试文件中的类型错误"],"ja":["API スキーマの更新後、GraphQL タイプを再生成する","API 呼び出しとクエリのタイプチェックを自動化する","API を使用してファイル内のタイプエラーをデバッグする"],"ko":["API 스키마 업데이트 후 GraphQL 유형을 다시 생성하는 것","API 호출 및 쿼리의 유형 검사를 자동화하는 것","API를 사용하여 파일 내의 유형 오류를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Regenerar tipos GraphQL después de las actualizaciones del esquema de API","Automatizar las comprobaciones de tipos para llamadas y consultas de API","Depurar errores de tipo en archivos que utilizan la API"],"fr":["Régénérer les types GraphQL après les mises à jour du schéma d''API","Automatiser les vérifications de types pour les appels et les requêtes d''API","Déboguer les erreurs de type dans les fichiers utilisant l''API"],"de":["GraphQL-Typen nach Aktualisierungen des API-Schemas regenerieren","Typüberprüfungen für API-Aufrufe und -Abfragen automatisieren","Typfehler in Dateien, die die API verwenden, debuggen"],"pt":["Regenerar tipos GraphQL após atualizações do esquema de API","Automatizar verificação de tipo para chamadas de API e consultas","Depurar erros de tipo em arquivos que usam a API"],"ru":["Регенерировать типы GraphQL после обновлений схемы API","Автоматизировать проверку типа для вызовов API и запросов","Отлаживать ошибки типа в файлах, использующих API"],"ar":["تجديد أنواع GraphQL بعد تحديث مخطط واجهة البرنامج","تأتميم فحص النوع لاستدعاءات واجهة البرنامج والاستفسارات","تصحيح أخطاء النوع في الملفات التي تستخدم واجهة البرنامج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm and TypeScript configuration","Limited to GraphQL API schema","Needs active API schema source, such as https://api.cartridge.gg/query"],"zh":["需要 pnpm 和 TypeScript 配置","仅限 GraphQL API 模式","需要活跃的 API 模式源，例如 https://api.cartridge.gg/query"],"ja":["pnpm と TypeScript の設定が必要","GraphQL API スキーマに限定される","アクティブな API スキーマソース（例：https://api.cartridge.gg/query）が必要"],"ko":["pnpm 및 TypeScript 구성이 필요","GraphQL API 스키마로 제한됨","활성 API 스키마 소스(예: https://api.cartridge.gg/query)가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de pnpm y TypeScript","Limitado al esquema de API de GraphQL","Necesita una fuente de esquema de API activa, como https://api.cartridge.gg/query"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de pnpm et de TypeScript","Limité au schéma d''API GraphQL","Nécessite une source de schéma d''API active, telle que https://api.cartridge.gg/query"],"de":["Benötigt pnpm- und TypeScript-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf GraphQL-API-Schema","Benötigt eine aktive API-Schema-Quelle, wie z. B. https://api.cartridge.gg/query"],"pt":["Exige configuração do pnpm e TypeScript","Limitado ao esquema de API GraphQL","Necessita de fonte ativa de esquema de API, como https://api.cartridge.gg/query"],"ru":["Требует настройки pnpm и TypeScript","Ограничен схемой API GraphQL","Требует активного источника схемы API, такого как https://api.cartridge.gg/query"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين pnpm و TypeScript","محدود بمخطط واجهة البرنامج GraphQL","يحتاج إلى مصدر نشط لمخطط واجهة البرنامج، مثل https://api.cartridge.gg/query"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0df21ed58b1f0fce55915e9b80e852a978ef39c5a62ae720c7b94a75a3c65dd8","qualityScore":39}');
