personalizados","Integración con ASP.NET Core","Soporte multi-tenant","Framework de aplicación modular","Código abierto y extensible"],"fr":["Création de modules personnalisés","Intégration avec ASP.NET Core","Prise en charge multi-locataire","Framework d''application modulaire","Code source ouvert et extensible"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Modulen","Integration mit ASP.NET Core","Multi-tenant-Unterstützung","Modulares Anwendungsframework","Open-Source-Code und erweiterbar"],"pt":["Criação de módulos personalizados","Integração com o CMS Orchard Core","Ferramenta de código aberto","Suporte a ASP.NET Core","Multi-tenancy"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских модулей","Интеграция с CMS Orchard Core","Открытый инструмент","Поддержка ASP.NET Core","Мультиарендность"],"ar":["إنشاء وحدات مخصصة","التكامل مع نظام إدارة المحتوى أوركارد كور","أداة مفتوحة المصدر","دعم ل ASP.NET Core","الاستئجار المتعدد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Orchard Core模块创建器","ASP.NET Core模块化框架","多租户应用程序","内容管理系统","模块化架构","如何使用Orchard Core","Orchard Core模块创建器教程","Orchard Core模块创建器安装"],"ja":["Orchard Coreモジュール作成者","ASP.NET Coreモジュール化フレームワーク","マルチテナントアプリケーション","コンテンツ管理システム","モジュール化アーキテクチャ","Orchard Coreの使い方","Orchard Coreモジュール作成者チュートリアル","Orchard Coreモジュール作成者インストール"],"ko":["Orchard Core 모듈 생성기","ASP.NET Core 모듈화 프레임워크","多租户 애플리케이션","콘텐츠 관리 시스템","모듈화 아키텍처","Orchard Core 사용법","Orchard Core 모듈 생성기 튜토리얼","Orchard Core 모듈 생성기 설치"],"es":["cómo usar Orchard Core","qué es un módulo de Orchard Core","Orchard Core vs Umbraco","instalación de Orchard Core","guía de configuración de Orchard Core","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser Orchard Core","qu''est-ce qu''un module Orchard Core","Orchard Core vs Umbraco","installation d''Orchard Core","guide de configuration d''Orchard Core","outils d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man Orchard Core verwendet","was ist ein Orchard Core-Modul","Orchard Core vs Umbraco","Installation von Orchard Core","Konfigurationshandbuch für Orchard Core","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar o criador de módulos Orchard Core","o que é o Orchard Core","alternativas ao Orchard Core","Orchard Core vs Umbraco","instalar o criador de módulos Orchard Core","guia de configuração do criador de módulos Orchard Core"],"ru":["как использовать создатель модулей Orchard Core","что такое Orchard Core","альтернативы Orchard Core","Orchard Core vs Umbraco","установить создатель модулей Orchard Core","руководство по настройке создателя модулей Orchard Core"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام منشئ الوحدات أوركارد كور","ما هو أوركارد كور","بديلات أوركارد كور","أوركارد كور مقابل أومبراكو","تثبيت منشئ الوحدات أوركارد كور","دليل إعداد منشئ الوحدات أوركارد كور"]}},"owner":"OrchardCMS","repo":"OrchardCore","repoPath":"OrchardCMS/OrchardCore","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.922Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"orchardcore-module-creator","description":"Creates new OrchardCore modules with proper structure, manifest, startup, and patterns. Use when the user needs to create a new module, add content parts, fields, drivers, handlers, or admin functionality.","bodyPreview":"# OrchardCore Module Creator\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new OrchardCore modules following project conventions.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- OrchardCore repository at `D:\\orchardcore`\n- .NET SDK 10.0+ installed\n\n## Module Creation Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Determine Module Type\n\n**What kind of module are you creating?**\n\n| Type | Description | Key Components |\n|------|-------------|----------------|\n| **Content Part** | Adds data/behavior to content items | Part, Driver, Views |\n| **Content Fiel","body":"# OrchardCore Module Creator\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new OrchardCore modules following project conventions.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- OrchardCore repository at `D:\\orchardcore`\n- .NET SDK 10.0+ installed\n\n## Module Creation Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Determine Module Type\n\n**What kind of module are you creating?**\n\n| Type | Description | Key Components |\n|------|-------------|----------------|\n| **Content Part** | Adds data/behavior to content items | Part, Driver, Views |\n| **Content Field** | Custom field type | Field, Driver, Views |\n| **Settings** | Site-wide configuration | SiteSettings, Driver |\n| **Admin Feature** | Admin pages/tools | Controller, Views, Menu |\n| **API** | REST endpoints | ApiController |\n| **Background Task** | Scheduled jobs | IBackgroundTask |\n\n### Step 2: Create Module Directory\n\n```bash\n# Create module folder\nmkdir src/OrchardCore.Modules/OrchardCore.YourModule\ncd src/OrchardCore.Modules/OrchardCore.YourModule\n```\n\n### Step 3: Create Required Files\n\nEvery module needs these three files:\n\n1. **Manifest.cs** - Module metadata\n2. **Startup.cs** - Service registration  \n3. **OrchardCore.YourModule.csproj** - Project file\n\nSee `references/module-structure.md` for templates.\n\n### Step 4: Add Components Based on Type\n\n**For Content Part modules:**\n```\nModels/YourPart.cs\nViewModels/YourPartViewModel.cs\nDrivers/YourPartDisplayDriver.cs\nViews/YourPart.cshtml\nViews/YourPart_Edit.cshtml\n```\n\n**For Admin modules:**\n```\nControllers/AdminController.cs\nViews/Admin/Index.cshtml\nAdminMenu.cs\nPermissionProvider.cs\n```\n\n**For Data-storing modules:**\n```\nMigrations.cs\nIndexes/YourIndex.cs\n```\n\nSee `references/patterns.md` for code templates.\n\n### Step 5: Register in Startup.cs\n\n```csharp\npublic override void ConfigureServices(IServiceCollection services)\n{\n    // Content part\n    services.AddContentPart<YourPart>()\n        .UseDisplayDriver<YourPartDisplayDriver>();\n    \n    // Services\n    services.AddScoped<IYourService, YourService>();\n    \n    // Migrations (if storing data)\n    services.AddDataMigration<Migrations>();\n    \n    // Permissions (if securing features)\n    services.AddPermissionProvider<PermissionProvider>();\n    \n    // Navigation (if adding admin menu)\n    services.AddNavigationProvider<AdminMenu>();\n}\n```\n\n### Step 6: Build and Test\n\n```bash\n# Build the module\ncd D:\\orchardcore\ndotnet build src/OrchardCore.Modules/OrchardCore.YourModule\n\n# Run the application\ncd src/OrchardCore.Cms.Web\ndotnet run -f net10.0\n\n# Enable the feature in Admin → Features\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n| Item | Convention | Example |\n|------|------------|---------|\n| Module folder | `OrchardCore.ModuleName` | `OrchardCore.Rating` |\n| Namespace | `OrchardCore.ModuleName` | `OrchardCore.Rating` |\n| Feature ID | `OrchardCore.ModuleName` | `OrchardCore.Rating` |\n| Content Part | `NamePart` | `RatingPart` |\n| Driver | `NamePartDisplayDriver` | `RatingPartDisplayDriver` |\n| View | `PartName.cshtml` | `RatingPart.cshtml` |\n| Edit View | `PartName_Edit.cshtml` | `RatingPart_Edit.cshtml` |\n\n### Common Dependencies\n\nAdd to `.csproj` as needed:\n\n```xml\n<!-- Core module support -->\n<ProjectReference Include=\"..\\..\\OrchardCore\\OrchardCore.Module.Targets\\OrchardCore.Module.Targets.csproj\" />\n\n<!-- Content management -->\n<ProjectReference Include=\"..\\..\\OrchardCore\\OrchardCore.ContentManagement\\OrchardCore.ContentManagement.csproj\" />\n\n<!-- Admin UI -->\n<ProjectReference Include=\"..\\..\\OrchardCore\\OrchardCore.Admin\\OrchardCore.Admin.csproj\" />\n```\n\n### Feature Categories\n\nUse in `Manifest.cs`:\n- `Content Management`\n- `Content`\n- `Navigation`\n- `Security`\n- `Infrastructure`\n- `Theming`\n- `Developer`\n\n## References\n\n- `references/module-structure.md` - Directory layout and file templates\n- `references/patterns.md` - Code patterns (parts, drivers, handlers, etc.)\n- `references/examples.md` - Complete module examples\n- `AGENTS.md` (repo root) - Coding conventions and build commands\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:22.934Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for .NET Agents needing modular application framework capabilities with ASP.NET Core.","zh":"Perfect for .NET Agents 需要具有 ASP.NET Core 的模块化应用程序框架能力。","ja":".NET Agents が ASP.NET Core を使用したモジュラーなアプリケーションフレームワーク機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"ASP.NET Core를 사용하는 모듈형 애플리케이션 프레임워크 기능이 필요한 .NET 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes .NET que necesitan capacidades de framework de aplicación modulares con ASP.NET Core.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents .NET nécessitant des capacités de framework d''application modulaires avec ASP.NET Core.","de":"Perfekt für .NET-Agents, die modulare Anwendungsframework-Funktionen mit ASP.NET Core benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes .NET que precisam de capacidades de framework de aplicação modulares com ASP.NET Core.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов .NET, которым необходимы модульные возможности фреймворка приложений с ASP.NET Core.","ar":"مثالي لعميل .NET الذي يحتاج إلى قابليات إطار تطبيق موديولار مع ASP.NET Core."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create new OrchardCore modules following project conventions, leveraging .NET SDK 10.0+ and ASP.NET Core, enabling the development of Content Parts, Content Fields, and other module types with key components like Part, Driver, and Views.","zh":"赋予代理创建新的 OrchardCore 模块的能力，遵循项目约定，利用 .NET SDK 10.0+ 和 ASP.NET Core，实现开发 Content Parts、Content Fields 和其他模块类型，包括 Part、Driver 和 Views 等关键组件。","ja":"オーケストレーションエージェントが、プロジェクトの規約に従って新しいOrchardCoreモジュールを作成できるようにし、.NET SDK 10.0+ と ASP.NET Core を活用して、コンテンツパーツ、コンテンツフィールド、その他のモジュールタイプを開発し、パート、ドライバー、ビューなどの重要なコンポーネントを含む。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 규칙을 따라 새로운 OrchardCore 모듈을 생성할 수 있도록 하여, .NET SDK 10.0+ 및 ASP.NET Core를 활용하여 콘텐츠 파트, 콘텐츠 필드, 기타 모듈 유형을 개발하고, 파트, 드라이버, 뷰와 같은 주요 구성 요소를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear nuevos módulos de OrchardCore siguiendo las convenciones del proyecto, aprovechando .NET SDK 10.0+ y ASP.NET Core, lo que permite el desarrollo de partes de contenido, campos de contenido y otros tipos de módulos con componentes clave como Part, Driver y Views.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouveaux modules OrchardCore en suivant les conventions de projet, en exploitant .NET SDK 10.0+ et ASP.NET Core, ce qui permet le développement de parties de contenu, de champs de contenu et d''autres types de modules avec des composants clés tels que Part, Driver et Views.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, neue OrchardCore-Module nach Projektübereinstimmungen zu erstellen, .NET SDK 10.0+ und ASP.NET Core zu nutzen, um die Entwicklung von Content-Teilen, Content-Feldern und anderen Modultypen mit Schlüsselkomponenten wie Part, Driver und Views zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos módulos OrchardCore seguindo convenções de projeto, aproveitando o .NET SDK 10.0+ e ASP.NET Core, permitindo o desenvolvimento de Partes de Conteúdo, Campos de Conteúdo e outros tipos de módulos com componentes-chave como Part, Driver e Views.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые модули OrchardCore, следуя проектным конвенциям, используя .NET SDK 10.0+ и ASP.NET Core, что позволяет разрабатывать части контента, поля контента и другие типы модулей с ключевыми компонентами, такими как Part, Driver и Views.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء وحدات OrchardCore الجديدة اتباعًا لاتفاقيات المشروع، واستخدام .NET SDK 10.0+ و ASP.NET Core، مما يتيح تطوير أجزاء المحتوى وحقول المحتوى وأنواع الوحدات الأخرى مع المكونات الرئيسية مثل Part و Driver و Views."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom Content Parts for OrchardCore applications","Developing modular extensions for multi-tenant systems","Generating Content Fields with specific data types and behaviors"],"zh":["为OrchardCore应用程序创建自定义的Content Parts","为多租户系统开发模块化扩展","生成具有特定数据类型和行为的Content Fields"],"ja":["OrchardCoreアプリケーション用のカスタムコンテンツパーツを作成する","マルチテナントシステム用のモジュール拡張を開発する","特定のデータ型と動作を持つコンテンツフィールドを生成する"],"ko":["OrchardCore 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 지정 콘텐츠 파트 생성","다중 테넌트 시스템을 위한 모듈형 확장 개발","특정 데이터 유형 및 동작을 갖는 콘텐츠 필드 생성"],"es":["Creación de partes de contenido personalizadas para aplicaciones OrchardCore","Desarrollo de extensiones modulares para sistemas multi-tenant","Generación de campos de contenido con tipos de datos y comportamientos específicos"],"fr":["Création de parties de contenu personnalisées pour les applications OrchardCore","Développement d''extensions modulaires pour les systèmes multi-locataires","Génération de champs de contenu avec des types de données et des comportements spécifiques"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Content-Teile für OrchardCore-Anwendungen","Entwicklung modularer Erweiterungen für Multi-Tenant-Systeme","Generierung von Content-Feldern mit spezifischen Datentypen und Verhaltensweisen"],"pt":["Criar Partes de Conteúdo personalizadas para aplicações OrchardCore","Desenvolver extensões modulares para sistemas multi-inquilinos","Gerar Campos de Conteúdo com tipos de dados e comportamentos específicos"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских частей контента для приложений OrchardCore","Разработка модульных расширений для многоарендных систем","Генерация полей контента с конкретными типами данных и поведением"],"ar":["إنشاء أجزاء المحتوى المخصصة لتطبيقات OrchardCore","تطوير الامتدادات الموديولار لأنظمة متعددة الإيجار","توليد حقول المحتوى مع أنواع بياناتและสلوكيات محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OrchardCore repository setup",".NET SDK 10.0+ installation","ASP.NET Core compatibility"],"zh":["需要OrchardCore仓库设置","需要 .NET SDK 10.0+ 安装","需要ASP.NET Core兼容性"],"ja":["OrchardCoreリポジトリの設定が必要",".NET SDK 10.0+ のインストールが必要","ASP.NET Coreの互換性が必要"],"ko":["OrchardCore 저장소 설정이 필요합니다.",".NET SDK 10.0+ 설치가 필요합니다.","ASP.NET Core 호환성이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración del repositorio de OrchardCore","Instalación de .NET SDK 10.0+","Compatibilidad con ASP.NET Core"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du référentiel OrchardCore","Installation de .NET SDK 10.0+","Compatibilité avec ASP.NET Core"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung des OrchardCore-Repositorys",".NET SDK 10.0+-Installation","ASP.NET Core-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Requer configuração do repositório OrchardCore","Instalação do .NET SDK 10.0+","Compatibilidade com ASP.NET Core"],"ru":["Требует настройки репозитория OrchardCore","Установка .NET SDK 10.0+","Совместимость с ASP.NET Core"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مستودع OrchardCore","تثبيت .NET SDK 10.0+","التوافق مع ASP.NET Core"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"17c0ee0feecd5f70fef44f090ee1af286513da94ff50e2eae99e05b0b01e8fba","qualityScore":39}');
