v2.0.67","guides d''installation de formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","alternatives à formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow vs claud code","comment utiliser formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","configuration de formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"],"de":["ki-tools","software-engineering","automatisierung von aufgaben","claud code v2.0.67","installation guides für formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","alternativen zu formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow vs claud code","wie man formax-repomix-handoff-workflow verwendet","konfiguration von formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para engenharia de software","como usar formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","o que é formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow vs Claude Code","instalar formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","guia de configuração do formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"],"ru":["ИИ-помощницы для программной инженерии","как использовать formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","что такое formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow vs Claude Code","установить formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","руководство по настройке formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للهندسة البرمجية","كيفية استخدام formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","ما هو formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","دليل إعداد formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"]}},"owner":"yusifeng","repo":"formax","repoPath":"yusifeng/formax","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.965Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","description":"Use when preparing a Formax code handoff: selecting files, generating repomix bundles, and writing a high-quality prompt for WebGPT or another coding agent with clear constraints and validation scope.","bodyPreview":"# formax-repomix-handoff-workflow\n\n## Goal\nCreate a clean handoff package for another AI with:\n- the smallest correct repomix bundle\n- a prompt that matches the target environment\n- explicit acceptance criteria and non-goals\n- predictable artifact naming + validation (so uploads stay consistent)\n\n## Where to change what\n- All handoff artifacts live in one folder: `repomix-output/`\n- Bundle output: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt`\n- Handoff prompt: `repomix-output/<topic>-handoff-promp","body":"# formax-repomix-handoff-workflow\n\n## Goal\nCreate a clean handoff package for another AI with:\n- the smallest correct repomix bundle\n- a prompt that matches the target environment\n- explicit acceptance criteria and non-goals\n- predictable artifact naming + validation (so uploads stay consistent)\n\n## Where to change what\n- All handoff artifacts live in one folder: `repomix-output/`\n- Bundle output: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt`\n- Handoff prompt: `repomix-output/<topic>-handoff-prompt.md`\n- File manifest notes: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-files.md`\n- Template references: `references/prompt-templates.md`\n\n> Required hygiene: each new pack run must clear previous files in `repomix-output/` first, so users can upload that folder as-is without manual file picking.\n\n## Pack tiers (default taxonomy)\nUse exactly one tier label in bundle filename:\n\n- `minimal`: changed runtime files + direct dependencies + adjacent tests.\n- `core`: `minimal` + only critical contract/design docs needed for intent.\n- `full`: broad context pack for deep investigations (cross-subsystem docs/tests).\n\nExample names:\n- `repomix-topic-minimal.txt`\n- `repomix-topic-core.txt`\n- `repomix-topic-full.txt`\n\n## Patterns\n1. Classify target runtime first\n- `Static consumer` (e.g., WebGPT): cannot run local commands or tests.\n- `Executable agent` (repo access): can run local commands/tests.\n\n2. Pick a pack tier first (`minimal` / `core` / `full`)\n- Default to `minimal`.\n- Upgrade to `core` only when architecture/contracts matter.\n- Use `full` only when root cause plausibly spans multiple subsystems.\n\n3. Build the include set for that tier\n- Include changed runtime files + direct dependencies + adjacent tests.\n- Include only docs needed for intent/constraints at the chosen tier.\n- Avoid unrelated folders to keep context small.\n\n4. Pack with deterministic command (single folder, auto-clean)\n```sh\nbunx repomix . \\\n  --style plain \\\n  --no-git-sort-by-changes \\\n  -o repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt \\\n  --include \"<comma-separated-file-list>\"\n```\nOr use the helper script:\n```sh\nbash .codex/skills/formax-repomix-handoff-workflow/scripts/build-repomix.sh \\\n  repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt \\\n  \"<comma-separated-file-list>\"\n```\nThe helper script will:\n- create `repomix-output/` if missing\n- delete previous files under `repomix-output/` (except `.gitkeep`)\n- write the new bundle into `repomix-output/`\n\n5. Write prompt + file manifest with naming convention\n- Prompt: `repomix-output/<topic>-handoff-prompt.md`\n- Manifest: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-files.md`\n- Always use **repo-relative paths** in prompt + manifest (no machine absolute paths).\n\n6. Write prompt with explicit boundaries\n- State known symptoms.\n- State hard constraints (what must not change).\n- Define deliverables (root cause model, options, recommended plan, test/validation matrix).\n- Include acceptance criteria with observable assertions.\n\n7. Run artifact validation (required)\n```sh\nbash .codex/skills/formax-repomix-handoff-workflow/scripts/check-handoff-artifacts.sh \\\n  repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt \\\n  <topic>\n```\nThis check enforces:\n- Bundle/prompt/manifest files all exist.\n- Prompt and manifest reference the current bundle name.\n- Manifest references the prompt filename.\n- Prompt + manifest do not contain local absolute paths.\n\n8. Sanity-check before handoff\n- `repomix-output/` only contains current-round artifacts.\n- Bundle exists and includes the expected files.\n- Prompt has no impossible instructions for the target runtime.\n- Prompt does not ask static consumers to run commands.\n- Naming is topic-driven and consistent across all three artifacts.\n\nSee `references/prompt-templates.md` for copy-ready templates.\n\n## Tests to update\n- No repository tests required for creating the handoff itself.\n- If target is executable, include a suggested minimal test list in the handoff prompt.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Never include `bun run test:coverage` in a static-consumer prompt.\n- Never assume the other AI can read files outside the provided bundle unless explicitly attached.\n- Keep asks decision-oriented first (root cause/options) before patch implementation.\n- Prefer concrete acceptance checks over vague goals.\n- Avoid mixing unrelated bugfixes into one handoff package.\n- Never leak machine absolute paths (e.g., `/Users/...`) in prompt/manifest.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:51:33.972Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Software Engineering Agents needing efficient handoff workflows with minimal repomix bundles and predictable artifact naming.","zh":"非常适合需要高效交接工作流和最小化 repomix 包以及可预测的构件命名的软件工程代理。","ja":"ソフトウェアエンジニアリングエージェントが効率的なハンドオフワークフローと最小の repomix バンドルおよび予測可能な成果物命名を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 핸드오버 워크플로와 최소한의 repomix 번들 및 예측 가능한 아티팩트命名이 필요한 소프트웨어 엔지니어링 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Ingeniería de Software que necesitan flujos de trabajo de entrega eficientes con paquetes mínimos de repomix y nombres de artefactos predecibles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénierie logicielle nécessitant des flux de travail de passation efficaces avec des bundles de repomix minimaux et des noms d''artefacts prévisibles.","de":"Perfekt für Software Engineering Agents, die effiziente Handoff-Workflows mit minimalen repomix-Bundles und vorhersehbaren Artefakt-Namen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Engenharia de Software que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de handoff eficientes com pacotes de repomix mínimos e nomeação de artefatos previsível.","ru":"Идеально для агентов инженерии программного обеспечения, которым требуются эффективные рабочие процессы передачи с минимальными пакетами repomix и предсказуемым именованием артефактов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الهندسيين البرمجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى سير عمل مثالية لتحويل مع الحزم المخففة من repomix وأسماء الملفات المتوقعة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create clean handoff packages with explicit acceptance criteria, non-goals, and validated artifact naming, utilizing terminal-first interfaces and repomix bundles in .txt format.","zh":"赋予代理创建干净的交接包的能力，具有明确的验收标准、非目标和验证的构件命名，利用基于终端的接口和 repomix 包的 .txt 格式。","ja":"エージェントが明確な受け入れ基準、非目標、および検証された成果物命名を使用してクリーンなハンドオフパッケージを作成する能力を提供し、ターミナル第一のインターフェイスと repomix バンドルの .txt 形式を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가明确한 수락 기준, 비목표 및 검증된 아티팩트命名을 사용하여 깨끗한 핸드오버 패키지를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 터미널 우선 인터페이스와 repomix 번들의 .txt 형식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear paquetes de entrega limpios con criterios de aceptación explícitos, no objetivos y nombres de artefactos validados, utilizando interfaces de terminal en primer lugar y bundles de repomix en formato .txt.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des paquets de passation propres avec des critères d''acceptation explicites, des non-objectifs et des noms d''artefacts validés, en utilisant des interfaces de terminal en premier lieu et des bundles de repomix au format .txt.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, saubere Handoff-Pakete mit expliziten Akzeptanzkriterien, Nicht-Zielen und validierten Artefakt-Namen zu erstellen, indem sie terminal-erste Schnittstellen und repomix-Bundles im .txt-Format nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem pacotes de handoff limpos com critérios de aceitação explícitos, metas não alcançadas e nomeação de artefatos validada, utilizando interfaces de terminal em primeiro lugar e pacotes de repomix no formato .txt.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать чистые пакеты передачи с явными критериями приемки, недостижимыми целями и проверенным именованием артефактов, используя терминальные интерфейсы и пакеты repomix в формате .txt.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء حزم مثالية لتحويل مع معايير قبول صريحة وأهداف غير قابلة للتحقيق وأسماء الملفات المثبتة، باستخدام واجهات الطرفية أولاً وحزم repomix بامتداد .txt."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating minimal repomix bundles for handoffs","Creating predictable and validated artifact names for uploads","Defining explicit acceptance criteria and non-goals for target environments"],"zh":["为交接生成最小的 repomix 包","为上传创建可预测且验证的构件名称","为目标环境定义明确的验收标准和非目标"],"ja":["ハンドオフ用に最小の repomix バンドルを生成する","アップロード用に予測可能且つ検証された成果物名を作成する","ターゲット環境用に明確な受け入れ基準と非目標を定義する"],"ko":["핸드오버를 위한 최소한의 repomix 번들을 생성하는 것","업로드를 위한 예측 가능하며 검증된 아티팩트 이름을 생성하는 것","타겟 환경을 위한 명확한 수락 기준 및 비목표를 정의하는 것"],"es":["Generación de bundles de repomix mínimos para entregas","Creación de nombres de artefactos predecibles y validados para subidas","Definición de criterios de aceptación explícitos y no objetivos para entornos de destino"],"fr":["Génération de bundles de repomix minimaux pour les passations","Création de noms d''artefacts prévisibles et validés pour les téléchargements","Définition de critères d''acceptation explicites et de non-objectifs pour les environnements cibles"],"de":["Generierung minimaler repomix-Bundles für Handoffs","Erstellung vorhersehbarer und validierter Artefakt-Namen für Uploads","Definition expliziter Akzeptanzkriterien und Nicht-Ziele für Zielumgebungen"],"pt":["Geração de pacotes de repomix mínimos para handoffs","Criação de nomes de artefatos previsíveis e validados para uploads","Definição de critérios de aceitação explícitos e metas não alcançadas para ambientes de destino"],"ru":["Генерация минимальных пакетов repomix для передачи","Создание предсказуемых и проверенных имен артефактов для загрузки","Определение явных критериев приемки и недостижимых целей для целевых сред"],"ar":["توليد حزم repomix المخففة لتحويل","إنشاء أسماء الملفات المتوقعة والمدقة للمرفقات","تحديد معايير القبول الصريحة والأهداف غير القابلة للتحقيق للبيئات المستهدفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires terminal-first interface compatibility","Output artifacts limited to repomix-output/ folder","Bundle output and handoff prompt follow specific naming conventions"],"zh":["需要基于终端的接口兼容性","输出构件仅限于 repomix-output/ 文件夹","包输出和交接提示遵循特定的命名约定"],"ja":["ターミナル第一のインターフェイスの互換性が必要","出力成果物は repomix-output/ フォルダに限定される","バンドル出力とハンドオフプロンプトは特定の命名規則に従う"],"ko":["터미널 우선 인터페이스 호환성이 필요","출력 아티팩트는 repomix-output/ 폴더에만 제한","번들 출력 및 핸드오버 프롬프트는 특정한 명명 규칙을 따름"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con interfaces de terminal en primer lugar","Los artefactos de salida están limitados a la carpeta repomix-output/","La salida del bundle y la invitación de entrega siguen convenciones de nomenclatura específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec les interfaces de terminal en premier lieu","Les artefacts de sortie sont limités au dossier repomix-output/","La sortie du bundle et l''invite de passation suivent des conventions de dénomination spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Kompatibilität mit terminal-ersten Schnittstellen","Die Ausgabe-Artefakte sind auf den Ordner repomix-output/ beschränkt","Die Bundle-Ausgabe und die Handoff-Aufforderung folgen spezifischen Benennungskonventionen"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com interface de terminal em primeiro lugar","Artifacts de saída limitados à pasta repomix-output/","Saída do pacote e prompt de handoff seguem convenções de nomeação específicas"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с терминальным интерфейсом в первую очередь","Артефакты вывода ограничены папкой repomix-output/","Вывод пакета и подсказка передачи следуют конкретным соглашениям об именовании"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع واجهة الطرفية أولاً","محدودية الملفات الناتجة إلى مجلد repomix-output/","مخرجات الحزمة وتنبيه التحويل تتبع اتفاقيات命名 محددة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"96f19b328a9ee07a5c8c63581472ee482beb3abf8feb8f8c95d07818139f0d64","qualityScore":39}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('hookvibe/hookcode/hookcode-preview-highlight', 'community', 'hookvibe', 'hookcode', 'hookvibe/hookcode', 'hookcode-preview-highlight', 0, 0, 39, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.965Z', '2026-03-02T02:51:36.259Z', '91d5ceadec9f13c1c2e53ea3fe90d401bbcc05441a0c552843d48f4c7021cbc2', '{"id":"hookvibe/hookcode/hookcode-preview-highlight","name":"hookcode-preview-highlight","description":{"zh":"HookCode Preview Highlight是一种智能代码审查和自动化平台，支持CLI编码助手和Webhooks","ja":"HookCode Preview Highlightは、CLIコーディングアシスタントとWebhookをサポートするコードレビューと自動化プラットフォームです","ko":"HookCode Preview Highlight는 CLI 코딩 어시스턴트와 Webhook를 지원하는 코드 리뷰와 자동화 플랫폼입니다","es":"HookCode es una plataforma inteligente de revisión y automatización de código que activa asistentes de codificación CLI a través de conversaciones y Webhooks","fr":"HookCode est une plateforme intelligente d''examen et d''automatisation de code qui déclenche des assistants de codage CLI via des conversations et des Webhooks","de":"HookCode ist eine intelligente Plattform für Code-Review und -Automatisierung, die CLI-Coding-Assistenten über Konversationen und Webhooks auslöst","pt":"HookCode é uma plataforma de revisão e automação de código inteligente que dispara assistentes de codificação CLI através de conversas e Webhooks","ru":"HookCode — это интеллектуальная платформа для код-ревью и автоматизации, которая с помощью разговоров и Вебхуков запускает помощников кодирования CLI","ar":"هوك كود هي منصة مراجعة وتنفيذ آلي ذكاء اصطناعي للكود التي تنشئ مساعدين كود CLI من خلال المحادثات والويب هوك","en":"HookCode is an intelligent code review and automation platform that elegantly triggers CLI coding assistants through conversations and Webhooks. It supports independent deployment and provides a visual console for real-time task execution monitoring."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代码审查工具 - HookCode Preview Highlight","ja":"AIエージェントを活用したコードレビュー - HookCode Preview Highlight","ko":"AI 에이전트를 활용한 코드 리뷰 도구 - HookCode Preview Highlight","es":"Herramientas de AI: HookCode Preview Highlight","fr":"Outils d''IA: HookCode Preview Highlight","de":"KI-Tools: HookCode Preview Highlight","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: hookcode-preview-highlight","ru":"ИИ Агенты: hookcode-preview-highlight","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: hookcode-preview-highlight","en":"hookcode-preview-highlight"},"description":{"zh":"HookCode Preview Highlight是一种智能代码审查和自动化平台，支持CLI编码助手和Webhooks","ja":"HookCode Preview Highlightは、CLIコーディングアシスタントとWebhookをサポートするコードレビューと自動化プラットフォームです","ko":"HookCode Preview Highlight는 CLI 코딩 어시스턴트와 Webhook를 지원하는 코드 리뷰와 자동화 플랫폼입니다","es":"HookCode es una plataforma inteligente de revisión y automatización de código que activa asistentes de codificación CLI a través de conversaciones y Webhooks","fr":"HookCode est une plateforme intelligente d''examen et d''automatisation de code qui déclenche des assistants de codage CLI via des conversations et des Webhooks","de":"HookCode ist eine intelligente Plattform für Code-Review und -Automatisierung, die CLI-Coding-Assistenten über Konversationen und Webhooks auslöst","pt":"HookCode é uma plataforma de revisão e automação de código inteligente que dispara assistentes de codificação CLI através de conversas e Webhooks","ru":"HookCode — это интеллектуальная платформа для код-ревью и автоматизации, которая с помощью разговоров и Вебхуков запускает помощников кодирования CLI","ar":"هوك كود هي منصة مراجعة وتنفيذ آلي ذكاء اصطناعي للكود التي تنشئ مساعدين كود CLI من خلال المحادثات والويب هوك","en":"HookCode is an intelligent code review and automation platform that elegantly triggers CLI coding assistants through conversations and Webhooks. It supports ..."},"definition":{"en":"HookCode is an intelligent code review and automation platform that elegantly triggers CLI coding assistants through conversations and Webhooks. It supports independent deployment and provides a visual console for real-time task execution monitoring."},"features":{"zh":["支持CLI编码助手","Webhooks集成","实时任务执行监控","独立部署","代码审查自动化"],"ja":["CLIコーディングアシスタントのサポート","Webhookの統合","リアルタイムタスク実行モニタリング","独立したデプロイ","コードレビューの自動化"],"ko":["CLI 코딩 어시스턴트 지원","Webhook 통합","실시간 태스크 실행 모니터링","독립적인 배포","코드 리뷰 자동화"],"es":["Integración de asistentes de codificación CLI","Despliegue independiente","Consola visual para monitoreo de tareas en tiempo real","Automatización de la revisión de código","Soporte para Webhooks"],"fr":["Intégration d''assistants de codage CLI","Déploiement indépendant","Console visuelle pour le suivi des tâches en temps réel","Automatisation de l''examen de code","Prise en charge des Webhooks"],"de":["Integration von CLI-Coding-Assistenten","Unabhängiges Deployment","Visuelle Konsole für Echtzeit-Aufgabenüberwachung","Automatisierung der Code-Überprüfung","Unterstützung für Webhooks"],"pt":["Dispara assistentes de codificação CLI","Suporta implantação independente","Fornece console visual para monitoramento de tarefas em tempo real","Integração com Webhooks","Conversas para automação de código"],"ru":["Запускает помощников кодирования CLI","Поддерживает независимую установку","Предоставляет визуальную консоль для мониторинга задач в реальном времени","Интеграция с Вебхуками","Разговоры для автоматизации кода"],"ar":["تنشئ مساعدين كود CLI","تدعم التثبيت المستقل","توفر واجهة مرئية لمراقبة المهام في الوقت الفعلي","التكامل مع الويب هوك","المحادثات للتنفيذ الآلي للكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代码审查","HookCode Preview Highlight","代码审查自动化","CLI编码助手","Webhooks集成","代码优化工具","如何使用HookCode","HookCode替代品"],"ja":["AIエージェント","HookCode Preview Highlight","コードレビュー自動化","CLIコーディングアシスタント","Webhookの統合","コード最適化ツール","HookCodeの使い方","HookCodeの代替"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","HookCode Preview Highlight","코드 리뷰 자동화","CLI 코딩 어시스턴트","Webhook 통합","코드 최적화 도구","HookCode 사용법","HookCode 대안"],"es":["cómo usar HookCode","qué es la automatización de código","alternativas a HookCode","HookCode vs GitHub","instalación de HookCode","guía de configuración de HookCode"],"fr":["comment utiliser HookCode","qu''est-ce que l''automatisation de code","alternatives à HookCode","HookCode vs GitHub","installation de HookCode","guide de configuration de HookCode"],"de":["wie man HookCode verwendet","was ist Code-Automatisierung","Alternativen zu HookCode","HookCode vs GitHub","Installation von HookCode","Konfigurationsanleitung für HookCode"],"pt":["como usar hookcode","o que é hookcode","alternativas ao hookcode","hookcode vs github","instalar hookcode","guia de configuração do hookcode","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","revisão de código automática"],"ru":["как использовать hookcode","что такое hookcode","альтернативы hookcode","hookcode vs github","установить hookcode","руководство по настройке hookcode","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","автоматический код-ревью"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام hookcode","ما هو hookcode","بديلات hookcode","hookcode مقابل github","تثبيت hookcode","دليل إعداد hookcode","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","مراجعة الكود الآلية"]}},"owner":"hookvibe","repo":"hookcode","repoPath":"hookvibe/hookcode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.965Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hookcode-preview-highlight","description":"End-to-end workflow for HookCode preview DOM highlighting check/start/stop previews, install dependencies, send highlight commands, and verify preview bridge readiness via PAT-authenticated APIs. Use when debugging cross-origin preview iframes, validating bridge integration, or scripting highlight requests against task-group previews.","tags":"","bodyPreview":"<!-- Add tags metadata for built-in skill filtering. docs/en/developer/plans/skills-registry-20260225/task_plan.md skills-registry-20260225 -->\n\n# Hookcode Preview Highlight\n\n\n## Overview\n\n\nThis skill ships JS request scripts (with `.env` loading) and protocol notes for the complete preview highlight flow: check preview status, start previews, install dependencies if needed, send highlight commands, and stop previews after debugging. It also explains the bridge handshake required for cross-origi","body":"<!-- Add tags metadata for built-in skill filtering. docs/en/developer/plans/skills-registry-20260225/task_plan.md skills-registry-20260225 -->\n\n# Hookcode Preview Highlight\n\n\n## Overview\n\n\nThis skill ships JS request scripts (with `.env` loading) and protocol notes for the complete preview highlight flow: check preview status, start previews, install dependencies if needed, send highlight commands, and stop previews after debugging. It also explains the bridge handshake required for cross-origin iframes so you can confirm whether highlight commands are actually reaching the preview DOM. Selector rules now include CSS selectors plus text/attribute matchers (for example `text:Save`, `attr:data-testid=cta`, `data:testid=cta`, `aria:label=Search`, `role:button`, or loose `data-testid=cta`). If a highlight command includes `targetUrl`, the preview UI will auto-navigate to that URL (and push it to the iframe history) unless the user locks auto-navigation in the toolbar. Target URL matching now supports route patterns like `:id`, `*`, `**`, hash/query wildcards, and `||` alternatives to avoid unnecessary navigation.\n<!-- Document auto-navigation + lock behavior for highlight target URLs. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n<!-- Document selector matcher rules in the skill overview. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n<!-- Document advanced targetUrl route matching rules in the skill overview. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Query preview status to discover instance names and availability before highlighting.\n- Start preview instances or install dependencies when the dev server is missing.\n- Send highlight commands with selector/mode/color/padding/scroll options via the backend API.\n- Send optional bubble tooltip payloads alongside highlights (text + placement + theme).\n- Provide CLI flags that map one-to-one with highlight + bubble payload fields.\n<!-- Expand highlight capability coverage to include bubble payloads. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n- Support selector matcher rules like `text:`, `attr:`, `data:`, `aria:`, `role:`, and `testid:` when CSS selectors are not enough.\n<!-- Describe selector matcher capabilities for highlight requests. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- Auto-navigate previews when `targetUrl` is supplied, with a lock toggle and route-matching rules to keep the current URL stable.\n<!-- Explain auto-navigation support in the preview highlight skill. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- Verify bridge readiness by checking `subscribers` and bridge error responses.\n- Stop previews after debugging to free ports and resources.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Copy `.env.example` → `.env` inside this skill folder and fill in `HOOKCODE_API_BASE_URL`, `HOOKCODE_PAT`, and `HOOKCODE_TASK_GROUP_ID` (optional: `HOOKCODE_PREVIEW_INSTANCE`).\n2. Fetch preview status to confirm instance names:\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_status.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n3. Send a highlight command (highlight parameters must be passed via CLI flags):\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_highlight.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId> \\\n  --instance app \\\n  --selector \".page-kicker\"\n```\n\n4. Send a highlight + bubble command:\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_highlight.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId> \\\n  --instance app \\\n  --selector \".page-kicker\" \\\n  --target-url \"/add\" \\\n  --bubble-text \"Update this headline\" \\\n  --bubble-placement right \\\n  --bubble-theme dark\n```\n<!-- Document bubble highlight example for CLI usage. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n\nSet these in `.env` (or override via CLI flags). Highlight-specific options are CLI-only.\n\n| Variable | Purpose | Used by |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `HOOKCODE_API_BASE_URL` | Base URL of the HookCode backend (for example `http://127.0.0.1:4000`). | All scripts |\n| `HOOKCODE_PAT` | PAT token for API authentication. | All scripts |\n| `HOOKCODE_TASK_GROUP_ID` | Default task group id to target. | All scripts |\n| `HOOKCODE_PREVIEW_INSTANCE` | Default preview instance name (for example `app`). | `preview_highlight.mjs` |\n\n## Operations (HTTP)\n\n### 1) Get preview status\n\n**Endpoint**: `GET /api/task-groups/:id/preview/status`\n\n**Purpose**: Confirm the preview is configured, see instance names, and check `running/starting` status before highlighting.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_status.mjs`\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_status.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n### 2) Start preview\n\n**Endpoint**: `POST /api/task-groups/:id/preview/start`\n\n**Purpose**: Start all configured preview instances so the highlight API can reach a running dev server.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_start.mjs`\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_start.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n### 3) Install preview dependencies\n\n**Endpoint**: `POST /api/task-groups/:id/preview/dependencies/install`\n\n**Purpose**: Run dependency installation without starting the dev server. Use this when highlight requests fail because the dev server never started.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_dependencies_install.mjs`\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_dependencies_install.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n### 4) Send highlight command\n\n**Endpoint**: `POST /api/task-groups/:id/preview/:instance/highlight`\n\n**Purpose**: Forward a DOM highlight command to the preview iframe bridge.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_highlight.mjs`\n\n**Parameters**:\n- `selector` (required): CSS selector to highlight (max length 200); supports matcher rules like `text:`, `attr:`, `data:`, `aria:`, `role:`, `testid:`, or loose `data-testid=...`.\n<!-- Document selector matcher rules in the parameter list. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- `targetUrl` (optional): preview URL or path to navigate to before highlighting; matching supports `:param`, `*`, `**`, query/hash wildcards (e.g. `/users/:id?tab=*`), and `||` alternatives (first entry is used for navigation).\n<!-- Document target URL route matching behavior in the parameter list. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n\n**TargetUrl matching rules**:\n- `:param` matches a single path segment (e.g. `/users/:id`).\n- `*` matches any characters within a segment; `**` matches across segments (e.g. `/projects/**/settings`).\n- Query rules only require params you declare; use `?tab` for any value or `?tab=*` for wildcard values.\n- Hash rules accept wildcards like `#section-*`.\n- `||` separates alternatives; the first entry is used for navigation if auto-navigation is needed.\n<!-- Detail targetUrl route matching rules in the skill docs. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- `padding` (optional): number of pixels around the element (0-64, default 4).\n- `color` (optional): CSS color string for outline/glow (max length 40).\n- `mode` (optional): `outline` or `mask` (default `outline`).\n- `scrollIntoView` (optional): `true`/`false` (default `false`).\n- `bubble` (optional): object for tooltip rendering near the highlight.\n  - `text` (required when bubble provided): text content to display (1-280 chars).\n  - `placement` (optional): `top` | `right` | `bottom` | `left` | `auto` (default `auto`); auto prefers bottom/top and flips when space is insufficient to avoid clipping.\n  <!-- Document bubble placement flipping rules to avoid clipped tooltips. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n  - `align` (optional): `start` | `center` | `end` (default `center`).\n  - `offset` (optional): number of pixels between highlight and bubble (0-64, default `10`).\n  - `maxWidth` (optional): max width in px (120-640, default `320`).\n  - `theme` (optional): `dark` | `light` (default `dark`).\n  - `background` (optional): bubble background CSS color override.\n  - `textColor` (optional): bubble text color override.\n  - `borderColor` (optional): bubble border color override.\n  - `radius` (optional): bubble corner radius in px (0-24, default `12`).\n  - `arrow` (optional): `true`/`false` to show the pointer (default `true`).\n- `requestId` (optional): client-defined id for tracking.\n<!-- Expand highlight parameter docs to include bubble payload fields. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n\n**Response**:\n- `success`, `requestId`, `subscribers`, and optional `targetUrl` echo for navigation-aware clients.\n<!-- Document highlight response fields including targetUrl echo. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_highlight.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId> \\\n  --instance app \\\n  --selector \".page-kicker\" \\\n  --mode outline \\\n  --color \"#ff4d4f\" \\\n  --padding 4 \\\n  --scroll true \\\n  --bubble-text \"Edit this title\" \\\n  --bubble-placement top \\\n  --bubble-align center \\\n  --bubble-offset 12 \\\n  --bubble-theme dark\n```\n<!-- Add bubble flag example to highlight CLI sample. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n\n### 5) Stop preview\n\n**Endpoint**: `POST /api/task-groups/:id/preview/stop`\n\n**Purpose**: Stop preview instances after debugging to free ports and resources.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_stop.mjs`\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_stop.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n## Bridge requirements (must be installed in the preview app)\n\n- Copy `shared/preview-bridge.js` into the preview project and import it in the app entry file.\n- The bridge answers a `hookcode:preview:ping` handshake from HookCode. Only after the handshake does the frontend forward highlight commands.\n- A highlight API response with `subscribers: 0` usually means the preview UI is not connected or the bridge did not answer the ping.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **`preview_not_running`** (409): Start the preview first or check the instance name.\n- **`selector_required` / `selector_not_found`** (response from bridge): verify the selector exists in the preview DOM.\n- The bridge now retries selector resolution with `querySelectorAll`, simple id/class/tag fallbacks, and open shadow-root scans; when in doubt, send a stable CSS selector that maps to a visible element.\n<!-- Note selector fallback strategies in troubleshooting guidance. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- If a `targetUrl` is supplied but the preview does not navigate, check whether the auto-navigation lock button is enabled in the preview toolbar.\n<!-- Document auto-navigation lock behavior in troubleshooting guidance. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- **`bubble_text_required`**: a bubble payload was supplied without valid `text`.\n- **`fetch failed`**: the backend is unreachable; check `HOOKCODE_API_BASE_URL` and local network access.\n- **`subscribers: 0`**: the preview UI is not listening or the bridge script is missing.\n<!-- Document bubble-specific error messaging. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n\n## References\n\n- `references/highlight-protocol.md` for full protocol details and bridge message formats.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:51:36.259Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated code review and preview highlighting capabilities through Webhooks and CLI coding assistants.","zh":"非常适合需要通过Webhooks和CLI编码助手实现自动代码审查和预览突出显示功能的开发代理。","ja":"WebhooksとCLIコーディングアシスタントを介して自動コードレビューとプレビューのハイライト機能を実現する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Webhooks와 CLI 코딩 도우미를 통해 자동 코드 리뷰 및 미리보기 하이라이트 기능을 구현해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan revisión de código automatizada y capacidades de resaltado de vista previa a través de Webhooks y asistentes de codificación de CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une revue de code automatisée et des fonctionnalités de mise en évidence de l''aperçu via des Webhooks et des assistants de codage CLI.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Code-Überprüfung und Vorschau-Hervorhebungs-Funktionen über Webhooks und CLI-Coding-Assistenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de revisão de código automatizada e capacidades de realce de pré-visualização por meio de Webhooks e assistentes de codificação CLI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима автоматизированная проверка кода и возможности предварительного выделения через Webhooks и помощники кодирования CLI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطيين الذين يحتاجون إلى مراجعة 코드 آلية وقدرات تمييز معاينة من خلال Webhooks ومرافقي تعليمات CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger CLI coding assistants through conversations, send highlight commands, and monitor real-time task execution using protocol notes and JS request scripts with .env loading, enabling seamless preview highlight flow and cross-origin bridge handshakes.","zh":"赋予代理通过对话触发CLI编码助手、发送突出显示命令并使用协议笔记和JS请求脚本（带有.env加载）监视实时任务执行的能力，从而实现无缝的预览突出显示流程和跨源桥接握手。","ja":"エージェントが会話を介してCLIコーディングアシスタントをトリガーし、ハイライトコマンドを送信し、プロトコルノートとJSリクエストスクリプト（.envロードを使用）を使用してリアルタイムのタスク実行を監視する機能を提供し、シームレスなプレビューのハイライトフローとクロスオリジンブリッジのハンドシェイクを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 대화를 통해 CLI 코딩 도우미를 트리거하고 하이라이트 명령을 보내고 프로토콜 노트 및 JS 요청 스크립트(.env 로딩 사용)를 통해 실시간 작업 실행을 모니터링 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 無шов한预览 하이라이트 흐름 및 크로스 오리진 브리지 핸드シェ이크를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para activar asistentes de codificación de CLI a través de conversaciones, enviar comandos de resaltado y monitorear la ejecución de tareas en tiempo real utilizando notas de protocolo y scripts de solicitud JS con carga de .env, lo que permite un flujo de resaltado de vista previa sin problemas y apretones de manos de puente de origen cruzado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclencher des assistants de codage CLI via des conversations, d''envoyer des commandes de mise en évidence et de surveiller l''exécution des tâches en temps réel à l''aide de notes de protocole et de scripts de requête JS avec chargement de .env, ce qui permet un flux de mise en évidence de l''aperçu sans accroc et des poignées de main de pont d''origine croisée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, CLI-Coding-Assistenten über Konversationen auszulösen, Hervorhebungsbefehle zu senden und die Ausführung von Aufgaben in Echtzeit mit Hilfe von Protokollnotizen und JS-Anfrage-Skripten mit .env-Ladefunktion zu überwachen, was einen nahtlosen Vorschau-Hervorhebungs-Fluss und Cross-Origin-Brückenhandschlag ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acionar assistentes de codificação CLI por meio de conversas, enviar comandos de realce e monitorar a execução de tarefas em tempo real usando notas de protocolo e scripts de solicitação JS com carregamento .env, permitindo um fluxo de realce de pré-visualização sem problemas e apertos de mão de ponte de origem cruzada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать помощники кодирования CLI через разговоры, отправлять команды выделения и отслеживать выполнение задач в реальном времени с помощью заметок протокола и скриптов запроса JS с загрузкой .env, обеспечивая бесшовный поток предварительного выделения и рукопожатия моста перекрестного происхождения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل مساعدي الترميز CLI من خلال المحادثات وإرسال أوامر التمييز ومراقبة تنفيذ المهام في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام ملاحظات البروتوكول و스크рип特ات JS مع تحميل .env ، مما يتيح تدفق معاينة التمييز دون مشاكل وتصافح الجسر الأصلي المتقاطع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code review processes through Webhooks","Generating preview highlights for debugging purposes","Installing dependencies and sending highlight commands for efficient development"],"zh":["通过Webhooks实现代码审查流程的自动化","为调试目的生成预览突出显示","安装依赖项并发送突出显示命令以实现高效开发"],"ja":["Webhooksを介してコードレビュー処理の自動化","デバッグ目的のプレビューのハイライトの生成","依存関係のインストールとハイライトコマンドの送信による効率的な開発"],"ko":["Webhooks를 통해 코드 리뷰 프로세スの 자동화","디버깅 목적을 위한 미리보기 하이라이트 생성","의존성 설치 및 하이라이트 명령 전송을 통한 효율적인 개발"],"es":["Automatizar procesos de revisión de código a través de Webhooks","Generar resaltados de vista previa para fines de depuración","Instalar dependencias y enviar comandos de resaltado para un desarrollo eficiente"],"fr":["Automatiser les processus d''examen de code via des Webhooks","Générer des mises en évidence de l''aperçu pour des fins de débogage","Installer des dépendances et envoyer des commandes de mise en évidence pour un développement efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Überprüfungsprozessen über Webhooks","Erzeugen von Vorschau-Hervorhebungen für Debugging-Zwecke","Installieren von Abhängigkeiten und Senden von Hervorhebungsbefehlen für effizientes Entwickeln"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de revisão de código por meio de Webhooks","Gerar realces de pré-visualização para fins de depuração","Instalar dependências e enviar comandos de realce para desenvolvimento eficiente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы проверки кода через Webhooks","Генерировать предварительные выделения для целей отладки","Устанавливать зависимости и отправлять команды выделения для эффективной разработки"],"ar":["توفير عمليات مراجعة الكود من خلال Webhooks","توليد معاينات تمييز للغرض من تصحيح الأخطاء","تثبيت التبعيات وإرسال أوامر التمييز من أجل التطوير الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires independent deployment setup","Needs Webhook configuration for automated triggering"],"zh":["需要独立的部署设置","需要Webhook配置以实现自动触发"],"ja":["独立したデプロイ設定の必要性","自動トリガーのためにWebhookの設定が必要"],"ko":["독립적인 배포 설정의 필요성","자동 트리거를 위한 Webhook 구성의 필요성"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de implementación independiente","Necesita configuración de Webhook para activación automática"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''installation indépendante","A besoin d''une configuration de Webhook pour un déclenchement automatique"],"de":["Benötigt eine unabhängige Bereitstellungs-Einrichtung","Benötigt Webhook-Konfiguration für automatisches Auslösen"],"pt":["Requer configuração de implantação independente","Necessita de configuração de Webhook para acionamento automatizado"],"ru":["Требует независимой настройки развертывания","Требует настройки Webhook для автоматического запуска"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تركيب مستقل","يحتاج إلى إعداد الويب هوك للتشغيل التلقائي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"91d5ceadec9f13c1c2e53ea3fe90d401bbcc05441a0c552843d48f4c7021cbc2","qualityScore":39}');
