-Tools: doc-maintenance für Minecraft","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: doc-maintenance para Minecraft","ru":"ИИ Агенты: doc-maintenance для Minecraft","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: doc-maintenance لمايﾝكرافت","en":"doc-maintenance"},"description":{"zh":"doc-maintenance是一个Minecraft时间维度模组，添加了Chrono Dawn时间主题世界，支持Fabric和NeoForge","ja":"doc-maintenanceはMinecraftの時間テーマワールドを追加するモッドで、FabricとNeoForgeをサポート","ko":"doc-maintenance는 마인크래프트 시간 차원 모드로서 Chrono Dawn 시간 테마 월드를 추가하며 Fabric와 NeoForge를 지원","es":"Doc-maintenance es una herramienta de IA para Minecraft que agrega un mundo de tiempo con portales personalizados y batallas de jefes","fr":"Doc-maintenance est un outil d''IA pour Minecraft qui ajoute un monde de temps avec des portails personnalisés et des batailles de boss","de":"Doc-maintenance ist ein KI-Tool für Minecraft, das eine Zeitwelt mit benutzerdefinierten Portalen und Bosskämpfen hinzufügt","pt":"O mod doc-maintenance adiciona um mundo temático de tempo ao Minecraft com portais personalizados e artefatos de manipulação do tempo","ru":"Мод doc-maintenance добавляет время-тематический мир в Minecraft с кастомными порталами и артефактами манипуляции временем","ar":"يضيف مود doc-maintenance عالمًا محوريًا للزمن إلى مايﾝكرافت مع بوابات مخصصة وتحف من يمانيبولات الوقت","en":"🕰️ A dimension mod for Minecraft that adds Chrono Dawn, a time-themed world with custom portals, boss battles, and time-manipulating artifacts. Supports Fab..."},"definition":{"en":"🕰️ A dimension mod for Minecraft that adds Chrono Dawn, a time-themed world with custom portals, boss battles, and time-manipulating artifacts. Supports Fabric & NeoForge."},"features":{"zh":["自定义传送门","boss战","时间操纵神器","支持Fabric和NeoForge","时间主题世界","Chrono Dawn世界"],"ja":["カスタムポータル","ボスバトル","時間操作アーティファクト","FabricとNeoForgeのサポート","時間テーマワールド","Chrono Dawnワールド"],"ko":["커스텀 포털","보스 전투","시간 조작 아티팩트","Fabric와 NeoForge 지원","시간 테마 월드","Chrono Dawn 월드"],"es":["Mundo de tiempo con portales personalizados","Batallas de jefes y artefactos que m