mgebung","Verbesserung der Stabilität und Leistung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Überwachung und Analyse der Haltbarkeit","nachhaltige Entwicklungspraktiken","wie man die Haltbarkeit von Homelab verbessert","KI-Tools für die Haltbarkeit von Homelab"],"pt":["como melhorar a durabilidade do homelab","ferramentas de durabilidade do homelab","agentes de IA para homelab","homelab vs laboratório profissional","instalação do homelab","guia de configuração do homelab","otimização do desempenho do homelab","soluções de backup e recuperação para homelab"],"ru":["как улучшить надежность homelab","инструменты надежности homelab","ИИ агенты для homelab","homelab vs профессиональная лаборатория","установка homelab","руководство по настройке homelab","оптимизация производительности homelab","решения для резервного копирования и восстановления homelab"],"ar":["كيفية تحسين متانة homelab","أدوات متانة homelab","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لhomelab","homelab مقابل مختبر احترافي","تثبيت homelab","دليل إعداد homelab","تحسين أداء homelab","حلول النسخ الاحتياطي والاستعادة لhomelab"]}},"owner":"bebopbabailey","repo":"homelab-llm","repoPath":"bebopbabailey/homelab-llm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.996Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"homelab-durability","description":"Enforce docs-first, minimal-contract, validation-heavy workflow; prevent cross-host mistakes and scope creep.","bodyPreview":"# Homelab Durability\n\n## Sources of Truth (Must read first)\n- docs/_core/OPERATING_MODEL.md\n- docs/_core/SOURCES_OF_TRUTH.md\n- docs/_core/CHANGE_RULES.md\n- docs/foundation/operating-rhythm.md\n- layer-gateway/CONSTRAINTS.md\n- docs/foundation/topology.md\n- docs/PLATFORM_DOSSIER.md\n\n## Execution Contract (Strict)\n\n## Defaults (Conservative)\n- Download approval threshold: 500MB.\n- Disk check required before any model download/cache action or any explicitly large (>5GB) action: YES.\n- Host confirmati","body":"# Homelab Durability\n\n## Sources of Truth (Must read first)\n- docs/_core/OPERATING_MODEL.md\n- docs/_core/SOURCES_OF_TRUTH.md\n- docs/_core/CHANGE_RULES.md\n- docs/foundation/operating-rhythm.md\n- layer-gateway/CONSTRAINTS.md\n- docs/foundation/topology.md\n- docs/PLATFORM_DOSSIER.md\n\n## Execution Contract (Strict)\n\n## Defaults (Conservative)\n- Download approval threshold: 500MB.\n- Disk check required before any model download/cache action or any explicitly large (>5GB) action: YES.\n- Host confirmation: strict for ops commands, but may be treated as sticky within the same session after explicit confirmation.\n- Violations: HARD-BLOCK for MLX/disk/host/file-list rules; WARN for stylistic rules.\n\n## Workflow Rules (Behavioral)\n- Use `SCRATCH_PAD.md` only when the user asks. This is mainly for use if user needs to run \n  commands themselves or asks to review commands/outputs/diffs; otherwise inline is acceptable.\n- `NOW.md` must reflect the active development task; update it when the active work changes.\n- `NOW.md` contains only active work + a single “NEXT UP” section. Everything else goes to `BACKLOG.md`.\n- Journal entries are append-only. Do not move or delete files in `docs/journal/`.\n  If a correction is needed, add a new dated entry and update `docs/journal/index.md`.\n\n### Required startup declarations\nEvery response MUST begin by stating:\n1) **Host** (Mini vs Studio vs Orin)\n2) **Scope** (layer/service)\n3) **Files** (explicit list of intended files to change)\n\n### Hard-block rules (must refuse)\n- No multi-file edits without an explicit file list.\n- No ops commands unless **Host Check** is explicitly satisfied in the same response.\n- No restarts/service modifications unless **Stage = Validate** and a rollback is specified.\n- No disk repair / fsck / apfs repair / partition changes without explicit user approval.\n- MLX backends: MUST use `mlxctl` + registry as source of truth. No ad-hoc edits or direct `mlx-openai-server` control unless explicitly authorized.\n- Any download/cache/model pull > 500MB requires explicit user approval.\n\n### Disk guardrail\n- Before any model download/cache action or any explicitly large (>5GB) action, require a disk free check command suggestion and STOP until user confirms.\n\n### Default stance\n- Default to read-only inspection first.\n\n### Host Check (required before ops commands)\n- Explicitly confirm target host and its role.\n- If not confirmed, STOP and ask for confirmation.\n\n## Preferred Operating Rhythm\nInventory → Constraints → Minimal contract → Wire → Validate → Codify → Prune\n\n## Output Format (Required)\nMode: Discover|Design|Build|Verify\nStage: Inventory|Constraints|Minimal Contract|Wire|Validate|Codify|Prune\nHost: <explicit>\nScope: <layer/service>\nProposed Change: <one paragraph>\nFiles: <explicit list>\nCommands: <copy/paste safe; no wrapped lines>\nValidation: <commands>\nRollback: <commands>\n\n## How to use\n- Invoke by name: \"use homelab-durability\"\n- Behavior changes:\n  - Host check gate before any ops commands\n  - File list gate before edits\n  - Validation gate requires rollback for restarts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:04:25.538Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Infrastructure Agents requiring robust homelab setup and maintenance capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要强大家庭实验室设置和维护功能的基础设施Agent。","ja":"堅牢なホームラボのセットアップとメンテナンス機能を必要とするInfrastructure Agentに理想的です。","ko":"강력한 홈랩 설정 및 유지 관리 기능이 필요한 Infrastructure Agent에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Infrastructure Agents que requieren capacidades robustas de configuración y mantenimiento de homelab.","fr":"Idéal pour les Infrastructure Agents nécessitant des capacités robustes de configuration et de maintenance de homelab.","de":"Ideal für Infrastructure Agents, die robuste Fähigkeiten zur Einrichtung und Wartung eines Homelabs erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Infraestrutura que requerem capacidades robustas de configuração e manutenção de homelab.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Инфраструктурных Агентов, требующих надежных возможностей настройки и обслуживания домашней лаборатории (homelab).","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء البنية التحتية الذين يتطلبون إمكانيات قوية لإعداد وصيانة المعمل المنزلي (homelab)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict execution contracts, utilize conservative defaults such as download approval thresholds and disk checks, and adhere to sources of truth like OPERATING_MODEL and SOURCES_OF_TRUTH documents, ensuring durability and reliability in homelab environments through protocols like operating rhythms and topology management.","zh":"使Agent能够强制执行严格的执行合约，利用保守的默认设置（如下载批准阈值和磁盘检查），并遵守诸如OPERATING_MODEL和SOURCES_OF_TRUTH文档之类的单一事实来源，通过操作节奏和拓扑管理等协议确保家庭实验室环境的耐久性和可靠性。","ja":"Agentが厳格な実行契約を強制し、ダウンロード承認しきい値やディスクチェックなどの保守的なデフォルトを利用し、OPERATING_MODELやSOURCES_OF_TRUTHドキュメントなどの信頼できる情報源に従うことを可能にし、オペレーティングリズムやトポロジ管理などのプロトコルを通じてホームラボ環境の耐久性と信頼性を確保します。","ko":"Agent가 엄격한 실행 계약을 적용하고, 다운로드 승인 임계값 및 디스크 확인과 같은 보수적인 기본값을 활용하며, OPERATING_MODEL 및 SOURCES_OF_TRUTH 문서와 같은 단일 진실 소스를 준수하도록 지원하여 운영 리듬 및 토폴로지 관리와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 홈랩 환경의 내구성과 신뢰성을 보장합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para hacer cumplir contratos de ejecución estrictos, utilizar configuraciones predeterminadas conservadoras como umbrales de aprobación de descarga y comprobaciones de disco, y adherirse a fuentes de verdad como los documentos OPERATING_MODEL y SOURCES_OF_TRUTH, garantizando durabilidad y confiabilidad en entornos de homelab a través de protocolos como ritmos operativos y gestión de topología.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire appliquer des contrats d''exécution stricts, d''utiliser des paramètres par défaut conservateurs tels que les seuils d''approbation de téléchargement et les vérifications de disque, et de respecter des sources de vérité comme les documents OPERATING_MODEL et SOURCES_OF_TRUTH, garantissant ainsi la durabilité et la fiabilité dans les environnements homelab grâce à des protocoles tels que les rythmes opérationnels et la gestion de topologie.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, strikte Ausführungsverträge durchzusetzen, konservative Standardeinstellungen wie Download-Genehmigungsschwellenwerte und Plattenprüfungen zu nutzen und sich an Single Sources of Truth wie OPERATING_MODEL- und SOURCES_OF_TRUTH-Dokumente zu halten, wodurch durch Protokolle wie Betriebsrhythmen und Topologieverwaltung Dauerhaftigkeit und Zuverlässigkeit in Homelab-Umgebungen sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a impor contratos de execução estritos, utilizar padrões conservadores, como limites de aprovação de download e verificações de disco, e aderir a fontes de verdade como documentos OPERATING_MODEL e SOURCES_OF_TRUTH, garantindo durabilidade e confiabilidade em ambientes de homelab por meio de protocolos como ritmos operacionais e gerenciamento de topologia.","ru":"Позволяет агентам применять строгие контракты выполнения, использовать консервативные настройки по умолчанию, такие как пороги одобрения загрузки и проверки диска, и придерживаться источников истины, таких как документы OPERATING_MODEL и SOURCES_OF_TRUTH, обеспечивая долговечность и надежность в средах домашней лаборатории (homelab) с помощью таких протоколов, как операционные ритмы и управление топологией.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من فرض عقود تنفيذ صارمة، واستخدام الإعدادات الافتراضية المحافظة مثل عتبات الموافقة على التنزيل وفحوصات القرص، والالتزام بمصادر الحقيقة مثل وثائق OPERATING_MODEL وSOURCES_OF_TRUTH، مما يضمن المتانة والموثوقية في بيئات المعمل المنزلي (homelab) من خلال بروتوكولات مثل الإيقاعات التشغيلية وإدارة التوبولوجيا."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing download approval thresholds for large files","Implementing disk checks before model downloads or cache actions","Managing operating rhythms and topology for homelab durability"],"zh":["对大文件执行下载批准阈值","在模型下载或缓存操作前实施磁盘检查","管理操作节奏和拓扑以确保家庭实验室的耐久性"],"ja":["大きなファイルに対するダウンロード承認しきい値の実施","モデルのダウンロードやキャッシュアクション前のディスクチェックの実装","ホームラボの耐久性のためのオペレーティングリズムとトポロジの管理"],"ko":["대용량 파일에 대한 다운로드 승인 임계값 적용","모델 다운로드 또는 캐시 작업 전 디스크 확인 구현","홈랩 내구성을 위한 운영 리듬 및 토폴로지 관리"],"es":["Hacer cumplir umbrales de aprobación de descarga para archivos grandes","Implementar comprobaciones de disco antes de descargas de modelos o acciones de caché","Gestionar ritmos operativos y topología para la durabilidad del homelab"],"fr":["Application des seuils d''approbation de téléchargement pour les fichiers volumineux","Mise en œuvre de vérifications de disque avant les téléchargements de modèles ou les actions de cache","Gestion des rythmes opérationnels et de la topologie pour la durabilité du homelab"],"de":["Durchsetzung von Download-Genehmigungsschwellenwerten für große Dateien","Implementierung von Plattenprüfungen vor Modell-Downloads oder Cache-Aktionen","Verwaltung von Betriebsrhythmen und Topologie für die Dauerhaftigkeit des Homelabs"],"pt":["Fazer cumprir os limites de aprovação de download para arquivos grandes","Implementar verificações de disco antes de downloads de modelos ou ações de cache","Gerenciar ritmos operacionais e topologia para a durabilidade do homelab"],"ru":["Применение порогов одобрения загрузки для больших файлов","Выполнение проверок диска перед загрузкой моделей или действиями с кешем","Управление операционными ритмами и топологией для обеспечения долговечности домашней лаборатории (homelab)"],"ar":["فرض عتبات الموافقة على التنزيل للملفات الكبيرة","تنفيذ فحوصات القرص قبل تنزيل النماذج أو إجراءات الذاكرة المخبأة","إدارة الإيقاعات التشغيلية والتوبولوجيا لمتانة المعمل المنزلي (homelab)"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to defined sources of truth","Needs host confirmation for large actions","Imposes a download approval threshold of 500MB"],"zh":["需要严格遵守定义的单一事実来源","大型操作需要主机确认","设置了500MB的下载批准阈值"],"ja":["定義された信頼できる情報源への厳格な遵守が必要","大規模なアクションにはホストの確認が必要","500MBのダウンロード承認しきい値を課す"],"ko":["정의된 단일 진실 소스를 엄격히 준수해야 함","대규모 작업에 대한 호스트 확인이 필요함","500MB의 다운로드 승인 임계값을 적용함"],"es":["Requiere una adherencia estricta a las fuentes de verdad definidas","Necesita confirmación del host para acciones grandes","Impone un umbral de aprobación de descarga de 500MB"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte aux sources de vérité définies","Nécessite une confirmation de l''hôte pour les actions importantes","Impose un seuil d''approbation de téléchargement de 500 Mo"],"de":["Erfordert strikte Einhaltung der definierten Single Sources of Truth","Erfordert Host-Bestätigung für umfangreiche Aktionen","Legt einen Download-Genehmigungsschwellenwert von 500 MB fest"],"pt":["Requer adesão estrita às fontes de verdade definidas","Requer confirmação do host para ações grandes","Impõe um limite de aprovação de download de 500MB"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения определенных источников истины","Требует подтверждения от хоста для крупных действий","Устанавливает порог одобрения загрузки в 500 МБ"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام الصارم بمصادر الحقيقة المحددة","يتطلب تأكيد من المضيف للإجراءات الكبيرة","يفرض عتبة موافقة على التنزيل بقيمة 500 ميجابايت"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8b26cf3b7e9125bcff57eacfab7017af4a70d2d77c41025e5031ecb2d7c029c7","qualityScore":39}');
