 إس","أفضل الممارسات للمطورين","التكامل مع المكتبات الأخرى","أمثلة من التعليمات البرمجية للبدء","دعم مجتمع المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vue.js 最佳实践","AI 工具","检测离线和在线变化","优化应用程序的性能","提高用户体验","Vue.js 框架","如何使用 Vue.js","Vue.js 教程"],"ja":["Vue.js ベストプラクティス","AI エージェント","オフラインとオンラインの変更を検出","アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","Vue.js フレームワーク","Vue.js の使い方","Vue.js チュートリアル"],"ko":["Vue.js 최적화 방법","AI 에이전트","오프라인 및 온라인 변경을 감지","애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화","사용자 경험을 향상시키는","Vue.js 프레임워크","Vue.js 사용 방법","Vue.js 튜토리얼"],"es":["VueJS","detección de cambios","offline y online","mejores prácticas","componente simple"],"fr":["VueJS","détectection de changements","offline et online","meilleures pratiques","composant simple"],"de":["VueJS","Erkennung von Offline- und Online-Änderungen","beste Praktiken","einfacher Komponente"],"pt":["ferramentas de inteligência artificial","melhores práticas vue","detecção de mudanças offline e online","vuejs","desenvolvimento web","como usar vuejs","o que é vuejs","vuejs vs react","instalar vuejs","guia de configuração vuejs"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","лучшие практики для vue","обнаружение изменений онлайн и оффлайн","vuejs","веб-разработка","как использовать vuejs","что такое vuejs","vuejs vs react","установить vuejs","руководство по настройке vuejs"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أفضل الممارسات لفيو","اكتشاف التغييرات غير متصل بالإنترنت ومتصل بالإنترنت","فيو جيه إس","تطوير الويب","كيفية استخدام فيو جيه إس","ما هي فيو جيه إس","فيو جيه إس مقابل رياكت","تثبيت فيو جيه إس","دليل إعداد فيو جيه إس"]}},"owner":"vinayakkulkarni","repo":"v-offline","repoPath":"vinayakkulkarni/v-offline","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.014Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue-best-practices","description":"Vue.js performance optimization guidelines for building fast, maintainable applications. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring Vue.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving Vue components, reactivity, Composition API, state management, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vue Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Vue.js applications. Contains 40+ rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Vue components\n- Implementing reactive state and computed properties\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing Vue code\n- Optimizing rendering and re-renders\n- Working with Composition API or Options API\n\n##","body":"# Vue Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Vue.js applications. Contains 40+ rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Vue components\n- Implementing reactive state and computed properties\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing Vue code\n- Optimizing rendering and re-renders\n- Working with Composition API or Options API\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Reactivity Fundamentals | CRITICAL | `reactivity-` |\n| 2 | Component Performance | CRITICAL | `component-` |\n| 3 | Computed & Watchers | HIGH | `computed-` |\n| 4 | Template Optimization | MEDIUM-HIGH | `template-` |\n| 5 | Composition API Patterns | MEDIUM | `composable-` |\n| 6 | State Management | MEDIUM | `state-` |\n| 7 | Async & Data Fetching | LOW-MEDIUM | `async-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Reactivity Fundamentals (CRITICAL)\n\n- `reactivity-ref-vs-reactive` - Use ref() for primitives, reactive() for objects\n- `reactivity-avoid-destructure` - Don''t destructure reactive objects\n- `reactivity-toRefs` - Use toRefs() when destructuring is needed\n- `reactivity-shallowRef` - Use shallowRef() for large non-reactive data\n- `reactivity-raw-values` - Use toRaw() for read-only operations on large data\n\n### 2. Component Performance (CRITICAL)\n\n- `component-v-once` - Use v-once for static content\n- `component-v-memo` - Use v-memo for expensive list items\n- `component-async` - Use defineAsyncComponent for heavy components\n- `component-keep-alive` - Cache component state with KeepAlive\n- `component-functional` - Prefer functional components for stateless UI\n\n### 3. Computed & Watchers (HIGH)\n\n- `computed-cache` - Use computed() for derived values, not methods\n- `computed-getter-only` - Avoid setters in computed when possible\n- `computed-dependencies` - Minimize computed dependencies\n- `watch-immediate` - Avoid immediate watchers, use computed instead\n- `watch-deep-avoid` - Avoid deep watchers on large objects\n- `watch-cleanup` - Always cleanup async watchers\n\n### 4. Template Optimization (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `template-v-show-vs-if` - v-show for frequent toggles, v-if for rare\n- `template-key-attribute` - Always use unique keys in v-for\n- `template-avoid-v-if-v-for` - Never use v-if and v-for on same element\n- `template-static-hoisting` - Let compiler hoist static content\n- `template-event-modifiers` - Use event modifiers instead of JS handlers\n\n### 5. Composition API Patterns (MEDIUM)\n\n- `composable-single-responsibility` - One concern per composable\n- `composable-return-refs` - Return refs, not reactive objects\n- `composable-cleanup` - Handle cleanup in composables\n- `composable-lazy-init` - Lazy initialize expensive resources\n- `composable-provide-inject` - Use provide/inject for deep prop drilling\n\n### 6. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `state-pinia-stores` - Split stores by domain\n- `state-getters` - Use getters for computed state\n- `state-actions-mutations` - Keep mutations simple, logic in actions\n- `state-subscription-cleanup` - Cleanup store subscriptions\n\n### 7. Async & Data Fetching (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `async-suspense` - Use Suspense for async component loading\n- `async-error-boundaries` - Handle async errors gracefully\n- `async-stale-while-revalidate` - Implement SWR pattern for data fetching\n- `async-abort-controller` - Cancel pending requests on unmount\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-custom-directives` - Create directives for DOM manipulation\n- `advanced-render-functions` - Use render functions for dynamic templates\n- `advanced-teleport` - Use Teleport for modals and overlays\n- `advanced-transition-groups` - Optimize list transitions\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/reactivity-ref-vs-reactive.md\nrules/component-v-memo.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:09:43.940Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Vue.js application optimization and best practices guidance.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Vue.js应用优化和最佳实践指导的前端代理。","ja":"Vue.jsアプリケーションの高度な最適化とベストプラクティスのガイダンスが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Vue.js 애플리케이션 최적화 및 최선의 지침이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una optimización avanzada de aplicaciones Vue.js y orientación sobre las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée des applications Vue.js et de conseils sur les meilleures pratiques.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Optimierung von Vue.js-Anwendungen und eine Anleitung zu den besten Praktiken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de otimização avançada de aplicativos Vue.js e orientação sobre as melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация приложений Vue.js и рекомендации по лучшим практикам.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين تطبيقات Vue.js المتقدمة وتوجيه لأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize Vue.js applications with 40+ performance optimization rules, prioritized by impact, covering reactive state, computed properties, and rendering optimization using Composition API or Options API.","zh":"赋予代理优化Vue.js应用的能力，具有40+性能优化规则，按影响力优先级排列，涵盖反应状态、计算属性和使用Composition API或Options API的渲染优化。","ja":"エージェントにVue.jsアプリケーションを最適化する能力を与え、影響度に優先順位を付けた40以上のパフォーマンス最適化ルールを提供し、Composition APIまたはOptions APIを使用したリアクティブ状態、計算済みプロパティ、レンダリングの最適化をカバーします。","ko":"에이전트가 Vue.js 애플리케이션을 최적화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 영향력에 따라 우선 순위를 정한 40개 이상의 성능 최적화 규칙을 제공하여 반응 상태, 계산된 속성 및 Composition API 또는 Options API를 사용한 렌더링 최적화를 다룹니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones Vue.js con más de 40 reglas de optimización del rendimiento, priorizadas por impacto, que cubren el estado reactivo, las propiedades computadas y la optimización de representación utilizando Composition API o Options API.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications Vue.js avec plus de 40 règles d''optimisation des performances, priorisées par impact, couvrant l''état réactif, les propriétés calculées et l''optimisation de rendu en utilisant Composition API ou Options API.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Vue.js-Anwendungen mit über 40 Leistungs-Optimierungsregeln zu optimieren, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert sind und reaktiven Zustand, berechnete Eigenschaften und Rendering-Optimierung unter Verwendung von Composition API oder Options API abdecken.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicativos Vue.js com 40+ regras de otimização de desempenho, priorizadas por impacto, abrangendo estado reativo, propriedades computadas e otimização de rendering usando Composition API ou Options API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения Vue.js с 40+ правилами оптимизации производительности, отсортированными по влиянию, охватывающими реактивное состояние, вычисляемые свойства и оптимизацию рендеринга с использованием Composition API или Options API.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين تطبيقات Vue.js مع 40+ قاعدة لتحسين الأداء، يتم تحديد الأولوية لها حسب التأثير، وتغطية الحالة التفاعلية والخصائص المحسوبة وتحسين العرض باستخدام Composition API أو Options API."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code refactoring for better performance","Generating optimized Vue components with improved rendering","Debugging performance issues in existing Vue applications"],"zh":["自动化代码重构以获得更好的性能","生成渲染优化的Vue组件","调试现有Vue应用的性能问题"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの向上のためのコードのリファクタリングの自動化","レンダリングの最適化されたVueコンポーネントの生成","既存のVueアプリケーションのパフォーマンスの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["성능 향상을 위한 코드 리팩토링 자동화","렌더링 최적화된 Vue 컴포넌트 생성","기존 Vue 애플리케이션의 성능 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la refactorización de código para un mejor rendimiento","Generar componentes Vue optimizados con una mejor representación","Depurar problemas de rendimiento en aplicaciones Vue existentes"],"fr":["Automatiser le refactoring de code pour de meilleures performances","Générer des composants Vue optimisés avec un meilleur rendu","Déboguer les problèmes de performances dans les applications Vue existantes"],"de":["Automatisieren des Code-Refactorings für bessere Leistung","Erzeugen von optimierten Vue-Komponenten mit verbesserter Darstellung","Debuggen von Leistungsproblemen in bestehenden Vue-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a refatoração de código para melhor desempenho","Gerar componentes Vue otimizados com renderização aprimorada","Depurar problemas de desempenho em aplicativos Vue existentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рефакторинг кода для лучшей производительности","Генерировать оптимизированные компоненты Vue с улучшенной отрисовкой","Отлаживать проблемы с производительностью в существующих приложениях Vue"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في إعادة هيكلة الشفرة من أجل أداء أفضل","إنتاج مكونات Vue محسنة مع عرض محسّن","تصحيح أخطاء الأداء في تطبيقات Vue الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vue.js application context","Limited to Vue.js ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Vue.js应用程序上下文","仅限于Vue.js生态系统"],"ja":["Vue.jsアプリケーションのコンテキストが必要","Vue.jsエコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["Vue.js 애플리케이션 컨텍스트가 필요","Vue.js 생태계에 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere contexto de aplicación Vue.js","Limitado al ecosistema Vue.js"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte d''application Vue.js","Limité à l''écosystème Vue.js"],"de":["Benötigt Vue.js-Anwendungskontext","Begrenzt auf das Vue.js-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Exige contexto de aplicativo Vue.js","Limitado ao ecossistema Vue.js"],"ru":["Требует контекста приложения Vue.js","Ограничен экосистемой Vue.js"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تطبيق Vue.js","محدود بنظام Vue.js"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bde2d41f8ad8db07c9c029b39917be7427e88a01f27e857b2ca09c72efeb8a3e","qualityScore":39}');
