 GitHub","установить sc-managing-worktrees","руководство по настройке sc-managing-worktrees"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام sc-managing-worktrees","ما هو sc-managing-worktrees","بديل sc-managing-worktrees","sc-managing-worktrees مقابل GitHub","تثبيت sc-managing-worktrees","دليل إعداد sc-managing-worktrees"]}},"owner":"randlee","repo":"synaptic-canvas","repoPath":"randlee/synaptic-canvas","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.076Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sc-managing-worktrees","description":">","version":"0.8.0","bodyPreview":"# Managing Git Worktrees\n\nUse this skill to manage worktrees with a standard structure and tracking. Use the `/sc-git-worktree` command to invoke this skill.\n\n## Agent Delegation\n\nThis skill delegates to specialized agents via the **Task tool**:\n\n| Operation | Agent | Returns |\n|-----------|-------|---------|\n| Create | `sc-worktree-create` | JSON: success, path, branch, tracking_row |\n| Scan | `sc-worktree-scan` | JSON: success, worktrees list, recommendations |\n| Cleanup | `sc-worktree-cleanup","body":"# Managing Git Worktrees\n\nUse this skill to manage worktrees with a standard structure and tracking. Use the `/sc-git-worktree` command to invoke this skill.\n\n## Agent Delegation\n\nThis skill delegates to specialized agents via the **Task tool**:\n\n| Operation | Agent | Returns |\n|-----------|-------|---------|\n| Create | `sc-worktree-create` | JSON: success, path, branch, tracking_row |\n| Scan | `sc-worktree-scan` | JSON: success, worktrees list, recommendations |\n| Cleanup | `sc-worktree-cleanup` | JSON: success, branch_deleted, tracking_update |\n| Abort | `sc-worktree-abort` | JSON: success, worktree_removed, tracking_update |\n| Update | `sc-worktree-update` | JSON: success, commits_pulled, conflicts (if any) |\n\nTo invoke an agent, use the Task tool with:\n- Prompt file: `.claude/agents/<agent-name>.md`\n- Parameters as documented in each agent''s Inputs section\n\n## Standards and paths\n- Repo root: current directory.\n- Default worktree base: `../synaptic-canvas-worktrees`.\n- Worktrees live in `<worktree_base>/<branch>`.\n- Tracking document (if used): `<worktree_base>/worktree-tracking.md` must be updated on create/scan/cleanup/abandon. Allow a toggle to disable tracking for repos that don''t use it.\n- Naming: worktree directory = branch name; branch naming follows repo policy (e.g., master release; develop/DevBranch integration; feature from integration; hotfix from master; release branches as needed).\n- Branch protections/hooks: no direct commits to protected branches; ensure hooks/branch protections are respected across worktrees.\n- Cleanliness: worktrees must be removed and tracking updated when work is complete or branch is merged.\n\n## Protected Branch Configuration\n\nProtected branches (main, develop, master, etc.) require special handling to prevent accidental deletion:\n\n```yaml\n# Configuration (typically in repo .claude/config or passed to agents)\ngit_flow:\n  enabled: true  # boolean: whether git-flow workflow is used\n  main_branch: \"main\"  # or \"master\" - the primary production branch\n  develop_branch: \"develop\"  # only if git_flow.enabled = true\n\nprotected_branches:\n  - \"main\"\n  - \"develop\"\n  - \"master\"\n  # Can include additional patterns: \"release/*\", \"hotfix/*\"\n```\n\n**Protected Branch Rules:**\n- If `git_flow.enabled: false` → protect only `main_branch`\n- If `git_flow.enabled: true` → protect `main_branch` + `develop_branch`\n- Additional branches can be added to `protected_branches` array\n- **Cleanup/abort agents NEVER delete protected branches** (local or remote)\n- Protected branches can only be removed from worktrees, never deleted\n- Use `--update` to safely pull changes for protected branches in worktrees\n\n## Workflows\n\n### Scaffolding (if missing)\n- Ensure base path exists: `<worktree_base>`. If missing, create it.\n- If tracking is enabled, ensure tracking doc exists with headers.\n\n### Create worktree (and branch)\n1) Inputs: `--branch <name>`, `--base <master|develop|...>`, optional `--path`.\n2) Ensure scaffolding/tracking doc exists (if enabled); fetch all: `git fetch --all --prune`.\n3) Confirm base branch exists and is up to date.\n4) Determine path: default `<worktree_base>/<branch>` (or override).\n5) Create branch/worktree:\n   - If branch does not yet exist: `git worktree add -b <branch> <path> <base>`.\n   - If branch exists: `git worktree add <path> <branch>`.\n6) In the new worktree, ensure hooks apply and verify status is clean.\n7) If tracking enabled, add/refresh entry in tracking doc (branch, path, base, purpose, owner, created date, status).\n8) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-create` agent; it returns structured JSON (tracking row, status).\n\n### Scan/verify worktrees\n1) List worktrees: `git worktree list --porcelain`.\n2) Cross-check tracking doc (if enabled); flag missing/stale entries or extra rows.\n3) For each worktree, check status and merge state:\n   - `git -C <path> status --short`\n   - `git -C <path> fetch`\n   - `git branch --remotes --contains <branch>` to see if merged.\n4) Identify issues: untracked changes, diverged branches, merged-but-not-cleaned worktrees, missing tracking entries.\n5) Update tracking doc with current state and issues (if enabled); propose cleanup where appropriate.\n6) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-scan` agent; it returns structured JSON.\n\n### Clean-up worktree (post-merge or finished work)\n1) **Check if branch is protected**: If branch is in protected_branches list, ONLY remove worktree, NEVER delete the branch.\n2) If `git status` is not clean, stop and request explicit approval/coordination.\n3) Ensure all work is committed/pushed or explicitly confirmed to discard.\n4) Confirm target branch merged or otherwise approved for removal.\n5) Remove worktree: `git worktree remove <path>` (use `--force` only with approval).\n6) For **non-protected branches**: If merged and no unique commits, delete the branch locally (`git branch -d <branch>`) and remotely (`git push origin --delete <branch>`) by default; only skip if the user explicitly opts out. If the remote branch is already absent, continue without error. If not merged, only delete with explicit approval.\n7) For **protected branches**: Only remove worktree, preserve branch locally and remotely. Update tracking to note \"worktree removed, branch preserved (protected)\".\n8) If tracking enabled, update tracking doc to remove/mark cleaned with merge SHA/date.\n9) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-cleanup` agent; it returns structured JSON.\n\n### Abandon worktree (discard work)\n1) **Check if branch is protected**: If branch is in protected_branches list, ONLY remove worktree, NEVER delete the branch.\n2) If `git status` is not clean, stop and request explicit approval/coordination.\n3) Confirm user approval to discard local changes and optionally delete the branch.\n4) Remove worktree: `git worktree remove <path>` (force only with approval).\n5) For **non-protected branches**: If instructed, delete the branch locally (`git branch -D <branch>`) and remotely (`git push origin --delete <branch>`).\n6) For **protected branches**: Only remove worktree, preserve branch locally and remotely. Require confirmation: \"Branch is protected. Remove worktree but preserve branch?\"\n7) If tracking enabled, update tracking doc to remove the entry and note abandonment.\n8) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-abort` agent; it returns structured JSON.\n\n### Update protected branch (pull latest changes)\n1) **Verify branch is protected**: Only operates on branches in protected_branches list. If no branch is specified, update all protected branches that have worktrees.\n2) Check if worktree exists at expected path; error if missing.\n3) If `git status` is not clean, stop and report dirty state.\n4) Fetch and pull: `git fetch origin <branch>` then `git pull origin <branch>`.\n5) **If merge conflicts occur**:\n   - Collect conflicted files: `git diff --name-only --diff-filter=U`\n   - Return control to main agent with conflict details\n   - Main agent coordinates with user to resolve conflicts\n   - After resolution, user commits and continues\n6) **If clean pull**: Update tracking with last_checked timestamp and commits pulled count.\n7) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-update` agent; it returns structured JSON with success or conflict details.\n\n## Safety and reminders\n- **NEVER delete protected branches** (main, develop, master) under any circumstances.\n- Protected branches can only be removed from worktrees; the branch itself must always be preserved.\n- Never delete branches or force-remove worktrees without explicit approval.\n- Never clean/abandon a worktree with uncommitted changes unless explicitly approved.\n- Keep tracking doc in sync on every operation when enabled.\n- Respect branch protections and hooks; no direct commits to protected branches.\n- Use background agents for long scans/cleanups; keep the main context focused on decisions and summaries.\n- When updating protected branches in worktrees, handle merge conflicts by returning control to main agent for user coordination.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:29:00.150Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Git-integrated AI Agents needing advanced worktree management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级工作树管理功能的Git集成AI代理。","ja":"Git統合AIエージェントが高度なワークツリー管理機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 작업 트리 관리 기능이 필요한 Git 통합 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA integrados con Git que necesitan capacidades de gestión de worktree avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA intégrés à Git nécessitant des capacités de gestion de worktree avancées.","de":"Ideal für in Git integrierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Worktree-Verwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA integrados ao Git que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de worktree.","ru":"Идеально для AI-агентов, интегрированных с Git, требующих продвинутых возможностей управления worktree.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتكامل مع Git الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة worktree."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage worktrees with a standard structure and tracking using the `/sc-git-worktree` command, leveraging JSON data for success, path, branch, and tracking row information, and delegates tasks to specialized agents via the Task tool.","zh":"赋予代理管理工作树的标准结构和跟踪使用 `/sc-git-worktree` 命令的能力，利用 JSON 数据来成功、路径、分支和跟踪行信息，并通过 Task 工具将任务委托给专用代理。","ja":"エージェントに `/sc-git-worktree` コマンドを使用して標準構造とトラッキングを持つワークツリーを管理する能力を付与し、JSON データを使用して成功、パス、ブランチ、およびトラッキング行情報を提供し、Task ツールを使用してタスクを専用エージェントに委任します。","ko":"에이전트에게 `/sc-git-worktree` 명령을 사용하여 표준 구조 및 추적을 갖춘 작업 트리를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, JSON 데이터를 사용하여 성공, 경로, 분기 및 추적 행 정보를 제공하며, Task 도구를 사용하여 태스크를専用 에이전트에 위임합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar worktrees con una estructura estándar y seguimiento utilizando el comando `/sc-git-worktree`, aprovechando los datos JSON para la información de éxito, ruta, rama y seguimiento de fila, y delega tareas a agentes especializados a través de la herramienta Task.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des worktrees avec une structure standard et un suivi en utilisant la commande `/sc-git-worktree`, en exploitant les données JSON pour les informations de réussite, de chemin, de branche et de suivi de ligne, et délègue des tâches à des agents spécialisés via l''outil Task.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Worktrees mit einer Standardstruktur und Nachverfolgung unter Verwendung des Befehls `/sc-git-worktree` zu verwalten, indem JSON-Daten für Erfolgs-, Pfad-, Branch- und Nachverfolgungszeileninformationen genutzt werden, und delegiert Aufgaben an spezialisierte Agents über das Task-Tool.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar worktrees com uma estrutura padrão e rastreamento usando o comando `/sc-git-worktree`, aproveitando dados JSON para sucesso, caminho, branch e informações da linha de rastreamento, e delega tarefas a agentes especializados por meio da ferramenta Task.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять worktree с стандартной структурой и отслеживанием с помощью команды `/sc-git-worktree`, использует данные JSON для успеха, пути, ветки и информации о строке отслеживания, и делегирует задачи специализированным агентам через инструмент Task.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة worktrees ببنية معيارية وتعقب باستخدام الأمر `/sc-git-worktree` ، مستفيداً من بيانات JSON للنجاح والمسار والفرع ومعلومات صفحة التعقب ، و تفويض المهام إلى وكلاء متخصصين من خلال أداة Task."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new worktrees with the `sc-worktree-create` agent","Scanning existing worktrees for recommendations using the `sc-worktree-scan` agent","Cleaning up worktrees with the `sc-worktree-cleanup` agent"],"zh":["使用 `sc-worktree-create` 代理创建新的工作树","使用 `sc-worktree-scan` 代理扫描现有的工作树以获取建议","使用 `sc-worktree-cleanup` 代理清理工作树"],"ja":["`sc-worktree-create` エージェントを使用して新しいワークツリーを作成する","`sc-worktree-scan` エージェントを使用して既存のワークツリーをスキャンして推奨事項を取得する","`sc-worktree-cleanup` エージェントを使用してワークツリーをクリーンアップする"],"ko":["`sc-worktree-create` 에이전트를 사용하여 새로운 작업 트리를 생성하는 것","`sc-worktree-scan` 에이전트를 사용하여 기존 작업 트리를 스캔하여 추천을 받는 것","`sc-worktree-cleanup` 에이전트를 사용하여 작업 트리를 정리하는 것"],"es":["Crear nuevos worktrees con el agente `sc-worktree-create`","Escaneo de worktrees existentes para recomendaciones utilizando el agente `sc-worktree-scan`","Limpieza de worktrees con el agente `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux worktrees avec l''agent `sc-worktree-create`","Analyse de worktrees existants pour des recommandations en utilisant l''agent `sc-worktree-scan`","Nettoyage de worktrees avec l''agent `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Worktrees mit dem Agent `sc-worktree-create`","Scannen von bestehenden Worktrees für Empfehlungen unter Verwendung des Agents `sc-worktree-scan`","Bereinigen von Worktrees mit dem Agent `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"pt":["Criação de novos worktrees com o agente `sc-worktree-create`","Varredura de worktrees existentes para recomendações usando o agente `sc-worktree-scan`","Limpeza de worktrees com o agente `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"ru":["Создание новых worktree с помощью агента `sc-worktree-create`","Сканирование существующих worktree для рекомендаций с помощью агента `sc-worktree-scan`","Очистка worktree с помощью агента `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"ar":["إنشاء worktrees جديدة مع عميل `sc-worktree-create`","مسح worktrees الحالية لتوصيات باستخدام عميل `sc-worktree-scan`","تنظيف worktrees مع عميل `sc-worktree-cleanup`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Dependent on Task tool for agent delegation"],"zh":["需要 Git 安装","依赖 Task 工具进行代理委托"],"ja":["Git のインストールが必要","エージェントの委任には Task ツールに依存する"],"ko":["Git 설치가 필요함","에이전트 위임에는 Task 도구에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Git","Dependiente de la herramienta Task para la delegación de agentes"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Git","Dépend de l''outil Task pour la délégation d''agents"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation","Abhängig von dem Task-Tool für die Delegation von Agents"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Git","Dependente da ferramenta Task para delegação de agentes"],"ru":["Требует установки Git","Зависит от инструмента Task для делегирования агентов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Git","يعتمد على أداة Task لتفويد الوكلاء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1082cef00ec5f414c0ca666202d4023392dae287550e0711a3a7b9001962e97c","qualityScore":39}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('intertwine/hive-orchestrator/hive-mcp', 'community', 'intertwine', 'hive-orchestrator', 'intertwine/hive-orchestrator', 'hive-mcp', 0, 0, 39, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.096Z', '2026-03-02T03:32:26.141Z', '4eeae84c0ac7fe50c537577c7d2a73a9cc4c04140918e48fa54b5dc776aed44d', '{"id":"intertwine/hive-orchestrator/hive-mcp","name":"hive-mcp","description":{"zh":"Hive-MCP是一种基于Markdown的自动化协调OS，支持多种AI智能代理，包括Claude、GPT、Gemini和Grok","ja":"Hive-MCPは、Markdownを使用した自動化オーケストレーションOSであり、Claude、GPT、Gemini、Grokなどの多種多様なAIエージェントをサポートしています","ko":"Hive-MCP는 마크다운 기반의 자동화 오케스트레이션 OS로서 Claude, GPT, Gemini, Grok 등의 다양한 AI 에이전트를 지원합니다","es":"hive-mcp es un sistema operativo de orquestación para agentes de inteligencia artificial autónomos, que coordina Claude, GPT, Gemini y Grok mediante archivos Markdown","fr":"hive-mcp est un système d''exploitation d''orchestration pour agents d''intelligence artificielle autonomes, qui coordonne Claude, GPT, Gemini et Grok à l''aide de fichiers Markdown","de":"hive-mcp ist ein Betriebssystem für die Orchestrierung autonomer KI-Agents, das Claude, GPT, Gemini und Grok über Markdown-Dateien koordiniert","pt":"hive-mcp é um sistema operacional de orquestração vendor-agnostic para agentes de IA autônomos. Coordena Claude, GPT, Gemini e Grok usando Markdown como memória compartilhada","ru":"hive-mcp - это систем операционный оркестрации для автономных ИИ агентов. Координирует Claude, GPT, Gemini и Grok с помощью Markdown как общей памяти","ar":"hive-mcp هو نظام تشغيل أوركسترالي لوسيط एजنت إيا ذاتي الحكم. ينسق Claude و GPT و Gemini و Grok باستخدام Markdown كذاكرة مشتركة","en":"Vendor-agnostic orchestration OS for autonomous AI agents. Coordinate Claude, GPT, Gemini, and Grok using Markdown files as shared memory. Human-in-the-loop, Git-native, runs on GitHub Actions free tier."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理Hive-MCP：基于Markdown的自动化协调","ja":"AIエージェントのためのHive-MCP：マークダウンを使用した自動化オーケストレーション","ko":"AI 에이전트를 위한 Hive-MCP: 마크다운 기반 자동화 오케스트레이션","es":"hive-mcp: Orquestación de Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial","fr":"hive-mcp: Orchestration d''Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle","de":"hive-mcp: Steuerung von KI-Agents","pt":"Orquestração de Agente de IA - hive-mcp","ru":"ИИ Агенты Оркестрация - hive-mcp","ar":"توجيه وسيط एजنت إียมكب - hive-mcp","en":"hive-mcp"},"description":{"zh":"Hive-MCP是一种基于Markdown的自动化协调OS，支持多种AI智能代理，包括Claude、GPT、Gemini和Grok","ja":"Hive-MCPは、Markdownを使用した自動化オーケストレーションOSであり、Claude、GPT、Gemini、Grokなどの多種多様なAIエージェントをサポートしています","ko":"Hive-MCP는 마크다운 기반의 자동화 오케스트레이션 OS로서 Claude, GPT, Gemini, Grok 등의 다양한 AI 에이전트를 지원합니다","es":"hive-mcp es un sistema operativo de orquestación para agentes de inteligencia artificial autónomos, que coordina Claude, GPT, Gemini y Grok mediante archivos...","fr":"hive-mcp est un système d''exploitation d''orchestration pour agents d''intelligence artificielle autonomes, qui coordonne Claude, GPT, Gemini et Grok à l''aide ...","de":"hive-mcp ist ein Betriebssystem für die Orchestrierung autonomer KI-Agents, das Claude, GPT, Gemini und Grok über Markdown-Dateien koordiniert","pt":"hive-mcp é um sistema operacional de orquestração vendor-agnostic para agentes de IA autônomos. Coordena Claude, GPT, Gemini e Grok usando Markdown como memó...","ru":"hive-mcp - это систем операционный оркестрации для автономных ИИ агентов. Координирует Claude, GPT, Gemini и Grok с помощью Markdown как общей памяти","ar":"hive-mcp هو نظام تشغيل أوركسترالي لوسيط एजنت إيا ذاتي الحكم. ينسق Claude و GPT و Gemini و Grok باستخدام Markdown كذاكرة مشتركة","en":"Vendor-agnostic orchestration OS for autonomous AI agents. Coordinate Claude, GPT, Gemini, and Grok using Markdown files as shared memory. Human-in-the-loop,..."},"definition":{"en":"Vendor-agnostic orchestration OS for autonomous AI agents. Coordinate Claude, GPT, Gemini, and Grok using Markdown files as shared memory. Human-in-the-loop, Git-native, runs on GitHub Actions free tier."},"features":{"zh":["基于Markdown的共享内存","支持多种AI智能代理","基于GitHub Actions的自动化","人机协同工作模式","Git原生支持"],"ja":["マークダウンを使用した共有メモリ","多種多様なAIエージェントのサポート","GitHub Actionsを使用した自動化","ヒューマン・イン・ザ・ループの作業モード","Gitネイティブのサポート"],"ko":["마크다운 기반의 공유 메모리","다양한 AI 에이전트의 지원","GitHub Actions를 사용한 자동화","ヒューマン・イン・ザ・ループ의 작업 모드","Git 네이티브의 지원"],"es":["Orquestación de agentes de inteligencia artificial","Compatibilidad con Claude, GPT, Gemini y Grok","Uso de archivos Markdown como memoria compartida","Funcionamiento en GitHub Actions de forma gratuita"],"fr":["Orchestration d''agents d''intelligence artificielle","Compatibilité avec Claude, GPT, Gemini et Grok","Utilisation de fichiers Markdown comme mémoire partagée","Fonctionnement sur GitHub Actions de manière gratuite"],"de":["Orchestrierung von KI-Agents","Kompatibilität mit Claude, GPT, Gemini und Grok","Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien als gemeinsame Speicher","Funktionsweise auf GitHub Actions kostenlos"],"pt":["Orquestração de agente de IA vendor-agnostic","Coordenação de Claude, GPT, Gemini e Grok","Uso de Markdown como memória compartilhada","Suporte a human-in-the-loop","Integração com GitHub Actions free tier"],"ru":["Оркестрация ИИ агентов без привязки к поставщику","Координирование Claude, GPT, Gemini и Grok","Использование Markdown как общей памяти","Поддержка human-in-the-loop","Интеграция с GitHub Actions бесплатного тарифного плана"],"ar":["توجيه وسيط एजنت إيا بدون ارتباط بالبائع","تنسيق Claude و GPT و Gemini و Grok","استخدام Markdown كذاكرة مشتركة","دعم الإنسان في الحلقة","التكامل مع GitHub Actions الطراز المجاني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","自动化协调","Markdown","GitHub Actions","人机协同","Git原生","Hive-MCP教程","AI工具比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","自動化オーケストレーション","マークダウン","GitHub Actions","ヒューマン・イン・ザ・ループ","Gitネイティブ","Hive-MCPの使い方","AIツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","자동화 오케스트레이션","마크다운","GitHub Actions","ヒューマン・イン・ザ・ループ","Git 네이티브","Hive-MCP 사용법","AI 툴 비교"],"es":["cómo usar hive-mcp","qué es la orquestación de agentes de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a hive-mcp","hive-mcp vs otros sistemas de orquestación","instalación de hive-mcp","guía de configuración de hive-mcp"],"fr":["comment utiliser hive-mcp","qu''est-ce que l''orchestration d''agents d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à hive-mcp","hive-mcp vs d''autres systèmes d''orchestration","installation de hive-mcp","guide de configuration de hive-mcp"],"de":["wie man hive-mcp verwendet","was ist die Orchestrierung von KI-Agents","Alternativen zu hive-mcp","hive-mcp vs andere Orchestrierungssysteme","Installation von hive-mcp","Konfigurationsanleitung für hive-mcp"],"pt":["orquestração de agente de IA","como usar hive-mcp","o que é hive-mcp","hive-mcp vs outros agentes de IA","instalar hive-mcp","configurar hive-mcp","guias de hive-mcp","documentação de hive-mcp"],"ru":["оркестрация ИИ агентов","как использовать hive-mcp","что такое hive-mcp","hive-mcp vs другие ИИ агенты","установить hive-mcp","настроить hive-mcp","руководства по hive-mcp","документация hive-mcp"],"ar":["توجيه وسيط एजنت إيا","كيفية استخدام hive-mcp","ما هو hive-mcp","hive-mcp مقابل وسيطات إيا أخرى","تثبيت hive-mcp","تنفيذ hive-mcp","دلائل hive-mcp","توثيق hive-mcp"]}},"owner":"intertwine","repo":"hive-orchestrator","repoPath":"intertwine/hive-orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.096Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hive-mcp","description":"Use the Agent Hive MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for programmatic project management. Use this skill when working with MCP tools to list projects, claim/release projects, update status, add notes, or query dependencies through the MCP interface.","bodyPreview":"# Hive MCP Server\n\nThe Hive MCP server exposes Agent Hive functionality as MCP tools, enabling AI agents like Claude to programmatically manage projects through standardized tool interfaces.\n\n## Overview\n\nMCP (Model Context Protocol) provides a standardized way for AI agents to interact with external tools. The Hive MCP server exposes project management operations as callable tools.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Configuration\n\nAdd the Hive MCP server to your Claude configuration:\n\n**For Claude Desktop (`~/.con","body":"# Hive MCP Server\n\nThe Hive MCP server exposes Agent Hive functionality as MCP tools, enabling AI agents like Claude to programmatically manage projects through standardized tool interfaces.\n\n## Overview\n\nMCP (Model Context Protocol) provides a standardized way for AI agents to interact with external tools. The Hive MCP server exposes project management operations as callable tools.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Configuration\n\nAdd the Hive MCP server to your Claude configuration:\n\n**For Claude Desktop (`~/.config/claude/claude_desktop_config.json`):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"hive\": {\n      \"command\": \"uv\",\n      \"args\": [\"run\", \"python\", \"-m\", \"src.hive_mcp\"],\n      \"cwd\": \"/path/to/agent-hive\",\n      \"env\": {\n        \"HIVE_BASE_PATH\": \"/path/to/agent-hive\",\n        \"COORDINATOR_URL\": \"http://localhost:8080\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**For DevContainer (`.devcontainer/devcontainer.json`):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"hive\": {\n      \"command\": \"uv\",\n      \"args\": [\"run\", \"python\", \"-m\", \"src.hive_mcp\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Description | Default |\n|----------|-------------|---------|\n| `HIVE_BASE_PATH` | Root path of the hive | Current directory |\n| `COORDINATOR_URL` | URL of coordination server | Not set (optional) |\n\n## Available Tools\n\n### Project Discovery\n\n#### `list_projects`\nList all projects in the hive with their metadata.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"list_projects\",\n  \"arguments\": {}\n}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"count\": 3,\n    \"projects\": [\n      {\n        \"project_id\": \"demo\",\n        \"status\": \"active\",\n        \"owner\": null,\n        \"priority\": \"medium\",\n        \"tags\": [\"example\"]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### `get_ready_work`\nGet projects ready for an agent to claim.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"get_ready_work\",\n  \"arguments\": {}\n}\n```\n\nReturns projects that are:\n- Status: `active`\n- Not blocked\n- No current owner\n- Dependencies satisfied\n\n#### `get_project`\nGet full details of a specific project.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"get_project\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"demo\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Response includes:**\n- All metadata fields\n- Full markdown content\n- Dependency information\n\n### Project Ownership\n\n#### `claim_project`\nClaim a project by setting ownership.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"claim_project\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"demo\",\n    \"agent_name\": \"claude-sonnet-4\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Success response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"demo\",\n    \"owner\": \"claude-sonnet-4\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Failure (already claimed):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": \"Project already claimed by grok-beta\"\n}\n```\n\n#### `release_project`\nRelease ownership of a project.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"release_project\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"demo\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Status Management\n\n#### `update_status`\nUpdate the status of a project.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"update_status\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"demo\",\n    \"status\": \"completed\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Valid statuses:**\n- `active` - Ready for work\n- `pending` - Not yet started\n- `blocked` - Waiting for external input\n- `completed` - All tasks done\n\n#### `add_note`\nAdd a timestamped note to Agent Notes section.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"add_note\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"demo\",\n    \"agent\": \"claude-sonnet-4\",\n    \"note\": \"Completed research phase. Found 5 relevant sources.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Dependency Analysis\n\n#### `get_dependencies`\nGet dependency information for a project.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"get_dependencies\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"demo\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"is_blocked\": false,\n    \"reasons\": [],\n    \"blocking_projects\": [],\n    \"in_cycle\": false,\n    \"cycle\": []\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### `get_dependency_graph`\nGet full dependency graph for all projects.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"get_dependency_graph\",\n  \"arguments\": {}\n}\n```\n\n### Coordinator Integration\n\nThese tools require `COORDINATOR_URL` to be configured.\n\n#### `coordinator_status`\nCheck if coordination server is available.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"coordinator_status\",\n  \"arguments\": {}\n}\n```\n\n#### `coordinator_claim`\nClaim via coordination server (prevents conflicts).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"coordinator_claim\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"demo\",\n    \"agent_name\": \"claude-sonnet-4\",\n    \"ttl_seconds\": 3600\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### `coordinator_release`\nRelease claim via coordination server.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"coordinator_release\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"demo\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### `coordinator_reservations`\nGet all active reservations.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"coordinator_reservations\",\n  \"arguments\": {}\n}\n```\n\n## Tool Reference\n\n| Tool | Description | Required Args |\n|------|-------------|---------------|\n| `list_projects` | List all projects | None |\n| `get_ready_work` | Find claimable projects | None |\n| `get_project` | Get project details | `project_id` |\n| `claim_project` | Claim ownership | `project_id`, `agent_name` |\n| `release_project` | Release ownership | `project_id` |\n| `update_status` | Change project status | `project_id`, `status` |\n| `add_note` | Add agent note | `project_id`, `agent`, `note` |\n| `get_dependencies` | Check blocking status | `project_id` |\n| `get_dependency_graph` | Full dependency view | None |\n| `coordinator_status` | Coordinator health | None |\n| `coordinator_claim` | Real-time claim | `project_id`, `agent_name` |\n| `coordinator_release` | Real-time release | `project_id` |\n| `coordinator_reservations` | Active reservations | None |\n\n## Response Format\n\nAll tools return a standardized response:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true|false,\n  \"data\": { ... },      // Present on success\n  \"error\": \"message\"    // Present on failure\n}\n```\n\n## Workflow Example\n\n### Starting Work on a Project\n\n```\n1. list_projects()           # See what''s available\n2. get_ready_work()          # Find claimable projects\n3. get_project(\"my-proj\")    # Review project details\n4. claim_project(\"my-proj\", \"claude-sonnet-4\")\n5. [Do the work]\n6. add_note(\"my-proj\", \"claude-sonnet-4\", \"Completed task X\")\n7. update_status(\"my-proj\", \"completed\")\n8. release_project(\"my-proj\")\n```\n\n### With Coordinator (Parallel-Safe)\n\n```\n1. coordinator_status()      # Verify coordinator is up\n2. coordinator_claim(\"my-proj\", \"claude-sonnet-4\", 3600)\n3. claim_project(\"my-proj\", \"claude-sonnet-4\")  # Also update AGENCY.md\n4. [Do the work]\n5. release_project(\"my-proj\")\n6. coordinator_release(\"my-proj\")\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Check ready work first** - Use `get_ready_work` to find available projects\n2. **Read before claiming** - Use `get_project` to understand the work\n3. **Use coordinator for parallel agents** - Prevents race conditions\n4. **Add notes for transparency** - Document your progress\n5. **Release when done** - Don''t hold claims unnecessarily\n6. **Handle errors gracefully** - Check `success` field in responses\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Project not found\"\nVerify project_id matches exactly (case-sensitive).\n\n### \"Project already claimed\"\nAnother agent owns the project. Use `get_project` to see current owner.\n\n### \"Coordinator unavailable\"\n- Check `COORDINATOR_URL` is set\n- Verify coordinator server is running\n- Test with `coordinator_status` tool\n\n### \"Failed to update project\"\n- Verify AGENCY.md file exists\n- Check file permissions\n- Ensure path is within HIVE_BASE_PATH\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:32:26.141Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous AI Agents needing vendor-agnostic orchestration and standardized tool interfaces via Model Context Protocol (MCP)","zh":"Perfect for Autonomous AI Agents 需要供应商无关的编排和通过 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 标准化的工具接口","ja":"Autonomous AI Agents がベンダー非依存のオーケストレーションと Model Context Protocol (MCP) 経由の標準化されたツールインターフェイスを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자율적인 AI 에이전트가 Model Context Protocol (MCP)를 통한 베ンダ 무관의 오케스트레이션과 표준화된 툴 인터페이스를 필요로 할 때 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Autónomos que necesitan orquestación agnóstica de proveedores e interfaces de herramientas estandarizadas a través del Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP)","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA Autonomes ayant besoin d''une orchestration agnostique des fournisseurs et d''interfaces d''outils standardisées via le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle (MCP)","de":"Perfekt für autonome KI-Agents, die eine herstellerunabhängige Orchestrierung und standardisierte Werkzeugschnittstellen über das Model Context Protocol (MCP) benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos de IA que necessitam de orquestração agnóstica de fornecedor e interfaces de ferramentas padronizadas via Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP)","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов ИИ, которым требуется оркестрация, независимая от поставщика, и стандартизированные интерфейсы инструментов через Протокол контекста модели (MCP)","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستقل الذي يحتاج إلى أوركسترا غير معتمدة على البائع وتواصل أدوات معيارية عبر بروتوكول سياق النموذج (MCP)"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to programmatically manage projects through standardized tool interfaces using Markdown files as shared memory, leveraging MCP tools and running on GitHub Actions free tier with support for Claude, GPT, Gemini, and Grok","zh":"赋予代理程序通过标准化的工具接口以编程方式管理项目的能力，使用 Markdown 文件作为共享内存，利用 MCP 工具，并在 GitHub Actions 免费层运行，支持 Claude、GPT、Gemini 和 Grok","ja":"エージェントに、標準化されたツールインターフェイスを使用してプログラムによってプロジェクトを管理する能力を付与し、Markdown ファイルを共有メモリとして使用し、MCP ツールを利用し、GitHub Actions 無料層で実行し、Claude、GPT、Gemini、Grok をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 표준화된 툴 인터페이스를 사용하여 프로그램으로 프로젝트를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Markdown 파일을 공유 메모리로서 사용하며, MCP 툴을 활용하며, GitHub Actions 무료 계층에서 실행하며, Claude, GPT, Gemini, Grok를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar programáticamente proyectos a través de interfaces de herramientas estandarizadas utilizando archivos Markdown como memoria compartida, aprovechando las herramientas MCP y ejecutándose en el nivel gratuito de GitHub Actions con soporte para Claude, GPT, Gemini y Grok","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière programmatique des projets grâce à des interfaces d''outils standardisées en utilisant des fichiers Markdown comme mémoire partagée, en exploitant les outils MCP et en s''exécutant sur le niveau gratuit de GitHub Actions avec un support pour Claude, GPT, Gemini et Grok","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Projekte programmatisch über standardisierte Werkzeugschnittstellen zu verwalten, indem Markdown-Dateien als gemeinsames Speicher verwendet werden, MCP-Tools nutzen und auf dem kostenlosen Tarif von GitHub Actions mit Unterstützung für Claude, GPT, Gemini und Grok ausgeführt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar projetos programaticamente por meio de interfaces de ferramentas padronizadas usando arquivos Markdown como memória compartilhada, aproveitando as ferramentas MCP e executando no GitHub Actions gratuito com suporte a Claude, GPT, Gemini e Grok","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью программно управлять проектами через стандартизированные интерфейсы инструментов, используя файлы Markdown в качестве общей памяти, используя инструменты MCP и работающие на бесплатном уровне GitHub Actions с поддержкой Claude, GPT, Gemini и Grok","ar":"يُمكّن العميل من إدارة المشاريع بشكل برمجي من خلال واجهات أدوات معيارية باستخدام ملفات Markdown كذاكرة مشتركة، ويسهم في أدوات MCP ويعمل على GitHub Actions المجانية مع دعم Claude وGPT وGemini وGrok"},"useCases":{"en":["Coordinating multi-agent projects using Markdown files","Automating project management workflows with GitHub Actions","Integrating AI agents like Claude and GPT using MCP tools"],"zh":["使用 Markdown 文件协调多代理项目","使用 GitHub Actions 自动化项目管理工作流","使用 MCP 工具集成 Claude 和 GPT 等 AI 代理"],"ja":["Markdown ファイルを使用してマルチエージェントプロジェクトを調整","GitHub Actions を使用してプロジェクト管理ワークフローを自動化","MCP ツールを使用して Claude や GPT などの AI エージェントを統合"],"ko":["Markdown 파일을 사용하여 멀티 에이전트 프로젝트를 조정","GitHub Actions를 사용하여 프로젝트 관리 워크플ロー 자동화","MCP 툴을 사용하여 Claude, GPT 등의 AI 에이전트를 통합"],"es":["Coordinar proyectos multiagente utilizando archivos Markdown","Automatizar flujos de trabajo de gestión de proyectos con GitHub Actions","Integrar agentes de IA como Claude y GPT utilizando herramientas MCP"],"fr":["Coordonner des projets multi-agents en utilisant des fichiers Markdown","Automatiser les flux de travail de gestion de projets avec GitHub Actions","Intégrer des agents d''IA comme Claude et GPT en utilisant des outils MCP"],"de":["Koordinieren von Multiagenten-Projekten unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien","Automatisieren von Projektmanagement-Workflows mit GitHub Actions","Integrieren von KI-Agents wie Claude und GPT unter Verwendung von MCP-Tools"],"pt":["Coordenar projetos multiagentes usando arquivos Markdown","Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de projetos com GitHub Actions","Integrar agentes de IA como Claude e GPT usando ferramentas MCP"],"ru":["Координировать проекты с несколькими агентами, используя файлы Markdown","Автоматизировать рабочие процессы управления проектами с помощью GitHub Actions","Интегрировать агентов ИИ, такие как Claude и GPT, используя инструменты MCP"],"ar":["تنسيق مشاريع متعددة الوكلاء باستخدام ملفات Markdown","أتمتة سير عمل إدارة المشاريع باستخدام GitHub Actions","دمج وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude وGPT باستخدام أدوات MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Actions setup","Limited to agents supporting Model Context Protocol (MCP)","Dependent on Git-native workflow"],"zh":["需要 GitHub Actions 设置","仅限支持 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 的代理","依赖于 Git 原生工作流"],"ja":["GitHub Actions の設定が必要","Model Context Protocol (MCP) をサポートするエージェントのみ","Git ネイティブワークフローに依存"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 설정이 필요","Model Context Protocol (MCP)를 지원하는 에이전트로 제한","Git 네이티브 워크플로에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de GitHub Actions","Limitado a agentes que admiten el Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP)","Dependiente de flujos de trabajo nativos de Git"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de GitHub Actions","Limité aux agents prenant en charge le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle (MCP)","Dépendant des flux de travail natifs de Git"],"de":["Benötigt eine Einrichtung von GitHub Actions","Begrenzt auf Agents, die das Model Context Protocol (MCP) unterstützen","Abhängig von Git-nativen Workflows"],"pt":["Requer configuração do GitHub Actions","Limitado a agentes que suportam o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP)","Dependente do fluxo de trabalho nativo do Git"],"ru":["Требуется настройка GitHub Actions","Ограничен агентами, поддерживающими Протокол контекста модели (MCP)","Зависит от родного рабочего процесса Git"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد GitHub Actions","محدود بالوكلاء الذين يدعمون بروتوكول سياق النموذج (MCP)","يعتمد على سير عمل Git الأصلي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4eeae84c0ac7fe50c537577c7d2a73a9cc4c04140918e48fa54b5dc776aed44d","qualityScore":39}');
