, and a beautiful cyberpunk-themed interface designed for edge deployment."},"features":{"zh":["自动模型管理","动态资源分配","美观的cyberpunk主题界面","适用于边缘部署","基于llama.cpp"],"ja":["自動モデル管理","動的リソース割り当て","美しいcyberpunkテーマのインターフェース","エッジデプロイメントに適しています","llama.cppをベースとしています"],"ko":["자동 모델 관리","동적 리소스 할당","아름다운 사이버펑크 테마 인터페이스","에지 배포에 적합합니다","llama.cpp 기반"],"es":["Gestión de modelos automatizada","Asignación de recursos dinámica","Interfaz de usuario con tema ciberpunk","Compatibilidad con OpenAI","Implementación de bordes"],"fr":["Gestion de modèles automatique","Allocation de ressources dynamique","Interface utilisateur à thème cyberpunk","Compatibilité avec OpenAI","Déploiement de bord"],"de":["Automatisiertes Modellmanagement","Dynamische Ressourcenzuweisung","Benutzeroberfläche mit Cyberpunk-Design","Kompatibilität mit OpenAI","Edge-Implementierung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento automático de modelos","Alocação dinâmica de recursos","Interface temática cyberpunk","Compatibilidade com OpenAI","Implantação em edge","Llama.cpp como base"],"ru":["Автоматическое управление моделями","Динамическое распределение ресурсов","Киберпанковский интерфейс","Совместимость с OpenAI","Развертывание на边","Llama.cpp как основа"],"ar":["إدارة النماذج الأوتوماتيكية","تخصيص الموارد دیناميكي","واجهة المستقبلية","التوافق مع OpenAI","التحديث على الحافة","Llama.cpp كقاعدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Cyber-Inference工具","自动模型管理","动态资源分配","边缘部署","llama.cpp","run-thor安装","run-thor设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Cyber-Inferenceツール","自動モデル管理","動的リソース割り当て","エッジデプロイメント","llama.cpp","run-thorのインストール","run-thorの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","사이버 추론 도구","자동 모델 관리","동적 리소스 할당","에지 배포","llama.cpp","run-thor 설치","run-thor 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","servidores de inferencia","OpenAI","gestión de modelos","implementación de bordes","cómo usar run-thor","run-thor alternativa","run-thor vs otros"],"fr":["outils d''IA","serveurs d''inférence","OpenAI","gestion de modèles","déploiement de bord","comment utiliser run-thor","run-thor alternative","run-thor vs autres"],"de":["KI-Tools","Inferenzserver","OpenAI","Modellmanagement","Edge-Implementierung","run-thor installieren","run-thor einrichten","run-thor alternative"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","servidores de inferência","openai","gerenciamento de modelos","alocação de recursos","interface cyberpunk","implantação em edge","llama.cpp","como usar run-thor","o que é run-thor"],"ru":["ии агенты","серверы вывода","openai","управление моделями","распределение ресурсов","киберпанковский интерфейс","развертывание на边","llama.cpp","как использовать run-thor","что такое run-thor"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","الخادمات الاستدلالية","openai","إدارة النماذج","تخصيص الموارد","واجهة المستقبلية","التحديث على الحافة","llama.cpp","كيفية استخدام run-thor","ما هو run-thor"]}},"owner":"RamboRogers","repo":"cyber-inference","repoPath":"RamboRogers/cyber-inference","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.102Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"run-thor","description":"Deploy and test cyber-inference on the Thor lab server. Use when the user wants to test on Thor, deploy to Thor, run on Thor, verify the server, or mentions thor.lab.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy & Test on Thor\n\nThor is the GPU lab server used for integration testing of cyber-inference. It is accessible via SSH and hosts the production-like test environment.\n\n## Connection Details\n\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| Host | `thor.lab` |\n| User | `matt` |\n| SSH | `ssh matt@thor.lab` |\n| Project path | `/home/matt/Local/cyber-inference` |\n| Server URL | `http://thor.lab:8337` |\n\n## Deploy Workflow\n\nFollow these steps in order. Each depends on the previous.\n\n### 1. Commit & Push","body":"# Deploy & Test on Thor\n\nThor is the GPU lab server used for integration testing of cyber-inference. It is accessible via SSH and hosts the production-like test environment.\n\n## Connection Details\n\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| Host | `thor.lab` |\n| User | `matt` |\n| SSH | `ssh matt@thor.lab` |\n| Project path | `/home/matt/Local/cyber-inference` |\n| Server URL | `http://thor.lab:8337` |\n\n## Deploy Workflow\n\nFollow these steps in order. Each depends on the previous.\n\n### 1. Commit & Push (local machine)\n\n```bash\ngit add -A && git commit -m \"<message>\" && git push\n```\n\n### 2. Pull on Thor (remote)\n\n```bash\nssh matt@thor.lab \"cd /home/matt/Local/cyber-inference && git pull\"\n```\n\n### 3. Start the Server (remote)\n\nThe server runs via `start.sh` which handles `uv sync` and auto-restart.\n\n```bash\n# Interactive (see logs live) - use for debugging\nssh -t matt@thor.lab \"cd /home/matt/Local/cyber-inference && ./start.sh\"\n\n# Background (detached) - use for long-running tests\nssh matt@thor.lab \"cd /home/matt/Local/cyber-inference && nohup ./start.sh > /tmp/cyber-inference.log 2>&1 &\"\n```\n\nCUDA PyTorch wheels are verified automatically when NVIDIA hardware is detected.\n\n### 4. Verify the Server\n\n```bash\n# Health check\ncurl -s http://thor.lab:8337/health\n\n# List models\ncurl -s http://thor.lab:8337/v1/models | python3 -m json.tool\n\n# System status\ncurl -s http://thor.lab:8337/admin/status | python3 -m json.tool\n\n```\n\nThe web GUI is available at: `http://thor.lab:8337`\n\n### 5. Test Inference\n\n```bash\n# Chat completion\ncurl -s http://thor.lab:8337/v1/chat/completions \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"model\": \"<model_name>\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}]}'' \\\n  | python3 -m json.tool\n\n# Embeddings\ncurl -s http://thor.lab:8337/v1/embeddings \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"model\": \"<model_name>\", \"input\": \"test text\"}'' \\\n  | python3 -m json.tool\n```\n\n## Quick One-Liner Deploy\n\nPull latest and restart in one command:\n\n```bash\nssh -t matt@thor.lab \"cd /home/matt/Local/cyber-inference && git pull && ./start.sh\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **Server won''t start**: Check logs with `ssh matt@thor.lab \"tail -50 /tmp/cyber-inference.log\"`\n- **Port in use**: Kill existing process with `ssh matt@thor.lab \"pkill -f ''cyber-inference serve''\"`\n- **Check running processes**: `ssh matt@thor.lab \"ps aux | grep cyber-inference\"`\n- **GPU/CUDA issues**: `ssh matt@thor.lab \"nvidia-smi\"`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:34:26.990Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing GPU-accelerated inference server management and cyberpunk-themed interface for edge deployment.","zh":"适用于需要GPU加速推理服务器管理和赛博朋克主题界面进行边缘部署的AI代理。","ja":"GPU加速の推論サーバー管理とサイバーパンク風のインターフェイスによるエッジデプロイメントを必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"GPU 가속된 추론 서버 관리 및 사이버펑크 테마의 인터페이스를 통한 에지 배포가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan administración de servidores de inferencia acelerados por GPU y una interfaz con tema ciberpunk para implementación de bordes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une gestion de serveurs d''inférence accélérés par GPU et d''une interface à thème cyberpunk pour le déploiement de bord.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine GPU-beschleunigte Inferenzserververwaltung und eine cyberpunk-thematische Schnittstelle für Edge-Implementierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de gerenciamento de servidor de inferência acelerado por GPU e interface com tema cyberpunk para implantação de bordo.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходим сервер управления выводом, ускоренный GPU, и интерфейс в стиле киберпанк для развертывания на краю сети.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى إدارة خادم استنتاج معزز بواسطة GPU وواجهة ذات طابع سايبربانك لتنفيذ الحافة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage OpenAI-compatible inference servers with automatic model management, dynamic resource allocation, and SSH access via llama.cpp, leveraging cyber-inference for production-like test environments on Thor GPU lab servers.","zh":"赋予代理管理OpenAI兼容的推理服务器的能力，具有自动模型管理、动态资源分配和通过llama.cpp的SSH访问，利用网络推理创建类似生产环境的测试环境，部署在Thor GPU实验室服务器上。","ja":"OpenAIと互換性のある推論サーバーの管理をエージェントに可能にし、自動モデルの管理、動的リソース割り当て、llama.cppを介したSSHアクセスを提供し、サイバー推論を使用してThor GPUラボサーバー上でプロダクションライクなテスト環境を作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenAI와 호환되는 추론 서버를 관리할 수 있도록 해주며, 자동 모델 관리, 동적 리소스 할당, llama.cpp를 통한 SSH 접근을 제공하고, 사이버 추론을 통해 Thor GPU 연구소 서버에서 프로덕션과 같은 테스트 환경을 생성 할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar servidores de inferencia compatibles con OpenAI con administración automática de modelos, asignación dinámica de recursos y acceso SSH a través de llama.cpp, aprovechando la inferencia cibernética para entornos de prueba de producción en servidores de laboratorio Thor GPU.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des serveurs d''inférence compatibles OpenAI avec une gestion automatique de modèles, une allocation dynamique de ressources et un accès SSH via llama.cpp, en exploitant l''inférence cybernétique pour des environnements de test de production sur les serveurs de laboratoire Thor GPU.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, OpenAI-kompatible Inferenzserver mit automatischer Modellverwaltung, dynamischer Ressourcenzuweisung und SSH-Zugriff über llama.cpp zu verwalten, indem es die cyber-Inférenz für produktionsähnliche Testumgebungen auf Thor-GPU-Laborserver nutzt.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar servidores de inferência compatíveis com a OpenAI com gerenciamento de modelo automático, alocação de recursos dinâmica e acesso SSH via llama.cpp, aproveitando a inferência cibernética para ambientes de teste de produção em servidores de laboratório Thor GPU.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять серверами вывода, совместимыми с OpenAI, с помощью автоматического управления моделями, динамического распределения ресурсов и доступа SSH через llama.cpp, используя кибервывод для тестовых сред, подобных производственным, на серверах лаборатории Thor GPU.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إدارة خوادم الاستنتاج المتوافقة مع OpenAI مع إدارة نموذجية آلية وتخصيص ديناميكي للموارد والدخول إلى SSH من خلال llama.cpp ، والاستفادة من الاستنتاج السيبراني لبيئات اختبار الإنتاج على خوادم مختبر Thor GPU."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying and testing cyber-inference on Thor","Managing OpenAI-compatible inference servers","Automating model updates and resource allocation on edge devices"],"zh":["在Thor上部署和测试网络推理","管理OpenAI兼容的推理服务器","在边缘设备上自动更新模型和资源分配"],"ja":["Thor上でサイバープッシュをデプロイしてテストする","OpenAIと互換性のある推論サーバーを管理する","エッジデバイス上でモデルを自動的に更新してリソースを割り当てる"],"ko":["Thor에서 사이버 추론을 배포 및 테스트","OpenAI와 호환되는 추론 서버 관리","에지 디바이스에서 모델 자동 업데이트와 리소스 할당"],"es":["Implementar y probar la inferencia cibernética en Thor","Administrar servidores de inferencia compatibles con OpenAI","Automatizar actualizaciones de modelos y asignación de recursos en dispositivos de borde"],"fr":["Déployer et tester l''inférence cybernétique sur Thor","Gérer des serveurs d''inférence compatibles OpenAI","Automatiser les mises à jour de modèles et l''allocation de ressources sur les appareils de bord"],"de":["Cyber-Inférenz auf Thor bereitstellen und testen","OpenAI-kompatible Inferenzserver verwalten","Modell-Updates und Ressourcenzuweisung auf Edge-Geräten automatisieren"],"pt":["Implantando e testando inferência cibernética no Thor","Gerenciando servidores de inferência compatíveis com a OpenAI","Automatizando atualizações de modelo e alocação de recursos em dispositivos de bordo"],"ru":["Развертывание и тестирование кибервывода на Thor","Управление серверами вывода, совместимыми с OpenAI","Автоматизация обновлений моделей и распределения ресурсов на устройствах края сети"],"ar":["تنفيذ اختبار الاستنتاج السيبراني على Thor","إدارة خوادم الاستنتاج المتوافقة مع OpenAI","تحسين تحديثات النموذج وتخصيص الموارد على أجهزة الحافة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SSH access to thor.lab","Dependent on llama.cpp and cyber-inference","Specific to OpenAI-compatible inference servers"],"zh":["需要thor.lab的SSH访问","依赖于llama.cpp和网络推理","仅适用于OpenAI兼容的推理服务器"],"ja":["thor.labへのSSHアクセスが必要","llama.cppとサイバープッシュに依存","OpenAIと互換性のある推論サーバーに限定"],"ko":["thor.labへの SSH 접근이 필요","llama.cpp와 사이버 추론에 종속","OpenAI와 호환되는 추론 서버에만 적용"],"es":["Requiere acceso SSH a thor.lab","Dependiente de llama.cpp y la inferencia cibernética","Específico para servidores de inferencia compatibles con OpenAI"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès SSH à thor.lab","Dépend de llama.cpp et de l''inférence cybernétique","Spécifique aux serveurs d''inférence compatibles OpenAI"],"de":["Benötigt SSH-Zugriff auf thor.lab","Abhängig von llama.cpp und cyber-Inférenz","Spezifisch für OpenAI-kompatible Inferenzserver"],"pt":["Requer acesso SSH ao thor.lab","Depende de llama.cpp e inferência cibernética","Específico para servidores de inferência compatíveis com a OpenAI"],"ru":["Требует доступа SSH к thor.lab","Зависит от llama.cpp и кибервывода","Конкретно для серверов вывода, совместимых с OpenAI"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى SSH إلى thor.lab","يعتمد على llama.cpp والاستنتاج السيبراني","محدد لخوادم الاستنتاج المتوافقة مع OpenAI"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7fc61fe5b2a40c54879d5f161638fc8c35015242978dc4bd1acf530d54db165a","qualityScore":39}');
